the chicken stood tall , feeling so proud of his discovery . he knew that he could still explore the world , but he chose to stay high on the hill . he looked out into the horizon , and he was happy . once upon a time there was a little girl who liked to play outside . one day , as she was playing , she saw a stranger . the little girl was scared and wanted to get away , so she started hurrying back to her house .

