the little girl was sad , but she learned an important lesson : pay attention and do n't run too fast . she was ready to start playing again , this time a little slower . one day , a little boy named jack was playing in his room . he decided to go and sit on his favourite chest . when he sat down , he noticed something unusual . the chest smelled smelly ! jack had never noticed a smelly smell before and he could n't work out what it was .

