when the puppy was outside , the smelly smell went away . jack was so relieved ! he sat back down on the chest , and said ' ahhh , much better ! ' once upon a time , there was a little girl . she was very happy and excited , but she was feeling dizzy . she decided to join a game , but she did n't know what to do .

