the little girl and the old man were both so happy . they had solved the mystery and created something wonderful . from then on , every single day , whenever the wise old man was seen outside , he had the magical blanket with him , always ready to help make wishes come true . once upon a time , there was a boy named pete . he was very little , only three years old ! while playing outside , pete got very sleepy . so , he settled in the grass and decided to take a nap . while pete was napping , a rude boy came and tried to wake him up . but pete 's body was too heavy and the rude boy could n't wake him .

