everyone who was included was so happy . they all laughed and cheered for the surprises . from then on , the bell was very important to the village . it was always a sign that something special was happening and that everyone was included in it . once upon a time , there was a wide meadow . all different animals lived in the meadow together . they all ate the same food , played together and had peace .

