the friends smiled at each other and hugged . they were so proud of themselves . they had worked together and shown that even tough lines can be separated and put back together . once upon a time , there were two bears who lived in a big house . they loved to tell stories to each other . one day , the two bears decided to go outside and explore . as they explored , they came across a vine that was growing up a tall tree .

