they played with their cars and had fun . they did not crash them again . they used lily 's stamp to decorate their cars with stars . they were happy and proud of their cars . they were good friends . lily and ben were hungry . they wanted to eat something yummy . they went to the kitchen and looked at the fridge . the fridge was big and cold . it had a lot of food inside .

