tom and anna hug mom and dad back . they love them too . they eat their lunch with their forks and spoons . they are a happy family . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play with their toys in the garden . one day , lily brought a new doll . it had long hair and a pretty dress . ben wanted to play with it .

