they ate the cookies . they played with their toys . they shared and took turns . they were happy . tom and sue were friends who liked to play in the big house . the big house had many rooms and doors and stairs . one day , they found a new door that was locked . they wanted to see what was inside .

" maybe there is a treasure or a toy or a cake , " tom said .

