they still did n't like the storm , but they knew they were safe and loved . lily was sick . she had a bad cough and a sore throat . she did not want to play or eat . she only wanted to sleep . her mom was worried . she gave lily a pill to make her feel better . but lily did not like the pill . it was big and bitter . she spit it out .

