they go inside . they sit on the couch . mia reads to tom . tom listens . they are quiet . they are happy . the rain goes on . tim and sam were brothers who liked to fish . they had a big pole that their dad gave them . they went to the lake with their pole and a bucket . they hoped to catch many fish and sell them at the market .

