she followed ben to the swings and slides . they played together and had fun . lily made a new friend . she was glad she mentioned her flute . sara and tom are playing in the kitchen . they want to make a cake for mom . they have a big bowl , some flour , some eggs , some milk and some sugar . they also have a spoon to stir .

