one day , tom and spot went to the park . they saw a big tree . tom wanted to climb the tree , but spot wanted to play with a ball . so , tom threw the ball for spot to catch .

when spot ran to get the ball , he saw a wild cat . spot wanted to play with the cat , but the cat did n't want to play . the cat was scared , and it bit spot . spot cried , and tom ran to help him . they went home , but spot was hurt and sad . the end . one day , a little boy named tim found some clay . it was soft and brown . he wanted to make something with it . he thought hard about what to make . tim was confused .

tim asked his mom for help . " mom , what can i make with this clay ? " his mom smiled and said , " you can make anything you want , tim . " she gave him an idea . " why do n't you make a cat ? " tim liked the idea and started to make a cat with the clay .

when he finished , he showed his cat to his mom . she was happy with his work . " good job , tim ! " she said . tim felt proud of his clay cat . he put it on a shelf in his room . every time he looked at it , he remembered how he asked his mom for help and she answered his question . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim loved to play with his toy cart . he would push it around the house and fill it with his favorite toys .

one day , tim saw his friend , sam , playing with a big , shiny new cart . tim felt envious of sam 's cart . he wanted one just like it . tim 's face showed a frown because he was sad .

