they looked around the garden and found all the bird 's friends . they counted them one by one . the bird was happy to know the number of friends . the bird thanked the cactus and they became good friends . from that day , they played together in the big garden and had lots of fun . once upon a time , there was a shy little rabbit named remy . remy lived in a small tunnel with his family . he loved to play with his friends , but he was too shy to ask them to play with him .

