remy came out of his tunnel and was so happy to see his friends . they all shared the big carrot and had a wonderful time . from that day on , remy was not shy anymore . he learned that sharing with friends was fun and it made him very happy . once upon a time , there was a big swamp . in the swamp , there lived an elderly frog . the elderly frog had many friends .

