tim remembered his unusual penny . he took it out of his pocket . the dog saw the penny and stopped trembling . the dog was not scared anymore . it was happy . tim and the dog played together all day . the unusual penny had made a new friend for tim . once upon a time , in a big sea , there was a sleepy fish named bob . bob lived near a reef with many other fish . one day , bob woke up and saw that his friend , the starfish , was gone . he felt sad and decided to search for his friend .

