the moral of the story is that it is important to be prepared , but it is also important to be a good neighbor and lend a helping hand when others are in need ! ben and lily were playing in the garden . they saw a big ladder leaning on the wall . ben wanted to climb the ladder and see what was on the other side . lily was scared and said , " no , ben , do n't go . it is too high and you might fall . "

but ben did not listen . he ran to the ladder and started to climb . he went up and up until he reached the top . he looked over the wall and saw a wide road with many cars and trucks . he felt dizzy and scared . he wanted to go back down , but he did not know how .

he shouted , " help , help , i am stuck . lily , help me ! " lily heard him and ran to the ladder . she looked up and saw ben crying . she felt sorry for him and said , " do n't cry , ben , i will help you . hold on tight and i will get dad . "

she ran to the house and found dad . she told him , " dad , dad , ben is on the ladder and he ca n't come down . he is crying and scared . please help him . " dad followed lily to the garden and saw ben on the ladder . he said , " ben , do n't worry , i am here . i will get you down . just stay calm and listen to me . "

dad climbed the ladder and reached ben . he hugged him and said , " you are brave , ben , but you should not climb the ladder without me . it is dangerous and you could get hurt . next time , ask me first , ok ? " ben nodded and said , " ok , dad , i am sorry . i wo n't do it again . " dad carried ben down the ladder and put him on the ground . he kissed him and said , " i love you , ben . you are my son and i am proud of you . but please be careful and listen to lily . she is your sister and she cares for you . "

