he gave them the ball and walked away with the dog . lily and ben thanked him and played with the ball . they learned to be careful and polite with animals . anna and ben were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw an elderly lady sitting on a bench . she had a big bag with her and a small dog on a leash .

