they wished they had never tried to talk to the lady . they wished they had stayed away from her . they wished they had never gone to the park that day . sara was a big sister . she had a baby brother named tom . sara loved tom very much , but sometimes she was jealous . she wanted to play with mom and dad , but they were busy with tom .

