sara and ben hugged the lady and said they were sorry . the lady hugged them back and said they were very kind . she gave them a candy and said goodbye . sara and ben waved and thanked her . then they pulled each other in the wagon and had more fun . anna loves pandas . she has a big panda toy that she hugs every night . she calls him pandy . pandy is soft and black and white . he has a smile on his face .

