they hugged their mom and went to the kitchen . they enjoyed their cookies and milk . they were happy . they learned to return their toys to their places and keep the living room organized . sara was a charming girl who liked to speak to everyone . she had many friends at her school and at her home . she also liked to play with her toys , especially her black cat , luna .

