he decided to look for fluffy and apologize . he hoped fluffy would forgive him and play with him . he learned that being kind and sharing is better than being mean and greedy . he learned that being different is not bad . he learned that everyone needs a friend . lily and tom were best friends . they liked to play with trains . lily had a big train that made steam . tom had a small train that did not make steam .

