they played with their trains happily . they did not care about the boy 's train anymore . they were happy with their own trains . they were best friends . lily liked to use her crayons to draw pictures . she had many colors , but her favorite was peach . she liked how it looked like the fruit she ate with her mom . one day , she wanted to draw a peach on a big paper . she looked for her peach crayon , but she could not find it . she asked her brother max if he had seen it .

