they smiled and hugged each other . they were happy and proud of their island . they played with sand until it was time to go home . ben and lily are twins . they like to play with their toys in their room . but today , mom says they have to help with the laundry . she gives them a big basket of dirty clothes and tells them to take it to the washing machine .

