they held hands and ran to their ship . they sailed away , singing and laughing . they were the best pirates ever . sam and jen were best friends . they liked to play in the park with their toys . sam had a red car that could zoom very fast . jen had a pink bike that she could jog on . they had fun racing each other and making noises .

