sam and jen learned a lesson . they said sorry to the dog and gave him a bone . the dog wagged his tail and licked their faces . he was happy and friendly . they played with him and their toys . they zoomed and jogged together , but not too fast or loud . they had fun and were safe . anna and ben were playing with paper and scissors . they wanted to make snowflakes and stars . anna cut many shapes and showed them to ben . " look , i made a big snowflake ! and a star with six points ! and a heart ! " she said .

