they worked together and smashed the lock with the rock . the cage opened and the other goose came out . the two geese hugged and thanked lily and tom .

" you are welcome , " lily said . " we are happy to help . "

the geese gave lily and tom their red ribbons as a gift . then they flew away , honking happily . lily and tom smiled and waved goodbye . they were proud of their plan and their kindness . lily was a shy girl who liked to play with puzzles . she had many puzzles with animals , cars , and flowers . she could solve them very fast and make nice pictures .

