" bye , bye , squirrel ! " lily and ben said . they were happy . they went back to the cabin and cleaned up the mess . then they had their picnic and played with their toys . they had fun in the woods . ben and lily liked to play with their toys in their room . they had many toys , but their favorite ones were the blocks . they could make many things with the blocks , like houses , cars , and animals . they had a big shelf where they kept their blocks and other toys .

