they play with spot and the man . they run and throw a ball . they make a new friend . they are very glad . sara and ben were playing in the living room . they liked to pretend they were grown - ups . sara found an empty ashtray on the table . she thought it was a hat . she put it on her head and said , " look at me , ben ! i 'm a princess ! "

