sara and ben smiled . they loved mom and dad . they were happy . they learned a lesson . they went to play with their toys . they did not raise any more trouble . lily was a daughter who loved flowers . she liked to smell them , touch them , and look at their colors . she had a garden with many flowers , but her favorite was the rose . she waited for the rose to bloom every spring .

one day , she saw a bud on the rose . she was very happy and ran to tell her mom . " mom , mom , look ! the rose is going to bloom soon ! " she said . her mom smiled and hugged her . " that 's wonderful , lily . the rose is a very delicate flower . you have to be gentle with it and give it water and sun . "

