one morning , she woke up and ran to the garden . she gasped when she saw the rose . it had bloomed ! it was a beautiful pink color , with soft and smooth petals . it smelled sweet and fresh . lily was so happy , she clapped her hands and danced around . " you did it , rose ! you bloomed ! you are the most beautiful flower in the world ! " she said .

the rose seemed to smile at her . it whispered in her ear , " thank you , lily . you are the best friend a flower could have . you helped me bloom with your love and care . you are the most beautiful daughter in the world . " lily hugged the rose gently and kissed it . she felt the rose hug her back and kiss her . they were both very happy . tom is a curious cat . he likes to explore new places and find new things . one day , he sees a big box in the living room . he wonders what is inside . he jumps on the box and sniffs it . he hears a soft sound . he scratches the box and makes a hole . he peeks inside .

