tom and max become friends . they play together and share their toys . they cuddle and nap together . they hope to stay together forever . they are happy . jen and ben were twins who liked to play in the attic . they found many old things there , like hats and books and toys . one day , they saw a big chest in the corner . it was covered with dust and had a lock on it .

