they never told anyone about their icy secret . but sometimes , they would go back to the attic and play with the ice things again . they wondered who made them and why they were in the chest . but they never found out . they just enjoyed their magic . lila and ben love to play in the park . they like to slide , swing and run . but their favorite thing is the zip line . the zip line is a long rope with a seat . you sit on the seat and hold the rope . then you go very fast from one side to the other .

