they put the toy lizard back on the rock and went with their mom and dad to look for a real lizard in the garden . they learned that lizards were not so bad after all . they had fun and forgot about the beetle . anna and ben are playing with their toys in the living room . they have a lot of fun making noises with their cars , dolls and blocks . they zoom , beep , bang and chatter as they pretend to be drivers , doctors and builders .

