" a magic box ? that sounds wonderful ! " mom said . she smiled and gave them a hug . she wondered who left the box under the tree . mia and sam liked to play on the beach . they liked to make sand castles and look for shells . one day , they saw something shiny and pink in the water . it looked like a flower .

