they shrugged and followed mommy . they said sorry to the neighbor and gave him the rest of the pears . they went to their room and cried . they wished they had never seen the pears . they wished they had listened to lily . they wished mommy was not angry . they wished they could play again . lily liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she wanted to be a good cook like her mom . today , they were going to make soup for lunch . mom said they needed to prepare some vegetables first .

mom gave lily a big knife and a cutting board . she showed lily how to cut the celery into small pieces . lily was careful with the knife . she liked the sound of the knife on the board . she liked the smell of the celery . she felt proud of her work .

