they take turns spinning the top and watching it . they laugh and cheer . they are happy with their present . they thank their grandma and hug each other . they play with the top until it is time for dinner . lily and tom were adventurous kids . they liked to explore the world and find new things . one day , they saw a big hole in the ground . they wondered what was inside .

