they both continued to play and repeat , " meow " . they could not stop and became the best of friends for life . once upon a time , there was a normal deer . the deer went outside to play in the sun and look for something to do . the deer went to a nearby field and the field included lots of things the deer could play with . the deer saw some horses , cows , and sheep . it also saw some squirrels and birds . the deer had a great time playing in the field with the animals . it even made some new friends . the deer spent the whole day in the field , playing and having fun with its new animal friends . when the day was done , the deer went home feeling happy and content . it could not wait to come back and play with its friends again . the end . one day bob decided to perform an experiment . he opened a small chamber and examined what was inside . to his surprise , he found lots of broken bits lying inside . using these broken pieces , bob decided to perform a test . he put the broken bits and pieces together and , slowly but surely , he began to put them back together again . after several attempts , bob was pleased to discover a perfect functioning chamber ! bob was so proud of his work that he showed it off to his friends . they were amazed by his clever experiment ! once upon a time there was a boy named tommy . tommy was three years old and he loved to whistle . one day after his dinner , tommy grabbed his dirty plate and whistled a happy tune . he went out into the garden and sat under the apple tree .

