the end . once there was a chubby bee who liked to zoom . he zoomed around his garden all day long , looking for places to explore . one day , he noticed a vase sitting on the ledge of the garden wall . he was very curious , so he zipped over to have a closer look . the glass was shiny and there were lots of pretty flowers inside . he wanted to see the flowers better , so he zoomed around to the other side and touched the vase . suddenly , it tipped over , and the flowers and water spilled out ! he quickly buzzed away , worried that he had made a mess . but then he heard a voiceâ€”it was his momma ! she said , " do n't worry , my little bee . we can fix it . " and so they did , with a little help from momma . after all the flowers were back in the vase , they both admired it and then the chubby bee continued to zoom around the garden . the end . once upon a time there was an cool dragon . it loved to explore and fly around the world . one day it came across a peaceful village and decided to settle there . it made its home in a cave near the village . everyone was very excited to have a dragon living close by !

