the mom and dad worked hard and showed each other how much they loved each other . even though sometimes they still got angry , they kept trying to talk and understand and found peace in their marriage . the end . once upon a time , a little raven flew from its nest in search of something special . after flying for a while , the raven spotted a bright lake . as it perched on a nearby tree , it heard the most beautiful music coming from the lake .

