the little raven and the girl became great friends . they both enjoyed each others company and the music the girl played . the little raven looked forward to hearing the girl 's music each and every day . once upon a time there was a girl who loved cocoa . every day , she would go for a walk , and if she found a cocoa tree , she 'd shake it to see if any cocoa beans would fall down .

