" we did not mean to make a mess , " tom said .

mom shook her head . she pointed at the green fruit . " do you know what this is ? "

lily and tom shook their heads .

" this is a lime , " mom said . " it is not for eating . it is for cooking or making drinks . you wasted a lot of good fruit . and you ruined the rug . you are in big trouble . "

lily and tom felt bad . they wished they did not play with the fruit . they wished they did not push the lime . they wished they listened to mom . they said they were sorry . but mom was still angry . she sent them to their rooms . they could not play anymore . they could not have any more fruit . they had a bad ending . lily and ben were playing in the park after the rain . they liked to jump in the puddles and splash each other . they saw a big puddle that looked like a mirror . they ran to it and gazed at their faces .

" look , i have a big nose ! " lily said , making a funny face .

