anna and ben nod . they say sorry to each other and hug . they decide to play nicely and share their toys . mom is happy and proud of them . she joins them in the garden and helps them make a cake for the party . tom was a very intelligent boy . he liked to read books and learn new things . he also liked to play with his dog , spot . spot was a good friend and a loyal pet .

one day , tom and spot went to the park . they saw many flowers and trees and birds . they also saw a big pond with ducks and frogs . tom wanted to feed the ducks some bread . he took out a slice from his bag and tore it into pieces .

