they ran to the garden and played ball . they forgot about the bowl and the stones . they were happy . lily liked to watch the sun rise every morning . she would wake up early and go to the window . she would see the sky change from dark to light . she would see the sun peek out from behind the hills . she would see the birds fly and sing . she felt a lot of wonder in her heart .

one morning , lily wanted to see the sun rise closer . she put on her shoes and coat . she opened the door and went outside . she walked up the hill behind her house . she walked and walked until she was very tired . she was strong and brave .

when she reached the top of the hill , she saw the sun rise in front of her . it was big and bright and warm . it made the grass and the flowers and the trees glow . it made lily smile and laugh . she felt happy and proud . she had seen the sun rise closer . she had done something new and amazing . she felt more wonder in her heart . sara and ben like to play with copper . copper is a shiny metal that they find in the park . they make rings and bracelets and necklaces with copper . they think copper is unique and pretty .

one day , they meet a new friend in the park . his name is leo . leo sees their copper jewelry and says , " wow , what is that ? can i play with you ? "

