her kind mother saw the clever girl 's worry and explained that sometimes during our lives we face difficult situations , but it is important to remember that even when things become difficult we should never give up .

the clever girl took her mother 's advice and used a tiny bit of glue to secure the gem back into the bracelet . after some time , she had her bracelet just as beautiful and perfect as it was before .

the clever little girl learnt that although she might not be able to fix all of her problems , there were still ways she could tackle them . from this experience she learnt that life sometimes can be tricky , but we should always do our best to try and find a way to fix the situation . once upon a time , two little boys were playing in the park . the oldest boy , vito , was so stubborn . he always wanted to do things his way .

