but there was a nosy duck in the park . he saw lily and sam having fun . he wanted to join them . he followed them to the merry - go - round and the swing . he quacked and pecked and tried to get on . lily and sam did not like the nosy duck . he was rude and annoying . they told him to go away .

the nosy duck did not listen . he kept bothering them . he made them angry and sad . mom saw the nosy duck . she shooed him away . she gave lily and sam some bread . they fed the nice ducks in the pond . they forgot about the nosy duck . they were happy again . they hugged mom and thanked her . they went home after a nice day at the park . lily was a little girl who liked to touch soft things . she had a toy sheep that was made of wool . she loved to hug it and feel its fluffy wool on her face . she called it baa - baa .

one day , lily went to the farm with her mom and dad . she saw many real sheep in the field . they were white and black and brown . they made loud noises . lily wanted to touch them too . she thought they would be like baa - baa .

she ran away from her mom and dad and climbed over the fence . she ran towards the sheep . the sheep saw her and got scared . they ran away from her . lily chased them . she did not see the big dog that was guarding the sheep . the dog saw her and got angry . he thought she was a bad person who wanted to hurt the sheep . he barked and ran towards her .

lily heard the dog and turned around . she saw his big teeth and his angry eyes . she was very scared . she tried to run back to the fence , but the dog was faster . he bit her leg and made her fall . she cried and screamed . she dropped baa - baa on the ground .

her mom and dad heard her and ran to help her . they saw the dog and the sheep and lily . they shouted at the dog and scared him away . they picked up lily and baa - baa and took them to the car . they drove to the hospital . lily had a big wound on her leg . she needed stitches and medicine . she was very hurt and very sad . she hugged baa - baa and wished she never touched the real sheep . she was very sleepy and very sorry . lily and ben were twins who liked to help their mom bake pies . one day , mom made a big apple pie and put it on the table to cool . she told lily and ben not to touch the pie until it was ready .

but lily and ben were very hungry and curious . they wanted to taste the pie . they waited until mom went to the garden and then they tiptoed to the table . lily reached for the pie and lifted it with both hands . it was heavy and hot .

" be careful , lily ! " ben whispered . " do n't drop the pie ! "

but lily was not careful . she lost her balance and the pie slipped from her hands . it fell on the floor with a loud thud . the pie broke into pieces and made a big mess .

" oh no ! " lily cried . " we dropped the pie ! "

mom heard the noise and came back to the kitchen . she saw the pie on the floor and lily and ben with sad faces .

" what happened here ? " mom asked .

" we 're sorry , mom , " lily and ben said . " we wanted to try the pie and we dropped it . "

mom was not happy , but she was not angry either . she hugged lily and ben and said , " it 's okay , my lively twins . i know you did n't mean to drop the pie . but next time , please listen to me and wait until the pie is cool . now let 's clean up this mess and make a new pie together . " lily loved to paint . she had many colors and brushes and papers . she liked to paint flowers and animals and rainbows . but she did not have much space to paint in her room . her room was small and shared with her brother . her brother did not like to paint . he liked to play with cars and balls and make noise .

one day , lily found a door in the hallway . she opened the door and saw stairs . she climbed the stairs and found a big room . it was the attic . the attic had many old things and dust and cobwebs . but it also had a window and a lot of space . lily thought it was a perfect place to paint .

she brought her colors and brushes and papers to the attic . she set them on a table and started to paint . she painted a big sun and a blue sky and a green field . she was very happy . she did not hear her mother calling her for lunch .

her mother looked for her in the house . she did not find her in her room or in the kitchen or in the living room . she asked her brother if he knew where she was . he said he did not know . he did not care . he was busy playing with his cars and balls .

her mother opened the door in the hallway and saw the stairs . she climbed the stairs and found lily in the attic . she saw her paintings and smiled . they were very beautiful . but she also saw the dust and the cobwebs and the old things . she was worried .

" lily , what are you doing here ? " she asked .

" i 'm painting , mommy . look , i made a sun and a sky and a field . do you like them ? " lily said .

" they are very nice , lily . but you should not be in the attic . it is not safe . there are many things that can hurt you or make you sick . and you missed your lunch . you must be hungry . " her mother said .

" i 'm sorry , mommy . i did not know . i just wanted to paint . i did not have space in my room . and my brother did not let me paint . he was noisy and mean . " lily said .

her mother hugged her and said , " i understand , lily . you have a wonderful talent and you should paint . but you should also be careful and listen to me . and you should be kind to your brother . he may not like to paint , but he is your brother and he loves you . maybe you can teach him how to paint . or maybe you can find another place to paint . how about the backyard ? it has a lot of space and light and fresh air . and you can see the real sun and sky and field . "

lily liked the idea . she said , " thank you , mommy . you are right . i will be careful and listen to you . and i will be kind to my brother . and i will paint in the backyard . can we go now ? "

her mother nodded and said , " yes , we can go now . but first , let 's clean up the attic and have some lunch . and then , you can paint as much as you want . "

lily smiled and said , " ok , mommy . i love you . "

her mother smiled and said , " i love you too , lily . "

the moral value of the story is : be careful and listen to your parents . be kind to your siblings . follow your passion and creativity . sara and ben like to play with their bikes . they ride fast and have fun . one day , sara 's bike has a problem . her tire is flat . she is sad and does not want to play .

ben sees sara 's flat tire . he wants to help her . he remembers that his dad has a pump in the garage . he says to sara , " do n't be sad . i can solve your problem . come with me . "

they go to the garage and find the pump . ben shows sara how to use it . he puts the pump on the tire and pushes the handle . the tire gets bigger and bigger . sara is happy and says , " thank you , ben . you are a good friend . "

they go back to the yard and ride their bikes again . they are careful not to ride on sharp things . they know that the tire is fragile and can break easily . they enjoy their bikes and have fun . lily and ben are twins . they like to play together . they are playful and happy . they have many toys and games .

one day , mom makes lunch for them . she puts broccoli on their plates . lily and ben do not like broccoli . they make faces and say , " yuck ! we do not want broccoli ! "

mom says , " broccoli is good for you . it makes you strong and healthy . you should try it . you might like it . "

lily and ben shake their heads . they do not want to try it . they push their plates away . they want to play more .

mom says , " you can not play until you eat your broccoli . it is not nice to waste food . there are many children who do not have enough food . you should be thankful for what you have . "

lily and ben think about what mom says . they feel sorry for the children who do not have enough food . they do not want to be ungrateful . they decide to try the broccoli .

they take a small bite . they are surprised . the broccoli is not so bad . it is crunchy and green . it has a sweet and nutty taste . they take another bite . they start to like it .

they finish their broccoli . they smile at mom . they say , " thank you , mom . the broccoli was good . we are sorry we were fussy . we did not know we would like it . "

mom hugs them . she says , " you are welcome , my loves . i am proud of you . you learned something new today . you learned to try new things and to be thankful for what you have . that is a good lesson . "

lily and ben nod . they are happy . they learned a good lesson . they also learned to like broccoli . they ask mom if they can play now . mom says yes . they run to their toys and games . they are playful and happy . ben and jen are twins . they like to play in the park . but today , the sky is gloomy . it is dark and cold . ben and jen feel sad .

they see a big bin in the park . it is full of old things . ben and jen are curious . they want to see what is inside . they run to the bin and climb on it .

they find a ball , a hat , a book and a toy car . they are happy . they start to play with the old things . they throw the ball , wear the hat , read the book and drive the toy car .

but then , they hear a loud noise . it is a big truck . it is coming to the park . it is coming to take the bin away . ben and jen are scared . they do not want to go with the bin . they do not want to lose their old things .

they hurry to get off the bin . they grab their old things . they run to their mom . she is waiting for them on a bench . she is glad to see them . she hugs them and says , " what have you been doing ? "

ben and jen show her their old things . they tell her about the bin and the truck . they ask her if they can keep their old things . she smiles and says , " yes , you can . but you have to wash them first . they are dirty . "

ben and jen are happy . they thank their mom . they go home with their old things . they do not care about the gloomy sky . they have fun with their old things . they are happy twins . tom is a bald boy . he has no hair on his head . he likes to wear hats and scarves to keep warm . sometimes , other kids tease him and call him names . tom feels sad and lonely .

one day , tom goes to the park with his mom . he sees a big dog with brown fur and a wagging tail . the dog runs up to tom and licks his face . tom laughs and pets the dog . the dog 's owner is a nice lady . she says the dog 's name is max and he is very friendly .

tom asks his mom if he can play with max . his mom says yes , but he has to be careful and gentle . tom and max run and chase each other on the grass . they play fetch with a ball and tug with a rope . tom and max have fun and become friends .

when it is time to go home , tom says goodbye to max and the nice lady . he gives max a big hug and thanks him for playing . max barks and wags his tail . he gives tom a lick and a nudge . tom smiles and waves .

tom and his mom walk home . tom tells his mom how much he likes max and how he made him happy . his mom says she is glad and proud of him . she says he is a brave and kind boy . she gives him a kiss and a hug .

when they get home , tom goes to his room . he takes off his hat and scarf . he looks at his bald head in the mirror . he does not feel sad or lonely anymore . he feels loved and happy . he gets into his bed and pulls up his sheet . he closes his eyes and dreams of max . he hopes to see him again soon . lily liked to borrow books from the library . she had a task to read one book every week . she liked books with pictures and stories about animals and magic .

one day , she saw a book with a shiny cover and a big dragon on it . she wanted to borrow it , but it was not in the library . it was in the shop next to the library . the shop had a sign that said " books for sale " .

lily went inside the shop and asked the man if she could borrow the book . the man said no , she had to buy it . he said the book was not cheap , it was very expensive . he said it was a special book with a secret inside .

lily was sad . she did not have money to buy the book . she asked the man if he could make it cheaper . the man said no , he could not . he said the book was worth a lot of money .

lily left the shop and went back to the library . she looked for another book to borrow . she found one with a cute puppy on it . she liked puppies . she borrowed the book and went home . she read the book and liked it . she forgot about the book with the dragon . she was happy . lila and sam are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big slide . it looks like a palace . they want to go on the slide .

they run to the slide . they wait for their turn . lila goes first . she climbs up the steps . she sits on the slide . she slides down fast . she laughs . she likes the slide .

sam goes next . he climbs up the steps . he sits on the slide . he slides down fast . he shouts . he likes the slide too .

they go on the slide again and again . they have fun . they see a seesaw . they want to try the seesaw .

they run to the seesaw . they sit on each end . they push with their feet . they go up and down . they smile . they like the seesaw .

they try to balance on the seesaw . they want to make the seesaw stay still . they move their bodies . they try to be the same weight . they try hard . they balance on the seesaw . they clap . they are happy .

they hear a loud noise . they look around . they see a big truck . it is coming to the park . it has a sign . it says " new toys " . they wonder what toys are in the truck . they are curious .

they get off the seesaw . they run to the truck . they want to see the new toys . they hope they are fun . they hope they can play with them . they are excited . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play and laugh together . one day , they found a big box in the park . it was brown and had a hole on one side .

" what is in the box ? " lily asked .

" i do n't know . let 's see , " ben said .

he walked to the box and looked inside . he saw something furry and black . he smiled and had an idea .

" lily , i dare you to put your hand in the box , " he said .

lily was scared . she did not know what was in the box . she thought it might be a monster or a snake .

" no , i do n't want to , " she said .

" come on , it 's just a joke . do n't be a baby , " ben said .

he pushed her to the box and made her put her hand in the hole . lily screamed and pulled her hand out . she saw a big scratch on her finger . she started to cry .

ben laughed and said , " it 's only a cat . it was hungry and wanted to play . "

lily was angry and sad . she did not think it was funny . she ran away from ben and the box . she did not want to be his friend anymore .

ben felt bad . he did not mean to hurt lily . he wanted to say sorry and make her happy again . he looked in the box and saw the cat . it was hungry and lonely . he had an idea .

he took the cat out of the box and ran after lily . he found her sitting on a bench . he said , " lily , i 'm sorry . i was mean to you . i have a gift for you . look , it 's a cat . it 's cute and soft . do you want to keep it ? "

lily looked at the cat and saw its big eyes and fluffy tail . she liked the cat . she forgot about the scratch and the joke . she smiled and said , " yes , i want to keep it . thank you , ben . you are my friend again . "

ben was happy . he hugged lily and the cat . they played and laughed together . they named the cat box . they took it home and gave it food and water . they loved box and box loved them . they were best friends . lily and sam are twins . they like to play with trains . they have many trains and tracks in their room . they make a big station with bridges and tunnels .

one day , they want to go to the real station . they ask their mom to take them . mom says yes , but they have to be good and hold her hand . they are very happy and put on their coats and shoes .

they walk to the bus stop and wait for the bus . the bus is big and noisy . it has many people inside . lily and sam sit next to the window and look outside . they see cars , trees , shops and dogs . they talk to each other and point at things .

" look , sam , a red car ! "

" look , lily , a big dog ! "

they are having fun .

the bus stops at the station . mom says they have to get off . they follow her and get off the bus . they see many trains at the station . some are fast and some are slow . some are long and some are short . some are loud and some are quiet . they hear whistles and horns and bells .

" wow , so many trains ! " lily says .

" can we ride one ? " sam asks .

mom says they can , but they have to find the right one . she looks at the signs and the tickets . she says they have to go to platform 5 . they walk to platform 5 and wait for their train .

they are tired from walking and waiting . they sit on a bench and rest . they see their train coming . it is blue and white . it has many windows and doors . it stops at the platform and opens its doors .

mom says they have to get on . they stand up and hold her hand . they get on the train and find their seats . they put their coats and shoes in the rack . they sit next to the window and look outside .

the train starts to move . it goes faster and faster . it leaves the station and goes to the countryside . they see fields , cows , sheep and horses . they see rivers , bridges , hills and trees . they see the sun and the clouds and the sky .

they are happy and excited . they talk to each other and point at things .

" look , sam , a cow ! "

" look , lily , a bridge ! "

they are having fun . sara and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big house on the hill . it has many windows and a big gate .

" wow , that house is rich ! " sara says . " i hope we can go there and see what is inside . "

ben nods . he wants to see the rich house too . he points to the gate . " look , there is a button . maybe we can push it and the gate will open . "

sara and ben run to the gate . they push the button . they hear a loud sound . the gate does not open . a voice says , " who is there ? go away ! "

sara and ben are scared . they run away from the gate . they go back to the park . they play with their toys . they forget about the rich house .

they are happy . they do not need a rich house . they have each other . lily had a big bear that she loved very much . she hugged him every night and took him everywhere . one day , she went to the park with her mom and her bear . she saw some other kids playing with a ball and wanted to join them .

she asked her mom if she could play with the ball , and her mom said yes . she left her bear on a bench and ran to the kids . she had fun kicking the ball and laughing with them . she forgot about her bear for a while .

then , she heard a loud bark . she turned around and saw a big dog running towards her bear . the dog grabbed the bear in his mouth and shook him . lily was scared and sad . she yelled at the dog to stop . she ran to the bench and tried to get her bear back .

the dog did not listen . he ran away with the bear . lily chased him , but he was too fast . she cried and cried . she wanted her bear back . she felt very embarrassed . she thought the other kids would laugh at her .

her mom saw what happened and hugged her . she said she was sorry and that they would find the dog and get the bear back . she said she loved her and that it was not her fault . she said she was brave and kind . she said she could play with the ball again if she wanted .

lily felt a little better . she wiped her tears and smiled . she thanked her mom and said she loved her too . she said she still wanted to play with the ball , but she would cover her bear with her jacket next time . she said she hoped the dog would not hurt her bear . she said she missed him very much . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play with toys , draw pictures and read books . one day , lily saw a big frame in ben 's room . it had a shiny photo of ben and his family .

" wow , what is that ? " lily asked .

" that is my frame . my grandma gave it to me . she is very rich . she lives in a big house with a lot of things . she said this frame is very special and i should keep it safe , " ben said .

lily felt sad . she did not have a frame like that . she did not have a grandma who was rich . she lived in a small house with her mom and dad . they did not have a lot of things . she wished she had a frame like ben .

" can i touch it ? " lily asked .

" no , you ca n't . it is mine . you might break it or make it dirty . go play with something else , " ben said .

lily felt hurt . she did not like how ben talked to her . she thought he was not a good friend . she went to her room and cried .

later , ben felt sorry . he did not mean to make lily cry . he remembered that lily was his best friend . he liked to play with her and share his toys . he did not care if she had a frame or not . he cared if she was happy or not .

he went to lily 's room and knocked on the door .

" lily , can i come in ? " ben asked .

lily opened the door . she saw ben holding his frame .

" what do you want ? " lily asked .

" i want to say i am sorry . i was not nice to you . i want to share my frame with you . you can touch it and look at it . it is not as special as our friendship , " ben said .

lily smiled . she felt happy . she hugged ben and thanked him . she looked at his frame and said it was very pretty . she said she liked his family .

they went back to ben 's room and played with toys , drew pictures and read books . they felt glad . they learned that being rich is not about having things . it is about having friends . tom was a boy who liked to play with his toys . he had a big truck , a red ball , and a teddy bear . he loved his teddy bear the most . it was soft and brown and had a funny mustache . tom liked to pretend that his teddy bear was his friend and they would talk and laugh together .

one day , tom 's mom said they had to go to the store . she said tom could bring one toy with him . tom thought hard . he wanted to bring his truck , but it was too big . he wanted to bring his ball , but it might roll away . he decided to bring his teddy bear . he hugged it and said , " you are my best friend . i will never leave you . "

tom and his mom went to the store . it was very busy and loud . tom held his mom 's hand and his teddy bear tight . he saw many things in the store . he saw candy , books , and clothes . he saw other kids with their toys . he saw a man with a big mustache . he looked like his teddy bear . tom smiled and waved at him . the man smiled and waved back .

tom and his mom got what they needed and went to the checkout . tom put his teddy bear on the counter . he wanted to show it to the lady who worked there . he thought she would like it . he said , " this is my teddy bear . he is soft and brown and has a funny mustache . he is my best friend . "

the lady smiled and said , " he is very cute . i like his mustache . it looks like mine . " she pointed to her face . she had a small mustache too . tom was surprised . he did not know that ladies could have mustaches . he looked at his mom . she did not have one . he looked at the lady again . he did not understand .

the lady saw tom 's face . she said , " do n't worry , sweetie . some ladies have mustaches and some do n't . it 's okay . it 's just how we are . it does n't change who we are inside . we are still nice and kind and friendly . just like your teddy bear . "

tom thought about what the lady said . he looked at his teddy bear . he looked at the lady . he looked at his mom . he nodded . he said , " i understand . you are nice and kind and friendly . just like my teddy bear . thank you for liking him . he likes you too . "

the lady gave tom his teddy bear back . she said , " you 're welcome . you are a very smart and sweet boy . have a nice day . " she gave him a sticker . it had a picture of a teddy bear with a mustache . tom smiled . he said , " thank you . you have a nice day too . " he put the sticker on his teddy bear . he hugged it and said , " you are my best friend . i will never leave you . " tom and lily liked to play with tools . they had a big box of tools that their dad gave them . they had hammers , saws , screws , nails , and more . they liked to pretend they were builders and make things with the tools .

one day , they decided to make a house for their toys . they found some wood and cardboard in the garage and started to cut and hammer . they had a lot of fun , but they also made a lot of noise .

their mom heard the noise and came to see what they were doing . she saw the mess they made and was not happy . she said , " stop , stop , stop ! you ca n't play with tools in the garage . you can hurt yourself or break something . and look at this mess ! you have to clean it up right now ! "

tom and lily felt sad . they did not want to stop playing . they did not want to clean up . they said , " but mom , we are making a house for our toys . we are almost done . please let us finish . "

their mom shook her head . she said , " no , you have to stop now . you can play with tools another time , but not in the garage . and you have to clean up your mess . it 's not fair to leave it for someone else . come on , i 'll help you . "

tom and lily sighed . they knew their mom was right . they put their tools back in the box and started to pick up the wood and cardboard . they were very tired from playing . they hoped they could finish their house another day . they said , " sorry , mom . we love you . " tom and anna were twins who liked to play together . one day , they saw a big box in the living room . it had a sign that said " prize for the best listener " . they wondered what was inside the box . it looked mysterious and exciting .

tom wanted to open the box right away . he did not listen to his mom , who told him to wait until she came back . he pulled the box and tried to rip the tape . anna told him to stop . she listened to her mom and wanted to follow the rules . she said they should be patient and respectful .

but tom did not listen to anna either . he kept pulling and ripping until he opened the box . he was disappointed when he saw what was inside . it was a pile of books and puzzles . he did not like books and puzzles . he liked toys and games . he threw the books and puzzles on the floor and said they were boring .

anna was sad and angry . she liked books and puzzles . she wanted to share them with tom and have fun . she said he was selfish and rude . she picked up the books and puzzles and put them back in the box . she said he did not deserve the prize .

then their mom came back . she saw what tom had done and was very upset . she said he was naughty and did not listen . she said he had to go to his room and think about his actions . she said he could not play with the prize or anything else until he said sorry .

she also saw what anna had done and was very proud . she said she was good and did listen . she said she could keep the prize and play with it as much as she wanted . she said she was a great listener and a great sister .

tom felt sorry and ashamed . he realized he had made a mistake . he wished he had listened to his mom and anna . he learned that listening is important and respectful . he went to anna and said sorry . he asked if he could play with her and the prize . anna forgave him and said yes . they hugged and smiled . they learned that listening is a prize in itself . tim and lily were best friends . they liked to play outside every day . they had a big tree house in the backyard . it was their secret place .

one day , they decided to watch the sunset from the tree house . they climbed up the ladder and sat on the floor . they looked at the sky . it was orange and pink and purple . it was very pretty .

" wow , look at the sunset ! " tim said . " it is like a painting . "

" yes , it is beautiful , " lily agreed . " i wish we could stay here forever . "

they smiled at each other . they were happy .

but then , they heard a loud noise . it was a big storm . it came very fast . the wind was strong . the rain was heavy . the thunder was scary .

" oh no , what do we do ? " lily asked . she was afraid .

" do n't worry , i have an idea , " tim said . he was dependable . he always had a plan . " we can cover ourselves with this blanket . it will keep us dry and warm . "

he grabbed the blanket from the corner and wrapped it around them . they hugged each other . they hoped the storm would go away soon .

but the storm did not go away . it got worse . the wind shook the tree house . the rain leaked through the roof . the thunder cracked the sky .

the blanket was not enough . it was wet and cold . they were still afraid .

" help , help ! " they cried . but no one heard them . no one came to save them .

the storm was too strong . it broke the tree house . it fell to the ground . it crushed tim and lily .

they never saw the sunset again . they never played outside again . they never smiled again .

they were gone . sara liked to pick daisies in the park . she liked their white and yellow colors and their soft petals . she made a chain of daisies and put it on her head . she felt happy and pretty .

but then she saw a big bee on a daisy . she wanted to touch it , because it looked fuzzy and cute . she reached out her hand and tried to pet the bee . but the bee did not like that . it was scared and angry . it had a sharp sting on its back . it used its sting to hurt sara 's finger .

sara felt a big pain in her finger . she cried out loud and dropped the daisy chain . she ran to her mom , who was sitting on a bench . she showed her mom her finger , which was red and swollen . her mom hugged her and said , " i 'm sorry , honey . the bee stung you . it was not nice . but it will get better soon . let me put some ice on it . "

sara felt upset and sad . she did not like the bee or the sting . she did not want to pick daisies anymore . she wanted to go home and play with her toys . her mom said , " it 's okay , sara . you can still like daisies . they are beautiful and friendly . the bee was just scared and tried to protect itself . it did not mean to hurt you . maybe next time , you can look at the bee from far away , and not touch it . then it will not sting you . "

sara nodded and wiped her tears . she felt a little better . she said , " okay , mom . i will be careful next time . can we go home now ? " her mom said , " yes , we can . but first , let me give you a kiss and a band - aid for your finger . and you can keep your daisy chain . it still looks lovely on you . " sara smiled and said , " thank you , mom . i love you . " her mom said , " i love you too , sara . " they held hands and walked to the car . sara still liked daisies , but she did not like bees . she learned a new word : sharp . lila was a princess who liked to explore . she did not like to wear dresses or crowns . she liked to wear pants and boots . she liked to climb trees and run in the grass . she was different from the other princesses .

one day , she went to the forest with her dog , spot . she saw a big castle . she wanted to see inside . she told spot to wait for her . she climbed over the wall and sneaked into the castle . she saw many rooms and halls . she saw paintings and statues . she saw a big throne .

