the elephant saw them and was angry . it swung its long nose and hit the car . mom and dad were scared . they shouted at lily and ben to come back . lily and ben were scared too . they ran back to the car . but the elephant was faster . it reached out its long nose and pinched ben 's leg . ben cried out . it hurt a lot .

