but no one heard them . they were too far in the hole . they were stuck . they were scared . they were sorry . lila and ben were playing with snow in the park . they made a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . lila wanted to be the bossy player . she told ben what to do and how to make the snowman . ben did not like that . he wanted to have fun and make his own snowman .

