one day , ben went out with his friends . he left the motorcycle in the garage . tom saw it and felt curious . he went to the garage and climbed on the motorcycle . he pushed a button and the motorcycle started . it made a very loud noise and moved fast . tom was frightened . he did not know how to stop it . he crashed into a wall and fell off . the motorcycle was broken and tom was hurt .

