the spider saw tom and his toy car . it wanted to play too . it crawled towards them very quick . it thought the car was a friend . it wanted to touch it and say hello . but tom did not want the spider to touch his car . he wanted the spider to go away . he shouted , " no , no , spider ! go away ! leave my car alone ! "

tom looked around for help . he saw his mom in the kitchen . she was making a cake . she was tall and kind . she always helped tom when he was scared . tom crawled to his mom as fast as he could . he dragged his car with him . he said , " mom , mom , help me ! there is a spider on the floor ! it is big and scary ! it wants to play with my car ! "

