mom took a cup and a paper and gently caught the spider . she carried it to the door and let it go in the garden . she said , " bye bye , spider . have fun outside . be nice to other animals . " then she went back to tom and gave him a slice of cake . she said , " you are very brave , tom . you did a good job . i am proud of you . now , let 's enjoy your cake and play with your car . do you want to share it with me ? "

