lily and ben smile and keep looking at the sky . they see many different shapes and colors . they have fun guessing and imagining . they love the sky and the clouds . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the park . they liked to go on the slide , the seesaw and the swing . but sometimes ben was mean to lily and teased her . he said she was too slow , too small and too scared . he made her feel sad and hurt .

