lily and ben hugged and smiled . they learned a lesson that day . they learned that teasing and being mean is not fun and can hurt others . they learned that being kind and sharing is fun and can make others happy . they learned that friendship is a precious thing that needs respect and care . they learned that they can be better friends if they treat each other the way they want to be treated . lily liked to skip . she skipped in the park , she skipped in the garden , she skipped in the house . she skipped when she was happy , she skipped when she was sad , she skipped when she was bored . she skipped all the time .

one day , lily skipped to the lake . she saw the water , the fish , the ducks , the flowers . she thought it was very pretty and peaceful . she wanted to skip on the water , like the ducks . she took off her shoes and socks , and ran to the edge of the lake .

but the water was not like the ground . it was wet and cold and deep . lily could not skip on the water . she fell in the water . she was scared and cold and wet . she could not breathe . she needed oxygen . she tried to scream , but no one heard her .

then , she felt something grab her hand . it was her big brother , sam . he had seen her fall in the water . he jumped in the water , and pulled her out . he hugged her and rubbed her back . he gave her oxygen . he told her it was okay . he told her not to skip on the water . he told her he loved her .

lily was happy and grateful . she hugged her brother and said sorry . she said she loved him too . she learned her lesson . she never skipped on the water again . she only skipped on the ground , where it was safe and dry . she still liked to skip , but she was more careful . she was glad she had her brother to save her . he was her hero . tom and sue are husband and wife . they live in a small house with a big garden . they like to grow flowers and vegetables in the garden . sometimes they share their vegetables with their neighbors .

