sue refuses to listen to tom . she says , " i do n't care . i like my book more than your salad . go away and leave me alone . "

tom is sad . he does not like to fight with sue . he loves his wife . he decides to eat the salad by himself . he hopes that sue will change her mind and join him later . he thinks that maybe she needs some time to calm down . he wishes that they could be happy again . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to travel with her family . one day , they went to the beach and lily saw a yellow ice - cream truck . she said , " mommy , daddy , can we have ice - cream ? " they said yes and lily was very happy .

lily ran to the ice - cream truck and said to the man , " i want a yellow ice - cream , please . " the man smiled and gave her a big scoop of yellow ice - cream . lily said , " thank you ! " and ran back to her parents .

they all sat down and ate their ice - cream . lily said , " this is the best day ever ! i love to travel and eat ice - cream . " her parents smiled and said they loved it too . they all had a great day at the beach and lily went to bed dreaming of her yellow ice - cream . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily who loved to jump on her bed . she would jump and jump until she got tired and then she would lay down on her cushion and rest . one day , lily 's mom told her that she had to stop jumping on the bed because it was not safe .

lily insisted that she could still jump on the bed and be safe . her mom was very polite , but she said no again . lily was sad , but she listened to her mom and stopped jumping on the bed .

later that day , lily 's mom surprised her with a new trampoline . lily was so happy ! she could jump and jump as much as she wanted , but now it was safe . she thanked her mom and hugged her tight . from that day on , lily loved to jump on her trampoline and rest on her soft cushion . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a big jar of jelly that she loved to eat . one day , her mom told her to be obedient and clean up her toys .

lily replied , " okay , mommy . i will clean up my toys . " she obediently picked up all her toys and put them away .

after she finished , lily asked her mom if they could print out some pictures . her mom said yes and they went to the computer to print pictures of animals .

while they were printing , lily 's little brother came in and asked for some jelly . lily shared her jelly with her brother and they happily ate it together while looking at their animal pictures .

the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the park . one day , she saw a big yellow goose walking in the grass .

lily wanted to say hello to the goose , so she took a step closer . the goose looked at her with its big eyes and lily felt a little scared .

but then , the goose started to waddle away . lily took another step and followed the goose . she watched it until it disappeared into the trees .

lily was happy to see the yellow goose and she went home with a smile on her face . from that day on , she would always look for the yellow goose whenever she went to the park . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . timmy loved to play with his toys and run around outside . one day , timmy went to the store with his mommy . while they were there , timmy saw a big sack of candy . he asked his mommy if he could have some , but she said no .

timmy felt sad and did n't understand why he could n't have any candy . he started to cry , but then his mommy told him to be quiet and enjoy the silence . timmy did n't know what silence meant , but he stopped crying and listened to the quiet sounds around him .

as they left the store , timmy saw a man who was acting mean to his dog . timmy thought the man was ignorant for not being nice to his pet . he wanted to help the dog , but his mommy told him they had to go home . timmy went home feeling sad about the dog , but happy to have learned some new words like sack , silence , and ignorant . one day , a little girl named lily was playing outside her house . she loved to play with her toys and sing songs . suddenly , she heard a loud sound . " what 's that noise ? " she asked her mom . " it 's thunder , lily , " her mom replied .

lily was scared of thunder , but her mom hugged her and said , " do n't worry , thunder ca n't hurt you . it 's just a big noise . " they went inside and watched the rain pouring down from the window .

later that day , lily 's favorite toy car disappeared . she looked for it everywhere , but it was nowhere to be found . " where did my car go ? " lily asked her mom . " i do n't know , lily . maybe it ran away , " her mom teased .

