later that day , timmy 's family went to the beach . timmy and his sister were building a sandcastle when a big wave came and separated them . timmy felt scared , but he remembered what he did for the little girl at the pool . he looked for his sister until he found her and they hugged . timmy felt proud that he could help his sister . once upon a time , there was a little boy who loved to play outside in the snow . he liked to slide down a big hill using his sled . one day , he saw a shiny pole sticking out of the ground . the boy thought it would be fun to slide down the pole , so he tried it . but the pole was icy and slippery , and he fell down and hurt himself .

