lily was very excited and began to mix all the ingredients together . she poured the batter into the pan and put it in the oven . but when she turned on the oven , she heard a loud noise . it was the fan inside the oven ! it was so heavy that it made a loud noise .

lily was scared and did n't know what to do . but then , she remembered what her mom had told her . " if you ever get scared or nervous , just take a deep breath and keep going . " so , lily took a deep breath and waited patiently for the cake to bake . when it was done , she took it out of the oven and it was perfect !

lily learned that even when things seem scary or heavy , if she just keeps going and believes in herself , she can do anything she sets her mind to . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy loved to play with his toys and run around outside . one day , timmy 's mom came in and said , " timmy , i need you to clean up your toys . it 's your job to keep your room clean . "

