as she was eating her ice - cream , a boy came up to her and said , " can i ride on the slide with you ? " lily said , " sure ! " they went up the stairs together and slid down the slide . they laughed and had so much fun together .

when it was time to go home , lily said goodbye to the boy and thanked him for riding with her . she hugged her mommy and said , " today was the best day ever ! " lily liked to organize her toys . she had a big box for her dolls , a small box for her cars , and a bag for her blocks . she liked to make everything neat and pretty .

one day , she found a pair of scissors in her mom 's drawer . she thought they looked shiny and fun . she wondered what she could do with them . she had an idea . she took the scissors and went to her room .

