mom hears sara 's cry and comes to see what is wrong . she sees sara holding the ring and the stuck drawer . she is not angry , but she is worried . she asks sara to give her the ring and helps her open the drawer . she explains to sara that the ring is very special and expensive and that she should not play with it without asking . she also tells sara that some jewelry can pinch her skin or hurt her ears if she wears them too long .

