they held hands and walked through the snow . they hoped to see their snowman soon . they hoped the helicopter would find them too . lily liked to climb . she climbed on chairs , on beds , on tables . she climbed on everything she could find . but her mom said no . she said climbing was dangerous . she said lily could fall and hurt herself . she said lily had to be gentle and careful .

