they hear their mom coming . they hide the violin under the bed . they hope she will not find out . they say , " we are sorry . we love each other . we will not fight again . " lily was a spoiled girl who always got what she wanted . she had many toys , dresses , and candies , but she was never happy . she always wanted more and more , and she did not like to share with anyone .

one day , she saw a boy wearing a cap that she liked . it was red and blue , and it had a star on it . she wanted that cap for herself , so she ran to the boy and tried to grab it from his head . the boy was surprised and angry , and he shouted at lily to leave him alone .

lily did not listen , and she pulled harder on the cap . the boy pulled back , and they started to fight over the cap . they made a lot of noise , and soon a teacher came to see what was wrong . she saw lily and the boy tugging on the cap , and she scolded them both .

she told lily that she was being rude and selfish , and that she should apologize to the boy . she told the boy that he should be more careful with his things , and that he should forgive lily . she took the cap from them , and said that she would keep it until the end of the day .

lily was very mad , and she did not want to say sorry . she wanted the cap , and she wanted it now . she waited until the teacher was not looking , and she tried to escape from the classroom . she sneaked to the teacher 's desk , and reached for the cap . but she was not fast enough , and the teacher saw her .

the teacher caught lily , and she was very disappointed . she told lily that she was not only spoiled , but also dishonest and naughty . she said that lily had to stay in the corner for the rest of the day , and that she would not get the cap at all . she also said that she would call lily 's parents , and tell them what she had done .

lily felt ashamed and sad , and she wished she had not been so greedy . she realized that the cap was not worth losing her friends and her teacher 's trust . she learned a hard lesson , and she hoped that she could do better next time . lila and ben were playing in the sand by the sea . they made a big castle with shells and sticks . they were very happy and proud of their castle .

