they closed their eyes and rested . they felt warm and cozy and happy . they dreamed of their castle and the sea . they knew mommy would always take care of them . lily and ben were twins who loved to paint . they had many colors and brushes and papers to make pictures . one day , they wanted to make a surprise for their mom . they decided to paint a big card with flowers and hearts and write " we love you , mom " on it .

