their mom gasped and clapped her hands . " oh , wow ! this is the most fancy and beautiful card i have ever seen ! thank you so much , lily and ben ! you are the best painters and the best twins in the world ! i love you , too ! " she said .

she kissed them and hugged them and put the card on the wall . lily and ben were very happy . they had made their mom happy with their surprise . they decided to paint more cards for their dad and their grandma and their friends . they loved to paint and they loved to make surprises . anna and ben were going on vacation with mom and dad . they were very happy . they packed their bags and got in the car . they drove for a long time until they reached a big house near the sea .

