they grabbed their towels and buckets and went to the beach . they had a lot of fun . they forgot about the scary man in the painting . they enjoyed their vacation . ben and mia are friends . they like to play with toys in the playroom . ben has many cars and trucks . mia has many dolls and dresses . they share their toys and have fun .

