they hug and make up . they pick up the broken toys and the rest . they organize them again . they play together and have fun . anna and ben are friends . they like to play together . one day , they go to the movie with anna 's mom . the movie is about a dog and a boy . the dog and the boy have many adventures . anna and ben like the movie .

