they look at the screen . the boy is still crying . the dog is still lost .

anna and ben sigh . they wish the movie was different . they wish the dog and the boy were happy . they wish they were home . tim and sue like to play with the ball in the park . they take turns to kick the ball and run after it . they have fun and laugh a lot .

one day , a big dog comes to the park . the dog sees the ball and wants to play too . he runs to the ball and grabs it with his mouth . he shakes it and makes it wet .

