sue follows tim and the dog . she is not afraid of the dog . she thinks he is lively and cute . she calls to the dog and says , " hi , doggy ! do you want to play with us ? you can have the ball if you give it back . "

the dog hears sue and stops . he looks at her and wags his tail . he drops the ball and runs to sue . he licks her face and barks . he likes sue and wants to be her friend .

tim comes to sue and the dog . he is not angry anymore . he sees that the dog is friendly and happy . he says , " sorry , doggy . i did n't mean to yell at you . you can play with us if you want . "

the dog barks again and nods his head . he picks up the ball and gives it to tim . he waits for tim to kick the ball and then chases it . tim and sue join him and they all play together . they have more fun and laugh more . sara and ben were playing with blocks . they wanted to make a big tower . they put many blocks on top of each other . but the tower was not strong . it fell down and the blocks were broken .

