they laughed and walked to the zoo entrance . they were ready for a fun adventure . sara liked to play with her tablet . it had a screen that showed many colorful things . she could watch cartoons , draw pictures , and learn new words . she always had fun with her tablet .

one day , her mom said , " sara , it 's time to put away your tablet . we have to go to the park and meet your friends . "

sara did not want to go . she wanted to play more with her tablet . she said , " no , mom , i want to stay here . i like my tablet . "

her mom said , " sara , you can play with your tablet later . but now you have to go to the park . remember , you like the park too . you can swing , slide , and run with your friends . and you can see the flowers , the birds , and the sky . they are also colorful and beautiful . "

sara thought for a moment . she remembered that she liked the park too . she remembered that she had fun with her friends . she remembered that she liked the flowers , the birds , and the sky . she said , " okay , mom , i will go to the park . but can i bring my tablet with me ? "

her mom said , " yes , you can bring your tablet with you . but you have to put it in your backpack and only use it when we get back home . deal ? "

sara said , " deal . " she put her tablet in her backpack and went to the park with her mom . she had a good time with her friends . she saw many colorful things . she was happy . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a big hill with some rocks and grass . they wanted to climb the hill and see what was on the other side .

" come on , lily , let 's go up the hill ! " tom said .

" ok , tom , but be careful . there might be bugs or thorns or something , " lily said .

they started to climb the hill , holding hands . they saw some flowers and some birds and some ants . they were having fun . but then , they heard a hiss . they looked down and saw a long , thin , green thing on the ground . it had a forked tongue and sharp teeth . it was a snake !

" tom , look , a snake ! " lily screamed .

