" i do n't know , lily , i 'm scared too , " tom said .

they wished they had never climbed the hill . they wished they had stayed on the slide . they wished someone would help them .

then , they heard a bark . they saw a big , brown , furry thing running towards them . it had a wet nose and a wagging tail . it was a dog !

the dog saw the snake and barked louder . it ran faster and jumped on the snake . the snake tried to bite the dog , but the dog was too quick and strong . the dog bit the snake and shook it . the snake let go and slithered away .

the dog licked tom and lily and wagged its tail . tom and lily hugged the dog and thanked it .

