" yes , he 's a good dog . we love him . thank you , mister . thank you , dog , " lily said .

the man smiled and put the leash on the dog . he said goodbye to tom and lily and walked away . tom and lily waved to them and ran back to the slide . they decided to never climb the hill again . they decided to always play with the dog . they decided that the dog was their best friend . tom loved to go to the park with his mom . he liked to see the birds , the flowers , the trees and the pond . he was very enthusiastic about nature . he always brought his binoculars , his sketchbook and his bread crumbs .

one day , he saw a big cage near the pond . he ran to see what was inside . he saw four ducks with orange beaks and green heads . they looked sad and scared . he asked his mom why they were in the cage . she said they were hurt and the park people were helping them . she said they would release them soon , when they were better .

tom wanted to help the ducks . he asked his mom if he could give them some bread crumbs . she said yes , but he had to be gentle and quiet . he opened the cage door a little and threw some bread crumbs inside . the ducks came closer and ate them . they quacked softly and looked at tom . tom smiled and felt happy .

but he did not close the cage door well . he did not hear the click . he did not see the wind push it open . he did not notice the ducks walk out of the cage . he was too busy drawing them in his sketchbook .

when he finished his drawing , he looked up and saw the ducks were gone . he saw them in the pond , swimming and splashing . he saw them fly away , high in the sky . he felt sad and happy at the same time . he showed his mom his drawing . she said it was beautiful . she said the ducks were free and happy . she said he helped them . she said he was a good boy . she hugged him and kissed him . he hugged her and kissed her . he was very enthusiastic about nature . tom and lily were twins who liked to travel . they had a big suitcase that was square and had wheels . they put their clothes and toys inside and zipped it up . they were going to visit their grandma who lived far away .

they went to the airport with their mom and dad . they had to wait in a long line to check their suitcase . tom and lily were bored and hungry . they saw a candy shop and wanted to buy some sweets . they asked their mom and dad , but they said no . they said they had to save their money for the trip .

tom and lily were unhappy . they decided to sneak away from their mom and dad and go to the candy shop . they took some coins from their dad 's pocket and ran to the shop . they bought a lot of candy and ate it all . they felt sick and uncomfortable .

they did not notice that their mom and dad were looking for them . they did not hear the loudspeaker that called their names . they did not see that their suitcase was taken away by a man who worked at the airport . they did not know that their plane was leaving soon .

when they finished their candy , they went back to the line . but they could not find their mom and dad . they could not find their suitcase . they could not find their plane . they were scared and alone . they cried and cried .

they learned a hard lesson . they should have listened to their mom and dad . they should have stayed with them . they should have been careful with their money . they should have been happy with what they had . they should not have been greedy and sneaky . they lost their chance to travel and see their grandma . they lost their suitcase and their toys . they lost their mom and dad . they were very sorry . tim and lily were playing pirates in the garden . they had a big box that was their ship , and a flag with a skull on it . they also had some coins and jewels that they pretended were treasure .

