she ran to her room and got her diary and crayons . she put them in a backpack and hung it on the car . then she got in the car and drove to the living room , where she had a mat that looked like a park .

she parked the car on the mat and got out . she opened her backpack and took out her diary and crayons . she looked around and saw many colorful flowers on the mat . she picked one that was pink and smelled nice .

she opened her diary and drew the flower on a page . she wrote " pink flower " under the drawing . she was very proud of her work . she showed it to her car .

