anna smiled and hugged her car . she was happy to have such a fun and kind friend . she decided to draw more flowers and fill her diary with beautiful things . tom and sue were friends who liked to play with toys . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big tank that could make noises and move . they would pretend to be soldiers and have battles with the tank .

one day , tom wanted to play with the tank , but sue said no . she said it was her turn and she would not share . tom was angry and sad . he tried to take the tank from sue , but she held it tight . they started to fight and pull the tank .

they did not hear their mom come into the room . she saw them fighting and was very mad . she took the tank away from them and said they could not play with it anymore . she said they had to learn to share and be nice to each other .

tom and sue were miserable . they had lost their favorite toy and their mom was not happy with them . they wished they had not fought and shared the tank . they learned that being greedy and selfish only leads to trouble and sadness . sam and lily liked to help their mom bake cakes . they had a big mixer that could stir the flour , sugar , eggs and butter . mom said the mixer was heavy and they had to be careful with it .

one day , mom had to go to the store and left sam and lily alone in the kitchen . she told them not to touch the mixer or the oven . sam and lily nodded , but they were curious . they wanted to perform a show with the mixer and pretend they were chefs .

they put on aprons and hats and turned on the mixer . they added some water and food coloring to the bowl . the mixer made a loud noise and splashed the colorful liquid everywhere . sam and lily laughed and clapped .

" look , we made a rainbow cake ! " sam said .

" let 's put it in the oven and see what happens ! " lily said .

they lifted the mixer and tried to carry it to the oven . but the mixer was too heavy for them . they dropped it on the floor and it broke . the bowl cracked and the liquid spilled . the mixer stopped working and made a sad sound .

sam and lily were scared and sorry . they heard mom coming back and ran to hide under the table . mom saw the mess and the broken mixer and was angry and sad .

" who did this ? " she asked .

sam and lily came out and said they were sorry . they told mom they wanted to perform a show with the mixer and make a rainbow cake .

mom sighed and hugged them . she said they should not play with the mixer or the oven because they were dangerous . she said they had to help her clean up and buy a new mixer . she said she loved them but they had to listen to her .

sam and lily said they loved her too and they would listen to her . they helped her clean up and went to the store . they learned their lesson and never played with the mixer or the oven again . they still liked to help mom bake cakes , but only with her permission and supervision . mark was a boy who liked to act . he liked to make funny faces and voices and pretend to be different animals and people . he had a big box of costumes and props that he used for his shows . he liked to act for his mom and dad , his sister and brother , and his friends .

one day , he decided to act for his teacher and his classmates at school . he brought his box of costumes and props and asked his teacher if he could do a show for everyone . his teacher said yes , but he had to wait until after lunch . mark was very happy and grateful . he thanked his teacher and put his box in a corner .

after lunch , mark got his box and went to the front of the class . he put on a hat and a coat and said , " hello , i am a detective and i am going to solve a mystery . " he took out a magnifying glass and a notebook and started to look around the room . he said , " hmm , i see some clues . there is a red crayon on the floor , a cookie wrapper on the desk , and a wet spot on the rug . who did this mess ? "

he pointed his magnifying glass at different classmates and asked them questions . he said , " did you do this ? did you do this ? did you do this ? " some of the classmates laughed , but some of them felt scared and angry . they did not like mark accusing them of making a mess . they did not like mark acting like a detective .

one of the classmates , sam , got very mad . he did not like mark at all . he thought mark was silly and annoying . he wanted mark to stop acting and go away . he grabbed mark 's hat and coat and threw them on the floor . he said , " you are not a detective , you are a dummy . you are a bad actor and a bad friend . go away and leave us alone . "

mark felt very sad and hurt . he did not understand why sam was so mean to him . he did not mean to make anyone upset . he just wanted to act and have fun . he picked up his hat and coat and his box and ran out of the class . he cried and cried . he wished he never acted for his teacher and his classmates . he wished he never brought his box of costumes and props . he wished he never liked to act . he wished he had no friends . he wished he had no mark . sam and ben are friends . they like to play sport in the park . they kick a ball and run and jump . they have fun .

one day , sam feels sick . he has a cold . he sneezes a lot . he says to ben , " i ca n't play sport today . i need to rest . "

ben is sad . he wants to play with sam . he says , " i hope you get better soon . you are my best friend . "

sam smiles . he says , " thank you , ben . you are my best friend too . you are very cool . "

ben has an idea . he says , " i know what we can do . we can read a book together . i have a book about sport . it has pictures of cars and bikes and planes . do you want to see ? "

sam nods . he says , " yes , please . that sounds fun . i like cars and bikes and planes . they are fast and loud and cool . "

ben runs to his house and gets the book . he comes back to sam and they sit on the grass . they look at the book and talk about sport . they laugh and learn . they have fun . anna and ben were twins who liked to play in the garden . they had a dog named spot who was very obedient and followed them everywhere . one day , they found a shiny rock in the dirt . they wondered what it was and decided to show it to their mom .

" mom , look what we found ! " they said , running into the house with the rock .

mom smiled and took the rock from them . she looked at it closely and said , " this is a mineral , children . it is a part of the earth that has different colors and shapes . some minerals are very rare and valuable , and some are very common and useful . this one is called quartz , and it is very pretty . "

" wow , a mineral ! " anna and ben said , amazed . " can we keep it , mom ? "

" of course , you can keep it , but you have to share it and take good care of it . it is a gift from nature , and we should respect and appreciate it , " mom said .

anna and ben nodded and thanked their mom . they took the mineral back to the garden and put it in a special place . they played with it and showed it to spot , who wagged his tail and licked their faces . they had so much fun that they forgot about the time .

" children , it is getting late . time to go inside and get ready for bed , " mom called from the window .

anna and ben yawned and realized they were very tired . they picked up the mineral and ran to the house . they gave it to their mom and asked her to keep it safe for them . they hugged and kissed their mom and spot and went to their room . they brushed their teeth , put on their pajamas , and climbed into their beds .

" good night , anna . good night , ben . good night , spot . i love you all , " mom said , tucking them in .

" good night , mom . we love you too . and we love our mineral , " anna and ben said , smiling .

they closed their eyes and fell asleep , dreaming of the shiny rock and the wonderful world of minerals .

the moral of the story is : we should be curious and learn about the things around us , but we should also be grateful and respectful of the gifts of nature . we should also listen to our parents and be obedient when they tell us what to do . and we should always share and care for the things and the people we love . tom and mia were friends who liked to play near the lake . one day , they saw a boat on the water . it was big and white and had many windows . they wondered who was inside the boat .

" let 's go and see ! " tom said . he ran to the shore and waved at the boat . mia followed him , but she was a little scared .

" hello ! " tom shouted . " can we come on your boat ? "

a man came out of the boat . he had a long beard and a hat . he smiled at tom and mia .

" hello , little ones ! " he said . " do you want to see my boat ? it is very special . it can glow in the dark ! "

tom and mia were curious . they nodded and climbed on the boat . the man showed them around . he had a kitchen , a bedroom , a bathroom and a living room . he also had a lot of books and toys .

" wow ! " tom said . " this is amazing ! how does your boat glow ? "

the man winked at him . he said , " it is a secret . but i will show you tonight . do you want to stay for dinner ? i have some delicious soup and bread . "

