they ate the soup and bread with the man . he told them stories about his travels and adventures . he was very kind and funny . tom and mia liked him a lot .

when it was dark , the man said , " now , watch this ! " he pressed a button and the boat started to glow . it was blue and green and purple . it looked like a rainbow on the water .

