tom and mia said , " yes , please ! "

they snuggled in the bed and watched the boat glow . they felt happy and safe . they said , " good night , mr. boatman . thank you for everything . "

the man said , " good night , tom and mia . thank you for being my friends . " ben likes to play with his toy cars . he has many cars of different colors and sizes . he makes them zoom and crash on the floor . he likes to pretend he is a driver .

