tom and lily play with the snake and the duck . they are happy . they are friends . they like different toys . tim and sue like to play with balls . they have many balls of different colors and sizes . they like to throw them , catch them , kick them and roll them . sometimes they play with their friends in the park , and sometimes they play in their backyard .

one day , they decide to play a new game with their balls . they call it strike and strip . the game is easy and fun . they take turns to throw a ball at a big box . the box has many strips of paper taped on it . if they hit the box , they can take off one strip . if they miss , they have to wait for their next turn .

