they continue to play strike and strip until they run out of balls and strips . they have a lot of fun and laugh a lot . they like their new game very much . one day , sam and his mom went to the zoo . sam loved to see the animals , but he was afraid of some of them . he saw a big gray animal with a long nose and two enormous ears . it was an elephant .

