" those are tusks , sam . they are like big teeth that grow out of the elephant 's mouth . they are made of ivory , which is very hard and white . some elephants use them to dig or fight . but they are also very precious and some bad people want to take them away . that is why we have to protect the elephants , " mom explained .

sam felt sad for the elephants . he did not like bad people . he wanted the elephants to be happy and safe .

