" that is not an arm , sam . that is a leg . the elephant has four legs , just like a dog or a horse . but you can not hug the elephant , sam . it is too big and too far . and it might not like it . the elephant needs its space and respect . you can wave at it or talk to it , but you have to stay behind the fence , " mom explained .

sam nodded . he understood . he waved at the elephant and said hello . the elephant waved back with its trunk and made a loud noise . sam laughed . he liked the elephant . he thought it was enormous and amazing . ben and sam were friends . they liked to play with cars and balls . they lived in a big nation with many people . the people had different colors and languages . ben and sam did not care . they were happy .

one day , some bad men came to their nation . they had guns and bombs . they wanted to change the nation . they wanted everyone to be the same as them . they did not like people who were different . they hurt and killed many people . they made big fires and smoke . they made the nation sad and scared .

