the bad men came to the school . they kicked the doors and windows . they shouted and laughed . they looked for people to hurt . they found the teacher and the children . they pointed their guns at them . they asked them what color and language they were . the teacher said they were all children of the nation . she said they were all good and kind . she said they did not want to change . she said they wanted to live in peace .

the bad men did not listen . they did not care . they were angry and mean . they shot the teacher and the children . they did not leave anyone alive . they threw a bomb in the school . they made it explode . they made the school fall down . they made dust and ash . they made the nation cry and mourn .

