the bad men were not happy . they did not change the nation . they made it stronger and braver . they made it fight back and resist . they made it unite and love . they made it proud and free .

the bad men were ashamed . they knew they were wrong and evil . they knew they had no place in the nation . they knew they had no friends and hope . they knew they had no future and joy . they wished they were dead . tim likes to ride his motorcycle . it is red and shiny and makes a loud noise . he knows how to put on his helmet and gloves and start the engine . he likes to go fast and feel the wind on his face .

one day , he sees a big hill . he wants to go up the hill and see what is on the other side . he thinks it will be fun and exciting . he speeds up and zooms towards the hill .

but the hill is too steep and his motorcycle is too heavy . he tries to push harder , but his motorcycle goes slower and slower . he feels scared and sad . he thinks he will not make it to the top .

then he hears a voice . it is his dad . he is behind him on his own motorcycle . he says , " do n't worry , tim . i am here to help you . you can do it . just keep going . "

tim feels happy and brave . he listens to his dad and keeps going . his dad gives him a little push and his motorcycle goes faster . he reaches the top of the hill and sees a beautiful view . he smiles and hugs his dad . he says , " thank you , dad . you are the best . i love you . " sara had a big cut on her knee . it hurt a lot and she cried . mommy came and hugged her . she said , " do n't worry , sara . your cut will heal soon . you are very brave . "

mommy took sara to the bathroom . she put some water and shampoo on a soft cloth . she said , " this shampoo is harmless . it will not sting your cut . it will make it clean and help it heal faster . " she gently washed sara 's knee with the cloth . sara felt the shampoo tickle her skin . she smiled a little .

mommy dried sara 's knee with a towel . she put a band - aid on it . she said , " there , all done . now your cut is covered and protected . you can play again , but be careful not to hurt your knee again . " she kissed sara 's cheek .

sara said , " thank you , mommy . you are the best . i love you . " she hugged mommy . she felt better . she ran to her room to find her favorite toy . she was happy . her cut would heal soon . lily was playing with her dolls in her room . she liked to make them talk and have tea parties . she was happy and did not see the spider on the wall .

the spider was black and had eight legs . it was looking for a place to make a web . it saw lily and her dolls and was curious . it crawled closer to them .

lily heard a tiny noise and looked up . she saw the spider and was scared . she did not like spiders . she screamed and dropped her dolls . she ran to the door and called for her mom .

" mom , mom , there is a spider in my room ! help me , help me ! "

mom heard lily and came to her room . she saw the spider and was not scared . she knew it was not a bad spider . she picked up a cup and a paper and caught the spider .

" lily , it 's okay , do n't be afraid . the spider is not going to hurt you . it is just a little animal that likes to make webs . look , i have it in this cup . do you want to see it ? "

lily stopped crying and stared at the cup . she saw the spider moving inside . she was still scared , but also curious . she nodded and moved closer to mom .

mom showed lily the spider and told her some facts about it . she told her that spiders have eight eyes , that they can spin silk , and that they eat bugs . she asked lily if she wanted to keep the spider as a pet or let it go outside .

lily thought for a moment . she did not want to keep the spider as a pet . she did not like it very much . she wanted to let it go outside . she told mom her choice .

" okay , lily , that is very kind of you . let 's take the spider outside and find a nice spot for it . maybe it will make a beautiful web there . do you want to say goodbye to the spider ? "

lily nodded and said goodbye to the spider . she was not so scared anymore . she was brave and learned something new . she thanked mom for helping her and hugged her . she went back to her room and picked up her dolls . she was happy again . sara and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . they had many toys : cars , dolls , blocks , books , and more . they made a lot of noise and a big mess . they did not care about cleaning up .

mom came in and saw the messy living room . she was not happy . she said , " sara and ben , you have to store your toys now . it is time for dinner . and we have to make room for our guests . they are coming soon . they need a shelter for the night . their house was broken by the storm . "

