mom was firm . she said , " sara and ben , you have to be kind and share . the guests are our friends . they have no home right now . they are sad and scared . we have to help them . and you have to store your toys . it is the rule . if you do not store your toys , you will have no dessert . "

sara and ben did not like the rule . but they liked dessert . they decided to store their toys . they put them in boxes and baskets and shelves . they made the living room neat and tidy . mom was proud of them . she said , " thank you , sara and ben . you did a good job . now you can have dinner and dessert . and you can meet our guests . they are very nice . they have a boy and a girl , just like you . maybe you can play with them tomorrow . "

sara and ben were curious . they wanted to meet the guests . they hoped they would be nice . they hoped they would like their toys . they hoped they would have a shelter soon . they felt sorry for them . they said , " ok , mom , we will be kind and share . we will meet the guests . we will help them . we are sorry for being messy . " tom and lily are twins . they like to play with their toys and dress up . one day , they find a big box in the living room . it has a sticker that says " mail " . they are curious .

" who is this for ? " tom asks .

