they rip the tape and open the box . inside , they find a lot of clothes . there are shirts , pants , dresses , hats , and shoes . there is also a belt . it is brown and shiny .

" wow , look at all these clothes ! " tom says . " they are so pretty and cool ! "

" maybe they are from grandma and grandpa ! " lily says . " they always send us nice things ! "

they start to try on the clothes . they mix and match different colors and styles . they laugh and have fun .

tom puts on a blue shirt , a red hat , and the belt . he thinks he looks like a cowboy . he says " yee - haw ! "

lily puts on a pink dress , a yellow scarf , and the belt . she thinks she looks like a princess . she says " how do i look ? "

they look at each other and giggle . they think they look funny and cute .

but then , mom comes in . she sees the mess and the open box . she is not happy .

