mom sighs . she is not very angry , but she is disappointed . she says " i know you like to play , but you have to ask before you touch things that are not yours . these clothes are for other kids who need them more than you . you have enough clothes in your closet . you should be grateful and share . "

tom and lily feel bad . they say " we are sorry , mom . we are grateful and share . we did not mean to be bad . "

