they hug mom and go to the car . they are happy again . they learned their lesson . they also learned that it is better to wear normal clothes than to wear clothes that are not theirs . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the snow . they have red and blue mittens . anna has red mittens and ben has blue mittens .

