tom and sue nodded . they liked cheese and crackers and grapes . they followed mom to the kitchen . they forgot about the truffle . they were happy . lily and tom were very happy . it was christmas eve and they wanted to decorate the tree . they had many shiny things to put on the tree : balls , stars , lights and candy canes . they liked candy canes a lot . they were sweet and red and white .

