when they came back from the store , tommy saw his little sister , lily , sitting on his bed . she was holding the envelope and the card . she looked at tommy with a guilty face and said , " i 'm sorry , tommy . i was curious . i wanted to see what grandma sent you . i did n't mean to take your coin . "

