a big car hits tim and sue . they fall on the ground . they bleed and cry . the car stops and the driver gets out . he is scared and sorry . he calls for help . but it is too late . tim and sue are dead . the end . one day , ben and lily went to the zoo with their mom . they saw many animals , like monkeys , elephants , and giraffes . but their favorite was the lion . the lion was big and strong , and had a long mane of hair . he was lying on a rock , looking bored .

