lily nodded and said , " thank you , teacher . i 'm sorry i made a mess . i wanted to be fast and helpful , but i got confused . "

the teacher smiled and said , " it 's okay , lily . you do n't have to be sorry . you are fast and helpful , and you are also brave and kind . sometimes we all get confused , but we can always ask for help or try again . that 's how we learn and grow . "

lily felt better and smiled back . she carried one book at a time and put it on the table . she saw that some of her friends were also carrying books and helping each other . she joined them and said , " can i help you ? " they said , " yes , please . thank you , lily . " lily felt happy and proud . she liked her class and her teacher . she liked to learn new things and play with her friends . lily and tom were friends . they liked to play in the forest . one day , they found a big bush with red berries . they were hungry and wanted to eat them .

" look , tom , berries ! " lily said . " let 's pick some and eat them . they look yummy . "

" ok , lily , but be careful . some berries are bad . they can make you sick . " tom said . he picked a berry and smelled it . it smelled sweet .

they ate some berries and felt happy . they had juice on their mouths and hands . they laughed and wiped their faces with leaves .

" let 's dance , tom . the berries make me want to dance . " lily said . she started to jump and spin around . she sang a silly song .

tom joined her . he danced with lily . he clapped his hands and made funny noises . they had fun .

but then , they heard a loud roar . it was a big bear . the bear was angry . he wanted the berries too . he saw lily and tom and ran towards them .

" run , lily , run ! it 's a bear ! he wants to eat us ! " tom shouted . he grabbed lily 's hand and pulled her away .

they ran as fast as they could . the bear was behind them . he was big and thick . he had sharp teeth and claws . he roared again .

lily and tom were scared . they looked for a place to hide . they saw a big tree with a hole . they ran to the tree and crawled inside . they hoped the bear would not find them .

they waited and waited . they heard the bear sniffing and growling . they hugged each other and whispered .

" are you ok , lily ? " tom asked .

" i 'm ok , tom . are you ok ? " lily asked .

" i 'm ok , lily . i 'm sorry we ate the berries . it was a bad idea . " tom said .

" it 's ok , tom . we did n't know . maybe the bear will go away soon . " lily said .

they prayed and wished . they wanted to go home . they wanted to be safe . they wanted to dance again . ben and lily were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a big ball in the yard . it was shiny and bouncy and had many colors . they both wanted to play with it , but they did not want to share .

" i saw it first ! " ben said .

" no , i did ! " lily said .

they pulled and tugged on the ball , trying to take it from each other . they did not listen to their mom , who told them to be nice and take turns . they were ignorant and selfish .

suddenly , the ball popped . it made a loud noise and split in two . the air came out and the ball became flat and sad . ben and lily looked at the broken ball and felt sorry . they had ruined their toy and made a mess .

they also saw their mom , who was angry and disappointed . she told them they were in trouble for fighting and not obeying . she took away the ball and sent them to their room . they had to sit on their beds and think about what they had done .

ben and lily felt bad . they wished they had shared the ball and played together . they learned their lesson and said sorry to each other and to their mom . they promised to be kind and respectful from then on . they hoped their mom would forgive them and give them another chance to play with the ball . one day , lily and her mom went to the veterinarian with their brown dog , max . max was sick and needed some medicine . lily loved max very much and wanted him to feel better .

when they got to the veterinarian , they saw many other animals . there were cats , birds , rabbits , and even a turtle . lily wanted to pet them all , but her mom told her to wait in the waiting room . " we have to be patient , lily . the veterinarian is very busy and will see us soon , " her mom said .

lily nodded , but she was bored . she looked around and saw a toy drum and a toy trumpet on a shelf . she had an idea . she grabbed the drum and the trumpet and gave them to her mom . " let 's play , mom . let 's march like soldiers , " she said .

her mom smiled and took the toys . she put the drum around her neck and the trumpet in her mouth . lily followed her and pretended to salute . they started to march around the waiting room , making loud noises . " boom , boom , boom ! toot , toot , toot ! " they shouted .

the other animals and people in the waiting room looked at them and laughed . they thought lily and her mom were very funny and cute . even max wagged his tail and barked . he felt a little better .

soon , the veterinarian came out and called their name . " lily and max , you 're next . come with me , please , " he said . lily and her mom stopped marching and followed him . they thanked the other animals and people for watching their show . they hoped max would get well soon . they were happy they had fun together . sam and lily were playing in the living room . they had many toys and books , but they wanted to do something new . they decided to pretend they were in a restaurant . sam was the waiter and lily was the customer .

" hello , welcome to sam 's cafe . what would you like to order ? " sam asked , holding a notepad and a pencil .

" i would like a big sandwich with cheese and ham , and a glass of milk , please , " lily said , looking at the menu .

" okay , one sandwich and one milk , coming right up ! " sam said , writing down the order . he went to the kitchen and made the sandwich with bread , cheese and ham . he poured some milk in a glass and put them on a tray .

he carried the tray back to the living room and put it on the table . he gave lily a napkin and a fork . " here you go , enjoy your meal ! " he said .

" thank you , sam . this looks yummy ! " lily said , taking a bite of the sandwich . she chewed and swallowed , but made a face . " ow , this is tough ! " she said , pointing to the ham .

sam looked at the ham and saw that it was hard and dry . he had forgotten to check the date on the package . it was old and bad . he felt sorry for lily . " i 'm sorry , lily . i gave you bad ham . do you want something else ? " he asked .

lily shook her head . she was not hungry anymore . she pushed the plate away . " no , thank you , sam . i do n't want anything else . i just want a cushion , " she said .

" a cushion ? why do you want a cushion ? " sam asked .

" because i want to hug it and lie down . my tummy hurts from the bad ham , " lily said , rubbing her belly .

sam felt very bad . he had made lily sick . he wanted to make her feel better . he ran to the sofa and grabbed a big , soft cushion . he brought it to lily and gave it to her . " here , lily . this is a cushion . you can hug it and lie down . i 'm sorry for the bad ham . i hope you feel better soon , " he said .

lily smiled and took the cushion . she hugged it and lay down on the couch . she felt a little better . she liked the cushion . it was warm and cozy . she closed her eyes and said , " thank you , sam . you are a good friend . i forgive you for the bad ham . maybe next time we can order something else . "

sam nodded and smiled . he was glad that lily was not angry with him . he was a good friend too . he sat next to her and patted her back . he said , " you 're welcome , lily . i 'm sorry for the bad ham . maybe next time we can order pizza or ice cream . they are not tough . they are yummy and good . "

they both laughed and cuddled with the cushion . they were happy and sleepy . they fell asleep on the couch , dreaming of pizza and ice cream . they had fun playing in the living room . they were good friends . the end . anna liked to play dress - up with her mom 's clothes . she would put on a big hat , a big coat , and big shoes . then she would stand in front of the mirror and pretend to be a grown - up . she would say things like , " hello , i am anna and i have a very important job . " or , " i am going to a fancy party with my friends . " she had a lot of fun .

one day , she found a big necklace in her mom 's drawer . it was shiny and colorful and had many beads . anna thought it was the most beautiful thing she ever saw . she wanted to wear it and show it to the mirror . she put it around her neck and ran to the mirror . but she did not see that the necklace was too long and got tangled in her feet .

as she reached the mirror , she tripped and fell . the necklace broke and the beads scattered all over the floor . anna was scared and sad . she started to cry . she thought her mom would be angry and not love her anymore .

she heard her mom coming up the stairs . she tried to hide under the bed , but it was too late . her mom saw the mess and the broken necklace . she came to anna and hugged her . she said , " do n't cry , my sweetie . i 'm not angry . i 'm sorry you got hurt . it was an accident . i can fix the necklace . i love you very much . "

anna felt better . she hugged her mom back and said , " i love you too , mom . i 'm sorry i broke your necklace . i wanted to be like you . you are so pretty and smart and nice . "

her mom smiled and said , " you are pretty and smart and nice too , anna . you do n't need to wear my clothes or my necklace to be like me . you are perfect just the way you are . " she kissed anna and helped her clean up the floor . then they played dress - up together with some other clothes and accessories that were not so big or fragile . they had a lot of fun . lila and sam love to go to the park with their mom . they like to feed the ducks and watch the swans . one day , they see a new swan in the pond . it is white and big and has a long neck .

" look , mom , a new swan ! " lila says .

" yes , it is beautiful , is n't it ? " mom says .

" can we feed it ? " sam asks .

" sure , but be careful . swans can be shy and sometimes bite , " mom says .

lila and sam take some bread from their bag and throw it to the pond . the new swan swims closer and eats the bread . it makes a soft sound and flaps its wings .

" hello , swan . what is your name ? " lila says .

the swan looks at lila and nods . it says , " my name is snowy . i am a traveler . i came from far away . "

" wow , you are a traveler ? where did you come from ? " sam says .

" i came from a place where it is very cold and snowy . i flew for many days and nights . i was tired and hungry . then i saw this pond and decided to rest here , " snowy says .

" that is amazing . you are very brave and strong , " lila says .

" thank you . you are very kind and friendly , " snowy says .

lila and sam smile . they like snowy . they ask him more questions about his journey and his home . snowy tells them stories and shows them how he can dive and splash in the water . he makes them laugh and wonder .

mom watches them and smiles too . she is happy that they have made a new friend . she thinks that snowy is a dependable swan . he is not shy or mean . he is polite and grateful . he shares his bread and his stories . he is a good swan .

lila and sam say goodbye to snowy and promise to come back soon . they hug him and thank him for his time . snowy hugs them back and thanks them for their food and their company . he says he will wait for them .

lila and sam wave to snowy as they leave the park . they are excited to see him again . they think that snowy is a wonderful swan . he is not just a traveler . he is a friend . tom and mia are friends . they like to play with toys . one day , tom has a new toy . it is a zebra . it is black and white and soft .

mia sees the zebra and wants to play with it . she asks tom , " can i play with your zebra , please ? "

tom says , " no , it is mine . you have your own toys . "

mia feels sad and angry . she thinks tom is not a good friend . she tries to take the zebra from tom . they pull and tug and shout .

" stop it ! " says mom . she comes and takes the zebra from them . she says , " you are both being difficult . sharing is caring . if you want to play with the zebra , you have to take turns . tom , you can give the zebra to mia for five minutes . then mia , you can give it back to tom for five minutes . do you understand ? "

tom and mia nod . they say , " sorry , mom . sorry , friend . " they hug and say , " thank you . " they play with the zebra and other toys . they have fun and are happy . they learn to share and be kind . lily and ben were playing with a ball in the park . they liked to kick the ball to each other and run after it . sometimes they kicked the ball too hard and it went far away .

one time , they kicked the ball so hard that it flew over the fence and landed in a pile of rags . lily and ben ran to the fence and looked for their ball . they saw a pale boy sitting on the rags . he was holding their ball .

" hey , that 's our ball ! " lily shouted . " give it back ! "

the pale boy looked at them and shook his head . he hugged the ball and said , " no , it 's mine now . i found it . it 's my only toy . "

lily and ben felt angry and sad . they wanted their ball back . they tried to climb the fence , but it was too high . they tried to talk to the boy , but he ignored them . they did n't know what to do .

then , lily had an idea . she said to ben , " maybe we can share the ball with him . maybe he is lonely and needs a friend . maybe he will let us play with him if we are nice . "

ben thought about it and nodded . he said , " ok , let 's try that . maybe he will be happy . "

lily and ben called to the boy and said , " hi , what 's your name ? we are lily and ben . we are sorry we shouted at you . we want to play with you . can we share the ball with you ? "

the pale boy looked at them and smiled . he said , " my name is sam . i live in the street . i do n't have any friends . i like the ball . it 's bright and bouncy . you can share it with me if you want . "

lily and ben smiled back . they said , " thank you , sam . we are happy to share it with you . do you want to play with us ? "

sam nodded and said , " yes , i do . thank you , lily and ben . you are nice . "

lily and ben climbed over the fence and joined sam on the rags . they kicked the ball to each other and had fun . they became friends and learned to share . they also learned that some people have less than them and need their help and kindness . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with books and toys . one day , they find a big book with many words . lily wants to open the book and read the words . ben wants to play with the toys and does not care about the book .

" please , ben , let me open the book , " lily says . " i want to see the words . maybe they are fun or funny or nice . "

" no , lily , i do n't want to open the book , " ben says . " i want to play with the toys . the book is boring and hard . you ca n't read the words . they are too big and too many . "

lily and ben start to fight . they pull the book from each other . they yell and cry . they are not friends anymore .

then , mom comes . she sees the book and the toys and the fight . she is not happy . she takes the book and the toys away . she says , " lily and ben , you are not nice . you are not sharing . you are not listening . you are not friends . you have to say sorry and hug and make up . "

lily and ben feel bad . they know mom is right . they look at each other . they say sorry and hug and make up . they are friends again .

mom smiles . she gives back the book and the toys . she says , " lily and ben , you are good . you are sharing . you are listening . you are friends . you can open the book and play with the toys . but you have to be careful and gentle . the book is old and special . it has many words . some words are fun or funny or nice . some words are wise or kind or true . the words can teach you and help you and make you happy . but you have to respect the words and the book . do you understand ? "

lily and ben nod . they understand . they say thank you to mom . they open the book and play with the toys . they are happy . they learn from the words and the book . they are friends . tom and sue were friends who lived in a big city . they liked to play in the park , but the park was very far from their homes . one day , they decided to take the bus to the park by themselves , without telling their moms .

they got on the bus and paid the driver with some coins they had saved . they sat on the seats and looked out the window . they saw many cars , buildings , and people . the city was very noisy and filthy . they did not like it .

" where is the park ? " sue asked tom .

" i do n't know , " tom said . " maybe we took the wrong bus . "

they started to feel scared and sad . they wished they had stayed home with their moms . they regretted their choice .

they saw a lady sitting next to them . she had a kind face and a big bag . she noticed their tears and asked them what was wrong .

" we want to go to the park , but we do n't know how , " tom said .

" oh , you poor things , " the lady said . " you should not go on the bus alone . it is not safe . where are your moms ? "

" we did n't tell them , " sue said .

" that was very naughty , " the lady said . " you should always tell your moms where you are going . they must be very worried about you . "

she took out her phone and called the bus driver . she told him to stop at the next station and wait for the police . she said she would help tom and sue find their moms .

tom and sue felt ashamed and sorry . they thanked the lady and hugged her . they hoped their moms would forgive them . they learned their lesson . they never went on the bus alone again . ben was a furry dog who liked to drive . he had a red car that he drove around the park . he liked to honk his horn and wave at the other animals . but some animals did not like ben 's driving . they thought he was too loud and too fast .

one day , ben saw a big hill in the park . he wanted to drive up the hill and see what was on the other side . he drove very fast and tried to climb the hill . but the hill was too steep and his car slid back down . ben tried again and again , but he could not reach the top . he was sad and angry .

then he saw a bird flying over the hill . the bird was blue and had a long tail . the bird saw ben and his car and flew down to him . the bird said , " hello , furry driver . why are you trying to drive up the hill ? "

ben said , " i want to see what is on the other side . but the hill is too hard . i ca n't do it . "

the bird said , " maybe you ca n't do it alone . but you can do it with a friend . i can help you . i can fly over the hill and tell you what is there . then you can decide if you want to go or not . "

ben liked the bird 's idea . he said , " thank you , bird . you are very kind . can you be my friend ? "

the bird said , " of course , furry driver . i can be your friend . friends help each other . come on , let 's go . "

the bird flew over the hill and came back . he told ben what he saw . he said , " there is a lake on the other side . the lake is blue and shiny . there are fish and frogs and ducks in the lake . there is a bridge over the lake . you can drive over the bridge and see the lake . "

ben was happy . he said , " that sounds wonderful . i want to see the lake . can you show me the way ? "

the bird said , " sure , furry driver . follow me . i will fly ahead and guide you . but you have to be careful . the hill is still steep and the bridge is narrow . you have to drive slowly and safely . "

ben said , " ok , bird . i will listen to you . you are a good friend . "

ben followed the bird and drove up the hill . he drove slowly and safely . he reached the top and saw the lake . it was beautiful . he drove over the bridge and saw the fish and frogs and ducks . he honked his horn and waved at them . they waved back and smiled . ben was happy . he had a new friend and a new place to explore .

the moral of the story is : sometimes you need a friend to help you achieve your goals . friends can offer support , advice , and encouragement . friends can also show you new things and make you happy . it is good to be friendly and make friends . tim and mia are at the beach with mom and dad . they like to play in the sand and look for shells . sometimes they go into the water , but not too far . the water is cold and makes big waves .

one day , they see a big boat on the water . it is white and has a flag . they hear a loud noise from the boat . it is a horn . the boat is saying hello .

" look , tim , a boat ! " mia says . " it is so big and powerful ! "

" let 's wave to the boat , mia ! " tim says . " maybe they will wave back ! "

they run to the edge of the water and lean forward . they wave their arms and shout . " hello , boat ! hello , boat ! "

the boat sees them and waves back . it has a big arm that moves up and down . it also makes the horn noise again . " hello , kids ! hello , kids ! "

tim and mia are happy . they feel like they have a new friend . they keep waving until the boat is far away . then they go back to their sand castle and smile . they had a fun day at the beach . lily and sam were playing a game . they had cards with animals on them . they had to match the cards with the same animals . lily had a lot of cards . sam had only a few cards .

