sam nodded . he was happy too . he liked lily . he liked playing games with her .

" yes , let 's play another game , " sam said . " maybe we can both win this time . " tim and mia were playing in the park . they liked to dig in the sand and make castles . they also liked to find pebbles and put them on their castles . pebbles were shiny and smooth and pretty .

but then , tim saw a big pebble that was not shiny or smooth or pretty . it was brown and sticky and smelly . it was a disgusting pebble . tim did not want it on his castle . he picked it up and threw it away .

but he did not see where it went . it flew in the air and landed on mia 's head . mia felt something wet and gross on her hair . she touched it and saw the disgusting pebble . she was very angry and sad .

she yelled at tim . " tim , you are mean ! you threw a disgusting pebble at me ! look at my hair ! it is dirty and stinky ! i do n't want to play with you anymore ! "

tim was sorry . he did not mean to hurt mia . he did not know the pebble was disgusting . he wanted to say sorry , but mia ran away . she cried and went to her mom .

tim felt bad . he wanted to make mia happy again . he looked for a nice pebble . he found one that was pink and shiny and smooth . he ran after mia and gave her the pebble . he said sorry .

mia looked at the pebble . it was a pretty pebble . she liked it . she looked at tim . he was sad . she felt sorry too . she said sorry .

they hugged and said they were friends . they went back to their castles and put the pretty pebble on them . they smiled and played . they forgot about the disgusting pebble . tom and sue were playing with their toys in the garden . they had a big box that they pretended was a spaceship . they put their dolls and cars inside and made noises like rockets and lasers .

" let 's go to the moon ! " tom said .

" ok , but we need to shrink first , " sue said . she had a magic wand that she found in the attic . she waved it at tom and said , " shrink , shrink , shrink ! "

tom felt a tickle and looked down . he was as small as a bug . he saw sue was small too . they climbed into the box and closed the lid .

" ready for blast off ! " sue said .

they pushed a button and the box shook . they felt like they were flying . they saw stars and planets through a hole in the box . they were having fun .

but then , something big and scary came out of the sky . it was a bird . it saw the box and thought it was food . it swooped down and grabbed the box with its beak .

tom and sue screamed . they felt a shock . the box broke and they fell out . they landed on the grass . they were still small .

they saw the bird fly away with the box . they were scared and sad . they lost their toys and their spaceship .

" help ! " tom cried .

" help ! " sue cried .

they heard a voice . it was mom . she was looking for them .

