the lady says , " of course , little girl . i will take you to him . but first , let me clean your knee . and let me fix your bike . it is not broken . it only needs some air . then you can ride it again . but remember , a bike is only a gift . a friend is a treasure . "

anna smiles . she says , " thank you , lady . you are very kind . i will remember . a bike is only a gift . a friend is a treasure . " she hugs the lady . then she rides her bike to ben 's house . she hopes he will forgive her . she hopes they can play together again . she hopes they can be friends forever . tom and lily are friends . they like to play with their toys in the garden . they have a lot of cute toys , like dolls , cars , balls and animals . they share their toys and have fun .

one day , a big dog comes into the garden . the dog is not mean , but he is curious . he sees the toys and wants to play with them . he runs to the toys and grabs one with his mouth . it is a car that tom likes very much .

