they climb down the tree , carefully and safely . they run to mom and dad and hug them . they sit on the bench and eat lunch . they share their stories and laugh . they are a happy family . tim and kim were twins who liked to play and eat . one day , their mom made soup for lunch . she told them to wait until the soup was cool , and then they could have some .

but tim and kim were very hungry and curious . they wanted to try the soup right away . they saw a big pot on the stove , and they decided to step on a chair and peek inside .

" wow , look at the soup ! " tim said . " it has carrots and potatoes and chicken . it smells good ! "

" let 's taste it ! " kim said . she grabbed a spoon and dipped it in the pot . but the soup was very hot , and it burned her tongue . she screamed and dropped the spoon .

the spoon made a loud noise , and the pot shook . the soup spilled over the edge , and it fell on tim and kim . they were covered in hot soup , and it hurt a lot . they cried and cried .

their mom heard the noise and ran to the kitchen . she saw tim and kim on the floor , with soup all over them . she was very angry and scared . she took them to the bathroom and washed them with cold water . then she put bandages on their burns .

" tim and kim , you were very naughty and foolish ! " she said . " you did not listen to me , and you touched the hot soup . you could have been hurt very badly . you are lucky it was not worse . you must never do that again . do you understand ? "

tim and kim nodded , and they said they were sorry . they felt very bad and ashamed . they learned their lesson . they never stepped on a chair and peeked in the pot again . they always waited until the soup was cool , and they thanked their mom for making it . they realized that soup was good , but not when it was weird and hot . anna and ben are friends . they like to play with toys and books . one day , they find a big zip on the wall . they want to see what is behind the zip .

