they learn a lesson . they learn to ask before they start . they learn to respect other people 's work . they learn to be gentle with things . and they learn to make a quilt with mom . lily was playing with her doll in her bedroom . she liked to dress her doll in pretty clothes and comb her hair . she pretended that her doll was her friend and they talked and laughed together .

but then , lily heard a loud noise from outside . she looked out of the window and saw a big truck . the truck was very noisy and scary . it made lily feel afraid . she dropped her doll and ran to the door .

