she and her doll played happily in her bedroom . the truck went away and the noise stopped . lily forgot about the truck and enjoyed her playtime . mama watched her and felt proud of her . she thought , " lily is a wonderful girl . i 'm glad that i can hug her and make her feel safe . " tom is a fat sheep who lives on a farm . he likes to eat grass and play with his friends . he has a lot of wool on his body , which keeps him warm and soft .

one day , a man comes to the farm with a big machine . he wants to cut the wool from the sheep and take it away . tom is scared of the machine . he does not want to lose his wool .

he runs away from the man and hides behind a tree . he sees his friend lily , a small sheep , who is also hiding . they talk to each other .

" tom , what are we going to do ? " lily asks . " the man will find us and cut our wool . "

" i do n't know , lily . i wish we could save our wool . it is ours , not his . " tom says .

" maybe we can trick him . maybe we can make him think we are not sheep . " lily says .

" how can we do that ? " tom asks .

lily looks around and sees a pile of hay . she has an idea .

" come on , tom . follow me . " she says .

she leads tom to the hay and tells him to roll in it . they cover themselves with hay and look like big balls . they stay very still and quiet .

the man comes to the tree and looks for the sheep . he does not see them . he only sees the hay . he thinks they ran away . he shrugs and leaves with his machine .

tom and lily peek out from the hay and smile . they saved their wool . they are happy . they shake off the hay and run back to their friends . they tell them their story and they all laugh . they are proud of tom and lily . they are brave sheep . ben and lily were playing knights and dragons in the garden . ben had a big shield made of cardboard and lily had a long scarf for a tail . they ran around the grass , pretending to fight and roar .

