" rrrr ! i am a fierce dragon and i will burn your castle with my fire ! " lily said , waving her scarf .

they had a lot of fun , but soon they got tired and thirsty . they decided to go inside and have some juice and cookies . they left their shield and scarf on the grass and went to the kitchen .

after they had their snack , they felt sleepy . they went to their bedroom and climbed into their beds . they cuddled with their teddy bears and closed their eyes .

but they did not know that someone was watching them from the window . it was a blue bird , who had seen their shield and scarf on the grass . the bird was curious and flew down to have a closer look . he pecked at the shield and the scarf , making holes and rips . he thought they were fun toys and he did not care if he ruined them .

when ben and lily woke up from their nap , they went back to the garden to play some more . but they were shocked to see what the bird had done to their shield and scarf . they were torn and dirty and had feathers stuck to them .

" who did this to our shield and scarf ? " ben asked , feeling sad and angry .

" it was a bad bird , a very bad bird ! " lily said , pointing at the blue bird , who was still sitting on a branch .

they wanted to chase the bird away , but he was too fast and flew away . they looked at their shield and scarf and felt like crying . they had worked hard to make them and they were their favorite things to play with .

but then they had an idea . they went to the garage and found some tape and paint . they fixed their shield and scarf , making them stronger and prettier . they painted them with different colors and patterns , making them look like new .

they were proud of their work and happy again . they went back to the garden and continued their game of knights and dragons . they did not care about the blue bird anymore . they had each other and their shield and scarf , and that was all they needed . sara loved to look at the sky and see the birds and the clouds . sometimes she saw a big plane that made a loud noise and left a white line behind it . she wondered where the plane was going and who was inside it .

one day , she saw a plane that looked different from the others . it was smaller and had a red and white color . it flew very low and close to her house . sara was curious and ran outside to get a better look . she waved at the plane and hoped that someone would wave back .

the plane saw sara and waved back . it was tom , a pilot who liked to fly his plane for fun . he was feeling lonely because he had no friends to fly with . he was happy to see sara and decided to fly around her house a few times . he made funny shapes with his plane , like a heart and a star . sara laughed and clapped her hands . she liked tom and his plane .

tom and sara became friends . they talked to each other with a radio that tom gave sara . they told each other stories and jokes and learned new things . sara learned about planes and tom learned about sara 's family and school . they made each other happy and less lonely .

the moral of the story is that friendship can appear in unexpected ways and make life more fun and colorful . tom and lily were playing in the park . they saw a big cage with a leopard inside . the leopard was sleeping on a dirty mat . it had yellow and black spots on its fur .

" wow , look at that leopard ! " tom said . " it is so big and strong ! "

" i wonder what it can do , " lily said . " can it run fast ? can it jump high ? can it roar loud ? "

tom had an idea . he wanted to have some fun . he said to lily , " i dare you to go near the cage and touch the leopard 's tail . i bet you are too scared to do it ! "

lily was not scared . she was brave . she said to tom , " i am not scared . i will do it . watch me ! "

she walked towards the cage . she reached out her hand . she touched the leopard 's tail . the leopard woke up . it opened its eyes . it saw lily . it was angry . it roared loud .

lily was scared . she ran away . she ran back to tom . she said , " that was not fun . that was scary . the leopard was angry . it roared loud . it almost bit me ! "

