lily nodded . she said , " i am okay . but i do n't want to play with the leopard anymore . let 's go and play with the swings . they are more fun and less scary . "

tom agreed . he said , " okay , let 's go and play with the swings . they are more fun and less scary . and next time , i will not dare you to do something silly . i will dare you to do something nice . "

they held hands . they walked to the swings . they played and laughed . they forgot about the leopard . they had fun . lily and max were going to a party at their friend 's house . they wanted to wear their fancy clothes , but they had a problem . lily 's dress had a zipper on the back , and max 's shirt had buttons on the front . they did not know how to close them by themselves .

they asked their mom for help , but she was busy in the kitchen . she said , " why do n't you ask your big sister , emma ? she can help you with your clothes . she is in her room . "

lily and max ran to emma 's room and knocked on the door . emma opened it and saw them holding their clothes . she smiled and said , " hi , little ones . what do you need ? "

" can you help us , please ? " lily said . " we want to wear our fancy clothes , but we do n't know how to close the zipper and the buttons . "

