" you 're welcome , lily and max , " emma said . " you look very fancy and cute . i recommend that you have fun at the party and be nice to your friend . " lily and max are playing with their gear toys . they have cars , trucks , trains and planes that can move with gears . lily likes the pink car and max likes the blue truck . they are having fun making them go fast and slow .

" look , lily , my truck can do a jump ! " max says . he pushes his truck hard and it flies over a ramp . lily claps and cheers .

