" thank you , max , you are a good friend . you are fair and kind , " lily says . she gives max a hug and they share their gear toys . they play together until it is time to go home . anna and ben liked to help mom in the kitchen . they put the dirty plates and cups in the dishwasher . mom said the dishwasher made them clean with hot water and soap .

one day , anna and ben found a big chocolate bar in the cupboard . they wanted to eat it , but mom said no . she said it was for later , for a special cake . she put the chocolate bar on the counter and told them not to touch it .

but anna and ben were very curious . they wanted to see the chocolate bar . they climbed on a chair and reached for it . it was soft and sticky . they broke a piece and tasted it . it was sweet and yummy .

" let 's put it in the dishwasher , " ben said . " maybe it will make it hard and shiny again . "

" okay , " anna said . they opened the dishwasher and put the chocolate bar inside . then they closed it and pressed the button .

they waited for a while . then they heard a beep . the dishwasher was done . they opened it and looked for the chocolate bar . but they could not find it . there was only a brown mess on the plates and cups .

" oh no , " anna said . " what did we do ? "

