they heard mom coming . they ran to their room and hid under the bed . they hoped mom would not see the dishwasher . they hoped she would not see the clear signs of their mischief . sara and ben were having dinner with their mom and dad . they ate chicken , rice , and peas . sara liked the chicken , but ben did not . he made a face and pushed his plate away .

