mom smiled and hugged him . sara and dad smiled too . they all enjoyed the cake and had a happy night . tom and jen like to play music . they have a band . tom plays the drum . jen plays the horn . they make loud sounds .

one day , they see a big truck . the truck has boxes . the boxes have their names . mom and dad say they have to move . they have a new home .

