the new home is big . it has a yard . it has a room for tom and jen . it has a room for their band . they see other kids . they say hello . they make new friends .

tom and jen are happy . they like their new home . they like their new friends . they like their band . they play music . they make loud sounds . lily and ben were playing in the park with their ball . they liked to kick the ball to each other and run after it . they were having fun and laughing .

but then , the sun started to go down and the sky became dark . lily and ben saw their shadows on the ground . they looked big and scary . lily and ben felt afraid .

