lily and ben said hello to the owner and spot . they played with them until it was time to go home . they had fun and made new friends . they learned that shadows and unknown noises are not always monsters . sometimes , they are just dogs . tim and sam were best friends . they liked to play in the park every day . they liked to swing on the swings , slide on the slides , and run on the grass . they always had fun together .

one day , tim saw a new swing in the park . it was big and shiny and had a long rope . tim wanted to try it . he ran to the swing and jumped on it . he pushed with his feet and swung high in the air . he felt happy and free .

