they walked to the nurse . they held hands . they were still best friends . they learned a lesson . they learned to be careful and to trust each other . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and books . one day , they find a big box in the attic . they open the box and see many things inside . they see clothes , hats , shoes , and photos .

