they talk to the photos and make funny noises . they have fun and forget about the time . they do not hear mom and dad calling them for lunch . they are happy in the attic with the photos . tom and lily were playing with matches . they liked to see the fire and the smoke . but they did not know that matches were dangerous . they did not listen to their mom , who told them to stay away from matches .

