they wave goodbye to the squirrel and go back to their home with max . they tell their mom about the new animal they saw in the park . she smiles and hugs them . she says they are very curious and brave . lily was a little lamb who liked to play in the field . she loved to nibble on the green grass and the soft hay . she had many friends , like ben the bunny and dot the duck . they would run and hop and quack together .

one day , lily saw a new animal in the field . it was big and brown and had long horns . lily was curious and wanted to say hello . she walked up to the animal and asked , " who are you ? "

