one day , sara sees a small brush on the floor . it is blue , her favorite color . she thinks the painter forgot it . she picks it up and feels the bristles . they are not sharp , they are soft . she wants to try it on the wall . she looks around and sees no one . she climbs on a chair and reaches for the wall .

