sara feels bad . she did not want to hurt the wall or herself . she did not want to make the painter mad . she says she is sorry and starts to cry . the painter sees her tears and softens . he says he is sorry too . he says he was worried about her . he says she can help him another way . he gives her a paper and some crayons . he says she can be a painter too , but on the paper , not on the wall .

