rex stopped and tilted his head . he did not understand . he was not a bad dog . he just wanted to play . he wagged his tail and walked slowly to the table . he sniffed the toys and licked them . he looked at anna and ben with his big eyes .

anna and ben peeked from behind the table . they saw rex was not angry . he was friendly . they felt sorry for rex . they came out from behind the table and hugged rex . they petted him and said sorry .

