rex wagged his tail and licked their faces . he was happy . he joined them on the carpet and played with their toys . he was the dragon , but a nice dragon . anna and ben were the princess and the knight , but they did not fight . they were friends .

the moral of the story is : do n't judge someone by their appearance . sometimes they are not what they seem . be kind and respectful to everyone , even if they are different . you can always make friends if you try . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big flag on a pole . the flag is red and white and blue . it has stars and stripes .

