" tom and mia , you are very creative . you have a lot of fun playing in the park . but there are no spies in the park . there are no secret cars or packages . the man you saw was not a spy . he was a taxi driver . he was waiting for a customer . he was whispering because he did not want to disturb the birds . he was doing his job , " their mom says .

