mom smiled too . she said , " you are welcome , anna . you are a good girl . you are a good sister . you are a good friend . you are not ordinary . you are special . " anna and ben are friends . they like to play with toys . anna has a toy phone . she pretends to call her mom and dad . ben has a toy car . he likes to make it go fast and loud .

one day , anna 's toy phone stops working . she pushes the buttons , but nothing happens . she feels sad . she shows her phone to ben .

