the lady says " you 're welcome . have a nice day . bye bye . " she walks away with the dog . the dog wags his tail . tom and anna wave goodbye . they go back to the slide . they slide down again . they laugh and whistle and say " whee " . they have fun . they are friends . the end . sara and ben were playing in the sand . they both had spades and buckets . they made a big castle with towers and walls . sara put a shell on top of her tower . ben put a feather on top of his tower .

