they played with the ball . they laughed and had fun . they were friendly . they shared . lily liked to play the piano . she wanted to be a musician when she grew up . she liked to make songs with her fingers and hear the sounds . she had a big piano book with many songs . she could play some of them , but not all .

one day , she saw a new song in the book . it had a picture of a star and a note that said " popular " . lily wanted to play the popular song . she looked at the notes and tried to play them . but the song was hard . she did not know some of the notes . she made many mistakes . she felt sad and angry .

she heard a voice behind her . it was her brother , ben . ben was older than lily . he liked to tease her and make her mad . he said , " lily , you are not a musician . you are a noise maker . you play the piano so bad . you make my ears hurt . you will never play the popular song . "

