lily and ben fell on the floor . they closed their eyes and did not move . they were dead . the ice cream killed them . the man in the truck was bad . he gave them bad ice cream . he did not care about them . he drove away and laughed . he was a bad man . sara and tom were playing with their dolls in the living room . sara had a new doll with a pretty dress and a shiny buckle on her belt . tom had an old doll with a torn shirt and a missing eye . he wanted to play with sara 's doll , but she said no .

