tom felt ashamed and lonely . he wished he had not taken sara 's doll . he wished he had been nice and shared . he wished he had a new doll with a pretty dress and a shiny buckle . he wished sara would forgive him . he went to his bed and cried . tom and anna are twins . they like to play in their room . they have many toys and books . but they do not like to clean up . they leave their toys and books on the floor .

one day , mom comes to their room . she sees the mess . she is not happy . she says , " tom and anna , you need to clean up your room . it is not good to have so much clutter . you can trip and hurt yourself . and you need to take care of your things . they are not trash . "

