tom and anna hug mom . they say , " thank you , mom . you were right . cleaning up is not so bad . it is fun and good . we like our room . we like our books and toys . we like you . " mia and ben liked to play in the park . they liked to feed the ducks and the geese . one day , they saw a very fancy goose . it had a big red bow on its neck and shiny feathers . mia and ben wanted to pet the fancy goose .

