but the fancy goose was not happy . it wanted all the park for itself . it chased away the other ducks and geese . it pecked at the flowers and the grass . it made a big mess .

soon , the park was empty and dirty . the fancy goose had no friends . it felt lonely and bored . it wished it had been nicer to mia and ben . it realized that being fancy was not as important as being kind . sara and ben were playing in the park . they saw a huge figure on the hill . it looked like a giant with a big nose and a long beard .

