they let go of his zip . they slide down together . they have fun . they are not jealous anymore . ben and lily love to play at the park . they like to swing , climb and run . but their favorite thing is to slide . they slide down the big slide , the small slide and the twisty slide . they laugh and shout as they go fast .

one day , they find a peanut on the ground near the slide . they wonder who left it there . maybe a squirrel or a bird . they decide to share it . ben breaks it in half and gives one part to lily . they both eat it and say yum .

but then , they feel itchy in their mouths . their tongues feel big and their throats feel tight . they are scared and sad . they run to their mom and dad , who are sitting on a bench . they show them the peanut shell and cry .

mom and dad see the peanut and know what is wrong . they are quick and smart . they give ben and lily some medicine from their bag . they call for help and wait for the ambulance . they hug ben and lily and tell them it will be okay .

ben and lily go to the hospital with mom and dad . the doctor and nurse check them and give them more medicine . they say they are allergic to peanuts . that means peanuts make them sick . they tell them to never eat peanuts again . they give them a bracelet that says " no peanuts " .

ben and lily feel better after a while . they are glad they are safe and loved . they are also very tired . they fall asleep in their beds , holding hands . they dream of playing at the park again . but they do not dream of peanuts . they dream of slides . sam and lily were playing in the garden . they liked to pretend they were soldiers and march around with sticks . they wore hats and boots and made loud noises .

