they finished their lunch and gave mommy a hug and a kiss . then they went to their room and changed their clothes . they put on dry and cozy pajamas and snuggled in their beds . they closed their eyes and dreamed of marching and playing with rover . ben and mia were playing in the park . they liked to dig in the sand and look for treasure . sometimes they found shiny stones , or shells , or coins . they put them in a bucket and pretended they were pirates .

