one day , lila and ben decided to go for a ride in the woods . they put on their hats and gloves because it was cold . they rode their bikes along the path and saw many animals . they saw birds , squirrels , rabbits and deer . they said hello to them and smiled .

as they rode deeper into the woods , they saw something different . it was a fox . the fox was orange and white and had a long tail . it looked at them with bright eyes and tilted its head .

