the fox smiled and waved its tail . it watched them ride away . it was not cold anymore . it was warm . mira loves to sing . she sings in the morning , she sings in the afternoon , she sings at night . she sings to her toys , she sings to her mom , she sings to her dad . she sings happy songs , she sings sad songs , she sings silly songs .

