anna and ben are happy . they have a new friend . they share their toys . they have fun . they do not miss anything . they have everything they need . they have a sack , a ball , a doll , a car , a book , a bear , a train and a dog . they have each other . they are friends . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big slide . lily wants to go on the slide , but ben is scared .

