the moral of the story is that it 's important to be kind to others , even if they are different from us . and sometimes , we need to push back against mean behavior to make sure everyone is treated fairly . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . timmy loved to pull his red wagon around the park . one day , he woke up early to see the beautiful sunrise . it was so pretty ! timmy wanted to show his friends how cool it was , so he pulled his wagon to their house . when he got there , all his friends were already outside . they saw timmy 's wagon and wanted to play with it too . timmy 's wagon was so popular ! they all took turns pulling it around the block . it was so much fun ! once upon a time , a little boy named timmy loved to play with his toy dinosaurs . he had a big green one that was his favorite . one day , timmy wanted to take his big green dinosaur to the park with him . but the dinosaur was too big to fit in timmy 's pocket , so he had to attach it to his backpack with a clip .

