timmy and the little girl had so much fun playing on the slide together with the big green dinosaur watching over them . from that day on , they became good friends and always played together at the park . timmy was happy he had his dinosaur to help him make new friends . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily who loved to wear her sunglasses . she wore them everywhere she went , even when it was cloudy outside . one day , lily went to the park to play with her friends . she was having so much fun , but then a boy came and disturbed their game . he took their ball and ran away .

