from that day on , lily and her friends always remembered to be kind to others and to share their things . they knew that it can make someone 's day and make them feel good too . once upon a time , there was a big , white seal . the seal lived in the ocean with all of his friends . one day , the seal wanted to play with his friends but he could n't find them . he looked and looked but they were nowhere to be found .

