when they left the museum , timmy was tired but happy . he told his mommy and daddy that he had a great time spreading his arms and pretending to be a bird and a dinosaur . they smiled and said they were glad he had fun . once upon a time , there was a little bird who was troubled . she did n't have a shelter to sleep in at night . one day , she met a friendly rabbit who asked her , " why do you look so sad ? "

