she closed her eyes and fell asleep . she had a good dream . she did not have a nightmare again . she was a regular girl who had regular dreams . and she knew how to display them . anna and ben are friends . they like to play with toys and books . one day , anna finds a telephone in her mom 's room . it is big and heavy and has many buttons .

