anna and ben were tired . they had a restless day . they cuddled with spot and fell asleep . they dreamed of daisies and dogs . lily was a little girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a lot of dolls , cars , blocks and books . she also had a big , soft bathrobe that she wore when she was cold or sleepy . she loved her bathrobe very much .

one day , lily was playing in her room with her toys . she heard a loud noise from the kitchen . she was nervous . she ran to see what was happening . she saw her big brother tom and his friend sam . they were making a mess . they had flour , eggs , milk and sugar all over the floor , the table and the walls . they were trying to make a cake , but they did not know how .

lily was angry . she did not like messes . she wanted to tell them to stop . but she was also scared . tom and sam were bigger and stronger than her . they sometimes teased her and took her toys . she did not want to make them mad . she decided to go back to her room and hide .

she ran to her room and closed the door . she looked for her bathrobe . she wanted to wrap herself in it and feel safe . but she could not find it . she searched under her bed , in her closet , in her drawers . she could not see it anywhere . she started to cry .

she heard another loud noise from the kitchen . she heard tom and sam laughing . she heard them say something about a fire . she was curious . she opened the door and peeked outside . she saw smoke and flames coming from the oven . she saw tom and sam running away . she saw her bathrobe on the floor . it was covered in flour , eggs , milk and sugar . it was also on fire . it was destroyed .

lily screamed . she was sad and scared . she lost her bathrobe . she lost her toys . she lost her room . she lost her home . she wished she had told tom and sam to stop . she wished she had a new bathrobe . she wished she had a happy ending . but she did not . she had a bad ending . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play with toys , read books and sing songs . one day , they decided to go on a trip to the park . they packed their bags with snacks , water and some toys .

