the big boy did not listen . he grabbed lily 's doll and ben 's car . he tried to fit them in his bag . but they did not fit . they were too big .

" hey , give us back our toys . they do n't fit in your bag . they do n't belong to you . they belong to us , " lily and ben said .

the big boy did not listen . he tried to force the toys in his bag . he broke lily 's doll 's hair and ben 's car 's wheel . he made them cry .

" hey , stop that . you are hurting our toys . you are hurting our feelings . you are being mean and rude , " lily and ben said .

the big boy did not listen . he laughed at them . he said they were silly and babyish . he said he did not care about their toys or their feelings .

but then , a lady came to the sandbox . she was the big boy 's mom . she saw what he was doing . she was very angry .

" hey , what are you doing ? why are you taking their toys ? why are you breaking their toys ? why are you making them cry ? " she asked .

the big boy did not answer . he looked down . he felt ashamed .

the lady took the toys from him . she gave them back to lily and ben . she said she was sorry . she said he was wrong . she said he should say sorry too .

the big boy said sorry . he said he was sorry for taking their toys , breaking their toys and making them cry . he said he learned his lesson . he said he would not do it again .

lily and ben accepted his apology . they said they forgave him . they said they were willing to share their toys with him . they said they could be friends .

the big boy smiled . he said he was happy . he said he wanted to be friends too . he said he wanted to play with them .

they played together in the sandbox . they fixed the doll 's hair and the car 's wheel . they made a bigger castle with more sand and sticks . they put their toys on the castle .

they learned that toys are more fun when they are shared . they learned that toys belong to those who care for them . they learned that toys do not fit in bags that are too small . they learned that friends do not hurt each other . they learned that saying sorry and forgiving are important . they learned that being kind and polite are good . they learned a lot from their trip to the park . lila and ben were playing in the park with their toys . they liked to make castles and cars with the sand and the sticks . they were having fun until they saw a big cloud of smoke in the sky . it was coming from the hill where the old house was .

" what is that ? " lila asked , pointing at the smoke .

" i do n't know . maybe it 's a fire , " ben said , feeling scared .

" let 's go see , " lila said , grabbing her toy car .

" no , do n't go . it 's too far and too dangerous , " ben said , holding her hand .

" but i want to see . maybe we can help , " lila said , pulling her hand away .

she ran towards the hill , leaving ben behind . he wanted to stop her , but he was too afraid to follow . he watched her run until she disappeared behind the trees .

lila reached the top of the hill and saw the old house . it was burning and making loud noises . she saw flames and sparks and smoke everywhere . she felt hot and scared . she wanted to go back , but she did n't know how . she looked for ben , but he was not there . she was alone .

" help ! help ! " she cried , hoping someone would hear her .

ben heard her cry and felt sorry . he wanted to help her , but he did n't know how . he looked for someone who could help , but he did n't see anyone . he felt alone .

then he saw a big red truck coming from the road . it had a loud siren and a long hose . it was a fire truck . he waved his arms and shouted .

" help ! help ! my friend is on the hill . she is in danger . please help her ! "

the fire truck stopped and some men came out . they wore helmets and jackets and boots . they were firefighters . they saw ben and heard his words .

" where is your friend ? " one of them asked .

" she is on the hill . she went to see the fire . she is trapped . please save her ! " ben said , pointing at the hill .

" ok , do n't worry . we will save her . you stay here and remain calm , " the firefighter said , patting his shoulder .

he and his friends ran to the hill with their hose and their tools . they sprayed water on the fire and tried to find lila . they searched and searched until they saw her . she was hiding behind a big rock . she was covered in ash and dirt . she was crying and shaking .

" lila ! lila ! we are here to help you . come with us , " one of them said , reaching out his hand .

lila saw him and felt happy . she took his hand and followed him . he and his friends took her to the fire truck and wrapped her in a blanket . they gave her some water and some candy . they checked her for injuries and told her she was ok .

" thank you . thank you for saving me , " lila said , smiling .

" you 're welcome . you 're very brave . but you should never go near a fire . it 's very dangerous . do you understand ? " the firefighter said , smiling back .

" yes , i understand . i 'm sorry . i wo n't do it again , " lila said , nodding .

she looked for ben and saw him waiting for her . he ran to her and hugged her .

" lila ! lila ! i 'm so glad you 're ok . i was so worried about you , " ben said , crying .

