today is a good day . ben and lily are happy . they are friends . they like to match . tom and lily wanted to make a snowman . they put on their hats and gloves and went outside . they rolled big balls of snow and stacked them on top of each other . they found a carrot , some rocks and a hat to make the snowman 's face and clothes .

