sara and ben are safe . they hug each other . they are still friends . they do not want to play with the cat 's clothes anymore . they go home and sing a song about friendship . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the pool . they had a game where they would dive into the water and look for toys of different colors . lily was good at diving and finding toys , but ben was scared of going under the water . he only stayed on the edge of the pool and watched lily .

one day , lily found a big toy fish that was red and yellow and green . it was very pretty and shiny . she showed it to ben and said , " look , ben , i found a fish ! it is so colorful and nice . do you want to try to find one too ? "

