lily and ben hugged and laughed . they had a good time in the pool . they learned that diving was fun and that colors were nice . they also learned that sharing was kind and that friendship was sweet . they were happy and proud of themselves . anna and ben are friends . they like to play with blocks . they make towers and houses and cars with the blocks . they have fun .

