the moral of the story is : do n't panic when you face a challenge . you can learn and overcome it . you can use what you know and what you have to help you . you are not alone . you have friends and teachers who care for you and support you . sara and ben were very happy . it was tuesday and they had no school . they wanted to decorate their room with red things . they liked red because it was bright and fun .

