she hugged them and kissed them . sara and ben were very happy . they had a fun tuesday . they liked to decorate their room with red things . ben and lily were two camels who lived in the desert . they liked to walk and look for food and water . sometimes they found an oasis , a place with green plants and a pond . they were happy when they found an oasis , because they could drink and rest .

one day , they saw a big oasis far away . they wanted to go there , but it was very hot and they were tired . ben said , " let 's roll on the sand . it will make us cool and comfortable . " lily said , " no , let 's keep walking . the oasis is important . we need water and shade . "

ben did not listen to lily . he rolled on the sand and closed his eyes . he felt good , but he did not see the sandstorm coming . the sandstorm was strong and loud . it covered ben with sand and made him lose his way . he could not see the oasis or lily .

lily kept walking . she reached the oasis and drank from the pond . she looked for ben , but she could not find him . she was worried and sad . she said , " where is ben ? i hope he is safe . i wish he listened to me . "

ben was scared and thirsty . he tried to find the oasis , but he could not . he said , " help ! help ! where is lily ? where is the oasis ? i made a mistake . i should have listened to lily . the oasis was important . "

the moral of the story is : listen to your friends who care about you . they can help you make good choices . do not be lazy or careless . you might miss something important . ben and lily were playing in the garden . they liked to dig holes and find bugs . they saw a big green thing with spikes . it was a cactus .

