lily smiled and hugged him back . she was glad he was okay . she said , " you 're welcome , ben . you are a good brother . i 'm sorry you got hurt . "

they went back to the garden and played with other things . they did not touch the cactus again . they had fun and were happy . lily and ben were twins who liked to play together . one day , they found a yellow ball in the park and decided to take it home . they threw the ball to each other in the living room , but they did not behave . they broke a vase , a lamp and a picture with the ball .

