they went back home and put the yellow ball in the trash . they decided to play with their own toys and to behave better from now on . they learned their lesson and did not want to go to the hospital again . lila and sam are playing with their toys in the living room . lila has a big box of crayons and paper . sam has a small bag of shiny stones . he likes to pretend they are magic crystals .

