they decide to try more magic words with their crystals . they have a lot of fun and learn new things . they are very careful not to burn anything or hurt themselves . they are happy and proud of their magic crystals . tom and mia were playing on the beach . they liked to make sand castles and dig holes . they also liked to watch the big waves that came and went . sometimes they ran to the water and got their feet wet , but they never went too far .

one day , they saw a man with a long stick . he was walking along the water and putting the stick in the sand . tom and mia were curious . they ran to the man and asked him what he was doing .

