tom and mia nodded . they followed the man and his stick . they learned how to read the numbers on the stick and how to write them down . they also learned how to watch the waves and how to avoid them .

they had a lot of fun measuring the waves . they felt like scientists too . but sometimes they also felt fearful . some waves were very big and loud and scary . they made them want to run away .

