tom and mia agreed . they thanked the man for letting them help him . they said goodbye and ran back to their sand castles . they decided to wave to the waves , but not to go near them . they were happy and safe on the beach . lily liked to fly with her big brown kite . she ran and ran in the park and the kite went up and up in the sky . she felt happy and free .

