they ran and ran in the park and both kites went up and up in the sky . they felt happy and free .

they became friends and flew their kites together . they also told each other stories about the clouds and the birds and the sun . they had fun and learned new things .

lily and ben liked to fly and to share stories . they were happy . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys , but they are very competitive . they always want to have the same toy or the better toy . one day , they see a big van outside their house . the van has many colorful stickers and balloons .

" wow , look at the van ! " lily says . " it is so pretty ! i want to go inside ! "

