lily and ben nod . they say sorry to each other . they hug and kiss .

" ok , mom , " they say . " we will share and be nice . "

mom smiles and takes them by the hand . she leads them to the backyard , where the clown is waiting . he has a big red nose and a funny hat . he makes them laugh and have fun . he gives them stickers and balloons . he lets them in the van , where they see more toys and games . they play together and have a good time . they are happy . they do n't cry anymore . ben and lily were twins who loved to play with their toys . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big red plane that could make noises and fly in the air . they liked to pretend they were pilots and go on adventures with their plane .

one day , ben and lily were playing with their plane in the living room , when their mom called them for lunch . she had made them sandwiches and juice , and told them to wash their hands before eating . ben and lily ran to the bathroom , but ben was in a hurry . he did not wash his hands well , and left some dirt and germs on them .

when they came back to the table , ben picked up his sandwich and took a big bite . lily saw his dirty hands and said , " ew , ben , your hands are disgusting ! you did not wash them well . you will get sick and make me sick too . you should wash them again . "

ben did not listen to lily . he said , " no , i do n't want to wash them . i 'm hungry . my hands are fine . you are silly . " he kept eating his sandwich and drinking his juice , and did not care about his hands .

after lunch , ben and lily went back to play with their plane . but soon , ben started to feel bad . his tummy hurt , and he felt hot and tired . he said , " lily , i do n't want to play anymore . i want to lie down . i do n't feel good . " lily looked at him and saw that he was pale and sweaty . she said , " ben , you are sick . you should have washed your hands . now you have germs in your body . you need to see the doctor . "

lily ran to get their mom , who came and checked on ben . she saw that he had a fever and a sore throat . she said , " ben , you have a cold . you need to take some medicine and rest . you also need to stay away from lily , so you do n't spread your germs to her . you should have washed your hands before eating . that 's how you keep yourself and others healthy . "

ben felt sorry and sad . he said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i 'm sorry , lily . i was wrong . i should have washed my hands . i do n't want to be sick or make anyone sick . i will wash my hands better next time . " mom gave him a hug and a kiss , and said , " it 's okay , ben . i love you . you will get better soon . just remember to wash your hands , and be careful with your plane . it 's not a toy to play with when you are sick . "

ben nodded and smiled weakly . he said , " i love you too , mom . i love you too , lily . thank you for caring about me . i will be more careful with my plane . it 's my favorite toy , and i want to share it with you . " lily smiled and said , " i love you too , ben . i hope you feel better soon . i will wait for you to play with the plane . it 's my favorite toy too , and i want to have fun with you . "

the moral of the story is : wash your hands before eating , and do n't spread germs to others . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . lily had a hoop that she could roll on the ground . ben had a ball that he could bounce and throw . they were having fun .

but then , a big dog came to the park . it was furry and brown and had a loud bark . the dog saw lily 's hoop and wanted to play with it . it ran to lily and took the hoop in its mouth . lily was scared and sad . she wanted her hoop back .

" hey , that 's my hoop ! " lily shouted . " give it back , dog ! "

but the dog did not listen . it ran away with the hoop , wagging its tail . ben saw what happened and ran after the dog . he had a plan .

