the dog heard ben and turned around . it saw ben holding his ball . the dog liked balls too . it dropped the hoop and ran to ben . ben threw the ball far away . the dog chased the ball .

ben quickly picked up the hoop and ran back to lily . he gave her the hoop and hugged her .

