ben smiled . " you 're welcome , lily . you are a good friend too . "

they reminded each other to be careful of dogs . then they continued to play with their hoop and ball . they were happy . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to pretend they were brave knights and princesses . they had sticks for weapons and leaves for crowns .

" look , lily , a wild dragon ! " tom said , pointing to a big dog . the dog was barking and running around . " we have to fight it and save the park ! "

lily was scared of the dog . she did not want to fight it . she wanted to call for help . " no , tom , it is too big and loud . let us call mom and dad . they will know what to do . "

tom did not want to call mom and dad . he wanted to be a hero . he ran towards the dog with his stick . " come on , lily , follow me . we can do it ! "

but the dog did not like tom 's stick . it growled and snapped at him . tom dropped his stick and ran back to lily . he was crying and shaking . " lily , lily , i am sorry . you were right . the dog is too wild . let us call mom and dad . "

lily hugged tom and took his hand . she saw mom and dad coming . they had heard the dog and the children . they were worried and angry . they scolded tom and lily for being foolish and reckless . they took them away from the park and the dog . they told them to never play with wild animals or use sticks as weapons . they said they loved them and wanted them to be safe . tom and lily said they were sorry and they loved them too . they learned their lesson and never played with wild dogs again . ben and mia love to play chess . chess is a game with black and white pieces that move on a board . ben has a king , a queen , a rook , a bishop , a knight and some pawns . mia has the same pieces , but in different colors . they take turns to move their pieces and try to catch the other 's king .

one day , ben and mia find a lovely chess set in the attic . the pieces are made of wood and have wings . they look like birds and fairies . ben and mia are very curious and want to play with them . they set up the board and start the game .

but something strange happens . when ben moves his knight , it flies off the board and lands on the window sill . mia gasps and moves her bishop . it also flies away and joins the knight . ben and mia are amazed and excited . they move more pieces and watch them fly around the room . they laugh and clap their hands .

soon , all the pieces are flying and playing with each other . they make sounds like chirping and singing . ben and mia forget about the game and join them . they pretend to be birds and fairies too . they fly and dance and have fun .

