he wished he had listened to sam . he wished he had not been stupid . he wished he had made good pizza . sam and mia were playing in the kitchen . they liked to pretend they were chefs and make food for their toys . sam found a big white thing in the fridge . he did not know what it was .

" look , mia , what is this ? " he asked , holding the white thing .

mia looked at it and smiled . she knew what it was . it was a cauliflower . her mom sometimes cooked it for dinner .

" it is a cauliflower , sam . it is a kind of flower that you can eat . do you want to try it ? " she said .

sam was not sure . he did not like flowers . they smelled funny and tasted bitter . he shook his head .

" no , thank you . i do not like flowers . they are not good for food . they are good for looking , " he said .

mia shrugged . she liked cauliflower . she thought it was crunchy and sweet . she decided to make a dish with it . she took a pot and filled it with water . she put the cauliflower in the pot and set it on the stove . she turned the knob to make the fire .

" be careful , mia . the fire is hot . it can hurt you , " sam warned .

mia nodded . she was serious . she knew how to be safe in the kitchen . she had watched her mom many times . she put on an oven mitt and a apron . she looked like a real chef .

" i know , sam . i am careful . i am making cauliflower soup . it is yummy . do you want some ? " she offered .

sam looked at the pot . he saw the water boiling and the cauliflower getting soft . he smelled something nice . he was curious . maybe cauliflower was not so bad after all .

" maybe i will try some . but only a little bit , " he said .

mia smiled . she was happy . she liked to share her food with her brother . she took a spoon and a bowl . she scooped some soup and gave it to sam . she watched him taste it .

sam was surprised . the soup was warm and creamy . it had salt and pepper and butter . it was not bitter at all . it was good . he liked it .

" mmm , this is good , mia . you are a good chef . thank you for the soup , " he said .

mia beamed . she was proud . she had made a good dish with cauliflower . she had made her brother happy .

" you are welcome , sam . i am glad you like it . do you want some more ? " she asked .

sam nodded . he did want some more . he had changed his mind about cauliflower . he thought it was a good flower for eating . he thought mia was a good sister for cooking . he thought they were a good team for playing . he was happy . lily and ben are good friends . they like to play in the big house . the big house has many chambers . some chambers have toys , some chambers have books , some chambers have beds .

one day , lily and ben find a new chamber . it is under the stairs . it is dark and small . they see a box . the box is shiny and has a lock . they want to open the box .

" maybe there is a treasure in the box , " lily says .

" maybe there is a monster in the box , " ben says .

they are both curious and scared . they decide to carry the box to a bright chamber . they hold the box together and walk up the stairs . the box is heavy and hard . they are tired and sweaty .

they reach a bright chamber . it has a window and a lamp . they put the box on the floor . they look for a key . they do not find a key .

" maybe we can break the lock , " lily says .

" maybe we can shake the box , " ben says .

they try to break the lock . they try to shake the box . they do not open the box .

they are sad and frustrated . they sit on the floor and sigh .

" maybe we should ask for help , " lily says .

" maybe we should leave the box alone , " ben says .

they look at each other and nod . they agree to ask for help . they stand up and hold hands . they carry the box back to the dark chamber . they hope to find someone who knows how to open the box . they hope to find out what is in the box . they are still curious and scared . but they are also good friends . lily likes to care for her toys . she has a doll , a bear , a truck and a book . she gives them hugs , food , rides and stories . she makes them happy and they make her happy .

one day , lily finds a new toy in her room . it is a big paper with many words on it . she does not know what it is . she asks her mom .

mom says , " this is a poem . it is a kind of story that sounds nice and has a rhythm . do you want to hear it ? "

lily nods . she likes stories . mom reads the poem to her . it is about a bird that sings in a tree . the words rhyme and make pictures in lily 's mind . she feels peaceful and calm .

lily says , " i like the poem . it is a nice toy . can i keep it ? "

mom smiles and says , " yes , you can . it is a gift from your grandma . she wrote it for you . she loves you and cares for you very much . "

lily hugs the poem and says , " thank you , grandma . i love you and care for you too . i will put the poem next to my bed and read it every night . " timmy liked to play with his toy lion . he made it roar and jump on his bed . he pretended he was a brave hunter who could catch the big lion . he had fun with his lion every day .

one day , timmy had to go to the doctor . he was scared of the doctor . he thought the doctor would hurt him with a needle . he did not want to go . he took his lion with him . he hoped his lion would protect him .

at the doctor 's office , timmy met a nice nurse . she smiled at him and said hello . she asked him his name and what he liked to play with . timmy showed her his lion and said he liked to roar . the nurse said she liked lions too . she said they were strong and brave , but also harmless and friendly . she said she had a lion sticker for him .

the nurse gave timmy the sticker and put it on his shirt . she said he was a good boy and he could roar as much as he wanted . she said the doctor would not hurt him , but only check him and make him feel better . she said she would be with him all the time .

timmy felt less scared . he liked the nurse and the sticker . he roared with his lion and smiled at the nurse . he said thank you and followed her to the doctor . he was still a little nervous , but he knew his lion and the nurse were with him . he was a brave hunter and a good boy . tim and tom are brothers . they like to eat sausage for breakfast . but today , there is only one sausage left in the fridge . tim and tom both want it .

" give me the sausage ! " tim says . he tries to grab it from the fridge .

" no , it is mine ! " tom says . he pushes tim away .

they start to fight over the sausage . they pull and tug and shout . the sausage is tight in their hands .

mom hears the noise . she comes to the kitchen . she sees tim and tom fighting over the sausage .

" stop it , boys ! " mom says . " why are you fighting over the sausage ? "

tim and tom look at mom . they feel ashamed .

" we both want the sausage , mom , " tim says .

" but there is only one sausage , mom , " tom says .

mom smiles . she has an idea .

" why do n't you discuss how to share the sausage ? " mom says . " maybe you can cut it in half , or take turns to eat it , or trade it for something else . "

tim and tom think about mom 's idea . they stop fighting . they discuss how to share the sausage .

they decide to cut it in half . they each get a piece of sausage . they say sorry to each other . they hug mom .

mom is happy . she gives them some bread and jam to go with the sausage . they eat their breakfast together . they thank mom .

the end . jill and tom like to play in the park . they like to swing on the swings . they swing high and low , and laugh and sing .

one day , they see a group of big kids on the swings . the big kids are organized . they have a leader who tells them when to swing and when to stop . they do not let anyone else use the swings .

jill and tom want to swing too . they wait for their turn , but the big kids do not give them a chance . they swing for a long time , and make fun of jill and tom .

jill and tom feel sad and angry . they decide to ask the big kids to share the swings . they walk up to the leader and say , " please , can we swing too ? we like to swing , and we have been waiting . "

the leader looks at them and laughs . he says , " no , you ca n't swing . these are our swings . you are too small and silly to swing . go away , or we will push you . "

jill and tom are scared . they try to run away , but the big kids catch them . they push them to the ground and kick them . they take their hats and scarves and throw them in the trash .

jill and tom cry and hurt . they wish they had never asked the big kids to share the swings . they wish they had stayed home and played with their toys . they learn a hard lesson : some people are mean and do not like to share . tom and anna are twins . they like to play pirates and look for treasure . one day , they find a big map in the attic . the map has a red x and many pictures of trees and rocks .

" look , tom , a treasure map ! " anna says . " let 's go find the treasure ! "

" okay , but we have to behave , " tom says . " mom and dad are working and they do n't want us to go outside . "

they put on their pirate hats and grab their shovels . they sneak out of the house and follow the map . they walk for a long time and get very tired and thirsty .

" are we there yet ? " anna asks .

" i do n't know , the map is hard to read , " tom says . " maybe we should go back . "

but then they see a big rock with a skull and crossbones on it . the map says the treasure is under the rock .

" wow , we found it ! " anna says . " let 's dig ! "

they start to dig with their shovels . they dig and dig and dig . but they do n't find any treasure . they only find a big hole .

" where is the treasure ? " tom asks .

" i do n't know , maybe someone took it , " anna says .

they are very sad and angry . they throw their shovels and hats on the ground . they sit on the edge of the hole and cry .

suddenly , they hear a loud laugh . they look up and see their dad standing behind them . he is holding a big chest full of toys and candy .

" surprise ! " he says . " i made the map and hid the treasure for you . i wanted to see how you would behave . "

tom and anna are very surprised and happy . they hug their dad and say sorry for sneaking out . they open the chest and see all the wonderful things inside .

" wow , thank you , dad ! " they say . " this is the best treasure ever ! "

they play with their toys and eat their candy . they are very sleepy and happy . they go back home with their dad and tell their mom about their adventure . they say they learned their lesson and they will always behave . they go to bed and dream of pirates and treasure . lily and ben were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they went to the lake with their mom and dad . they saw many things at the lake : fish , ducks , frogs , and a big furry dog .

" can we pet the dog , mom ? " lily asked .

" sure , but be gentle and ask the owner first , " mom said .

lily and ben ran to the dog , who was sitting by a man on a bench . the dog wagged its tail and licked their faces . they giggled and stroked its fur .

" hello , kids . this is max . he 's very friendly , " the man said .

" hi , max . you 're so soft and warm , " lily said .

" can we play with max , please ? " ben asked .

" of course . he loves to play fetch . here , take this stick and throw it for him , " the man said .

lily and ben took turns throwing the stick and watching max run after it and bring it back . they had a lot of fun with max .

but then , something bad happened . ben threw the stick too far , and it landed in the water . max jumped into the lake and swam to get it . lily and ben watched him , but they did not see him come back .

" where 's max ? " lily asked , worried .

" i do n't know . maybe he 's stuck under the water , " ben said , worried too .

they ran to the edge of the lake and looked for max . they called his name , but he did not answer .

" mom , dad , help ! max is gone ! " lily cried .

mom and dad heard them and came running . they saw the stick floating in the water , but no sign of max .

" oh no , where 's the dog ? " mom asked .

" he went to get the stick , but he did n't come back , " ben said .

" maybe he 's on the other side of the lake , " dad said . " let 's go and see . "

they followed the shore of the lake , hoping to find max . they searched and searched , but they could not see him .

they were about to give up , when they heard a loud bark . they turned around and saw max , wet and happy , running towards them . he had the stick in his mouth .

" max ! " lily and ben shouted . they hugged him and kissed him .

" good boy , max . you 're safe , " mom said .

" sorry , kids . i did n't mean to scare you . max is a good swimmer , but he likes to explore . he found a way out of the lake on the other side . he 's a smart dog , " the man said .

" thank you for letting us play with max . he 's the best dog ever , " lily said .

" you 're welcome . he likes you too . maybe we 'll see you again at the lake , " the man said .

lily and ben waved goodbye to max and the man . they were happy that max was okay . they learned to be careful when playing near the water . they also made a new furry friend . sam and mia like to go to the park with mom . they see many things on the way . they see cars and buses and bikes . they see trees and flowers and birds . they see a big billboard with a picture of a pizza . it looks tasty .

" mom , can we have pizza for lunch ? " sam asks .

" maybe later , honey . we have sandwiches at home , " mom says .

" but pizza is so tasty ! " mia says .

they get to the park and find a nice spot to play . they run and jump and slide and swing . they have fun with their toys and friends . they get hungry and thirsty .

" mom , can we have pizza now ? " sam asks again .

" not yet , sweetie . let 's have some water and fruit first , " mom says .

she gives them a bottle of water and some grapes . they sit on a bench and eat . they see the billboard again . it is very big and bright . it makes their mouths water .

" mom , please , can we have pizza soon ? " mia begs .

mom smiles and says , " okay , okay . you have been very good and patient . we can have pizza after we go home and wash our hands . "

sam and mia are happy . they hug mom and say thank you . they finish their water and grapes and throw the trash in the bin . they get ready to leave the park .

but before they go , they have an idea . they run to the billboard and kneel in front of it . they pretend to eat the pizza . they make yummy noises and say , " mmm , this is the best pizza ever ! "

mom laughs and takes a picture of them . she thinks they are very cute and funny . she joins them and kneels too . she pretends to eat the pizza with them . they all giggle and have fun .

they get up and walk to the bus stop . they are excited to have real pizza for lunch . they think it will be even more tasty than the billboard pizza . they are happy and full of love . tom and sue were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a big hill with a lot of dirt and rocks . they wanted to climb it and see what was on the other side .

" come on , sue , let 's go up the hill ! " tom said .

" ok , tom , but be careful . it looks steep and rough , " sue said .

they started to climb the hill , holding on to the rocks and dirt . they were almost at the top when tom saw a hole in the ground . it was wide and dark and scary .

" look , sue , a pit ! i wonder what 's inside , " tom said .

" tom , do n't go near the pit ! it might be dangerous . there could be snakes or bugs or traps , " sue said .

but tom was curious and did not listen to sue . he walked to the edge of the pit and leaned over to examine it . he wanted to see if there was anything shiny or fun or cool .

" tom , come back ! you 're too close to the pit ! " sue shouted .

but it was too late . tom lost his balance and fell into the pit . he screamed and cried and tried to grab something . but the pit was too deep and too wide and too dark . he could not see or hear or feel anything .

sue ran to the pit and looked down . she could not see tom . she could only hear his voice , faint and scared .

" tom , tom , where are you ? are you ok ? " sue called .

" sue , sue , help me ! i 'm scared ! i want to go home ! " tom answered .

sue did not know what to do . she was scared too . she wanted to help tom , but she could not reach him . she wanted to get help , but she did not know where to go . she wanted to cry , but she had to be brave .

she looked around and saw a man walking by . he had a hat and a coat and a bag . he looked nice and kind .

" sir , sir , please help me ! my friend fell into the pit ! he 's hurt and scared and i ca n't get him out ! " sue said .

the man stopped and looked at sue . he smiled and nodded .

" of course , little girl , i 'll help you . do n't worry , everything will be ok , " the man said .

he walked to the pit and looked down . he saw tom , lying on the bottom , bleeding and crying .

" hello , little boy , i 'm here to help you . just stay calm and quiet , and i 'll get you out , " the man said .

he reached into his bag and took out a rope and a hook . he tied the hook to the rope and threw it into the pit . he waited for tom to grab it and pull himself up .

but he did not want to help tom . he wanted to hurt him . he was a bad man , a mean man , a cruel man . he had a plan , a wicked plan , a evil plan .

he wanted to take tom away , to his dark and dirty house , where he had a cage and a knife and a fire . he wanted to make tom his slave , his toy , his prey . he wanted to make tom suffer , scream , and die .

he pulled the rope and lifted tom out of the pit . he grabbed tom and put him in his bag . he ran away , leaving sue alone and shocked .

" tom , tom , no , no , no ! " sue screamed .

but it was too late . the man was gone , and so was tom . sue never saw tom again . she was sad and lonely and angry . she wished she had never climbed the hill . she wished she had never seen the pit . she wished she had never met the man . she wished she had saved tom . lily liked to observe animals . she wanted to be a veterinarian when she grew up . she had many books about animals and their names . she also had a toy stethoscope and a bandage .

one day , she went to the zoo with her mom and dad . she saw many animals , like lions , monkeys , and elephants . she was very happy and excited . she asked her mom and dad many questions about the animals .

" mom , why does the lion have a big mane ? " she asked .

" the mane helps the lion to look strong and scary to other animals , " her mom answered .

" dad , why does the monkey have a long tail ? " she asked .

" the tail helps the monkey to balance and swing on the trees , " her dad answered .

lily learned a lot from her mom and dad . she observed the animals carefully and pretended to check their health with her toy stethoscope .

but there was one animal that lily did not like . it was the hippo . the hippo was big and gray and dull . it did not do anything . it just lay in the water and yawned .

lily thought the hippo was boring . she did not want to observe it . she wanted to see more animals .

" can we go now ? " she asked her mom and dad .

" sure , honey . we have seen all the animals . did you have fun ? " her mom asked .

" yes , i had a lot of fun . but i did not like the hippo . the hippo was dull , " lily said .

her mom and dad smiled .

" maybe the hippo was just tired . maybe it has more fun when we are not here . maybe it likes to splash and play with its friends , " her mom said .

" maybe you are right , mom . maybe the hippo is not so dull after all . maybe it is just different , " lily said .

she thought for a moment . then she said , " i still want to be a veterinarian . i want to help all the animals , even the dull ones . "

her mom and dad hugged her .

" we are proud of you , lily . you are a very kind and curious girl . you will be a great veterinarian someday , " they said . anna loved princesses . she had many princess dolls , princess books , and princess dresses . she wanted to be a princess too . she was very enthusiastic about princesses .

one day , she went to the store with her mom . she saw a beautiful princess crown . it was shiny and pink and had many jewels . she wanted to buy it . she asked her mom , " mom , can i buy the princess crown ? please , please , please ! "

her mom looked at the price tag . it was very expensive . she said , " no , anna , we can not buy the princess crown . it is too much money . we have to save money for other things . maybe you can get it for your birthday . "

anna was very sad and angry . she did not want to wait for her birthday . she wanted the princess crown now . she started to cry and scream . she said , " but i want it ! i need it ! i am a princess ! "

her mom was very upset and embarrassed . she tried to calm anna down . she said , " anna , stop crying and screaming . you are not a princess . you are a little girl . you have to be polite and respectful . you have to listen to me . i know you like princesses , but you can not have everything you want . "

anna did not listen . she kept crying and screaming . she threw a tantrum . she kicked and hit her mom . she said , " you are a mean mom ! you do not love me ! you do not understand me ! "

her mom was very hurt and angry . she said , " anna , that is enough . you are being very naughty and rude . you do not kick and hit me . you do not say those things to me . you do love me and i do love you . but you have to behave . you have to apologize to me . and you have to forget about the princess crown . "

anna did not apologize . she did not forget . she kept crying and screaming . she did not want to leave the store . she did not want to go home . she did not want to be a little girl . she wanted to be a princess . tom and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big slide . tom wants to go on the slide , but mia is scared .

" come on , mia , you can do it ! " tom encourages mia . " it is fun to go on the slide . i will go first and show you . "

tom runs to the slide and climbs up the ladder . he sits on the top and slides down . he laughs and shouts , " whee ! that was awesome ! "

mia watches tom . she thinks he is brave . she wants to try the slide , too . but she is still scared . she walks to the ladder and holds on to the bars . she looks up and sees how high the slide is . she feels her body shake .

" are you okay , mia ? " tom asks . he sees mia is scared . he runs to the ladder and stands next to her . he holds her hand and says , " do n't worry , mia . i am here with you . you can do it . just take one step at a time . it is not so bad . "

mia looks at tom . she sees he is kind . he is her friend . she trusts him . she takes a deep breath and says , " okay , tom . i will try . thank you for helping me . "

mia and tom climb up the ladder together . they sit on the top of the slide . they hold hands and smile . they slide down together . they laugh and shout , " whee ! that was fun ! "

mia and tom are happy . they hug each other . they are proud of themselves . they go on the slide again and again . they have a lot of fun .

they see a boy and a girl watching them . the boy and the girl have weird hats . they have feathers and stars on their hats . they look funny .

" hi , we are ben and lily , " the boy and the girl say . " we like your slide . can we play with you ? "

tom and mia look at ben and lily . they think they are nice . they say , " sure , you can play with us . we are tom and mia . we like your hats . they are weird , but cool . "

ben and lily smile . they say , " thank you . we like your slide . it is big , but fun . "

tom and mia , ben and lily become friends . they play on the slide together . they share their hats . they have a lot of fun . they encourage each other . they are not scared . they are happy . ben and lily were playing with their toy cars in the living room . they made zoom noises as they raced them on the carpet . lily had a red car and ben had a blue car .

" zoom , zoom , zoom ! i 'm faster than you ! " lily said .

" no , you 're not ! i 'm faster than you ! " ben said .

they zoomed their cars closer and closer , until they bumped into each other . lily 's car flew off the carpet and landed under the sofa .

" hey , that 's not fair ! you made my car disappear ! " lily cried .

she got down on her knees and tried to reach for her car . but it was too far and too dark under the sofa . she could not see it .

" ha , ha , ha ! you lost your car ! you lost your car ! " ben teased .

he zoomed his car around the carpet , making loud noises . he was happy that he had the only car left .

lily was very sad and very angry . she felt tears in her eyes . she did not want to play with ben anymore . he was very mean and very grumpy .

she got up and ran to her mom , who was in the kitchen . she hugged her mom and told her what happened .

" mom , ben made my car disappear ! he was very grumpy and he laughed at me ! " lily said .

mom hugged lily back and kissed her head . she felt sorry for lily .

" that 's not nice , ben . you should not make your sister 's car disappear . you should share your toys and be kind . how would you feel if lily made your car disappear ? " mom said .

she went to the living room and called ben . ben stopped zooming his car and looked at mom . he saw lily 's sad face and felt a little sorry too .

" i 'm sorry , lily . i did n't mean to make your car disappear . i was just playing . can we play together again ? " ben said .

he got down on his knees and helped lily look for her car under the sofa . after a while , they found it . it was not broken , just dusty .

" here , lily . i found your car . it 's still red and shiny . do you want to race with me again ? " ben said .

he gave lily her car and smiled . lily smiled too . she was happy that she had her car back . she was happy that ben was not grumpy anymore .

" thank you , ben . i 'm sorry i was angry . yes , i want to race with you again . let 's zoom , zoom , zoom ! " lily said .

they zoomed their cars on the carpet again , making happy noises . they were having fun . mom watched them and smiled . she was happy that they were playing nicely . she was happy that they were friends again . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big hole in the ground . they want to look inside .

" maybe there is a treasure in there , " tim says .

" or a monster , " sam says .

they go near the hole and bend down . they hear a noise . it is a rat . the rat has long teeth and a long tail . it is angry . it jumps out of the hole and bites tim on the nose .

" ow , ow , ow ! " tim cries . he runs away with sam . they look for their mom . she is on a bench . she sees tim 's nose . it is red and bleeding .

" oh , no , what happened ? " she asks .

" a rat bit me , " tim says .

" a rat ? where ? " she asks .

" in the hole , " sam says .

she takes them to the car . she drives to the doctor . the doctor gives tim a shot . he says tim has to take medicine for a week . he says rats can make people sick .

tim and sam are sad . they do not like shots or medicine . they do not like rats . they do not want to play in the park anymore . they want to stay home and watch tv . the end . lily and ben were playing in the park . they saw a big round pond with many ducks . lily wanted to feed the ducks some bread . ben wanted to splash the water with a stick .

" come on , lily , let 's splash the water . it 's fun ! " ben said .

" no , ben , that 's not nice . the ducks do n't like it . they want to eat the bread . see , they are coming to us . " lily said .

but ben did not listen . he ran to the pond and waved his stick . he made big splashes that scared the ducks away . lily was sad . she dropped the bread on the ground .

" ben , stop it ! you are mean to the ducks . they are incredible animals . they can swim and fly and quack . you should be kind to them . " lily said .

but ben did not stop . he laughed and splashed more water . he did not see the big duck behind him . the big duck was angry . it bit ben 's leg . ben cried out loud . he dropped his stick and ran away .

lily went to ben and hugged him . she felt sorry for him . she gave him a band - aid for his leg .

" are you okay , ben ? " lily asked .

" ow , ow , ow . that duck hurt me . it was mean to me . " ben said .

" no , ben , the duck was not mean to you . you were mean to the duck . you scared it and its friends . you should say sorry to the duck . and you should not splash the water anymore . it 's not fun . it 's rude . " lily said .

ben thought about what lily said . he realized he was wrong . he felt bad . he nodded his head .

" okay , lily , you are right . i was wrong . i 'm sorry , duck . and i 'm sorry , lily . can we still be friends ? " ben asked .

" of course , ben . we are always friends . but next time , let 's be nice to the ducks . and let 's feed them the bread . they will like that . and we will like that too . " lily said .

they smiled and hugged . they went back to the pond . they fed the bread to the ducks . the ducks came back and quacked happily . lily and ben had fun . they learned to be kind to animals . and they learned to be kind to each other . the end . ben was a big boy who liked to play with his toys . he had many cars , trucks , and trains that he kept in his pocket . he always took them with him when he went outside . he liked to make them zoom and honk and crash .

one day , he saw a new toy in the store . it was a shiny red fire truck with a ladder and a siren . he wanted it very much , but his mom said no . she said he had enough toys and he should be happy with what he had . ben was angry and sad . he decided to take the fire truck anyway . he waited until his mom was not looking and put it in his pocket .

he ran out of the store with the fire truck in his pocket . he thought he was very clever and nobody saw him . but he was wrong . a man who worked in the store saw him and followed him . he called his mom and told her what ben did . his mom was very upset and disappointed . she came to get him and made him give back the fire truck . she said he was naughty and he had to say sorry . she also said he had to give away some of his toys to other kids who had none .

ben felt very ashamed and sorry . he realized he had been greedy and dishonest . he learned that stealing was wrong and he should be grateful for what he had . he said sorry to the man and his mom . he also gave away some of his cars , trucks , and trains to other kids who were happy to have them . he felt better and promised to be good and never steal again . he learned that the best things in life are not in his pocket , but in his heart . lily and ben love to perform for their mom and dad . they like to sing songs , tell jokes , and make funny faces . sometimes they use toys and costumes to make their show more fun .

one day , they decided to perform a shape show . they found some paper and scissors and cut out different shapes . they had circles , squares , triangles , and stars . they also found some glue and glitter and made their shapes shiny and colorful .

they put on their hats and capes and went to the living room . they said , " ladies and gentlemen , welcome to our shape show ! we will show you some amazing shapes and what they can do ! " they held up their shapes and said their names . then they made them into different things . they made a circle into a sun , a square into a house , a triangle into a mountain , and a star into a fairy .

their mom and dad clapped and cheered . they said , " wow , what a great shape show ! you are very clever and creative ! " they gave lily and ben hugs and kisses . they also gave them a yummy treat . it was a cookie with icing and sprinkles . it had the same shapes as their paper shapes . lily and ben smiled and said , " thank you , mom and dad ! we love you and we love shapes ! " they ate their cookies and shared them with their shapes . they were very happy . lily and ben were playing with their blocks in the living room . they wanted to make a big building with many rooms and windows . they were having fun until they heard a loud noise outside .

they ran to the window and saw that it was raining hard . the sky was dark and the wind was blowing . they saw some people running with umbrellas and some cars splashing water .

" wow , look at the rain ! " ben said . " it is so wet and noisy ! "

" i do n't like the rain , " lily said . " it makes everything wet and cold . and it ruins our plans . we wanted to go to the park today . "

" maybe the rain will stop soon , " ben said . " then we can go outside and play . "

they waited for a while , but the rain did not stop . it got even harder and louder . they heard a thunder and saw a lightning . they got scared and hugged each other .

" ben , i 'm afraid of the thunder and the lightning , " lily said . " they are so angry and scary ! "

" do n't be afraid , lily , " ben said . " they are just noises and lights . they ca n't hurt us . we are safe inside our house . and we have each other . "

he gave her a kiss on the cheek and smiled . " and we still have our blocks . we can make our building here . we can make it as big and as beautiful as we want . and we can pretend that it is our park . "

lily smiled back and nodded . " you are right , ben . we can still have fun . and maybe the rain will be nice and stop soon . and then we can see a rainbow . "

they went back to their blocks and started to build their building . they forgot about the rain and the thunder and the lightning . they were happy and busy . they used their imagination and their creativity . they made their building and their park . and they had fun . tom and mia were playing with their toy cars . they liked to race them on the floor and see who was faster . tom had a red car and mia had a blue car . they made loud noises with their mouths as they pushed their cars .

" ready , set , go ! " tom said and they both moved their cars as fast as they could . the cars zoomed and zipped on the floor . tom 's car was ahead of mia 's car . he smiled and said , " i 'm going to win ! my car is the best ! "

but mia did not give up . she pushed her car harder and harder . she caught up with tom 's car and passed it . she said , " no , i 'm going to win ! my car is fierce ! "

tom and mia reached the end of the floor . they looked at their cars and saw that mia 's car was a little bit ahead of tom 's car . mia jumped up and down and clapped her hands . she said , " i won ! i won ! i have the victory ! "

tom was sad . he wanted to win too . he said , " no fair ! your car is too fierce ! let 's race again ! "

mia smiled and said , " ok , let 's race again . but you have to say my name first . what is my name ? "

tom thought for a moment . he knew mia 's name , but he did not want to say it . he wanted to win . he said , " your name is ... slow ! "

mia laughed and said , " no , that 's not my name ! my name is mia ! say it ! "

tom sighed and said , " ok , ok . your name is mia . happy ? "

mia nodded and said , " yes , i 'm happy . and you know what ? you 're a good friend . and your name is tom . say it ! "

tom smiled and said , " yes , i 'm a good friend . and my name is tom . say it ! "

they both said each other 's names and hugged . then they picked up their cars and said , " ready , set , go ! " they raced again and had fun . they did not care who won or who lost . they just liked to play . lila and ben love to watch the parade . they see big balloons , loud drums , and pretty costumes . they wave at the people who walk by and smile .

one day , they see a little dog in the parade . the dog has a red hat and a blue coat . he looks very happy . but then , he trips on a string and falls down . he starts to cry .

lila and ben feel sad for the dog . they want to help him . they run to the dog and hug him . they say , " it 's okay , dog . you are brave and cute . we are your friends . "

the dog stops crying and wags his tail . he licks their faces and thanks them . he says , " you are very kind and compassionate . you make me feel better . can i join you and watch the parade ? "

lila and ben nod and smile . they take the dog to their spot and share their snacks with him . they watch the parade together and have fun . they are happy . lily was a very intelligent girl . she liked to learn new things and ask questions . she had a big book of animals that she read every day . she wanted to know how big each animal was , so she asked her mom for a measure .

" mom , can i have the measure , please ? " she said . " i want to see how long the crocodile is . "

" sure , honey , here you go , " her mom said , handing her a tape measure . " but be careful with it , okay ? do n't pull it too hard or it might break . "

lily thanked her mom and ran to her room with the measure . she opened her book and found the page with the crocodile . she saw that it said the crocodile was six meters long . that was very long ! she wondered how long that was in real life .

she decided to use the measure to find out . she put one end of the measure on the floor and pulled the other end until it reached six . she looked at the measure and saw that it was longer than her bed , longer than her desk , longer than her door . she was amazed .

she wanted to show her mom how long the crocodile was . she ran to the living room with the measure still in her hand . she did n't notice that the measure was tangled around her legs . she tripped and fell on the floor . the measure snapped and made a loud noise .

" ouch ! " lily yelled . " mom , help ! "

her mom heard her yell and came running . she saw lily on the floor with the broken measure . she was worried .

" lily , are you okay ? " she asked . " what happened ? "

lily started to cry . she felt sorry for breaking the measure . she told her mom what she was doing with the book and the measure . she said she wanted to see how long the crocodile was .

her mom hugged her and said , " it 's okay , sweetie . i 'm glad you 're not hurt . you 're very intelligent and curious , and i 'm proud of you . but next time , be more careful with the measure , okay ? it 's not a toy . and you do n't need to yell , i 'm always here to help you . "

lily nodded and said , " okay , mom . i 'm sorry . i love you . "

" i love you too , lily , " her mom said . " now , let 's go and get a new measure . and maybe a new book , too . how about one with dinosaurs ? " tom was a boy who liked to play with keys . he had many keys of different shapes and colors . he liked to try them on different doors and locks . he wanted to see what was behind them .

one day , he found a big orange key in his dad 's drawer . he wondered what it could unlock . he took the key and went around the house . he tried it on the front door , the back door , the garage door , but none of them opened . he was disappointed .

then he saw a small door under the stairs . he had never noticed it before . he was curious . he put the orange key in the lock and turned it . the door opened with a click . he saw a dark and dusty room . he stepped inside .

he saw many old things , like books , toys , clothes , and pictures . he wanted to touch them and play with them . he did not see a sign that said " do not enter " . he did not hear his dad calling him .

suddenly , he heard a loud bang . the door had closed behind him . he was scared . he ran to the door and tried to open it . but the orange key was gone . he had dropped it somewhere . he could not find it . he could not unlock the door . he was trapped .

he cried and shouted for help . he wished he had not taken the key . he wished he had listened to his dad . he learned a lesson . he should not play with things that are not his . he should not go to places that are not safe . he should be careful and obedient . he hoped someone would find him soon . lila and sam are friends . they like to play with dolls and cars . they have a lot of fun together .

one day , a new girl arrives at their school . her name is mia . she has long hair and a big smile . she brings a lot of toys with her . she is very popular . everyone wants to play with her .

lila and sam feel sad . they think mia is taking their friends away . they do not want to play with mia . they want to play with their old friends .

they decide to make a plan . they want to show mia that they are better at playing . they think of a game that they are very good at . it is a race game . they have to run very quick and touch a tree .

they ask mia to play with them . they say it is a fun game . mia agrees . she likes to try new games .

they start the race . lila and sam run very quick . they think they will win . but mia runs quicker . she is very fast . she touches the tree first . she wins the game .

lila and sam are surprised . they did not expect mia to be so fast . they feel angry . they think mia is not fair . they do not want to play with her anymore .

but mia is not mean . she is very nice . she says to lila and sam : " that was a fun game . you are very quick too . do you want to play again ? or do you want to play something else ? i have many toys . we can share them . "

lila and sam look at mia . they see her big smile . they hear her kind words . they feel sorry . they realize mia is not taking their friends away . she is just making new friends . she wants to be their friend too .

they say to mia : " thank you . you are very fast . you are very nice . we want to play with you . we want to be your friend too . "

mia is happy . she hugs lila and sam . they hug her back . they become friends . they play with dolls and cars and toys . they have a lot of fun together . anna liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she could sort the forks and spoons and put them in the right drawers . she could also wash the plates and dry them with a towel . she felt great when her mom said she was a good helper .

one day , her mom had a big cake in the oven . it was for anna 's birthday . she told anna to be careful and not touch the oven or the cake . she said she had a surprise for her later . anna was curious and excited . she wanted to see the cake and the surprise .

she finished sorting the forks and spoons and moved on to the plates . she washed them with soap and water and rinsed them well . she picked up a big plate and tried to dry it with the towel . but the plate was slippery and heavy . it slipped from her hands and fell on the floor . it broke into many pieces . anna was scared and sad . she started to cry .

her mom heard the noise and came to the kitchen . she saw the broken plate and anna 's tears . she hugged anna and said , " it 's okay , sweetie . it was an accident . do n't worry about the plate . i have more plates . the important thing is that you are not hurt . i love you very much . "

she helped anna clean up the mess and gave her a kiss . she said , " now , do you want to see your surprise ? " she opened the oven and took out the cake . it was a beautiful cake with pink frosting and candles . it had anna 's name on it . anna 's eyes lit up . she smiled and said , " wow ! mom , you made me a cake ! it looks great ! thank you , thank you , thank you ! "

her mom smiled and said , " you 're welcome , my dear . happy birthday , anna . you are a great helper and a great daughter . i 'm so proud of you . " she put the cake on a new plate and lit the candles . she said , " now , make a wish and blow out the candles . " anna closed her eyes and made a wish . she wished for more happy days with her mom and her cake . she blew out the candles and hugged her mom . they both laughed and clapped . they cut the cake and ate it together . it was the best birthday ever . one night , lily and her dad went outside to look at the sky . they saw many stars that glow like little lights . lily liked to count the stars and make shapes with them . she saw a big bear , a fish and a spoon .

then , lily saw something very bright and fast in the sky . it was a star that moved across the sky like a bird . lily pointed and said , " look , dad , a shooting star ! " her dad smiled and said , " that 's right , lily , a shooting star . do you know what you can do when you see a shooting star ? "

lily shook her head and said , " no , what can i do ? " her dad said , " you can make a wish . a wish is something you want very much . you can close your eyes and say it in your mind . but do n't tell anyone , or it wo n't come true . "

lily closed her eyes and thought hard . she wished for a new doll , a big cake and a hug from her mom . she opened her eyes and said , " i made a wish , dad . " her dad said , " that 's good , lily . i hope your wish comes true . "

they hugged and went back inside . it was a mild night , not too cold and not too hot . lily felt happy and sleepy . she said good night to her dad and went to bed . she dreamed of stars and wishes . tom and lily were playing in the bathroom . they liked to turn on and off the faucet and make bubbles with the soap . they also liked to lock the door and pretend they were in a secret place .

" look , lily , i can make a big bubble ! " tom said , blowing into his hand . " can you do it too ? "

lily tried , but she could not make a bubble . she felt sad and angry . she wanted to be as good as tom . she thought of a way to make him stop .

" i know , tom , let 's play a game ! " lily said , smiling . " you close your eyes and count to ten , and i will hide . then you have to find me ! "

tom liked games . he agreed and closed his eyes . lily quickly ran to the door and locked it . then she hid behind the shower curtain .

" ready or not , here i come ! " tom said , opening his eyes . he looked around the bathroom , but he could not see lily . he went to the door and tried to open it , but it was locked .

" lily , where are you ? " tom called . " open the door , please ! "

lily did not answer . she felt proud . she had tricked tom and made him stuck . she thought it was funny .

tom felt scared . he did not like being locked in the bathroom . he banged on the door and shouted for help , but no one heard him . he started to cry .

lily heard tom crying . she felt sorry . she realized she had been mean and hurt tom 's feelings . she wanted to say sorry and open the door , but she did not know how . she had locked the door with the key , but she had dropped the key in the sink . she tried to reach it , but it was too far . she also started to cry .

they both cried and cried , until their mom came home . she heard them and ran to the bathroom . she saw the locked door and the key in the sink . she was angry and worried . she used a tool to open the door and found tom and lily sobbing .

" what happened here ? " she asked . " why did you lock the door and make a mess ? "

tom and lily told her what they had done . they felt ashamed . they knew they had been wrong .

mom hugged them and comforted them . she also scolded them and taught them a lesson .

" you should never lock the door and play with the faucet . it is dangerous and wasteful . you could get hurt or flood the bathroom . and you should never be mean to each other . you are brother and sister . you should love and respect each other . do you understand ? "

tom and lily nodded . they said sorry to mom and to each other . they promised to be good and kind . they learned their lesson , but they also lost their game and their fun . they wished they had not locked the door .

the end .

moral value : do not lock the door and play with the faucet . it is dangerous and wasteful . do not be mean to each other . love and respect your brother and sister . lily and tom are playing in the park . they see a big thing with four legs and a long nose . it makes a loud sound like " trumpet " .

" what is that thing ? " lily asks .

" i do n't know . let 's guess ! " tom says .

lily thinks hard . she says , " is it a big dog ? "

tom shakes his head . he says , " no , it is not a dog . dogs have fur and tails . this thing has no fur and no tail . "

tom thinks hard . he says , " is it a big horse ? "

lily shakes her head . she says , " no , it is not a horse . horses have manes and hooves . this thing has no mane and no hooves . "

they are both puzzled . they go closer to the thing . the thing sees them and makes another loud sound . it also sprays water from its nose .

lily and tom are surprised and wet . they laugh . they say , " this thing is silly ! "

a man comes to the thing . he says , " hello , kids . this is my elephant . his name is raja . he likes to play and make noise . do you want to pet him ? "

lily and tom nod . they are happy . they pet the elephant . they learn a new word . they say , " elephant ! " tom and amy liked to play with their toy trains . they had a big track that went around the room , with bridges and tunnels and stations . they were very enthusiastic about their trains and made them go fast and slow and honk and whistle .

one day , tom wanted to play with amy 's new train . it was shiny and red and had a big engine . amy said no , it was her train and she did not want to share . tom got angry and tried to grab the train from amy . they fought and pulled and pushed , and the train fell off the track and broke .

amy started to weep . she loved her new train and now it was ruined . she cried and cried and said tom was mean and bad . tom felt sorry and tried to say he was sorry , but amy did not listen . she ran to her mom and told her what tom did .

mom came and saw the broken train and the track all messed up . she was very upset and scolded tom . she said he had to go to his room and think about what he did . she said he could not play with trains for a week . she took amy and her train to the repair shop and hoped they could fix it .

tom went to his room and felt very sad . he liked trains and he liked amy , but he did a bad thing . he wished he could say sorry and make amy happy again . he wished he could play with trains and have fun . he lay on his bed and wept . he had no friends and no trains . he had a bad day . lily and tom were best friends . they liked to play with their toys and ask questions . they wanted to learn new words every day . one day , they found a big book in the attic . it had many pictures and words they did not know .

" look , tom , what is this ? " lily asked , pointing to a word on the page .

" i do n't know , lily . maybe it is a name of a place or a thing , " tom said , trying to sound smart .

they turned the pages and saw more words and pictures . they saw animals , plants , cars , stars , and many other things . they tried to say the words out loud , but they were hard to pronounce .

" tom , this book is too big for us . we need a grown - up to help us read it , " lily said , feeling sad .

" maybe we can ask mom or dad later . but let 's keep the book for now . it is our lucky find . maybe we can learn some words by ourselves , " tom said , feeling hopeful .

they put the book in their backpack and went downstairs . they did not see the note on the book that said : " do not open . this book belongs to grandpa . it is a magic book that can take you to different worlds . be careful what you wish for . " lily and ben were twins who liked to play music . lily played the piano and ben played the saxophone . they learned from their dad , who loved jazz . jazz was a kind of music that made people happy and dance .

one day , they decided to visit their grandpa , who lived in a big house . they wanted to show him their music and make him smile . but when they got there , they saw that grandpa was grumpy . he did not want to talk or play with them . he just sat on his chair and read his newspaper .

" grandpa , why are you so grumpy ? " lily asked .

" because i am old and tired and bored , " grandpa said .

" can we play some music for you ? " ben asked .

" no , i do n't like music . it is too loud and noisy , " grandpa said .

lily and ben felt sad . they wanted to make grandpa happy , but he did not like their music . they wondered what to do .

then , they had an idea . they went to the piano and the saxophone and started to play jazz . they played softly and gently , but with joy and rhythm . they played songs that their dad taught them , songs that grandpa used to like when he was young .

at first , grandpa did not notice . he kept reading his newspaper . but then , he heard the music . he looked up and saw lily and ben playing . he felt something in his heart . he felt a warm and happy feeling . he remembered his youth , when he used to dance and sing to jazz . he remembered his wife , who loved jazz too . he felt a tear in his eye .

he put down his newspaper and got up from his chair . he walked to the piano and the saxophone and hugged lily and ben .

" thank you , my dear children , " he said . " you have made me happy . you have reminded me of the beauty of music . i am sorry i was grumpy . i love you and i love your music . "

lily and ben smiled . they were glad they made grandpa happy . they learned that music can heal and connect people . they learned that jazz is a gift that they can share with others . they learned that they can always visit grandpa and play jazz for him . lily had a bad fall from her bike . she hurt her arm and cried a lot . mom took her to the doctor . the doctor was nice and gave her a sticker . he said he needed to take a picture of her arm with a special machine . he called it an x - ray .

lily was scared of the machine . it looked big and loud . she did not want to leave mom . mom said , " do n't worry , lily . i will be right here with you . the x - ray will not hurt . it will help the doctor see if your arm is broken or not . it will be very quick . can you be brave for me ? "

lily nodded and held mom 's hand . the doctor put her arm on a table and covered it with a cloth . he said , " now , lily , i need you to stay very still and not move your arm . i will go behind that window and press a button . you will hear a beep and see a flash . that 's the x - ray . it will be over in a second . are you ready ? "

lily said , " yes , i 'm ready . " she closed her eyes and squeezed mom 's hand . she heard the beep and saw the flash . she did not feel anything . the doctor came back and said , " good job , lily ! you did great . let me see your x - ray . " he showed her a picture of her arm with white lines and shapes . he said , " look , lily , this is your arm . see , it is not broken . it is just bruised . you will be fine . you just need some ice and a bandage . "

lily smiled and said , " thank you , doctor . i 'm glad my arm is not broken . " mom hugged her and said , " i 'm so proud of you , lily . you were very brave . let 's go home and have some ice cream . " lily said , " yes , let 's go home . i love you , mom . " they left the doctor 's office and went to the car . lily felt peaceful and happy . she had a good day after all . anna and ben like to play with paper . they can make many things with paper . they can fold paper into hats , boats , planes and animals . they have a big box of paper in different colors and shapes .

one day , they want to make a big paper castle . they fold many paper squares into bricks . they stack the bricks to make walls and towers . they fold paper triangles into roofs and flags . they fold paper circles into windows and doors . they use glue to stick everything together .

" look at our castle ! " anna says . " it is so big and pretty ! "

" yes , it is ! " ben says . " we are very good at folding paper . this is a success ! "

they are very happy with their paper castle . they play with it for a long time . they pretend to be a king and a queen . they invite their toys to visit their castle . they have a lot of fun .

but after a while , they start to feel tired . folding paper is hard work . their fingers are sore . their eyes are sleepy . their castle is also a bit messy . some bricks are falling off . some roofs are bent . some windows are torn .

" maybe we should stop playing now , " anna says . " we can play with our castle again tomorrow . "

" ok , " ben says . " but where should we put our castle ? it is too big for our box . "

they look around for a place to store their castle . they see a big shelf in the corner . it has some books and toys on it . there is some space left .

" let 's put our castle on the shelf , " anna says . " it will be safe there . "

" good idea , " ben says . " but how can we lift it ? it is too heavy for us . "

they think for a moment . then they have an idea . they fold their castle again . they fold the walls and towers into smaller bricks . they fold the roofs and flags into smaller triangles . they fold the windows and doors into smaller circles . they make their castle smaller and smaller until it fits in their hands .

" wow , we can fold our castle very small ! " anna says . " this is another success ! "

" yes , it is ! " ben says . " we are very clever at folding paper . "

they carry their folded castle to the shelf . they put it next to their books and toys . they are proud of their castle . they smile at each other .

" let 's go to bed now , " anna says . " we are very tired . "

" ok , " ben says . " but tomorrow , we can unfold our castle and play with it again . "

" ok , " anna says . " that will be fun . "

they hug each other . they say good night to their castle . they go to their beds . they fall asleep . they dream of their paper castle . lily loved to draw . she had many colors and papers . she liked to make pictures of animals and flowers and stars . she used her brain to think of new ideas . she was very good at drawing .

one day , she wanted to draw a bird . she looked at a book with many birds . she saw a big bird with white and black feathers . it had a yellow beak and feet . it was an eagle . lily liked the eagle . she wanted to draw it .

she took a blue paper and a black crayon . she drew a big circle for the head . she drew a triangle for the beak . she drew two dots for the eyes . she drew a long line for the body . she drew two curves for the wings . she drew two sticks for the legs . she drew four claws for the feet . she filled the head and the wings with white . she left the body and the feet black . she looked at her drawing . she was happy . she had made an eagle .

she showed her drawing to her mom . her mom smiled . she said , " wow , lily , you drew an eagle ! it looks very nice . you are very smart and creative . i am proud of you . "

lily smiled too . she hugged her mom . she said , " thank you , mom . i love you . i love drawing . i want to be like an eagle . i want to soar in the sky . " mia and leo were playing with their toys in the living room . mia had a doll and leo had a car . they liked to make up stories with their toys and pretend they were going on adventures .

" let 's go to the park ! " mia said , holding her doll . " we can have a picnic and play on the swings . "

" okay ! " leo agreed , pushing his car . " but we have to be careful . there is an enormous dog in the park . he is very big and loud and he likes to chase cars and dolls . "

mia and leo pretended to drive and walk to the park . they found a nice spot under a tree and spread out a blanket . they took out some snacks and drinks from their toy basket and shared them with their toys .

" this is fun ! " mia said , smiling . " but where is the enormous dog ? i do n't see him . "

" maybe he is sleeping , " leo said , looking around . " or maybe he went to another park . he is not here . "

just then , they heard a loud bark . they turned around and saw a big , fluffy dog running towards them . he had a long , colorful yarn in his mouth . he looked happy and playful , but mia and leo were scared .

" ah ! it 's the enormous dog ! " mia screamed , grabbing her doll . " he has our yarn ! we need it for our crafts ! "

" run ! " leo shouted , picking up his car . " he might want our toys too ! "

mia and leo ran away from the dog , leaving their blanket and basket behind . the dog followed them , wagging his tail and barking . he wanted to play with them and share his yarn . he did not know why they were afraid of him .

" help ! help ! " mia and leo cried , looking for their mom and dad . " there is an enormous dog chasing us ! "

their mom and dad heard them and came out of the kitchen . they saw the dog and recognized him . he was their neighbor 's dog , max . he was very friendly and gentle , but he liked to run away and find things to play with .

" max ! what are you doing here ? " their mom asked , holding out her hand . " did you escape from your yard again ? "

the dog stopped and dropped the yarn . he licked their mom 's hand and wagged his tail . he looked at mia and leo and tilted his head . he wanted to say sorry and be their friend .

" it 's okay , kids , " their dad said , hugging them . " this is max . he is not a bad dog . he just likes to play . he wo n't hurt you or your toys . he found your yarn and thought it was a toy too . "

mia and leo looked at max and saw that he was not so scary . he was just a big , fluffy dog . they felt sorry for running away from him . they decided to give him a chance and be nice to him .

" hi , max , " mia said , petting his fur . " we are sorry we were scared of you . do you want to play with us ? "

" yes , max , " leo said , holding out his car . " we have lots of toys . you can play with our yarn if you want . but you have to be gentle and not pull it too hard . "

max barked and wagged his tail . he was happy that mia and leo were not afraid of him anymore . he liked them and their toys . he wanted to play with them and share his yarn .

