her friend tom came to play with her . tom looked at the board and wanted to draw too . but he did not understand how to use it . mia saw that tom was sad and had an idea .

mia took tom 's hand and showed him how to draw on the beautiful board . tom was so happy , and they drew many fun things together . in the end , they both understood how to use the board and had a great day playing and drawing . once upon a time , there was a messy little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the mud . one day , she saw a shiny red bike with pedals . she wanted to ride it very fast .

" mom , can i ride the bike ? " lily asked . her mom said , " yes , but be careful and do n't rush . "

lily got on the bike and started to pedal . she went slow at first , then faster and faster . she forgot what her mom said and began to rush . the wind blew her messy hair as she rode .

suddenly , lily saw a big rock in front of her . she tried to stop , but it was too late . the bike hit the rock and she fell into a big mud puddle . she was even more messy now , but she was okay .

lily learned that day that it 's important to listen and not to rush . she still loved playing in the mud , but she made sure to pedal carefully from then on . once upon a time , there was a lawyer named tom . tom liked to help people . he wanted to make sure everyone was treated fair .

one day , a man came to tom . the man was sad because someone took his toy . tom wanted to help the man get his toy back . so , tom went to talk to the person who took the toy .

tom told the person , " it is not fair to take toys from others . please give the toy back to the man . " the person felt bad and gave the toy back . the man was very happy .

tom taught the person that it is important to be fair and not take things from others . everyone learned to share and be kind to each other . and they all lived happily ever after . sara and tom are friends . they like to play with pastels . pastels are soft and colorful . they can make pictures with them on paper .

one day , sara and tom walk to the park with their pastels . they want to draw flowers and trees and birds . they see a big bench . the bench is empty . they put their pastels on the bench . they start to draw .

but then , a big dog comes . the dog is brown and furry . the dog is curious . he sees the pastels . he thinks they are toys . he jumps on the bench . he grabs a pastel with his mouth . he runs away .

" hey , stop ! " sara shouts . " that is our pastel ! "

tom runs after the dog . he tries to catch him . but the dog is fast . he runs to the other side of the park . tom is tired . he stops .

sara is sad . she likes that pastel . it is her favorite color . it is pink .

then , a girl comes . the girl is older than sara and tom . she has long hair and a blue dress . she has a leash in her hand . she sees the dog . she sees the pastel .

" that is my dog ! " the girl says . " i am sorry . he likes to play with everything . he does not know better . "

she calls the dog . the dog comes . he drops the pastel . the girl picks it up . she walks to sara and tom . she gives them the pastel .

" here you go , " the girl says . " i am sorry he took your pastel . are you okay ? "

sara and tom smile . they are happy . they have their pastel back . it is not broken . it is still pink .

