" my name is lisa , " the girl says . " what are your names ? "

" i am sara , and this is tom , " sara says . " we are friends . we like to draw with pastels . "

" that is nice , " lisa says . " can i see your pictures ? "

sara and tom nod . they show lisa their pictures . lisa likes them . she says they are beautiful .

" can i draw with you ? " lisa asks .

sara and tom nod again . they have a new friend . they share their pastels . they draw more pictures . they have fun . sara and tom were playing at the beach . they liked to dig in the sand and look for shells and pebbles . sara found a pebble that was very weird . it was round and smooth , but it had many colors on it . it looked like a rainbow .

" look , tom , look at my pebble ! " sara said , holding it up . " it is so pretty and weird ! "

tom came over and looked at the pebble . he agreed that it was pretty and weird . he wanted to touch it and see if it felt smooth too .

" can i hold your pebble , sara ? " tom asked .

sara thought for a moment . she liked her pebble very much , but she also liked tom . he was her friend and he always shared his toys with her .

" okay , tom , you can hold my pebble . but be careful , do n't drop it or lose it ! " sara said , handing him the pebble .

tom took the pebble and felt it in his hand . it was smooth and cool , and it sparkled in the sun . he enjoyed holding the pebble and looking at its colors .

" thank you , sara , this is a very nice pebble . you are a good friend , " tom said , smiling .

sara smiled back . she was happy that tom liked her pebble and that he was nice to her . they decided to keep the pebble and share it . they put it in their bucket and went back to digging and looking for more shells and pebbles . they had a lot of fun at the beach . lila and ben were playing in the sandbox . they had many toys to make shapes and castles . lila liked to fill her bucket with sand and dump it on ben 's head . ben did not like that . he said , " stop , lila ! that is not nice . you make me dirty and sad . "

lila did not stop . she laughed and said , " it is fun , ben . you are silly . i have a weapon . it is my bucket . i can fill it with anything and throw it at you . "

ben was angry . he looked around and saw a stick . he thought , " i can use this stick as a weapon . i can hit lila with it and make her stop . " he picked up the stick and ran towards lila .

but then he saw a bird . the bird was on the ground . it had a broken wing . it looked scared and hurt . ben felt sorry for the bird . he forgot about lila and the stick . he put down the stick and went to the bird . he said , " hello , bird . you are hurt . i want to help you . i will be gentle . do not be afraid . "

lila saw ben and the bird . she stopped laughing . she felt bad for the bird too . she said , " ben , can i help you ? i am sorry i was mean to you . i do not want to use my bucket as a weapon . i want to use it to help the bird . "

ben smiled and said , " yes , lila . you can help me . we can fill the bucket with water and give it to the bird . we can also find some food and a soft place for the bird to rest . we can be gentle and kind to the bird . "

lila and ben worked together to help the bird . they filled the bucket with water and found some seeds and worms . they made a nest with leaves and grass . they gave the bird water and food and put it in the nest . they said , " we hope you get better , bird . we are your friends . we will come back and visit you . "

the bird chirped and thanked them . lila and ben hugged and said , " we are sorry we fought . we learned that weapons are bad and gentle is good . we learned that helping is better than hurting . we learned that we are better friends when we share and care . " sara and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys . but they do not like to share . one day , they find a big jar of money in their dad 's closet . they want to buy new toys with the money .

sara says , " i saw the money first . it is mine . i will buy a doll and a dress and a hat . " ben says , " no , it is mine . i will buy a car and a truck and a plane . " they start to pull the jar from each other . they are very angry .

then , they hear a loud noise . it is their dad . he comes into the closet . he sees sara and ben with the jar . he is very surprised . he says , " what are you doing with my money ? this is not your money . this is my money . i was saving it for something amazing . "

sara and ben feel ashamed . they let go of the jar . they say , " we are sorry , dad . we wanted to buy new toys . we did not know it was your money . " their dad says , " it is okay . i forgive you . but you should not take things that are not yours . and you should share with each other . sharing is caring . "

he hugs sara and ben . he says , " do you want to know what i was saving the money for ? " they nod . he says , " i was saving the money for a trip . a trip to the zoo . a trip for all of us . do you want to go to the zoo ? " sara and ben smile . they say , " yes , dad . we want to go to the zoo . that sounds amazing . " they hug their dad . they are happy . they learn a lesson . they decide to share their toys . and they look forward to the zoo . lily and max are friends . they love to play with toys . they have many toys , but their favorite is a big train . the train has many cars and makes noises . they can push the train on the floor and pretend to go to different places .

one day , lily and max are playing with the train in lily 's room . they are happy and have fun . they take turns to be the driver and the passenger . they say , " choo choo ! all aboard ! "

but then , lily 's little brother , ben , comes in . he sees the train and wants to play too . he grabs the train and runs away . lily and max are sad and angry . they say , " hey , that 's our train ! give it back ! "

ben does not listen . he laughs and says , " no , it 's my train now ! i 'm the best player ! "

lily and max chase ben around the house . they try to get the train back , but ben is fast and sneaky . he hides behind the sofa , under the table , and in the closet . he makes fun of lily and max . he says , " you ca n't catch me ! you are slow and silly ! "

lily and max are tired and frustrated . they do n't like ben . they think he is mean and rude . they say , " we do n't want to play with you ! you are a bad player ! "

but then , they hear a loud crash . they run to the kitchen and see what happened . ben tripped over a chair and fell down . he dropped the train and broke it . the train is in pieces and does not make noises anymore . ben is hurt and scared . he cries and says , " ow , ow , ow ! i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry ! "

lily and max feel sorry for ben . they see that he is not a bad player , just a little brother who wanted to join them . they say , " it 's okay , ben . we forgive you . we can fix the train together . do you want to play with us ? "

ben nods and smiles . he says , " yes , please . thank you , lily and max . you are good players and good friends . "

lily and max hug ben and help him up . they go to lily 's room and look for glue and tape . they work together to put the train back . they are happy and have fun . they say , " we love our train and we love each other ! " lily and max were very happy . they were going on a trip with mom and dad . they packed their bags with toys and clothes . they got in the car and drove for a long time .

" are we there yet ? " lily asked .

" soon , sweetie , " mom said . " we are going to a place with many colorful things to see and do . "

lily and max looked out the window . they saw trees and flowers and animals . they saw a big sign that said " welcome to the zoo " .

" wow ! " max said . " look at all the animals ! "

they got out of the car and walked to the gate . they saw a map of the zoo . it had pictures of different animals and where to find them .

" where do you want to go first ? " dad asked .

" i want to see the monkeys ! " lily said .

" i want to see the lions ! " max said .

" okay , let 's go see the monkeys first , then the lions , " mom said .

they followed the signs to the monkey house . they saw many monkeys of different sizes and colors . some were swinging from the trees , some were playing with each other , some were eating bananas .

" look at that one ! " lily said , pointing to a big monkey with a red face . " he is so funny ! "

" he seems to be the boss of the monkeys , " dad said .

lily and max laughed as they watched the monkey make noises and gestures to the other monkeys .

they had a lot of fun at the zoo . they saw many other animals , like elephants , giraffes , penguins , and bears . they learned their names and what they ate and how they lived . they also rode a train , ate ice cream , and bought souvenirs .

they were very tired when they got back to the car .

" did you enjoy the trip ? " mom asked .

" yes , it was awesome ! " lily and max said .

they hugged mom and dad and thanked them for the trip .

they fell asleep in the car , dreaming of the colorful animals they saw . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the park . they had a favorite slide that was blue and shiny . they took turns to go down the slide and zip to the bottom .

one day , they saw a new boy in the park . he had a big bag of wood blocks . he was building a tower near the slide . lily and ben wanted to see his blocks , but he said no .

" go away ! these are my blocks . you ca n't touch them ! " he said .

lily and ben felt sad and angry . they wanted to play with the blocks too . they thought the boy was mean and selfish .

they decided to make a plan . they waited until the boy went to the water fountain . then they ran to his tower and knocked it down . the blocks fell and scattered everywhere .

the boy came back and saw his tower was gone . he cried and shouted .

" who did this ? who ruined my tower ? you are bad and mean ! " he said .

lily and ben felt guilty and sorry . they realized they had done something wrong . they had hurt the boy 's feelings and destroyed his work .

they went to the boy and said sorry .

" we are sorry . we were angry and jealous . we wanted to play with your blocks . but we should not have knocked down your tower . that was not nice . can we help you build it again ? " they said .

the boy stopped crying and looked at them . he felt surprised and curious . he said yes .

" okay . you can help me . but you have to be careful and gentle . these are my blocks . i like them a lot . maybe we can share them and play together . " he said .

lily and ben smiled and nodded . they helped the boy pick up the blocks and build a new tower . they learned to be kind and respectful . they made a new friend . they had fun playing with the blocks and the slide . they zipped to the bottom and laughed . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the park with their dog , spot . spot is a big , brown dog who can run very fast and catch a ball . anna and ben throw the ball for spot and he brings it back to them .

one day , they see a new thing in the park . it is a big , shiny thing with wheels and a horn . it is a truck . the truck is making a loud noise and moving dirt . anna and ben want to see the truck , but spot is scared . he barks at the truck and runs away .

anna and ben run after spot . they call his name and try to catch him . but spot is too fast and he runs into the street . anna and ben stop at the edge of the sidewalk . they see a car coming towards spot . they are very scared . they scream , " spot , stop ! "

the car sees spot and stops . spot sees the car and stops . he is very lucky . he is not hurt . the car driver gets out and pets spot . he says , " you are a good dog . you are very brave . you should be careful of the street . it is dangerous . "

anna and ben run to spot and hug him . they are very happy . they say , " thank you , thank you , thank you ! " to the car driver . he says , " you are welcome , welcome , welcome ! " he gives them a sticker of a truck . he says , " this is for you . it is a useful thing . it can help people move things . but it can also be scary for dogs . you should keep your dog away from the truck . "

anna and ben say , " ok , ok , ok ! " they take the sticker and put it on spot 's collar . they say , " this is for you , spot . it is a reminder . you should stay with us in the park . we love you , spot . "

they go back to the park and play with the ball . spot is tired . he rests on the grass . he is not scared anymore . he is happy . anna and ben are happy too . they have learned a lesson . they have had a shock . they have made a friend . they have had a good day . lily and sam went to the museum with mom and dad . they saw many things that made them happy . they saw big animals , old cars , and shiny rocks . they also saw a room with many pictures on the wall . mom said they were prints .

" what are prints ? " lily asked .

" prints are like copies of paintings . someone uses a machine to make them look the same , " mom explained .

" can we make prints too ? " sam wondered .

" yes , you can . look , there is a table with paper and crayons . you can draw something and then put it in the machine . it will make a print for you , " dad said .

lily and sam ran to the table . they each picked a crayon and started to draw . lily drew a flower . sam drew a dinosaur . they were very proud of their drawings . they put them in the machine and waited . the machine made a noise and then gave them two prints .

" wow , they look just like our drawings ! " lily exclaimed .

" they do ! can we keep them ? " sam asked .

" of course you can . they are your prints . you can also give one to mom and dad if you want , " the machine said .

the machine could talk ! lily and sam were surprised . they looked at the machine and saw a face on it . it had eyes , a nose , and a mouth . it smiled at them .

" hello , i am printy . i am a friendly machine . i like to make prints for children . do you like your prints ? " the machine asked .

" yes , we do ! thank you , printy ! " lily and sam said .

" you 're welcome . you are very honest children . you did not try to take someone else 's prints . you only took your own . that is very good . honesty is important , " printy said .

lily and sam nodded . they agreed with printy . they gave one print to mom and dad and kept one for themselves . they said goodbye to printy and the other prints . they left the museum with happy hearts . they had learned something new and made a new friend . they liked prints . mia and ben are excited . they are going to the park with mom and dad . they want to play on the swings and the slide . they also want to see the sunset . the sunset is when the sky turns red and orange and yellow .

" can we go now , mom ? " mia asks .

" yes , dear . let 's go . ben , are you ready ? " mom says .

ben nods . he is holding his teddy bear . he likes his teddy bear . he takes it everywhere .

they walk to the park . it is not far . they see other kids playing . they hear birds singing . they smell flowers . they are happy .

they get to the park . they run to the swings . mom and dad push them . they go higher and higher . they laugh and shout . they feel the wind in their hair .

they play on the slide . they take turns . they slide down fast . they giggle and clap .

they play on the grass . they roll and tumble . they make shapes with the clouds . they see a dog . they pet it . it wags its tail .

they look at the sky . it is changing . it is getting darker . it is getting prettier . they see the sunset . it is beautiful .

" wow , look at the sunset ! " mia says .

" it 's amazing ! " ben says .

they hug mom and dad . they thank them for taking them to the park . they say they love them .

they watch the sunset . they smile . they are tired . they are happy . they are ready to go home . tom and anna are twins . they like to play with their toys in their room . one day , they find a large box in the corner . they wonder what is inside .

" let 's open it ! " tom says . he pulls the box to the middle of the room . anna helps him lift the lid .

inside the box , they see many books , clothes , and toys . they are not their books , clothes , and toys . they are their big brother 's . he is going to college soon .

" wow , look at all these things ! " anna says . she picks up a teddy bear and hugs it . " can we keep them ? "

" no , we ca n't ! " tom says . he sees a baseball bat and a glove . he wants to play with them . " these are his things . he will be mad if we touch them . "

but anna does not listen . she takes out more things from the box . she finds a hat , a scarf , and a pair of sunglasses . she puts them on and laughs .

" look at me , i 'm a star ! " she says . she walks around the room and pretends to sing .

tom is angry . he wants to play with the baseball bat and the glove . he grabs them from the box and runs to the door .

" stop , tom , do n't go ! " anna says . she follows him . she trips over a book and falls . she drops the teddy bear and the sunglasses . she hurts her knee and her nose .

she starts to cry . she cries very loud . she cries so loud that their mom hears her . she comes to their room and sees the mess .

" what happened here ? " she asks . she sees the large box , the books , the clothes , the toys , and the twins . she sees anna 's knee and nose . she sees tom 's baseball bat and glove .

she is not happy . she is very angry . she scolds them for taking their brother 's things . she tells them to put everything back in the box . she tells them to say sorry to their brother . she tells them to go to their bed .

tom and anna are sad . they do not want to go to their bed . they want to play with their toys . they say sorry to their mom and their brother . they put everything back in the box . they go to their bed .

they cry in their bed . they cry very soft . they cry so soft that their mom does not hear them . they cry until they fall asleep . mia and ben were playing in the park . they liked to dig in the sand and look for treasures . one day , they found a shiny stone that looked like a star . mia said , " wow , this is a diamond ! it is so pretty and sparkly ! "

ben wanted to see the diamond too . he asked mia , " can i hold it , please ? " mia nodded and gave him the diamond . ben held it in his hand and looked at it closely . he said , " it is very bright and smooth . i wonder where it came from . "

suddenly , a big dog ran towards them . it was smelly and loud . it barked and jumped on ben . ben was scared and dropped the diamond . the dog saw the diamond and thought it was a toy . it grabbed the diamond with its mouth and ran away .

mia and ben were sad and angry . they shouted , " hey , come back ! that is our diamond ! give it back to us ! " they chased the dog , but it was too fast . they lost sight of the dog and the diamond .

they sat on the ground and cried . they had lost their treasure . they hugged each other and said , " we are sorry . we should have been more careful . maybe we can find another diamond someday . " they wiped their tears and went back to their parents . they hoped the dog would not eat the diamond and get sick . they hoped the diamond would make someone else happy . lily and tom were friends who liked to play in the park . they liked to jump on the swings , the slide and the seesaw . they had a lot of fun and laughed a lot .

one day , they saw a new boy in the park . he was sitting on a bench and looked sad . lily and tom wanted to make him happy , so they went to him and said hello .

" hi , what is your name ? " lily asked .

" my name is ben , " the boy said .

" do you want to play with us ? " tom asked .

" no , thank you , " ben said . " i do n't like to play . i do n't like to jump . i do n't like to laugh . i have no spirit . "

lily and tom were surprised . they thought that playing , jumping and laughing were the best things in the world . they wondered why ben had no spirit .

" ben , why do you have no spirit ? " lily asked .

" because my mom and dad are far away . they had to go to work in another place . i miss them a lot . i have no one to play with , to jump with , to laugh with . i have no spirit , " ben said .

lily and tom felt sorry for ben . they wanted to help him . they had an idea .

" ben , we have a gift for you , " tom said .

" what is it ? " ben asked .

" it is a silly hat . it has a big flower on top . it makes you look funny . it makes you smile . it gives you spirit , " tom said .

he put the hat on ben 's head . ben looked at himself in a mirror . he saw the flower moving in the wind . he felt something in his chest . he felt a tickle . he felt a smile . he felt a spirit .

" thank you , lily and tom . you are very kind . you are very good friends . you made me happy . you gave me spirit , " ben said .

he hugged them and then he said , " do you want to play with me ? do you want to jump with me ? do you want to laugh with me ? "

lily and tom nodded and said , " yes , yes , yes ! "

they ran to the swings , the slide and the seesaw . they played , they jumped and they laughed . they had a lot of fun and spirit .

the moral of the story is : friendship can make you happy and give you spirit . sara and ben are twins . they live in a big city with many cars and people . they like to play in the park near their home . one day , they see a big sign that says " spring fair " . they ask their mom if they can go .

" yes , you can go , but only after lunch . you need to eat something first . you will be hungry at the fair , " mom says .

sara and ben nod . they eat their sandwiches and drink their juice . then they put on their jackets and hats . mom gives them some money and a hug . " have fun , but be careful . i will pick you up at four o'clock , " mom says .

sara and ben run to the park . they see many tents and stalls . they smell popcorn and cotton candy . they hear music and laughter . they are very excited . they spring from one thing to another . they ride the carousel and the train . they play games and win prizes . they pet the animals and watch the clowns .

they have so much fun that they forget the time . they also forget to eat . they start to feel hungry . their tummies rumble . they look for something to eat . they see a hot dog stand . they go there and buy two hot dogs with ketchup and mustard . they sit on a bench and eat them .

" yum , these are good , " sara says .

" yes , they are . i was so hungry , " ben says .

they finish their hot dogs and wipe their mouths . they look at their watches . they see that it is almost four o'clock . they remember that mom is coming soon . they get up and go to the gate . they wait for mom . they see her car . they wave and smile . they run to her and hug her .

" hi , mom . we had a great time at the fair , " sara says .

" yes , we did . we did so many things , " ben says .

" i 'm glad you enjoyed it . did you eat anything ? " mom asks .

" yes , we did . we ate hot dogs . they were yummy , " sara says .

" good . i 'm happy you are not hungry anymore . let 's go home . you can tell me more about the fair on the way , " mom says .

sara and ben nod . they get in the car . they buckle their seat belts . they tell mom about their adventures . they are happy and tired . they love spring and the city and the fair . here is one possible story , but there are many other ways to write it .

tom was a farmer who had a big field of corn . he liked to cut the corn when it was ripe and sell it at the market . one day , he saw a big truck with a scary machine on it . the truck stopped near his field and a man got out .

" hello , farmer , " the man said . " i am here to buy your corn . i will give you a lot of money for it . "

tom was happy to hear that . he wanted to have a lot of money to buy a new house and a new tractor . he said yes to the man and went to get his papers .

but the man was not nice . he was a liar and a thief . he did not want to buy the corn . he wanted to cut it and take it away for free . when tom was not looking , he turned on the scary machine and drove it into the field . the machine had big blades that cut the corn very fast and put it in the truck .

tom heard the noise and ran back to the field . he saw the man and the machine and the truck . he was very angry and very sad . he shouted at the man to stop , but the man did not listen . he kept cutting the corn and filling the truck .

tom tried to stop the man , but he was too late . the man had cut all the corn and drove away with the truck . tom was left with nothing but a empty field and a broken heart . he cried and cried and wished he had never trusted the man . he learned a hard lesson that day : not everyone is nice and some people are scary . anna loves animals . she has many books with pictures of animals . she likes to learn their names and sounds . her favorite animal is the leopard . she thinks leopards are great . they have spots and run fast .

one day , anna goes to the zoo with her mom . she is very excited to see the leopards . she runs to the cage where they are . she sees two big leopards lying on a rock . they look sleepy . anna wants to talk to them .

" hello , leopards ! " she says . " you are great ! i like your spots . can you teach me how to run fast like you ? "

the leopards open their eyes and look at anna . they see a small girl with curly hair and a red dress . they are curious . they get up and walk to the fence . they make a low sound .

" roar ! " anna says . " is that how you say hello ? "

the leopards nod . they like anna . she is brave and friendly . they want to teach her something . they point with their paws to a sign on the fence . the sign has words and pictures .

anna looks at the sign . she sees the word " leopard " and a picture of a leopard . she sees the word " fast " and a picture of a leopard running . she sees the word " spot " and a picture of a leopard 's fur .

" wow ! " anna says . " you are teaching me how to read ! thank you , leopards ! you are great ! "

anna 's mom comes to the cage . she sees anna smiling and talking to the leopards . she is amazed . she takes a picture of anna and the leopards . she thinks anna is great too . ben and lily were playing in the woods . they liked to pretend they were explorers , looking for new things . they saw a big log on the ground . it was brown and had holes in it .

" let 's go see what 's inside the log , " ben said . he was curious and brave .

" ok , " lily said . she was not so sure , but she followed ben . she was his best friend .

they walked to the log and peeked inside . they saw something moving . it was long and slimy and had many legs . it was a centipede .

" yuck ! " lily said . she was scared and disgusted . she did not like bugs .

" wow ! " ben said . he was amazed and excited . he liked bugs .

he reached his hand inside the log to touch the centipede . he wanted to see how it felt .

" ben , do n't ! " lily said . she tried to stop him . she knew it was a bad idea .

but it was too late . the centipede bit ben 's finger . it hurt a lot . ben screamed and pulled his hand out . his finger was red and swollen .

" ow , ow , ow ! " ben said . he cried and ran to lily . he wanted her to help him .

" i told you not to touch it , " lily said . she felt sorry for ben , but she was also a little angry . she hugged him and suggested they go home . she knew they needed to tell their mom .

they left the log and the centipede behind . they learned their lesson . they decided to be more careful next time they played in the woods . tom and sam are brothers . they like to play in the yard . they have a toy gun and a toy knife . they pretend to be hunters .

" look , sam , a deer ! " tom says . he points the toy gun at a big brown toy deer . " i will shoot it and get meat for dinner . "

" ok , tom , but be careful . the deer might run away or kick you , " sam says . he holds the toy knife and follows tom .

tom runs to the toy deer and pulls the trigger . the toy gun makes a loud noise . " bang ! bang ! bang ! " tom shouts . the toy deer falls over .

" good job , tom ! you got the deer ! " sam says . he runs to the toy deer and pretends to cut it with the toy knife . " now we have meat for dinner . yum ! "

they hear their mom calling them from the house . " tom ! sam ! come inside ! it 's time to eat ! "

" ok , mom , we 're coming ! " tom and sam say . they leave the toy gun and the toy knife and the toy deer in the yard . they run to the house . they are hungry and happy . they had a busy day of hunting . ben and mia liked to play with blocks . they built towers and houses and bridges with the blocks . sometimes they played together , but sometimes they wanted to see who could build the best thing .

one day , they decided to build a palace . a palace was a big and pretty house where a king or a queen lived . ben and mia each took some blocks and started to build their own palace . they wanted to make their palace bigger and prettier than the other one .

" look at my palace ! " ben said . " it has a lot of windows and a flag and a door . it is the best palace ever ! "

" no , look at my palace ! " mia said . " it has a lot of flowers and a garden and a balcony . it is the best palace ever ! "

they kept building and building , but they did not look at each other . they only looked at their own palace . they were very competitive .

then , something bad happened . ben and mia were so busy building that they did not see the candle on the table . the candle was burning and it was very hot . the candle fell down and landed on some paper . the paper caught fire and the fire spread to the blocks .

" fire ! fire ! " ben and mia shouted . they saw the fire and they were scared . they ran away from the table and called for help .

mom and dad came and saw the fire . they quickly put out the fire with water and a blanket . they were glad that ben and mia were safe , but they were also angry .

" what were you doing ? " mom asked . " you know you are not supposed to play with candles . you could have burned the whole house ! "

" we were sorry , mom , " ben and mia said . " we were building a palace , but we did not pay attention to the candle . we were too competitive . "

mom and dad hugged ben and mia and told them that they loved them . they also told them that they had to be careful and share and cooperate when they played . they said that building a palace was fun , but not as important as being safe and kind .

ben and mia nodded and said that they understood . they said that they were sorry for the fire and the mess . they said that they would help to clean up and that they would not play with candles again .

they also said that they would not be so competitive anymore . they said that they would rather play together than against each other . they said that they would build a new palace , but this time , they would build it for both of them . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with toys . lily has a tank . it is big and green . it can make noise and move . ben wants to see the tank .

" can you show me your tank ? " ben asks lily .

" okay , but be careful . it is my favorite toy , " lily says .

she gives the tank to ben . he holds it in his hands . he pushes a button . the tank makes a loud boom . he likes the noise . he pushes another button . the tank moves forward . he likes the movement .

" wow , this is fun ! " ben says .

he pushes more buttons . the tank makes more noise and moves faster . he does not see where it is going . the tank hits a vase . the vase falls and breaks . it makes a big mess . lily 's mom hears the noise . she comes to the room .

" what happened here ? " she asks .

she sees the broken vase and the tank . she is angry . she takes the tank from ben . she gives it back to lily .

" ben , you are not helpful . you are naughty . you broke my vase . you have to go home now , " she says .

ben is sad . he says sorry to lily and her mom . he goes home . he does not play with the tank anymore . lily is sad too . she likes ben , but she does not like what he did . she hugs her tank . she hopes ben will be more careful next time . lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a big green hill and wanted to climb it . they ran up the hill and looked around . they saw many trees and flowers and birds .

" look , tom , i see a shadow ! " lily said . she pointed to a dark shape on the ground . it looked like a big dog .

" where is the dog ? " tom asked . he looked around but he did not see any dog .

" maybe it is hiding behind the tree , " lily said . she walked towards the tree and called out , " hello , dog , are you there ? can you answer me ? "

there was no answer . lily and tom got closer to the tree and the shadow . they saw that the shadow was not a dog . it was a rock .

" it is not a dog , it is a rock , " tom said . he felt silly .

lily laughed . " it is a funny rock . it looks like a dog . let 's pretend it is our dog . we can name it shadow . "

" ok , let 's do that , " tom said . he smiled .

they played with the rock and pretended it was their dog . they gave it a stick and a ball and a bone . they petted it and talked to it . they had fun with their new friend , shadow . anna and ben are best friends . they like to play together every day . they know each other very well . they share their toys , their snacks and their secrets . they are reliable . they always help each other when they are sad or scared .

one day , they decide to go to the park . they see a big slide . anna wants to try it , but ben is afraid . he thinks it is too high and too fast . he says , " anna , i do n't want to go on the slide . can we play something else ? "

anna says , " ben , do n't be afraid . i will go with you . we can hold hands . it will be fun . trust me . i am your friend . "

ben looks at anna . he sees her smile . he feels her hand . he hears her voice . he knows she is right . he knows she is his friend . he says , " okay , anna . let 's go on the slide . together . "

they climb up the stairs . they sit on the slide . they hold hands . they say , " one , two , three , go ! " they slide down . they feel the wind . they hear the laughter . they see the sun . they are happy . they are brave . they are best friends .

they reach the bottom . they hug each other . they say , " that was awesome ! let 's do it again ! "

they run back to the stairs . they do n't see the man . the man is bad . he has a knife . he wants to hurt them . he waits for them . he is ready to strike .

but someone else sees the man . someone else knows the man . someone else stops the man . it is rex . rex is a dog . rex is a big dog . rex is a good dog . rex is a reliable dog . rex is anna 's dog . rex loves anna . rex loves ben . rex protects them . rex barks . rex bites . rex chases the man away .

anna and ben hear the noise . they turn around . they see rex . they see the man . they see the knife . they are scared . they are shocked . they are grateful .

they run to rex . they pet him . they thank him . they say , " rex , you are a hero ! you saved us ! you are the best dog ever ! "

rex wags his tail . he licks their faces . he knows they are safe . he knows they are his friends . he knows they love him . he feels it in his heart . lily liked to knit with yarn . she made hats and scarves and mittens for her friends and family . she had many colors of yarn , but her favorite was black . she thought black was cool and pretty .

one day , she saw a big truck outside her house . it was a delivery truck . lily ran to the door and opened it . she hoped the truck had something for her .

