the driver opened the door and lifted the box . he smiled at lily . " here you go . this is all for you . enjoy ! "

lily was so happy . she thanked the driver and took the box . she ran inside her house . she wanted to open the box and see the yarn .

but when she opened the box , she saw something terrible . the yarn was not black . it was red . bright red . like blood . and it was not yarn . it was snakes . lots of snakes . they hissed and slithered and bit lily . lily screamed and dropped the box . she was scared and hurt .

the driver heard her scream . he laughed . he was a bad man . he liked to trick and hurt people . he had delivered snakes to lily on purpose . he drove away , leaving lily alone with the snakes . lily cried and cried . she wished she had never opened the box . she wished she had never liked black yarn . lily liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she liked to stir the soup , cut the bread , and taste the cheese . but sometimes , lily was bored and wanted to play with other things . one day , she saw a shiny ball on the table . it was her brother 's ball . he liked to throw it and catch it in the yard .

lily wanted to play with the ball too . she picked it up and threw it in the air . it was fun to see it go up and down . she threw it higher and higher . but then , she threw it too high . the ball flew over her head and hit the stove . the stove was hot and made a loud noise . the ball bounced off the stove and hit a pot . the pot fell off the stove and spilled soup on the floor .

mom heard the noise and ran to the kitchen . she saw the mess and was angry . she asked lily what she did . lily was scared and said she was sorry . she said she just wanted to play with the ball . mom said the ball was not for playing in the kitchen . she said the stove was not a toy . she said the stove was for cooking regular food , not for burning balls . she said lily could have hurt herself or the stove or the pot . she said lily should not throw things in the house . she said lily should only play with safe things in the kitchen , like spoons and cups and plates .

lily felt bad and said she understood . she said she would not throw the ball in the kitchen again . she said she would help mom clean the mess . she said she would ask her brother to play with the ball in the yard later . mom said that was a good idea . she said she was glad lily was okay . she said she loved lily and gave her a hug . lily said she loved mom and gave her a hug too . they cleaned the mess together and then ate some bread and cheese . lily learned that throwing things in the house was not fun . she learned that she should be careful with the stove and the pot . she learned that she should listen to mom and follow the rules . she learned that she could have fun in the kitchen without making trouble . tim and sam were best friends . they liked to play with cars , balls and blocks . one day , tim got a new toy . it was a big robot that could talk and move . tim was very enthusiastic . he wanted to show sam his robot .

" look , sam , look at my robot ! " tim said . " it can say hello and bye - bye . it can walk and dance . it is so cool ! "

sam looked at the robot . he felt sad . he did not have a robot . he only had his old teddy bear . he wanted to play with tim , but tim only wanted to play with his robot . sam tried to talk to tim , but tim ignored him . he did not listen to sam . he only listened to his robot .

" tim , can we play something else ? " sam asked . " can we play with the cars or the balls or the blocks ? "

" no , sam , no , " tim said . " i only want to play with my robot . it is the best toy ever . you can go away . "

sam felt very hurt . he did not like tim anymore . he picked up his teddy bear and left . he did not say bye - bye to tim . he went to find another friend .

tim did not notice that sam was gone . he kept playing with his robot . he was happy for a while . but then , his robot stopped working . it did not talk or move anymore . it was broken . tim tried to fix it , but he could not . he felt very sad . he wanted to play with sam , but sam was not there . he looked for sam , but he could not find him . he realized that he had been very mean to sam . he wished he had not ignored him . he wished he had played with him . he felt very sorry .

he saw a message on the wall . it was from sam . it said : " tim , you are not my friend anymore . you only care about your robot . you hurt my feelings . goodbye . "

tim felt very bad . he wanted to say sorry to sam . he wanted to be his friend again . he hoped that sam would forgive him . he learned a lesson . he learned that friends are more important than toys . he learned that he should not ignore his friends . he learned that he should be kind and share . he hoped that sam would give him another chance . sara and ben were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a big box in the attic . inside the box , there were many old things . sara saw a shiny wand and a hat with stars . ben saw a book with pictures and a cape with a hood .

" let 's play magic ! " sara said . she put on the hat and took the wand . ben put on the cape and opened the book . they pretended to be wizards and witches . they waved the wand and said funny words . they looked at the book and pointed at the pictures .

but something strange happened . the wand and the book were really magic ! they made things come true . sara turned the sofa into a frog . ben made the lamp fly . they laughed and clapped . they did not know they were in trouble .

mom and dad came home and saw the mess . they were angry and scared . they tried to fix the sofa and the lamp , but they could not . they were helpless . they did not know what to do .

sara and ben felt sorry . they did not mean to make mom and dad sad . they wanted to help . they looked at the wand and the book . they remembered what they said and did . they tried to undo the magic . they waved the wand and said sorry . they pointed at the book and said stop .

the magic worked . the sofa turned back into a sofa . the lamp fell down . the frog hopped away . the wand and the book stopped glowing . mom and dad hugged sara and ben . they were happy and relieved . they thanked them for fixing the magic .

sara and ben smiled . they learned a lesson . they decided to join mom and dad and help them clean the attic . they put the wand , the book , the hat and the cape back in the box . they did not play with them again . they played with their own toys . they had fun without magic . tom and lily were playing with their toys in the living room . they had many toys , but they liked the big red truck the best . they took turns to drive the truck around the sofa and the table .

" can i have the truck now ? " lily asked tom .

" ok , but only for a little while , " tom said . he gave the truck to lily and picked up a teddy bear .

lily drove the truck fast and made loud noises . she pretended the truck was going to the park . she had fun with the truck .

after a few minutes , tom wanted the truck back . he put down the teddy bear and walked to lily .

" can i have the truck now ? " tom asked lily .

" no , i want to play more , " lily said . she held the truck tight and drove it away from tom .

tom felt sad and angry . he tried to grab the truck from lily , but she pushed him away . they started to fight over the truck .

" stop ! stop ! " their mom said . she heard the noise and came to the living room . she saw tom and lily fighting over the truck .

" what is going on here ? " she asked .

" tom wants the truck , but i want the truck , " lily said .

" lily wants the truck , but i want the truck , " tom said .

mom looked at the truck . it was big and red , but it was also empty . there was nothing inside the truck .

" did you know that this truck can carry things ? " she asked .

tom and lily stopped fighting and looked at mom .

" what things ? " they asked .

mom smiled and said , " why do n't you find out ? you can request things from each other and put them in the truck . then you can share the truck and drive it together . "

tom and lily liked the idea . they said sorry to each other and hugged . then they started to request things from each other and put them in the truck . they put books , balls , dolls , cars , and more in the truck . the truck was not empty anymore . it was full of things .

tom and lily shared the truck and drove it around the living room . they had more fun with the truck than before . they thanked mom for the idea .

mom was happy to see them playing nicely . she said , " you see , sharing is better than fighting . and sometimes , empty things can be filled with fun . "

tom and lily nodded and said , " yes , mom . we love you . "

they continued to play with the truck until it was time for dinner . they remembered that yesterday , they had pizza for dinner . they wondered what they would have today . they hoped it would be something yummy . one day , a little girl named lily was playing in the park with her doll . she loved her doll very much . she had a pink dress , yellow hair and blue eyes . lily pretended that her doll was a princess and she was a fairy .

but then , a big boy came and snatched her doll . he said , " this doll is ugly . i do n't like it . i will throw it in the trash . " he ran away with the doll , laughing . lily was very sad and scared . she cried and cried .

a little boy named ben saw what happened . he felt sorry for lily . he said , " do n't cry , lily . i will help you . i will rescue your doll . " he ran after the big boy . he was brave and fast .

he caught up with the big boy near a hot dog stand . he saw the big boy holding the doll over a trash can . he said , " stop ! give back the doll . it is not yours . it is lily 's . she loves it . " the big boy said , " no . it is ugly . i do n't care . " he was about to drop the doll .

but ben had an idea . he grabbed a bottle of sauce from the hot dog stand . he squirted the sauce on the big boy 's face . the big boy screamed and let go of the doll . he was angry and messy . he ran away , wiping his eyes .

ben picked up the doll and ran back to lily . he said , " here , lily . i rescued your doll . she is safe and clean . she is not ugly . she is beautiful . " lily smiled and hugged her doll . she said , " thank you , ben . you are very kind and smart . you are my hero . " she hugged ben too .

they became friends and played together . they shared their toys and snacks . they had fun and were happy . the end . lily and tom are twins . they have long , curly hair . they like to play with their hair and make funny shapes . but today , they have to go to the salon . they have to get a haircut .

lily is scared of the scissors . she does not want to cut her hair . she thinks it will hurt . she cries and hides behind mom . tom is brave . he wants to cut his hair . he thinks it will make him look cool . he smiles and sits on the chair .

the lady with the scissors is nice . she talks to tom and shows him pictures . she asks him how he wants his hair . tom points to a picture of a boy with short , spiky hair . he says he wants that . the lady nods and starts to cut his hair .

lily watches from behind mom . she sees tom 's hair fall to the floor . she sees his new hair . it is short and spiky . it looks cool . lily feels something in her chest . she feels envious . she wants to have cool hair too . she stops crying and comes out from behind mom . she says she wants a haircut too .

the lady with the scissors is happy . she says she can give lily a haircut too . she asks her how she wants her hair . lily looks at the pictures . she sees a girl with long , straight hair . she says she wants that . the lady nods and starts to cut her hair .

tom watches from the chair . he sees lily 's hair fall to the floor . he sees her new hair . it is long and straight . it looks pretty . tom feels something in his chest . he feels envious . he wants to have pretty hair too . he says he wants his hair back .

mom and the lady with the scissors laugh . they say hair grows back . they say lily and tom are both beautiful . they say they can play with their hair and make funny shapes again . lily and tom hug each other . they say they love each other . they say they love their hair . they are happy . tom and lily were twins who liked to play with blocks . they had many blocks of different colors and shapes . they liked to build towers and houses and cars with their blocks . sometimes they shared their blocks , and sometimes they fought over them .

one day , tom wanted to build a big tower with all the blocks . he did not want to share with lily . he took all the blocks and put them in a corner . lily was sad and angry . she wanted to play with some blocks too . she asked tom to give her some blocks , but tom said no . he said they were all his blocks .

lily waited for tom to finish his tower . she hoped he would let her play with it when he was done . but tom took a long time to complete his tower . he wanted to make it very tall and strong . he added more and more blocks to his tower . lily got bored and lonely . she looked around for something else to play with .

she saw a book on the shelf . it was a book of news . it had pictures and words about what was happening in the world . lily liked to look at the pictures and make up stories about them . she took the book and sat on the couch . she opened the book and started to look at it .

but she did not see that the book was very old and fragile . the pages were thin and torn . as she turned the pages , some of them ripped and fell out . lily did not notice . she was too busy looking at the pictures .

tom finally finished his tower . he was very proud of it . he wanted to show it to lily . he looked for lily and saw her on the couch . he saw the book in her hands . he saw the pages on the floor . he recognized the book . it was his grandfather 's book . it was a very special book . it was a very old book .

tom was very angry . he ran to lily and snatched the book from her . he yelled at her . he said she was a bad sister . he said she ruined his grandfather 's book . he said he hated her .

lily was very scared . she did not know why tom was so angry . she did not know the book was his grandfather 's book . she did not know the book was very old and special . she did not mean to rip the pages . she felt very guilty . she started to cry .

their mother heard the noise and came to see what was wrong . she saw tom and lily . she saw the book and the pages . she saw the tower and the blocks . she understood what happened . she was very sad and disappointed .

she told tom and lily to sit down and listen . she told them that the book was a gift from their grandfather . he gave it to them before he died . he wanted them to learn about the world and to love each other . he loved them very much . she told them that the book was very precious and irreplaceable . she told them that they should not have played with it without asking . she told them that they should have been more careful and respectful .

she also told them that the blocks were theirs to share . she told them that they should not have been selfish and greedy . she told them that they should have played together and helped each other . she told them that they should have been more kind and generous .

she told them that they had both made a big mistake . she told them that they had both hurt each other and themselves . she told them that they had both broken their grandfather 's heart . she told them that they should both feel sorry and ashamed .

she asked them what they should do to make things better . tom and lily looked at each other . they both felt very sorry and ashamed . they both felt very guilty . they both wanted to make things better .

they said they were sorry to each other . they hugged each other . they said they loved each other . they said they were sorry to their mother . they hugged her . they said they loved her . they said they were sorry to their grandfather . they looked at his picture . they said they loved him .

they asked their mother if they could fix the book . she said they could try . she said they could glue the pages back together . she said they could make a new cover for the book . she said they could write a letter to their grandfather and put it in the book . she said they could keep the book in a safe place and read it together .

they asked their mother if they could play with the blocks . she said they could . she said they could share the blocks and build something together . she said they could make something that their grandfather would like . she said they could make something that would show their love for each other .

tom and lily smiled . they felt a little better . they thanked their mother . they took the book and the blocks . they went to their room . they worked together to fix the book . they worked lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play with their toys and share their snacks . one day , they found a big box in the yard . they wanted to see what was inside .

" maybe it has candy or a new toy , " lily said .

" or maybe it has a monster or a spider , " ben said .

they opened the box and saw a lot of old clothes and books . they were not happy .

" this is not fair , " lily said . " who put this here ? "

" maybe it was mom or dad , " ben said . " they always give us old things . "

they decided to make a fort with the clothes and books . they put some on the ground and some on top . they made a door and a window . they crawled inside and pretended they were in a castle .

" this is fun , " lily said . " we can provide for ourselves . "

" yes , we can , " ben said . " we do n't need anyone else . "

they played for a long time until they heard a voice outside .

" hello , children , " the voice said . " do you like the box ? "

they peeked out and saw a lady with a big smile . she had a badge that said " charity " .

" i 'm sorry to bother you , but i 'm here to pick up the box . it belongs to the charity . we provide clothes and books for people who need them . "

lily and ben felt bad . they did not know the box was for charity . they thought it was for them .

" sorry , lady , " lily said . " we did not know . we thought it was ours . "

" that 's okay , children , " the lady said . " you can keep some of the clothes and books if you want . but please give the rest to me . there are many people who would be happy to have them . "

lily and ben nodded . they gave the lady most of the clothes and books . they kept a few for themselves . they thanked the lady and said goodbye .

they learned a lesson that day . they learned that some things are not fair , but some things are . they learned that it is good to provide for others , not just for themselves . they learned that they can still have fun with what they have .

they hugged each other and smiled . they were still best friends . sara and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park every day . they had a ball , a bike and a kite . they shared their toys and had fun .

one day , they saw a big sign in the park . it said : " keep the park tidy . put your trash in the bin . " sara and ben nodded . they wanted to help keep the park clean .

they played with their ball for a while . they kicked it , threw it and caught it . then they wanted to play with their bike . sara said : " let 's skip to the bike . skipping is fun . " ben agreed . they skipped to the bike , holding hands .

but when they got to the bike , they saw something bad . someone had left a lot of trash on the grass . there were cans , wrappers and bottles . sara and ben felt sad and angry . they said : " who did this ? this is not tidy . this is not nice . "

they looked around and saw a boy . he was holding a can of soda . he was about to throw it on the ground . sara and ben ran to him . they said : " stop ! do n't do that . you have to put your trash in the bin . that 's the rule . if you do n't , the park will be dirty and the animals will be sick . "

the boy looked at them . he felt ashamed . he said : " i 'm sorry . i did n't know . i was just lazy . i wo n't do it again . " he took his can and walked to the bin . he threw it inside . he said : " thank you for telling me . can i play with you ? "

sara and ben smiled . they said : " sure . you can play with us . but you have to be tidy and share . " the boy nodded . he said : " ok . i will . what do you want to play ? "

sara said : " how about kite ? we have a nice kite . we can take turns to fly it . " ben said : " good idea . let 's go . " they gave the boy a pass to join their group . they skipped to the kite , holding hands . they flew the kite high in the sky . they were happy and proud . they had made a new friend and kept the park tidy . lila was a spoiled girl who always wanted more toys . she had a big room full of dolls , cars , books and games , but she was never happy . she always cried and screamed when her mom and dad said no to her .

one day , she saw a shiny red balloon at the park . she ran to the man who was selling them and asked for one . the man said it was two coins , but lila had no coins . she looked at her mom and dad , who were sitting on a bench . they shook their heads and said she had enough toys at home .

lila was very angry . she stomped her feet and threw a tantrum . she grabbed the balloon from the man 's hand and ran away . the man shouted at her , but she did not care . she felt happy with her new balloon .

she ran to the swings and tied the balloon to the metal bar . she climbed on the swing and pushed herself higher and higher . she laughed and smiled as she felt the wind in her hair and the sun on her face . she looked at her balloon and felt proud .

but then , a gust of wind blew the balloon away . it snapped the string and flew up in the air . lila watched in horror as her balloon got smaller and smaller . she jumped off the swing and tried to catch it , but it was too late . the balloon was gone .

lila felt a big hole in her chest . she wanted her balloon back . she cried and cried , but no one heard her . the park was empty and quiet . there was only silence .

she realized she had made a big mistake . she had stolen the balloon and hurt the man . she had been selfish and spoiled . she had lost her balloon and her joy .

she wished she could say sorry to the man and give him back his coins . she wished she could hug her mom and dad and thank them for their love . she wished she could release her anger and sadness and be happy again . tom and lily wanted to go camping in the garden . they asked their mum if they could use the big tent . mum said yes , but they had to be careful and not go too far . she gave them some snacks and a flashlight .

tom and lily carried the tent to the grass . they worked together to set it up . it was hard , but they did it . they felt proud and happy . they put their snacks and flashlight inside the tent . then they ran around the garden , playing and exploring .

" look , a bird ! " lily said , pointing to a tree . " it is singing so pretty . "

tom listened to the bird . he tried to copy its sound . he made his mouth round and blew air . he was whistling ! he whistled louder and louder . the bird whistled back .

" wow , you can whistle ! " lily said . " i want to try too . " she made her mouth round and blew air . but she only made a funny noise . she tried again and again . she could not whistle .

" do n't worry , lily , " tom said . " you will learn soon . whistling is fun , but not easy . you can do other things well , like drawing and dancing . "

lily smiled . she hugged tom . " thank you , tom . you are a good brother . i love you . "

they heard mum calling them . it was getting dark . they ran back to the tent . they ate their snacks and turned on the flashlight . they told each other stories and jokes . they felt cozy and safe in the tent . they fell asleep , dreaming of birds and stars . lila was lonely . she had no friends to play with . she liked to draw squares on the paper , but she wished she had someone to share them with .

