ben and lily are happy . they play with the frog and the doll . they tell jokes . but they are good jokes . they are funny jokes . they make each other laugh . they have fun . lily and tom were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a big motorcycle parked on the street . it was shiny and loud and had two wheels .

