lily and tom nodded . they learned their lesson . they said they would never touch a motorcycle again without requesting . they thanked the man and went home with their mom . they decided to play with their own toys instead . lily loved animals . she wanted to be a veterinarian when she grew up . she liked to help her mom take care of their dog , max . max was old and weak . he had a bad cough and could not run or play .

