he said goodbye and left . lily smiled and cuddled her teddy bear . her mom smiled and cuddled her too . they were not worry anymore . they were happy . ben and lily were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . they saw a big tree with many leaves . they wanted to climb it .

