they learned a lesson . they learned to be careful . they learned to stick together . they learned to share . they were happy . ben and lily were playing in the garden . they saw a big bird with brown feathers and a red thing on its head . it was a turkey . the turkey was making loud noises . ben and lily wanted to examine the turkey .

