they ran back to the fence and looked at the turkey . the turkey was still making loud noises . ben and lily said " gobble gobble " back . they thought the turkey was nice . they liked the turkey more than the cat . tom and sam are brothers . they like to go to camp with mom and dad . they have a big tent and a small fire . they can play and sing and eat marshmallows .

