mom and dad smile and hug them . they say to tom and sam , " that is good . we love you both . now , let us unpack and make our camp . then we can play and sing and eat marshmallows . it will be fine . " lily and max went to the gym with their mom . they liked to play with the balls and the mats and the ropes . they had a lot of fun jumping and rolling and swinging .

but then lily felt a tickle in her nose . she tried to hold it in , but she could not . she sneezed very loud . " achoo ! "

