sara and tom smile . they say , " thank you , thank you ! " they take their ice cream . they lick their ice cream . sara 's ice cream is sweet and creamy . tom 's ice cream is spicy and hot . he makes a funny face . he says , " wow , this is spicy ! it burns my tongue ! "

