he goes to his mom and shows her his car . his mom is cheerful . she hugs him and says he is smart and clever . she says she is proud of him . ben smiles and zips his car around the room . he is happy . lily and ben were bored . they wanted to play outside , but it was raining . they looked out the window and saw the big puddles and the gray sky .

