they hugged and went back to their game . they pretended that the rain was magic and that it made their castle stronger . they had fun until their mom called them for dinner . lily was very happy . she had a great idea . she wanted to invite her friends to play with her new toy . it was a big box with many ropes and beads . she could make knots and bracelets and necklaces with them .

