they threw away their paper shapes and hugged mom . then , they went to sit on the couch . it was a big and soft seat . they liked to sit on it and watch tv or read books . it was a very useful seat . they were happy . anna liked to design things . she used paper , crayons , scissors and glue to make pictures and toys . she had a big box of things to design with . she was very happy .

