the end . lily and ben are kids who like to play outside . they have a big yard with a swing , a slide and a sandbox . they also have a dog named spot who likes to run and bark .

one day , lily and ben want to make a cake with sand . they fill a bucket with sand and water and stir it with a stick . they pour the sand into a pan and put it on the slide to bake in the sun .

but spot sees the pan and thinks it is food . he runs to the slide and tries to lick the sand . lily and ben see him and shout .

" spot , no ! that is not food , that is our cake ! " lily says .

" go away , spot ! you will spoil our cake ! " ben says .

they run to the slide and try to prevent spot from eating the sand . they pull his collar and push his nose . spot does not understand . he thinks they want to play . he wags his tail and jumps on them .

lily and ben fall on the ground . the pan falls too and the sand spills everywhere . spot licks some of the sand and makes a bitter face . he does not like it . he spits it out and whines .

lily and ben are sad . their cake is ruined . they look at spot and sigh .

" spot , you are a bad dog . you ruined our cake , " lily says .

