they get up and run to the yard . they forget about the sand cake . they have fun with spot . they are happy . lily is a nurse . she works at a big house where sick people go . she helps them feel better . she has a book and a pen . she writes in the book what the sick people need .

one day , she goes to see a sick man . his name is tom . he is very heavy . he has a big belly and a red face . he breathes hard . he lies on a bed with wheels .

" hello , tom , " lily says . " how are you today ? "

" not good , lily , " tom says . " i feel tired and sore . my heart hurts . "

lily feels sorry for tom . she puts her hand on his chest . she listens to his heart . it goes thump - thump - thump very fast . she looks at a machine that shows numbers and lines . the numbers and lines are high .

lily takes her pen and writes in her book . she records tom 's heart and how he feels . she needs to tell the doctor .

" tom , you need to eat less and move more , " lily says . " your heart is working too hard . you need to make it strong and happy . "

tom nods . he knows lily is right . he wants to feel better . he says , " thank you , lily . you are a good nurse . you are kind and patient . "

lily smiles . she likes to help tom and the other sick people . she hopes they will get well soon . she says , " you 're welcome , tom . i will come back later . take care . " she pushes the bed with wheels to another room . she goes to see another sick person . she writes in her book . she records what they need . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys . but sometimes they fight over the same toy . one day , they both want to play with the red car .

