one day , his mommy came home from work and brought a friend with her . she said , " tommy , this is mr. lee . he is a lawyer . he helps people with problems and rules . " tommy was curious . he wanted to know what a lawyer does . he asked , " mommy , can i see his work ? "

mommy smiled and said , " sure , tommy . mr. lee , can you show tommy some of your work ? " mr. lee nodded and took out a folder from his bag . he opened it and showed tommy some papers with words and numbers on them . he said , " these are contracts , tommy . they are agreements between people or companies . they say what they will do and what they will get . lawyers write and check contracts to make sure they are fair and clear . "

tommy looked at the papers and tried to read them . he saw some letters he knew , but he did not understand the words . he said , " these are hard , mr. lee . how do you read them ? " mr. lee said , " it takes a lot of practice , tommy . i went to school for many years to learn how to read and write contracts . it is not easy , but it is important . lawyers help people avoid or solve problems with contracts . "

tommy thought for a moment . he said , " mr. lee , you are mighty . you can read and write hard things . you can help people with problems and rules . you are like a superhero . " mr. lee laughed and said , " thank you , tommy . that is very kind of you . but you know what ? you are mighty too . you can play and learn and imagine . you can be anything you want to be . you are like a superhero too . " tommy smiled and said , " thank you , mr. lee . can we play with my toys now ? " mr. lee said , " sure , tommy . let 's play . " they went to tommy 's room and played with his cars , trains , and planes . they had a lot of fun . mommy watched them and smiled . she was happy that tommy had a new friend . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw many things in the park : trees , flowers , dogs , and people . but lily 's favorite thing was the birds . she liked to watch them fly and sing and hop .

" look , ben , a bird ! " lily said , pointing to a blue and yellow bird on a branch . " it is so pretty and smooth . do you know what kind of bird it is ? "

ben looked at the bird . he had a book about birds at home . he tried to remember what the book said . " i think it is a parrot , " he said . " parrots can talk . they can say hello and bye - bye and other words . "

" really ? " lily asked . she wanted to hear the parrot talk . she walked closer to the branch and said , " hello , parrot . can you talk to me ? "

the parrot looked at lily . it tilted its head and opened its beak . it said , " hello , parrot . can you talk to me ? "

lily and ben were surprised and happy . they laughed and clapped their hands . the parrot repeated what they said . they played with the parrot for a while . they asked it questions and taught it new words . the parrot was friendly and smart . it recognized their voices and learned their names .

lily and ben had a lot of fun with the parrot . they decided to come back to the park and visit it again . they said bye - bye to the parrot and thanked it for talking to them . the parrot said bye - bye and thanked them for playing with it . lily and ben waved to the parrot and ran back to their parents . they told them about their new friend , the smooth and pretty parrot . lily and tom were playing in the park with their bikes . they liked to ride fast and do tricks on the ramps . but one day , tom 's bike broke . the wheel came off and the chain fell down .

" oh no , my bike ! " tom cried . " how can i fix it ? "

lily looked at the bike and saw a nut on the ground . it was round and shiny and had a hole in the middle . she picked it up and said , " maybe this nut can help . it can hold the wheel and the chain together . "

she gave the nut to tom and he tried to put it on the bike . but it was too hard . the nut was too small and the wheel was too big . tom felt sad and angry .

" this nut is no good ! " he shouted . " it does n't fit ! "

lily thought for a moment and had an idea . she remembered that her dad had a tool box in the car . she ran to the car and opened the trunk . she found a wrench that was flexible . it could change its size and shape .

she brought the wrench to tom and said , " look , this wrench is flexible . it can make the nut bigger or smaller . let 's try it . "

she helped tom use the wrench to adjust the nut . they made it bigger and bigger until it fit the wheel and the chain . they tightened the nut and put the wheel back on the bike .

" wow , you did it ! " tom said . " you repaired my bike ! "

lily smiled and said , " you 're welcome . i 'm glad i could help . now let 's go ride again . "

they got on their bikes and rode away . they were happy and proud . they had repaired the bike with a nut and a flexible wrench . sara loved to hug her mom every morning . she liked how her mom smelled like coffee and flowers . she also liked to look at her mom 's colorful dresses and scarves . she wanted to be like her mom when she grew up .

one day , sara saw a big box in the living room . it had a bow and a tag that said " for mom " . sara was curious . she asked her dad what was in the box . he said it was a surprise and that she had to wait until tomorrow . sara wondered what it could be .

the next day was mom 's birthday . sara woke up early and ran to the living room . she saw her mom opening the box . she was smiling and laughing . sara saw something shiny and sparkly inside the box . it was a necklace with many colorful stones . sara thought it was beautiful .

mom saw sara and said , " look , honey , this is from your dad . he knows how much i love colorful things . is n't it lovely ? " she put on the necklace and hugged dad . then she hugged sara and said , " and this is from you . you are the best gift i ever had . i love you so much . " she kissed sara on the cheek and said , " let 's go have some coffee and cake . it 's a special day . "

sara was happy . she hugged her mom and dad again . she said , " happy birthday , mom . you are the most colorful and wonderful mom in the world . " she felt warm and cozy . she thought it was a perfect day . tom and lily are friends . they like to play in the grass . they have a ball and a kite . they throw the ball and run with the kite . they are happy .

but sam is not happy . he is angry . he does not have a ball or a kite . he does not have a friend . he is alone . he thinks he is intelligent . he thinks tom and lily are stupid .

he walks to tom and lily . he says , " give me your ball and your kite . they are mine . i am intelligent . you are stupid . "

tom and lily are scared . they say , " no , they are not yours . they are ours . we are not stupid . we are nice . go away . "

sam is very angry . he pushes tom and lily . he takes their ball and their kite . he runs away . he laughs .

tom and lily are sad . they cry . they have no ball and no kite . they have no fun . they are hurt .

the end . ben and lily were twins who loved to play music . they had a big drum that they found in the garage . it was old and dusty , but it made a loud sound when they hit it with their hands or sticks .

one day , they decided to put on a show for their mom and dad . they put on their hats and scarves and took the drum to the living room . they set it on a stool and waited for their parents to come .

" mom , dad , come see our show ! " ben shouted .

" okay , okay , we 're coming , " mom said . " but we have to delay a little bit . we have to finish something in the kitchen first . "

ben and lily felt sad . they wanted to show their parents their original songs . they had practiced a lot and made up funny words and rhythms .

they looked at each other and had an idea . they picked up the drum and carried it to the kitchen . they saw their mom and dad making a cake . they smiled and started to play their drum .

" boom , boom , boom , we have a drum , we have a drum , boom , boom , boom ! " they sang .

" hey , what are you doing here ? " dad asked , surprised .

" we want to show you our show , " lily said . " we have a drum and we have songs . they are original and fun . "

mom and dad laughed and clapped their hands . they liked their children 's show . they gave them hugs and kisses and a slice of cake .

" that was a wonderful show , " mom said . " you are very creative and talented . "

" thank you , mom , " ben and lily said . " we love you and we love our drum . " lily loves puzzles . she has many puzzles with animals , cars , flowers and stars . she likes to make the puzzles on the floor of her room . she feels happy when she sees the pictures .

one day , lily wants to make a new puzzle . it is a big puzzle with a rainbow and a unicorn . she opens the box and sees many pieces . she starts to put them together on the floor . she finds the corners and the edges first . she smiles when she sees the colors .

but then , she hears a loud noise . it is her brother max . he is running to her room . he wants to play with her . he does not see the puzzle on the floor . he rushes in and steps on the pieces . he breaks some of them . he makes a mess .

lily is very sad and angry . she cries and shouts at max . " you ruined my puzzle ! go away ! " max is sorry and scared . he says " i 'm sorry , lily . i did not mean to . i just wanted to play with you . " he tries to hug her , but she pushes him away .

mom hears the noise and comes to see what is wrong . she sees the broken puzzle and the upset children . she hugs them both and says " it 's okay , my loves . it was an accident . we can fix the puzzle together . let 's calm down and say sorry to each other . " she helps them pick up the pieces and look for the ones that are missing . she finds one under the bed and one behind the curtain . she says " you are lucky . we have all the pieces . we can still make the puzzle . " she shows them how to glue the broken ones . she helps them finish the puzzle . they see the rainbow and the unicorn . they feel happy again . they hug each other and say " i 'm sorry , i love you . " mom says " i 'm proud of you . you solved the problem . you are good at puzzles and at being kind . " she gives them a kiss and a cookie . they smile and say " thank you , mom . you are the best . " they play with the puzzle and with each other . they have fun . tom and mia like to collect napkins . they have many napkins of different colors and shapes . they keep them in a big box in their room . sometimes they play with the napkins and make funny things .

one day , they decide to make a napkin castle . they take out many napkins and stack them on the floor . they make walls and towers and a gate . they use tape to hold the napkins together . they are very happy with their castle .

" look at our castle , mia ! " tom says . " it is so big and pretty ! "

" yes , tom , it is ! " mia says . " let 's go inside and pretend we are the king and the queen ! "

they crawl inside the castle and sit on some napkins . they pretend to have a crown and a scepter . they make up stories and laugh .

but then , their mom comes in and sees the mess . she is not happy . she says , " tom and mia , what have you done ? you have used all the napkins in the house ! you have to clean up this mess right now ! "

tom and mia are sad . they do n't want to destroy their castle . they say , " but mom , we were having fun ! we made a napkin castle ! can we keep it , please ? "

mom shakes her head . she says , " no , you ca n't . napkins are not for playing . they are for wiping your mouth and nose . you have to put them back in the box and use them only when you need them . now , hurry up and clean up ! "

tom and mia sigh . they start to take apart their castle and put the napkins back in the box . they are not happy . they wish they could keep their napkin castle . they think it was funny and fun . tom and mia are twins . they like to play with their cat , fluffy . fluffy has soft fur and a long tail . sometimes , fluffy runs away from tom and mia . they chase him around the house .

one day , tom and mia find a new toy . it is a ball that can talk . when they say something , the ball repeats it . tom and mia think it is funny . they take turns to say things to the ball .

" hello , ball ! " tom says .

" hello , ball ! " the ball repeats .

" i like cake ! " mia says .

" i like cake ! " the ball repeats .

tom and mia laugh . they want to say more things to the ball . but they are also competitive . they want to say more things than the other .

" i can count to ten ! " tom says .

" i can count to ten ! " the ball repeats .

" i can sing a song ! " mia says .

" i can sing a song ! " the ball repeats .

tom and mia try to say more and more things . they talk louder and louder . they do not listen to each other . they only listen to the ball .

fluffy does not like the noise . he jumps on the sofa and hides behind a pillow . he wishes tom and mia would stop . he wishes they would play with him . he misses their hugs and kisses . he thinks the ball is boring . he does not want to repeat anything . he only wants to meow . anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the farm . one day , they see a big truck with many bags of wheat . the truck is slow and loud .

" where is the truck going ? " anna asks .

" let 's follow it and see , " ben says .

they run after the truck , but they are careful not to get too close . they see the truck stop at a big building with a sign that says " mill " . they hear a noise like " zzzz " .

" what is that ? " anna asks .

" that is the mill . it makes the wheat into flour , " ben says .

" what is flour ? " anna asks .

" flour is what you use to make bread and cake and cookies , " ben says .

" yum , i like bread and cake and cookies , " anna says .

" me too , " ben says .

they watch as the men take the bags of wheat from the truck and put them in the mill . they see a white powder come out of the mill and go into another truck .

" can we have some flour ? " anna asks .

" no , we ca n't . it is not ours . it belongs to the baker , " ben says .

" who is the baker ? " anna asks .

" the baker is the person who makes the bread and cake and cookies , " ben says .

" can we follow the baker ? " anna asks .

" ok , let 's follow the baker , " ben says .

they run after the truck with the flour . they hope to see the baker and maybe get a treat . they are happy and curious . they like to follow and learn . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . they pretend that the cars are racing on the road .

one day , they find a big car in the garage . it is shiny and black . it has a crown on the hood . it is the king 's car . tom and sam are curious . they want to see the king 's car up close .

they sneak into the garage and climb into the car . they see many buttons and levers . they wonder what they do . tom pushes a button . the car makes a loud noise . sam pulls a lever . the car starts to move .

" wow , this is fun ! " tom says . " let 's go faster ! "

" ok ! " sam says . he pushes another button . the car speeds out of the garage and onto the street .

the car is very fast . it zooms past other cars and people . tom and sam are excited . they feel like they are flying .

but they do not see the red light . they do not see the big truck . they do not hear the horn . they only hear a big crash .

the car is broken . the crown is gone . tom and sam are hurt . they are bleeding . they are crying .

the king sees the car . he is angry . he is sad . he runs to the car . he sees tom and sam .

" who are you ? " he asks . " what have you done to my car ? "

tom and sam are scared . they do not know what to say . they are sorry .

" we are sorry , king , " tom says . " we just wanted to play . "

the king is not happy . he is not kind . he is not forgiving .

" you are bad boys , " he says . " you have ruined my car . you have to pay . "

he takes out a gun . he points it at tom and sam . he pulls the trigger .

the gun makes a loud noise . tom and sam fall to the ground . they are not moving . they are not breathing . they are dead . lila and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big truck in the park . the truck has a cage . in the cage , there is a leopard . the leopard is light and has spots .

lila and ben are curious . they want to see the leopard up close . they sneak behind the truck . they find a door on the cage . the door is not locked . lila and ben open the door . they take the leopard out of the cage .

the leopard is scared and angry . it roars and scratches . lila and ben are scared and sorry . they try to put the leopard back in the cage . but the leopard is too strong and fast . it runs away from them . it runs into the park .

lila and ben hear people scream and shout . they see the leopard chase a dog , a bird , and a man . they see the truck driver run after the leopard . they see the police come with a net and a gun . they see the leopard get caught and put back in the cage .

lila and ben feel bad . they know they did a wrong thing . they go to the truck driver and the police . they say they are sorry . they say they will not take a leopard again . they say they will be good . the truck driver and the police are mad , but they are also glad . they say lila and ben are lucky . they say a leopard is not a toy . they say a leopard is a wild animal . they say a leopard belongs in the zoo . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the park with their mom and dad . one day , they see a big fountain in the park . the fountain has water that goes up and down . it makes a nice sound .

anna and ben run to the fountain . they want to touch the water . mom and dad say , " be careful , do n't get wet . " anna and ben say , " ok , mom and dad . " they put their hands in the water . it feels cold and soft . they laugh and splash .

after a while , anna and ben get tired . they say , " mom , dad , we are sleepy . " mom and dad say , " let 's go home , then . " they take anna and ben to the car . anna and ben fall asleep in the car . they dream of the fountain and the water . they are happy . sara liked to play with her toy dragon . she named him max and took him everywhere . she cared for him a lot . she gave him water and food and hugs . she made him a bed from a box and a blanket .

one day , sara and max went to the park with mom . sara saw a big slide and wanted to try it . she ran to the slide with max in her arms . she climbed up the ladder and sat on the top . she looked down and saw how high it was .

" are you ready , max ? " she asked her toy dragon . " we are going to have fun ! "

but max was heavy . he made sara lose her balance . she slipped and fell off the slide . she screamed and dropped max . he landed on the ground with a thud .

sara was scared and hurt . she cried and looked for max . she saw him lying on the grass . he had a tear in his wing and a dent in his nose . he looked sad and broken .

sara ran to him and picked him up . she hugged him and said , " i 'm sorry , max . i did n't mean to hurt you . you are my best friend . i love you . "

mom came and helped sara . she checked her for bumps and bruises . she said , " you are brave , sara . you are okay . but you have to be careful on the slide . it is too high for you and max . "

she took sara and max to the car . she said , " we can fix max at home . we have some glue and some tape . he will be good as new . "

sara smiled and said , " thank you , mom . you are the best . and thank you , max . you are the best , too . i will always care for you . " anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the garden . they see a big tree with many leaves . anna wants to climb the tree . ben says he can climb higher than anna . he teases her and says she is too small .

anna is not happy . she wants to show ben she can climb too . she finds a root that sticks out of the ground . she holds the root and pulls herself up . she reaches the first branch of the tree . she smiles and says , " look , ben , i can climb too ! "

ben is surprised . he did not think anna could climb the root . he feels sorry for teasing her . he says , " sorry , anna , you are very good at climbing . do you want to climb higher with me ? " anna nods and says , " yes , please , ben , let 's climb together . "

they climb higher and higher . they see many lovely things . they see birds and squirrels and flowers . they see the sun and the clouds and the sky . they feel happy and proud . they are friends again . they say , " we love this tree . it is a lovely tree . " tom and sam were friends who liked to play on the farm . one day , they saw a big bull in the field . the bull had horns and a ring in his nose . he looked angry and scary .

" let 's go and touch the bull ! " said tom . he was brave and curious . " no , do n't do that ! " said sam . he was careful and smart . " the bull might hurt us . he is not a toy . he is a living thing . "

but tom did not listen to sam . he ran towards the bull and tried to grab his horns . the bull did not like that . he snorted and kicked and shook his head . he threw tom off and chased him . tom was scared and sorry . he cried for help .

sam heard tom 's cry and ran to him . he saw the bull coming closer and closer . he had to think fast . he saw a fence nearby . he grabbed tom 's hand and pulled him to the fence . they climbed over it and escaped from the bull .

" are you okay , tom ? " asked sam . he was compassionate and kind . he hugged tom and checked his bruises . " i 'm okay , sam . thank you for saving me , " said tom . he was grateful and humble . he learned his lesson . " i 'm sorry for not listening to you . you were right . the bull is not a toy . he is a living thing . we should respect him and leave him alone . "

the moral of the story is : we should listen to our friends who care for us and not do foolish things that might harm us or others . we should also be compassionate and kind to all living things . lily had a new kitten . she was pale and soft and had blue eyes . lily loved her kitten very much . she named her snowy .

one day , lily and snowy went to the park . they saw many other children and animals . lily wanted to play with them , but snowy was shy . she hid under a bench and did not come out .

lily was sad . she wanted snowy to have fun and make friends . she tried to tell snowy that the park was nice and safe , but snowy did not listen . she was scared of the loud noises and the big dogs .

then , lily saw a boy with a red ball . he looked friendly and kind . lily asked him if he wanted to play with her and snowy . the boy smiled and said yes . he threw the ball gently to lily and she caught it .

lily ran to the bench and showed the ball to snowy . she said , " look , snowy , this is a ball . it is fun to play with . the boy is nice . he wants to play with us . come on , snowy , do n't be afraid . i am here with you . "

snowy peeked out from under the bench . she saw the ball and the boy . she saw that lily was happy and safe . she decided to try to play with them . she came out from under the bench and followed lily to the boy .

the boy was happy to see snowy . he petted her gently and said , " hello , snowy , you are a beautiful kitten . i am glad you came to play with us . my name is ben . "

snowy liked ben . he was gentle and kind . she purred and rubbed against his leg . she played with the ball and lily and ben . she had fun and made friends .

lily was happy too . she hugged snowy and said , " i am proud of you , snowy . you were brave and you tried something new . you learned that the park is not so scary and that you can make friends . you are a good kitten . "

snowy and lily learned a lesson that day . they learned that sometimes it is good to try new things and to trust others . they learned that they can have fun and be happy together . they learned that they are loved . anna and ben are playing with their toys . anna has a pink doll and ben has a blue car . they like to make stories with their toys .

" let 's set up a tea party for the doll , " anna says . " she is hungry and wants some cake . "

" ok , " ben says . " but can my car come too ? he likes cake too . "

anna nods . " sure , your car can come . but he has to be nice and share . "

they find a small table and some cups and plates . they pretend to cut some cake and pour some tea . they give some to the doll and some to the car .

" here you go , doll , " anna says . " this is a yummy cake . it is pink like you . "

" vroom , vroom , thank you , " ben says for the car . " this is a good cake . it is sweet and soft . "

they have fun eating and talking . they are happy and smile . they like to play together . anna and ben are friends . they like to play soccer . one day , they have a big game . they play very hard . they score many goals . they win the game . they are very happy .

they get a trophy . it is shiny and big . they want to show it to their families . they run to the car . anna sees her mom . she waves and smiles . she holds the trophy high .

" mom , look ! we won ! we have a trophy ! " anna shouts .

but her mom does not look . she does not smile . she does not hear . she is deaf . she can only talk with her hands . anna knows that . she feels sad .

she tries to show her mom the trophy with her hands . she points and signs . but her mom is busy . she is talking with another mom . she does not see anna . she does not pay attention .

anna feels angry . she wants her mom to be proud . she wants her mom to see her trophy . she wants her mom to hear her voice . she throws the trophy on the ground . it breaks . it makes a loud noise .

the other mom hears the noise . she looks at anna . she looks at the trophy . she looks at anna 's mom . she is shocked . she is mad .

" anna , what did you do ? that was a very bad thing ! you should not break your trophy ! you should be sorry ! " she scolds .

anna 's mom hears the scolding . she looks at anna . she looks at the trophy . she looks at the other mom . she is confused . she is sad .

she does not know what happened . she does not know why anna is angry . she does not know how to fix it . she hugs anna . she signs .

" anna , i love you . i am proud of you . i am sorry i did not see your trophy . please tell me what happened . please do not be mad . " she pleads .

but anna does not hug back . she does not sign . she does not talk . she is deaf to her mom . she is deaf to her love . she is deaf to her sorry . she turns away . she cries . she runs . she is gone . sara was shy . she did not like to talk to new people . she liked to play with her toys and read her books . but today was a big event . it was her birthday party . her mom and dad invited many friends and family to their house . sara was nervous .

" come on , sara , it 's time to stir the cake batter , " her mom said . she smiled and held a big bowl and a wooden spoon . " you can help me make your birthday cake . what flavor do you want ? "

sara thought for a moment . she liked chocolate . she liked vanilla . she liked strawberry . she could not decide . she looked at her mom and whispered , " can i have all three ? "

her mom laughed and nodded . " sure , why not ? we can make a rainbow cake . that will be fun and pretty . here , you stir the chocolate batter first , then we 'll add the other colors . "

sara took the spoon and started to stir . she felt the batter get thick and smooth . she liked the sound it made . she liked the smell of chocolate . she smiled and forgot about her shyness for a while .

soon , the cake was ready to bake . sara and her mom put it in the oven and set the timer . then they went to the living room , where the guests were waiting . sara saw many faces , some familiar , some not . she felt shy again . she hid behind her mom 's leg .

" hello , everyone , this is sara , the birthday girl , " her mom said . she lifted sara up and gave her a hug . " she 's a little shy , but she 's very sweet and smart . she helped me make a rainbow cake . do you want to see it ? "

the guests clapped and cheered . they said happy birthday to sara and gave her compliments and gifts . sara felt happy and warm . she was still shy , but she was also brave . she said thank you and smiled . she was excited to see her rainbow cake and share it with everyone . she thought it was the best event ever . sara and tom are twins . they like to play together in their room . they have many toys and books on the carpet . but sometimes they fight over the toys and books . they pull and push and yell at each other .

one day , mom comes into their room . she sees the mess and the noise . she is not happy . she says , " sara and tom , you need to separate your toys and books . you can each have half of the carpet . then you can play nicely and quietly . "

sara and tom do not like this idea . they want to have all the toys and books . they say , " no , mom , we do n't want to separate . we want to share . we can play together . "

mom smiles . she says , " that 's very good , sara and tom . sharing is caring . but you also need to respect each other . you ca n't fight over the toys and books . you need to take turns and say please and thank you . then you can have more fun and less trouble . "

sara and tom agree . they say , " ok , mom , we will try to respect each other . we will take turns and say please and thank you . we do n't want to fight anymore . we want to be friends . "

mom hugs them . she says , " i 'm proud of you , sara and tom . you are learning to be kind and polite . that 's very important . now you can play together on the carpet . but remember to clean up when you are done . "

sara and tom nod . they say , " yes , mom , we will clean up . thank you for helping us . we love you . "

mom leaves . sara and tom look at each other . they smile . they say , " we love you , too . " they pick up a toy and a book . they start to play together on the carpet . they are happy .

the end .

moral value : the story teaches the value of sharing , respecting , and being kind to others . it also shows the importance of listening to parents and cleaning up after playing . tom and sue wanted to make a cake for mom . they found a box of cake mix in the pantry and a big bowl . they poured the mix in the bowl and added some water and eggs . they stirred and stirred until the batter was smooth .

" let 's put it in the oven , " tom said . he opened the oven door and saw a lot of smoke . " oh no , the oven is dirty . it has old food and grease inside . it smells terrible . "

sue wrinkled her nose . " that 's gross . we ca n't bake our cake in there . it will taste bad . "

tom had an idea . " maybe we can clean the oven . let 's get some soap and a sponge . "

they ran to the sink and grabbed some soap and a sponge . they went back to the oven and started to scrub the inside . they did not know that the oven was still hot . they did not see the red light that said " on " .

" ouch ! " tom cried . he touched the oven rack and burned his hand . he dropped the sponge and ran to the sink . he put his hand under the cold water .

sue heard him scream and turned around . she saw the sponge catch fire . she dropped the soap and ran to the oven . she tried to grab the sponge , but it was too hot . she burned her fingers and let go . the sponge fell on the floor and set the kitchen rug on fire .

" help ! help ! " tom and sue shouted . they ran out of the kitchen and looked for mom . they found her in the living room , reading a book .

" mom , mom , the oven is on fire ! " they said .

mom jumped up and ran to the kitchen . she saw the smoke and the flames . she grabbed a fire extinguisher and sprayed the oven , the sponge , and the rug . she put out the fire and turned off the oven .

she looked at tom and sue . they had tears in their eyes and blisters on their hands . they looked very sorry .

" what were you doing ? " mom asked .

" we wanted to make a cake for you , " tom said .

" we wanted to test the oven , but it was dirty and terrible , " sue said .

mom hugged them and kissed their boo - boos . she was not angry , but she was worried .

" i appreciate your thought , but you should never play with the oven . it is very dangerous . you could have hurt yourselves or burned the house down . you should always ask me before you use the oven . do you understand ? "

tom and sue nodded . they said they were sorry and they learned their lesson .

mom smiled and said she loved them . she said they could make a cake together later , after they cleaned the kitchen and their hands .

they said they loved her too and they thanked her . they helped her clean the kitchen and their hands . they were happy to be safe and to have a nice mom . they decided to test the oven only when mom was with them . lily was a gifted girl who loved to sing and dance . she liked to make up songs and perform them for her family and friends . one day , she had a big idea . she wanted to put on a show for everyone in her neighborhood .

