when she finished her last song , everyone cheered and applauded . they gave her flowers and hugs and said how wonderful she was . lily felt very happy and proud . she thanked everyone for coming and for being so nice . she said she hoped they liked her show and that they had a good time . she also said she was glad to share her gift with them , because she valued their friendship and support . she said she loved them all very much . then she bowed and waved and went back to her mom and dad , who hugged her and kissed her and told her how much they loved her too . sara and ben liked to play in the park . they had a toy boat that they made from a box and some paper . they pretended to be sailors and sailed the boat on the pond .

