just then , daddy came in carrying a big surprise ! he had taken all the laundry to the dry cleaner and picked up a new set of bed sheets for everyone . john excitedly rushed to his room and put on his new bed sheets . he was so happy to have them ! one day , little mary had a fancy dream . in her dream , she was in a magical garden filled with sugary treats ! mary felt so happy she wanted to share the treats with everyone she knew . but , when she tried to gather them , they all started to tear .

