mary smiled , understanding . that day she promised herself to never take too many of the treats at once when ever she returned to the magical garden . once upon a time , there was a weird berry . every day , the berry grew just a tiny bit . but that tiny bit was enough , and the berry continued to grow . everywhere the berry went , it made more friends .

one day , the berry found a place with a lot of other berries . the berry was so excited ! but then it noticed something different ; the other berries were big , and the strange berry was still very small .

