this story teaches us that no matter how small we are , or how weird we may seem , we should believe in ourselves and never give up - then we can make a difference too ! the toddler went outside . he was feeling calm and saw a bright white bird . he smiled and nodded to it . but suddenly , the sky got dark . the toddler felt scared and the white bird flew away . rain started pouring down and the wind started to blow . the toddler didnâ€ ™ t know what to do . but then he saw a big tree and he ran to it . the big tree kept him calm and safe from the wind . he nodded at the tree in thanks . he waited for the storm to pass and when it finally did , the sun was shining again . the white bird returned and the toddler smiled and nodded . the bird flew up and the toddler went back home . he was happy and calm . once there was a small bear who lived in a dry city . every day , he ran around looking for food . one day , he saw a little boy handing out muffins . the bear was so excited ! he ran up to the boy and said , " please ! will you give me one ? "

