from then on , lucy and timmy were best friends . whenever they played together in the park , they always gave each other a big hug and their friendship was always very strong . once upon a time , there was a little girl called hannah . hannah was very naughty and often broke things in the house . but today , hannah was in a good mood and decided to try and be helpful . she noticed that her mum 's alarm was not working and she decided to try and fix it .

