then the wind started to blow . it blew and blew until , unfortunately , the sunflower fell to the ground and crashed into pieces . the animals were very happy that the sunflower was gone and they could enjoy the sunshine again . once upon a time , there was a jolly little girl . she loved to dance and hug . every day , she would dance and giggle . one day , she saw a neighbor dancing in their front yard . she ran up and they started to dance together . they laughed and hugged and it felt very good .

