the queen then thanked the tree for being so flexible and made it stand back up . the tree was happy and thanked the queen , too . from that day onwards , the queen and the tree became good friends and the queen continued to visit the park to make jokes with her flexible new tree friend . once upon a time , there lived a young boy called john . john was a very curious boy and he loved going for walks in the woods . one day , john was about to go for a walk in the woods but his parents mentioned something about an old trail . they said there was a light at the end of the trail . john was very interested , he wanted to know what was at the end of the trail .

