finally , after a few days , the hurricane was gone . the serious man had led them through danger and now the family was back safe . they all cheered and thanked the man for leading them safely . on a warm summer day , mama and her baby went for a walk . mama twisted her baby 's hair into a ponytail and held her hand as they stepped through the park . all around them , the bright , green trees swayed and twisted in the breeze .

