the moral of this story is that it is wrong to take things that do n't belong to us , even if we find them exciting . we must respect all creatures , big and small ! once upon a time , there was a famous crane . everyone was amazed by the crane 's beauty , and they all wanted to take a picture of it . every day , people from far away places would come to see the crane and were so impressed with its grace that they would applaud for it .

