on their way out , the girl still missed the museum . but she knew she could always come back again . she was so happy to have felt the light and beauty of the museum again . once there was a young boy . he was three years old and loved playing outside . one day he found a new watch . he was so happy that he wanted to show it to everyone he saw .

the boy ran to the park to find his friends . he saw them playing and showed them his new watch . then something strange happened . his friends started to change . they all suddenly looked older !

