the boy was happy that his watch had made his friends change and from that day onwards , he always kept it close . whenever he wanted to show it off , he knew that something magical would happen . once upon a time there was a puppy who wanted to go into the baby 's room . he saw the door to the baby 's room and started barking loudly . the baby 's mom told the puppy to stop making noise , and asked the puppy to behave . the puppy was very curious and he wanted to go inside the room . he tried to open the door quickly but it was n't budging . mom told the puppy to be patient and reached down to turn the door handle . the door opened slowly , and mom asked the puppy to be careful and to come inside very slowly . the puppy followed mom inside the baby 's room and saw the baby sleeping under a blanket . mom said , '' see , that 's why we must always behave and not make too much noise . we do n't want to wake the baby up and scare her ! " . the puppy understood and from then on , he tried to be very quiet around the baby and to always open the door slowly .

