the little girl was grateful that they were able to do it together . she learned an important lesson . when she has a problem , she can always ask her brother for help . they can work together to make things better . once upon a time there was a little girl called tina . she loved to play in the garden with her friends and have fun . one day , she was playing hide and seek with her friends when she saw something strange . it was a bean - shaped twister ! she was amazed and excited . she picked it up and started to twist it .

