the end . once upon a time , there was a pine tree . it was tall and very impressive . during the night , when the moon was full , the pine tree would come to life . it would start to dance ! it swayed back and forth to the music of the wind and the chirping of the crickets . its branches moved in a dazzling show of color and light . everyone who saw this was amazed by the sight .

one day , a little 3 - year - old girl happened to see the pine tree dancing in the moonlight . she stopped and watched in awe as the tree moved . she couldnâ€ ™ t believe how impressive it looked ! she wanted to join in , so she started to dance around the tree , spinning and twirling . soon , she was part of the amazing show !

the little girl and the pine tree danced together until the sun came up in the morning . they said goodbye to each other and the tree went back to sleep . but from then on , when the moon was full , the little girl would always look for the dancing pine tree to come back . once upon a time there was a fairy who loved being busy . she worked very hard to create the most beautiful cobwebs . she spent her days spinning her webs around the trees and spinning webs in the sky . everywhere she flew , she left a sparkling cobweb behind .

