finally , when the sun went down , the fairy had created the most enchanting cobweb ever . she beamed with pride and went to bed dreaming of the next day when she could create something new . once upon a time there were two best friends , rudy and sally . rudy loved to be cheerful , while sally was always sharp . one day , rudy and sally went out to play near the river . suddenly , they noticed that the water was very high and oxygen was very low . they were worried , but rudy was still cheerful . he encouraged sally to try and find a way to help .

sally thought of an idea and ran to get a bucket . she filled it up with the water from the river , and brought it back to the riverbank . rudy was so happy and said it was a brilliant idea ! together they poured the water back into the river , and the oxygen level began to increase .

