anna and ben smiled . they felt good . they had made a new friend . they went back to their shovels and continued to play . lila and rani were sisters who lived in a small village . they liked to help their mother cook food for their family . one day , their mother gave them a big orange fruit and told them to rub it on a grater . " this is a carrot , " she said . " it makes the food sweet and colorful . "

