one day , jill was playing with her flute and her doll in her room . she put the flute on the bed and held the doll in her hand . she said to the doll , " you are a fairy , right ? can you do magic for me ? "

the doll nodded and smiled . she said , " yes , i can do magic . but you have to be careful what you wish for . magic can be tricky sometimes . "

jill was curious and excited . she said , " i wish i could be as small as you . then we could fly together and have fun . "

the doll said , " are you sure ? if you shrink , you might not be able to go back to your normal size . "

jill said , " yes , i 'm sure . please , do it for me . "

the doll said , " okay , but do n't say i did n't warn you . " she waved her hand and said a magic word . jill felt a strange tingling in her body . she looked around and saw that everything was getting bigger and bigger . she was shrinking !

she saw her flute on the bed . it was now as big as a tree . she saw her doll next to her . she was now the same size as her . she said , " wow , this is amazing . let 's go and fly . "

the doll said , " okay , but be careful . there are many dangers in this big world . and do n't forget your flute . you might need it later . "

jill said , " okay , i wo n't forget . come on , let 's go . " she grabbed her flute and followed the doll . they flew out of the window and into the sky . they saw birds and clouds and flowers . they had a lot of fun .

but soon , jill started to miss her home and her family . she said , " i want to go back . i miss my mom and dad and my brother . can you make me big again ? "

the doll said , " i 'm sorry , i ca n't . the magic only works once . you have to find another way to go back . "

jill was scared and sad . she said , " but how ? how can i go back ? "

the doll said , " i do n't know . maybe you can use your flute . maybe it has some magic too . try to play it and see what happens . "

jill said , " okay , i 'll try . " she put the flute to her mouth and blew into it . she played a song that she learned from her mom . it was a song about love and hope . she played it with all her heart .

as she played , she felt another tingling in her body . she looked around and saw that everything was getting smaller and smaller . she was growing !

she saw her doll next to her . she was now much bigger than her . she said , " look , it 's working . the flute is making me big again . "

the doll said , " yes , it is . i 'm happy for you . but i 'll miss you . you are my best friend . "

jill said , " i 'll miss you too . you are my best friend too . but do n't worry . i 'll always remember you . and i 'll always play the flute for you . "

the doll said , " thank you . and i 'll always watch over you . and i 'll always listen to your flute . "

jill said , " goodbye , my fairy friend . "

the doll said , " goodbye , my human friend . "

jill grew back to her normal size . she was in her room again . she saw her flute on the bed . she saw her doll in her hand . she hugged the doll and smiled . she was happy to be home . she was happy to have a magic friend . she was happy to have a magic flute . lily liked to paint . she had many colors of paint and a big paper . she wanted to paint a rainbow and a sun . she asked her mom , " can i paint in the living room ? "

her mom said , " no , lily . you have to paint in your room . the living room is clean and white . you might make a mess with your paint . "

lily was sad . she did not want to paint in her room . she wanted to paint in the living room . she thought her mom was not kind . she decided to paint anyway . she took her paint and her paper and went to the living room . she put her paper on the floor and started to paint .

she painted a big red line , then a big orange line , then a big yellow line . she was happy . she thought her rainbow was pretty . she did not see that her paint was dripping on the floor and the couch . she did not hear her mom coming .

her mom saw the mess and was very angry . she shouted , " lily , what have you done ? you ruined the living room ! you did not listen to me ! you are a bad girl ! "

lily was scared . she dropped her paint and started to cry . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i just wanted to paint a rainbow and a sun . i thought you would like it . "

her mom did not like it . she took away her paint and her paper . she said , " you are not allowed to paint anymore . you have to go to your room and stay there . you have to clean the living room tomorrow . "

lily was very sad . she went to her room and sobbed . she wished she had listened to her mom . she wished she had been kind . she wished she could paint again . tom and jen are friends . they like to play with toys in the park . one day , they find a big sack . the sack is flexible . they can make it into different shapes .

tom and jen have fun with the sack . they make it into a hat , a cape , a tunnel , and a boat . they take turns to wear the sack and pretend to be different things .

but then , a big dog comes . the dog likes the sack too . it runs to the sack and grabs it with its teeth . it pulls the sack away from tom and jen . it makes a loud sound . it sounds like " woof , woof , woof " .

tom and jen are sad and scared . they want the sack back . they try to chase the dog , but the dog is faster . the dog runs away with the sack .

tom and jen cry . they do not have the sack anymore . they do not have anything to play with . they hug each other and say " sorry , sorry , sorry " .

the end . tommy was restless . he did not want to sit still and eat his potato . he wanted to ride his bike outside with his friends . he pushed his plate away and said , " no potato , mommy . i want to ride ! "

mommy was not happy . she said , " tommy , you have to eat your potato . it is good for you . you can ride your bike later , after you finish your dinner . "

tommy shook his head . he did not like potato . he thought it was yucky and boring . he said , " no , mommy . potato is bad . i want to ride now ! "

mommy sighed . she knew tommy loved his bike , but he also needed to eat healthy food . she had an idea . she said , " tommy , how about this ? if you eat half of your potato , i will let you ride your bike for ten minutes . but then you have to come back and eat the other half . deal ? "

tommy thought about it . he really wanted to ride his bike , but he also did not want to eat his potato . he looked at his plate . he saw that his potato was not very big . he decided to try mommy 's idea . he said , " okay , mommy . deal . i will eat half of my potato , and then i will ride . "

mommy smiled . she was glad tommy agreed . she cut his potato in half and gave him a fork . she said , " good boy , tommy . eat your potato , and then you can ride . but remember , only for ten minutes . "

tommy nodded . he took a bite of his potato . he did not like it , but he swallowed it . he took another bite , and another , until he ate half of his potato . he put down his fork and said , " done , mommy . i ate half of my potato . can i ride now ? "

mommy checked his plate . she saw that he ate half of his potato . she said , " yes , tommy . you can ride now . but do n't forget to come back and eat the other half . i will be waiting for you . "

tommy jumped off his chair and ran to his bike . he put on his helmet and said , " thank you , mommy . i will be back soon . bye ! "

mommy watched him ride away . she hoped he would have fun , but also remember his promise . she said , " bye , tommy . be careful and have fun . i love you . " anna and her mom went to the grocery store . they needed to buy food for dinner . anna liked to help her mom . she put apples , carrots , and cheese in the cart .

" can we get cookies , too ? " anna asked .

" maybe later , sweetie . we have to get some bread and milk first , " her mom said .

they walked to the other side of the store . anna saw a big display of balloons . they were red , blue , yellow , and green . they looked so pretty and fun . anna wanted a balloon .

" mom , can i have a balloon ? " anna asked .

" sure , honey . you can pick one , " her mom said .

anna ran to the balloons . she grabbed a red one . it had a string attached to it . she pulled the string and the balloon flew up in the air . anna laughed . she pulled the string again and the balloon came down . she did it over and over .

she spun around with the balloon . she felt happy . but then she felt dizzy . she stopped spinning . she felt sick . she let go of the string . the balloon flew away .

" mom , i do n't feel good , " anna said .

her mom came to her . she saw the balloon floating away . she saw anna 's pale face . she hugged her .

" i 'm sorry , baby . you spun too much . you need to sit down and rest , " her mom said .

she took anna to a bench . she gave her some water . she rubbed her back .

" it 's okay , anna . you 'll feel better soon . i love you , " her mom said .

anna nodded . she felt sorry for losing the balloon . she felt sorry for being dizzy . she loved her mom . she closed her eyes . she hoped to feel better soon . ben and mia were playing with their toy tank in the garden . they liked to make the tank go fast and make loud noises . they pretended they were soldiers and had to fight the bad guys .

" look , ben , i found some cookies in the kitchen ! " mia said . " let 's have a snack ! "

" ok , mia , but we have to share , " ben said . " you take two and i take two . "

they ran to the kitchen and grabbed the cookies . they sat on the floor and ate them . they were very yummy .

but mia was selfish . she wanted more cookies . she saw that ben had one cookie left . she reached out and took it from his hand .

" hey , that 's not fair ! " ben cried . " that was my cookie ! you already ate two ! "

" no , it 's mine now ! " mia said . " i 'm hungry and i like cookies . you are selfish ! "

ben was angry and sad . he wanted his cookie back . he saw the toy tank on the table . he had an idea .

he jumped up and grabbed the tank . he ran to the garden with it .

" mia , give me back my cookie or i will take the tank ! " he shouted .

mia followed him . she wanted the tank too . she loved to play with it .

" ben , give me back the tank or i will tell mom ! " she shouted .

they both pulled the tank . they both wanted it . they both were selfish .

but then they heard a loud noise . the tank broke in half . they both dropped it . they both gasped .

" oh no , what have we done ? " ben said .

" we broke the tank ! " mia said .

they looked at each other . they felt sorry . they realized they were wrong .

" ben , i 'm sorry i took your cookie , " mia said . " that was mean of me . here , you can have it back . "

" mia , i 'm sorry i took the tank , " ben said . " that was mean of me too . here , you can have this half . "

they hugged each other . they shared the cookie and the tank . they were not selfish anymore . they were happy . anna likes to play with her toys in her room . she has many toys , but her favorite is her white camera . she likes to pretend she is a photographer and take pictures of her dolls and animals . she says " cheese " and " click " when she snaps a photo .

one day , anna can not find her white camera . she looks under her bed , in her closet , and in her toy box . she feels sad and worried . where is her white camera ? she asks her mom for help . " mom , have you seen my white camera ? i want to play with it . "

mom thinks for a moment . she remembers that she put the camera in a drawer in the kitchen . she wanted to keep it safe from anna 's baby brother , who likes to put things in his mouth . she says " i know where your camera is , anna . come with me to the kitchen . i will show you . "

anna follows her mom to the kitchen . mom opens the drawer and takes out the white camera . she gives it to anna and says " here is your camera , anna . i 'm sorry i moved it . i was afraid your brother might break it or swallow it . you can play with it , but be careful and do n't leave it where he can reach it . "

anna feels happy and relieved . she hugs her mom and says " thank you , mom . i love my camera . i will be careful with it . can i take a picture of you and me ? " mom smiles and says " of course , anna . let 's say cheese and click together . " anna holds the camera and points it at them . she says " cheese " and " click " and takes a picture of her mom and herself . she looks at the picture and says " we look so pretty , mom . i love you . " mom says " i love you too , anna . you are my best photographer . " they hug and laugh . anna is glad she found her white camera . tom and lily are twins . they like to play in the garden . they see a cute bunny . the bunny has soft fur and long ears . the twins want to pet the bunny .

