" hi , bunny ! " tom says . he reaches his hand too . he touches the bunny 's ear . the bunny flicks its ear . it makes a sound .

the twins giggle . they think the bunny is funny . they pet the bunny gently . the bunny likes them . it comes out of the hole . it sits on the grass . it lets the twins hug it .

the twins are happy . they have a new friend . they love the cute bunny . they say thank you to the bunny . they crawl back to their mom . they show her the bunny . their mom smiles . she says they are good kids . she says they can keep the bunny . the twins cheer . they name the bunny fluffy . they play with fluffy all day . sara and tom were playing with their toys in the garden . they had a lot of fun with their cars , dolls , and blocks . they were very happy .

but then , a thief came . he was a bad man who wanted to take their toys . he saw them from the fence and waited for them to go inside . he had a big bag and a mean smile .

when sara and tom went inside to have a snack , the thief jumped over the fence and ran to their toys . he grabbed as many as he could and put them in his bag . he was very greedy .

but he did not see the dog . the dog was sara and tom 's friend . he was sleeping under the tree , but he heard the thief . he woke up and barked loudly . he chased the thief and bit his leg .

" ow ! ow ! ow ! " the thief cried . he dropped the bag and ran away . he was very scared .

sara and tom heard the noise and came outside . they saw the dog and the bag . they hugged the dog and thanked him . they opened the bag and saw their toys . they were very glad .

the thief ran to the river . he wanted to wash his leg . but the water was bitter . it was full of salt and dirt . he tasted it and spat it out . he was very sorry . anna and ben are playing in the park with their ball . they see the sky is getting orange and pink . they wonder why .

