they run to their mom , who is sitting on a bench . they show her the sky .

" mom , why is the sky orange ? " they ask .

mom smiles and hugs them . she points to the sun , which is going down behind the hills .

" the sky is orange because of the sunset , my loves . the sunset is when the sun says goodbye to the day and hello to the night . the sun makes the sky orange and pink and purple with its light . it is very beautiful , do n't you think ? " mom explains .

anna and ben nod . they think the sunset is very beautiful . they say goodbye to the sun and hello to the night . they thank mom for explaining the sunset . they go back to playing with their ball , under the orange sky . sara and ben are twins . they like to play in the kitchen . they pretend to cook and bake . they use pots and pans and spoons and bowls . they make a lot of noise and mess .

mom is in the living room . she is reading a book . she hears the noise and mess . she is not happy . she goes to the kitchen . she sees sara and ben . they have flour and eggs and milk on their faces and clothes . they have spilled and dropped things on the floor and the table .

mom says , " sara and ben , what are you doing ? you are making a big mess . you need to behave . you need to clean up . you need to say sorry . "

sara and ben look at mom . they feel bad . they say , " sorry , mom . we were playing . we wanted to cook and bake . we did not mean to make a mess . "

mom sighs . she sees a pan on the stove . she sees a cake in the pan . she smells chocolate . she says , " did you make this cake ? "

sara and ben nod . they say , " yes , mom . we made it for you . we wanted to surprise you . we love you . "

mom smiles . she says , " thank you , sara and ben . that is very sweet of you . i love you too . you are adorable . but you still need to behave . and you still need to clean up . "

sara and ben hug mom . they say , " ok , mom . we will behave . we will clean up . can we have some cake ? "

mom says , " yes , you can have some cake . but only after you clean up . and only a small piece . and only with some milk . "

sara and ben say , " ok , mom . thank you , mom . "

they start to clean up . they are happy . they are adorable . they are sara and ben . tom and mia are playing in the park . they see a big , furry dog . the dog is friendly and wags its tail . tom and mia want to pet the dog , but they are afraid .

" who is the dog 's owner ? " tom asks .

" i do n't know . maybe he is lost , " mia says .

they look around , but they do not see anyone who looks like the dog 's owner . the dog comes closer and sniffs them . he licks tom 's hand and mia 's cheek . they giggle and stroke his fur .

" maybe we can keep him , " tom says .

