" we are near the big slide . we will wait for you here . bye , " mia says .

they hang up and go back to max . they play with him until they see a car pull up . a man gets out and runs to them . he hugs max and thanks tom and mia .

" you are very kind and brave . you saved my dog . how can i thank you ? " he says .

tom and mia smile . they are happy they helped max and his owner .

" can we pet him one more time ? " tom asks .

