he lets them pet max and gives them a big chocolate bar each .

" thank you for the chocolate . and thank you for letting us play with max . he is a great dog , " mia says .

" you are very welcome . maybe we can meet again in the park . max would love that . bye for now , " the man says .

he puts max in the car and waves goodbye . tom and mia wave back and share their chocolate . they are proud of what they did . they sent max back to his owner . they made a new furry friend . lily and ben were playing in the park with their mom . they saw a big slide and ran to it . lily went first and slid down fast . she laughed and said , " that was fun ! "

ben wanted to try too , but he was scared . he looked at the slide and said , " no , no , too high ! "

