ben nodded and said , " yes , yes , picture ! "

mom took out her camera and held ben 's hand . they climbed up the stairs and reached the top of the slide . mom said , " ready , ben ? smile for the camera ! "

ben smiled and said , " cheese ! "

mom pressed the button and took the picture . then she let go of ben 's hand and said , " now , slide down , ben . you can do it ! "

ben slid down slowly and carefully . he felt the wind in his hair and the sun on his face . he reached the bottom and said , " i did it ! i did it ! "

