they all hugged and said , " we love you too , ben . "

they decided to keep the picture as a souvenir of their day in the park . they laughed about it later and showed it to their dad . he laughed too and said , " that 's a great picture , ben . you are a star ! " lily and tom are young . they like to play with blocks . they have many blocks of different colors and shapes . they can build houses , towers , cars and animals with their blocks .

one day , they decide to build a big city with their blocks . they need a lot of blocks to supply their city . they look for more blocks in their toy box , in their closet , in their drawers . they find some , but not enough . they want their city to be bigger and better .

they see their mom in the kitchen . she is busy . she is making lunch for them . she has a big pot on the stove and a big bowl on the table . she is stirring and mixing and chopping .

" mom , can we have more blocks ? " lily asks .

