" it is bread ! bread is round and soft and yummy . you can use bread to make more blocks . you can cut it and shape it and stack it . but you have to be careful . do not eat it . it is for your city , not for your mouth . ok ? " mom says .

lily and tom nod . they are excited . they say thank you to mom . they take the bag of bread and run back to their room . they use the bread to make more blocks . they add them to their city . they make roads and bridges and parks and shops and schools and hospitals . they have fun . they are busy .

mom watches them from the door . she smiles . she is happy . she thinks they are very clever and creative . she is glad she could supply them with more blocks . she hopes they will enjoy their lunch too . she has a surprise for them . she has made sandwiches with the leftover bread . she has cut them into different shapes and colors . she thinks they will like them . she thinks they will like her . she loves them . lily and tom were going to the park with mom . they were very happy . they wanted to play on the swings and the slide . they also wanted to eat ice cream . mom said they had to pack some things first . she gave them a big bag .

" pack your hats and your water bottles , " mom said . " it is very hot today . you do n't want to get sick . "

