but it was too late . lily and tom were very sick . they had to go to the hospital . they did not get to eat ice cream . they did not have fun . they had a bad ending . anna and ben were playing in the park . they liked to run , swing and slide . but it was very hot and sunny . they felt thirsty and tired .

