anna listened to ben . she did not remove the leaf . she smiled and said , " you are right , ben . the leaf is good for them . let 's leave them alone . they are happy in their nest . "

they got up and went to play some more . they were happy too . they had seen something beautiful and learned something new . sam and mia like to play catch with a melon . they think it is fun to throw and catch the big , green fruit . one day , they play catch in the park with their mom and dad . they are happy and laugh a lot .

but then , something bad happens . sam throws the melon too hard and it hits mia on the head . mia falls down and cries . she feels hurt and scared . sam feels sorry and sad . he runs to mia and says , " i 'm sorry , mia . i did n't mean to hurt you . are you okay ? "

mom and dad come to help mia . they hug her and check her head . they say , " it 's okay , mia . it 's just a bump . it will go away soon . you are brave and strong . " they give her a band - aid and a kiss . they also give sam a hug and say , " it 's okay , sam . it was an accident . you did n't mean to hurt mia . you are a good brother . "

mia stops crying and smiles . she says , " i 'm okay , sam . i forgive you . you are a good brother , too . " she gives sam a hug and a kiss . they say , " we love you , mom and dad . " they all hug and kiss each other . they are happy and love each other . they decide to play catch with a ball instead of a melon . they think it is safer and easier . they have fun and laugh a lot . the end . tom and mia are going to the station with mom . they want to see the big trains that go fast and make noise . mom says they have to hold her hand and be careful .

but tom is clumsy . he trips on a rock and falls down . he hurts his knee and starts to cry . mia stops and tries to help him . she says , " it 's okay , tom . it 's just a scratch . mom will make it better . "

