they watch the train from a safe distance . it is very big and fast . it makes a lot of noise . tom and mia think it is amazing . they forget about tom 's scratch and smile . they like the station . ben and lily were playing in the park . they liked to run , jump and slide on the grass . they saw a big pond with ducks and fish . they wanted to feed them some bread .

