they could not wait to get home and eat their shrimp . they hoped the shrimp would still be enthusiastic and make them laugh . they also hoped they would not be too hungry and eat them all . they wanted to share some with their dad , who also loved shrimp . anna and ben are twins . they go to school every day . they learn many things . they learn to read and write and count . they also learn to spell . spelling is hard , but fun .

