ben and jen forgive molly , but they do not want to ride her again . they say goodbye to her and give her a pat . they go back to the house with grandpa . he gives them some hot cocoa and cookies . he tells them a story about when he was a boy and rode a mule . he says mules are smart and loyal , but sometimes they are stubborn and silly . he says he loves molly , even when she is naughty . ben and jen love grandpa , and they love molly too . they smile and sip their cocoa . they are happy and warm . lily and ben went to the shop with mom . they wanted to buy a treat for being good . mom said they could choose one thing each .

