lily and ben learned a lesson that day . they learned that they should be careful and respectful . they learned that they should listen to their friends and not take what is not theirs . they learned that sometimes , the best things are not hidden , but right in front of them . sam and mia were playing in the garden . they liked to pretend they were lions and tigers . they would run and jump and roar at each other . they had a lot of fun .

one day , they found a big jug in the shed . it was empty and had a handle and a spout . sam had an idea . he said to mia , " let 's fill the jug with water and use it as a fountain . we can be lions and tigers who drink from the fountain . "

mia liked the idea . they took the jug to the tap and filled it with water . then they carried it to the middle of the garden and put it on the ground . they took turns to tilt the jug and make the water come out of the spout . they pretended to lap up the water with their tongues and make happy noises .

they were having so much fun that they did not hear their mum calling them for lunch . she came out to the garden and saw them playing with the jug . she smiled and said , " you two look like very thirsty lions and tigers . do you want to come inside and have some sandwiches and juice ? "

sam and mia nodded and ran to their mum . they gave her a hug and said , " thank you , mum . we love you . " they left the jug in the garden . it was peaceful and quiet . the sun shone on the water and made it sparkle . the jug was happy too . it had made two new friends . jill liked to play with snow . she made snowballs and snowmen with her friends . she wore a pink hat and a pink coat and pink gloves . she was very popular and everyone wanted to be her friend .

