they open their eyes and blow the candles . they clap and cheer . they cut the cake and share it with their friends . they say thank you to mama and papa . they are very happy . they are modest . they are twins . sam and lily were waiting for their dad to come home . he worked on a big boat in the navy . he was away for a long time , but today he would arrive .

