the end . lily did not like meat . she did not like how it looked , how it smelled , or how it tasted . she only liked fruits and vegetables . they were colorful , sweet , and crunchy .

one day , her mom made meat for dinner . she put a big piece on lily 's plate . lily looked at it and felt sick . she pushed her plate away and said , " no , thank you . i do not want meat . "

her mom frowned and said , " lily , you have to eat meat . it is important for your health . it has protein and iron . they make you strong and smart . "

lily shook her head and said , " no , mom . i do not need meat . i have protein and iron from other foods . i eat beans , nuts , eggs , and cheese . they are yummy and good for me . "

her mom sighed and said , " lily , i know you like those foods , but you also need to try new things . meat is not bad . it can be tasty and tender . why do n't you give it a chance ? just one bite , please . "

lily refused . she did not want to try meat . she did not care if it was important . she did not think it was tasty or tender . she thought it was gross and hard . she said , " no , mom . i do not like meat . i will not eat it . please , can i have more salad ? "

her mom was sad and angry . she did not know what to do with lily . she wanted her to eat well and be healthy . she said , " lily , you are being very stubborn and rude . you have to eat what i make for you . you can not have more salad until you finish your meat . "

lily was sad and scared . she did not want to make her mom unhappy . she loved her mom . but she also did not want to eat meat . she hated meat . she said , " mom , i am sorry . i do not mean to be stubborn and rude . but i really do not like meat . it makes me feel bad . can we please have something else ? "

her mom looked at lily and saw her tears . she felt sorry for her . she realized that lily was not trying to be difficult . she was just being honest . she said , " lily , i am sorry too . i do not mean to be harsh and unfair . i just want you to be healthy and happy . i understand that you do not like meat . maybe we can find another way to eat it . how about we make some meatballs with sauce and cheese ? they are soft and cheesy . maybe you will like them better . "

lily thought about it and said , " maybe , mom . can i help you make them ? "

her mom smiled and said , " of course , lily . you can help me roll the meatballs and sprinkle the cheese . come on , let 's go to the kitchen . "

lily and her mom hugged and went to the kitchen . they made meatballs with sauce and cheese . lily tried one and said , " it is not so bad , mom . it is a little bit yummy . "

her mom was happy and said , " i am glad , lily . you are a brave and good girl . thank you for trying something new . "

lily and her mom ate their dinner and enjoyed it . they learned that sometimes it is important to try new things , but also to respect each other 's feelings . they loved each other very much . tom and lily were twins who liked to play in the big building where they lived . one day , they found a shiny button in the hall . it was red and round and had a picture of a fire on it . tom and lily wondered what it did .

" let 's push it and see , " tom said .

" no , do n't do that . it might be dangerous , " lily said .

but tom was curious and pushed the button anyway . suddenly , a loud noise came from the wall . it was a siren that made tom and lily feel scared . they saw a door open and people came out . they looked angry and worried .

" what did you do ? " one of them shouted .

tom and lily did not know what to say . they saw another door open . it was the elevator . it had a sign that said " down " . tom and lily thought maybe they could hide in there .

" come on , let 's go in the elevator , " tom said .

" ok , but hurry , " lily said .

they ran to the elevator and got in . they pushed another button that had a picture of a star on it . they hoped it would take them to a nice place . but the elevator did not move . it was stuck .

tom and lily felt trapped . they heard more sirens and people outside . they wished they had not pushed the button . they wished they had listened to lily . they wished they could go back to their home .

they hugged each other and waited for someone to help them . they learned a lesson that day . they learned that some buttons are not for playing . they learned that some buttons are dangerous . they learned that some buttons can make things scatter . lily and sam were best friends . they liked to play in the park and read books together . lily was very intelligent . she knew many words and facts . sam was very brave . he liked to try new things and explore .

one day , they went to the ocean with their parents . they had never seen the ocean before . they were very excited . they saw the big waves , the blue water , and the white sand . they also saw many fish , crabs , and shells .

" look , lily , a starfish ! " sam said , pointing to a red and orange shape on the sand . " can we touch it ? "

" i do n't know , sam . maybe it is not nice to touch it . maybe it hurts , " lily said , looking at the starfish with curiosity .

" let 's ask mom and dad , " sam said , grabbing lily 's hand . " come on , run with me ! "

they ran to their parents , who were sitting on a blanket . they showed them the starfish and asked if they could touch it .

" sure , you can touch it gently , but do n't take it away from the ocean . it needs the water to live , " mom said , smiling .

" okay , mom . thank you , " lily and sam said , running back to the starfish .

they touched it carefully , feeling its rough and bumpy skin . they saw its tiny eyes and mouth . they wondered what it ate and how it moved .

they learned something new about the ocean and its creatures . they felt happy and amazed . they thanked the starfish for letting them touch it and left it on the sand . they ran to the water and splashed each other , laughing and having fun . they loved the ocean and each other . they were best friends . sara loves to watch the otters at the zoo . they are so funny and cute . they swim and play and slide on the rocks . sometimes they hold hands when they sleep . sara thinks they are the best animals ever .

one day , sara goes to the zoo with her mom and dad . she runs to the otter pool and looks for her favorite otter . his name is ollie . he has a brown fur and a white belly . he is very friendly and smart . he likes to wave at sara and make noises .

" hi , ollie ! " sara says . " do you want to play with me ? "

ollie hears sara and swims to the edge of the pool . he looks at her with his big eyes and nods his head . he makes a squeaky sound .

" okay , ollie , let 's play ! " sara says . " can you dance for me ? "

ollie likes to dance . he jumps out of the water and spins around . he shakes his tail and claps his paws . he makes sara laugh .

" wow , ollie , you are a great dancer ! " sara says . " can i dance with you ? "

sara starts to dance too . she hops and twirls and waves her arms . she and ollie dance together and have fun .

sara 's mom and dad watch them and smile . they think sara and ollie are very cute . they are happy to see sara enjoy the zoo .

" look at them , they are having a blast ! " sara 's mom says .

" yes , they are , " sara 's dad says . " they are not normal , they are special . " sara and ben were playing in the park . they saw a big bird with many feathers . the bird was red and blue and green . it was very pretty .

" look , sara , a bird ! " ben said . " can we touch it ? "

sara was not sure . she was a little frightened of the bird . she thought it might bite or scratch . she said , " no , ben , we should not touch it . it is wild . we can look at it from here . "

the bird saw sara and ben . it was not happy . it did not like people . it wanted to be alone . it opened its wings and tail . it made a loud noise . it wanted to scare sara and ben away . it displayed its feathers .

sara and ben were very frightened . they ran away from the bird . they hid behind a tree . they said , " wow , that bird was angry . it showed us its feathers . it was very big and noisy . "

they waited until the bird flew away . then they went back to their mom . they told her what they saw . she said , " that was a peacock . it is a kind of bird that has many feathers . it displays its feathers when it feels threatened or wants to impress . it is not very friendly . you did the right thing to leave it alone . "

sara and ben nodded . they learned something new . they still thought the peacock was pretty , but they did not want to touch it . they played with other things in the park . they had fun . anna and ben are twins . they like to play together , but sometimes they fight . one day , they find a big box in the living room . it has a red ribbon on it .

" what is in the box ? " anna asks .

" i do n't know . let 's open it ! " ben says .

they pull the ribbon and lift the lid . inside , they see a shiny toy car . it has four wheels , a horn , and a steering wheel . it looks like a real car , but smaller .

" wow ! it is a car ! " anna says .

" it is my car ! " ben says .

" no , it is mine ! " anna says .

they both reach for the car and start to pull it . they do not want to share . they do not care about the box or the ribbon . they only want the car .

" stop ! stop ! " a voice says .

they look up and see their mom . she looks sad and angry .

" what are you doing ? " she asks .

" we are playing with the car ! " ben says .

" it is not a car . it is a gift . a very important gift . it is for your grandpa . he is sick and he ca n't drive anymore . he loves cars . we wanted to make him happy . but you ruined it . you ripped the ribbon and the box . you scratched the car . you were selfish and greedy . you did not think about anyone else . you did not touch the gift with love . you touched it with hate . "

anna and ben feel ashamed . they did not know the gift was for their grandpa . they love their grandpa . they want to make him happy . they did not mean to hurt the gift or their mom .

" we are sorry , mom . we are sorry , grandpa . we did not know . we were wrong . we will share the car . we will fix the ribbon and the box . we will touch the gift with love . we will be good twins . " they say .

mom smiles and hugs them . she is glad they learned their lesson . she hopes they will remember to be kind and generous . she hopes they will touch everything with love . she hopes they will make their grandpa happy . she tells them she loves them . they tell her they love her too . they are a happy family . lila loved to sing . she sang every day , in her room , in the garden , in the car . she sang happy songs , sad songs , silly songs . she sang with her voice , with her toys , with her hands . she sang because it made her feel good .

one day , she went to the park with her mom and dad . she saw a big pond with many ducks and swans . she ran to the edge and threw some bread for them . she saw a white swan with a long neck and a black beak . she thought it was beautiful . she wanted to sing to it .

she opened her mouth and sang a song she made up . it was about the swan and how pretty it was . she sang loud and clear , hoping the swan would hear her . but the swan did not like her song . it hissed and flapped its wings . it splashed water at her and scared her . lila stopped singing and ran back to her mom and dad . she felt sad and hurt .

" why did the swan do that ? " she asked . " i just wanted to sing to it . "

her mom hugged her and said , " sometimes , not everyone likes the same things . the swan may have a different way of saying hello , or it may have been protecting its space . it does not mean your song was bad . your song was beautiful , because it came from your heart . you should not stop singing because of one swan . there are many other animals and people who would love to hear your song . "

lila nodded and smiled . she understood . she looked around and saw a squirrel on a tree , a dog on a leash , a boy on a bike . she decided to sing to them instead . she sang a new song , about the park and how fun it was . she sang with joy and confidence . she sang because it made her happy .

the end . lily liked to go to the sea with her mom and dad . she liked to play in the sand and look for shells . she also liked to watch the big waves and the birds .

one day , lily saw a chubby seal on a rock . the seal was brown and had a funny nose . lily wanted to say hello to the seal , but her mom said it was too far . lily asked her dad to bring her closer to the seal , but her dad said it was not safe .

lily was sad . she wanted to be friends with the chubby seal . she thought the seal looked lonely . she decided to make a gift for the seal . she found a big shell and some seaweed . she tied the seaweed around the shell and made a necklace .

lily waved to the seal and threw the necklace into the water . she hoped the seal would like it . she waited and watched . the seal saw the necklace and swam to get it . the seal put the necklace around its neck and looked at lily . the seal smiled and clapped its flippers .

lily was happy . she smiled and clapped her hands . she had made a new friend . the seal had liked her gift . lily and the seal waved to each other and said goodbye . lily went back to her mom and dad and told them about the chubby seal . they hugged her and said she was very kind . lily felt warm and proud . she loved the sea and the seal . anna and ben are playing on the shore . they like to dig in the sand and look for shells . they see a big boat on the water . it has a hose that can spray water very high .

