they run towards the boat , holding hands . they wave at the people on the boat . the people wave back and smile . they turn on the hose and spray water in the air . the water makes a rainbow in the sun .

anna and ben laugh and clap . they feel the water on their faces . it is not spicy . it is cool and fresh .

" thank you , thank you ! " they shout to the people on the boat .

the people on the boat say , " you 're welcome , you 're welcome ! have fun on the shore ! " tom is a boy who likes to play with cars . he has many cars of different colors and sizes . he likes to make them zoom and crash on the floor . but one day , he breaks his favorite car . it is a red car with a big engine and shiny wheels . he feels sad and cries .

his mom hears him cry and comes to see what is wrong . she sees the broken car and hugs tom . she says , " do n't worry , tom . we can repair your car . do you want to help me ? " tom nods and wipes his tears . he likes to help his mom .

they go to the kitchen and find some glue and tape . they put the pieces of the car together and stick them with glue and tape . they wait for the glue to dry and then test the car . it works ! tom is happy and says , " thank you , mom . you are the best repair tutor ! " his mom smiles and says , " you are welcome , tom . you are a good helper . "

they decide to go outside and play with the car . but when they open the door , they see that it is raining . the sky is gray and the ground is wet . tom frowns and says , " oh no , we ca n't play outside . the car will get wet and break again . " his mom thinks and says , " that 's true , tom . but we can play inside . do you want to make a race track with some books and boxes ? " tom nods and smiles . he likes to make race tracks .

they go back to the living room and find some books and boxes . they arrange them on the floor and make a race track . they put the car on the track and make it zoom and crash . they have fun and laugh . tom says , " this is the best race track ever ! " his mom says , " i agree , tom . you are very creative . " they play until it is time for dinner . they are happy and forget about the rain . lily and ben were hungry . they wanted to eat something yummy . mom said she had a new dish for them to try . it was shrimp with rice and sauce .

