lily and ben laughed . they looked at the cat , who was sleeping on the couch . he did not care about shrimp or rice or sauce . he was too lazy to test anything new . ben and lily love to play in the pool . they have a big yellow ball that they throw to each other . sometimes they splash water on their faces and laugh . they are very happy .

one day , mom brings them a snack . she has a bowl of grapes and some crackers . ben and lily get out of the pool and sit on the towels . they say thank you to mom and start to eat .

but then , a naughty bird comes and tries to take the grapes . it flies over the bowl and pecks at the fruit . ben and lily are scared and angry . they do n't want to share their grapes with the bird .

they look at their ball . they have an idea . they pick up the ball and throw it at the bird . the ball hits the bird and makes it go away . the bird squawks and flies to a tree . ben and lily cheer and hug each other . they are very brave .

they finish their grapes and crackers and go back to the pool . they play with their ball and splash water on their faces and laugh . they are very happy . they have a dependable ball that helps them . they love their ball . ben and mia went to the pet shop with mom . they wanted to choose a new friend to play with . there were many animals in the pet shop . some were furry , some had scales , some had feathers .

ben liked the furry animals . he saw a brown dog with a wagging tail . he said , " mom , can we choose this dog ? he is so furry and cute . he can run and fetch and cuddle with me . "

mia liked the scaly animals . she saw a green lizard with a long tongue . she said , " mom , can we choose this lizard ? he is so scaly and cool . he can climb and stick and change colors . "

