one day , tom has a new car . it is big and red and shiny . it has a button on the side . tom says , " this is my new car . it can change into a robot . watch this ! " he pushes the button and the car changes into a robot . the robot has arms and legs and eyes and a mouth . it makes a loud sound .

lily is scared . she says , " tom , i do n't like your new car . it is scary . can you change it back ? " tom says , " no , i like my new car . it is cool . it can do many things . look , it can walk and talk and dance . " he makes the robot walk and talk and dance . the robot says , " i am a robot . i am strong and smart and fast . i need fuel to work . give me fuel . "

tom says , " fuel ? what is fuel ? " the robot says , " fuel is what i eat . i eat metal and plastic and wood . give me fuel or i will be angry . " tom says , " i do n't have fuel . i only have cars and trucks and toys . " the robot says , " that is fuel . give me your cars and trucks and toys or i will take them . "

tom is sad . he says , " no , please do n't take my cars and trucks and toys . they are mine . i like them . they are fun . " the robot says , " too bad . i need fuel . i will take them anyway . " the robot grabs tom 's cars and trucks and toys and puts them in his mouth . he crunches them and swallows them . he makes a happy sound .

lily is very scared . she says , " tom , stop the robot . he is bad . he is eating your cars and trucks and toys . he will eat us too . " tom says , " i do n't know how to stop him . he wo n't listen to me . he wo n't change back . he is too big and strong . " the robot says , " i am not bad . i am hungry . i need more fuel . you are fuel too . come here . "

the robot reaches for tom and lily . they scream and run away . but the robot is faster . he catches them and puts them in his mouth . he crunches them and swallows them . he makes a very happy sound . he says , " i am a robot . i am full and healthy and happy . i like fuel . i want more fuel . " he looks around for more fuel . he sees a house . he walks towards the house . the end . lily and tom were friends . they liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big slide . lily wanted to go on the slide , but tom was scared .

" come on , tom , follow me ! " lily said . " the slide is fun ! "

" no , lily , the slide is too high . i do n't want to go , " tom said .

lily was angry . she thought tom was a baby . she ran to the slide and climbed up the ladder . she looked down and saw tom sitting on a bench . she shouted at him .

" tom , you are a baby ! you are not fit to be my friend ! i do n't like you anymore ! "

tom felt sad . he wanted to be lily 's friend , but he was afraid of the slide . he saw a man walking by with a dog . the dog was cute and fluffy . tom liked dogs . he got up and followed the man and the dog .

" hello , mister , can i pet your dog ? " tom asked .

the man smiled and nodded . he said his dog 's name was max . tom petted max and felt happy . he forgot about lily and the slide .

but the man was not nice . he was a bad man . he was a judge who liked to take children away from their parents . he saw that tom was alone and had no one to watch him . he had a plan . he pretended to be friendly and asked tom if he wanted to see more dogs .

" sure , mister , i love dogs ! " tom said .

the man took tom by the hand and led him to his car . he said he had more dogs in his car . he opened the door and pushed tom inside . he locked the door and drove away .

tom was scared . he realized he made a mistake . he wanted to go back to the park . he wanted to see lily . he wanted to say sorry . he cried and screamed , but no one heard him . the man was mean and hit him . he said he would never see his parents or lily again .

the end . sara and ben are playing with blocks in the living room . they like to build towers and bridges and houses with the blocks . they use different colors and shapes to make their creations .

" look , sara , i made a big tower ! " ben says , showing his block tower to his sister . " it is very tall and smooth . do you like it ? "

" yes , ben , it is very nice . but i like my bridge more . it is long and strong . it can hold many cars and trains . see ? " sara says , pointing to her block bridge on the floor .

they hear a loud sound from the kitchen . it is their mom , who is cooking dinner . she drops a pot on the floor by accident . the pot makes a big noise and rolls away .

" what was that sound ? " ben asks , scared . he runs to the kitchen to see what happened .

sara follows him , but she trips on her bridge . her bridge falls down and breaks . the blocks scatter everywhere . she feels sad and angry .

