ben sees the mess and feels sorry . he did not mean to make sara 's bridge end . he hugs her and says , " i am sorry , sara . i did not make your bridge end . it was the pot sound . it made me run . i did not see your bridge . it was very nice . can we make it again ? "

sara stops crying and nods . she hugs ben back and says , " ok , ben . we can make it again . but we have to be careful . we do not want to make more sounds . mom will be mad . "

they go back to the living room and pick up the blocks . they work together to make a new bridge . it is longer and stronger than before . they are happy and proud .

mom comes to the living room and sees their bridge . she smiles and says , " wow , sara and ben , you made a great bridge . it is very smooth and colorful . i am proud of you . do you want to help me set the table for dinner ? "

sara and ben say yes . they put away their blocks and go to the kitchen . they help mom set the table . they are hungry and excited . they have a nice dinner and talk about their bridge . they love each other . the end . tom and lily were friends who liked to play on the beach . one day , they saw a big crab in the sand . it had red claws and black eyes . tom and lily wanted to invite the crab to play with them .

they went closer to the crab and said hello . the crab did not say anything . it looked angry and scared . tom and lily thought the crab was shy . they tried to be nice and gave it a lovely shell they found . the crab did not take the shell . it snapped its claws at them .

tom and lily were sad and scared . they ran away from the crab . they wanted to find another friend to play with . but they did not see the big wave that was coming . the wave was very fast and strong . it washed tom and lily away from the shore . they screamed for help , but no one heard them . the crab saw them , but it did not care . it crawled back to its hole and hid . tom and lily were gone . the end . tim and jen are playing with their toys in the living room . they have many toys , but they like their cars the best . they make vroom - vroom noises and pretend to race each other .

" look , jen , i have a new car ! " tim says , holding up a shiny red car . " it is very fast and powerful . it can go over any hill or bump . "

" wow , tim , your car is nice ! " jen says , admiring the car . " where did you get it ? "

tim smiles and says , " it was a surprise from mom and dad . they gave it to me this morning . they said it was a reward for being good and helping them . "

jen feels a little sad . she wants a new car too . she has been good and helped mom and dad , but they did not give her anything . she wonders if they love tim more than her .

" can i see your car , tim ? " jen asks , hoping to play with it .

" sure , jen , you can see it , but you can not touch it , " tim says , keeping the car close to him . " it is very special and expensive . mom and dad said it was a high price . they said i have to be careful with it and not let anyone else play with it . "

jen feels even sadder . she thinks tim is being mean and selfish . she does not want to see his car anymore . she wants to have her own car , or at least share with tim .

" tim , that is not fair , " jen says , frowning . " you should share your toys with me . we are friends and siblings . sharing is nice and fun . "

tim shakes his head and says , " no , jen , i can not share this car with you . it is mine and only mine . you have your own toys . go play with them . "

jen feels angry and hurt . she does not like tim 's attitude . she thinks he is being a bad brother and a bad friend . she decides to teach him a lesson .

she waits until tim is not looking and grabs his car . she runs to the kitchen and hides behind the table . she hears tim shouting and looking for his car .

" jen , where are you ? where is my car ? " tim yells , sounding scared and angry . " give it back to me right now ! "

jen does not answer . she looks at the car and sees a button on the side . she wonders what it does . she presses the button and gasps .

the car opens up and reveals a secret compartment . inside , there is a small toy robot . it is silver and shiny and has glowing eyes . it makes beep - beep noises and moves its arms and legs .

jen is amazed and delighted . she thinks the robot is very cool and cute . she forgets about tim and his car . she plays with the robot and talks to it .

" hello , robot , what is your name ? " jen asks , smiling .

the robot beeps and says , " hello , jen , my name is robo . i am your new friend . i can do many things . i can sing , dance , tell jokes , and help you with anything . "

jen is overjoyed . she thinks robo is the best toy ever . she hugs him and says , " robo , you are awesome . i love you . you are much better than tim 's car . you are not expensive or powerful . you are fun and friendly . "

robo beeps and says , " i love you too , jen . you are very kind and smart . you are much better than tim . he is not fun or friendly . he is greedy and rude . "

jen and robo laugh and play together . they do not care about tim or his car . they are happy and content . they are the best friends in the world . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a big hill with a hole in it . " look , a cave ! " lily said . " let 's go inside ! "

tom was scared . he did not like dark places . " no , it is too dark and cold . there might be bad things inside . let 's play somewhere else . " he said .

lily was brave . she wanted to see what was in the cave . " do n't be scared , tom . it will be fun . maybe we will find treasure or animals or fairies . come on , follow me ! " she said . she ran to the cave and went inside .

tom did not want to be alone . he did not want to make lily sad . he followed her to the cave . he held her hand . they walked inside . it was dark and cold . they could not see much . they heard strange noises . they felt scared .

" hello , who are you ? " a voice said . tom and lily stopped . they saw a blue light . it was a blue bird . it was sitting on a nest . it had shiny feathers and a long tail . it looked nice .

" hello , we are tom and lily . we are playing in the park . we saw your cave and wanted to see what was inside . we are sorry if we bothered you . " lily said .

the blue bird smiled . " you are not bothering me . you are welcome to my cave . i am bluey . i live here with my eggs . they will hatch soon . do you want to see them ? " it said .

tom and lily nodded . they were curious . they walked to the nest . they saw four blue eggs . they were pretty . they felt warm . " wow , they are beautiful . when will they hatch ? " tom asked .

" soon , very soon . they will be like me . they will fly and sing and shine . they will be my friends . you can be my friends too . do you want to stay and play with me ? " bluey asked .

tom and lily looked at each other . they smiled . they liked bluey . they wanted to stay and play with him . they nodded . " yes , we want to stay and play with you . you are very nice . you have a nice cave . can we see more of it ? " lily asked .

bluey clapped his wings . he was happy . he had new friends . he nodded . " yes , you can see more of it . there are many things to see and do . come , follow me . i will show you . but be careful . do not touch anything . some things are sharp or hot or break . yield to me . i know the way . " he said .

tom and lily followed bluey . they saw more of the cave . they saw rocks and crystals and water and fire . they saw colors and shapes and shadows and light . they saw more animals and plants and bugs and things . they played and learned and laughed and talked . they had fun . they were happy . they liked the cave . they liked bluey . they were friends . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park and share their toys . but sometimes lily was bossy . she wanted to choose all the games and tell ben what to do .

one day , lily had a secret . she found a shiny ring in the grass . she put it on her finger and felt very happy . she did not want to show ben . she thought he would want it too .

" let 's play hide and seek , " she said to ben . " you count to ten and i will hide . "

ben nodded and started to count . lily ran away and looked for a good hiding spot . she saw a big tree with a hole in it . she crawled inside and smiled . she felt safe and cozy .

but then she heard a voice . it was a squirrel . it was living in the tree . it saw lily 's ring and wanted it .

" hey , what are you doing here ? " the squirrel asked . " that 's my ring . you stole it from me . "

lily was scared . she did not know the ring belonged to the squirrel . she tried to take it off her finger , but it was stuck .

" please , do n't be angry , " she said to the squirrel . " i did not know . i will give it back to you . "

the squirrel was not happy . it wanted to teach lily a lesson . it started to make loud noises and call its friends .

" help , help , there 's a thief in my tree ! " the squirrel shouted . " she took my ring and wo n't give it back ! "

soon , many squirrels came to the tree . they poked their heads inside and saw lily . they started to chatter and scold her .

lily felt very sorry . she wished she had shared her secret with ben . he would have helped her . he was a good friend .

she heard ben calling her name . he had finished counting and was looking for her .

" lily , where are you ? " he asked . " i ca n't find you . "

lily wanted to answer him , but she was afraid of the squirrels . she hoped he would find her soon and save her from the bossy squirrels . she learned her lesson . she would never spread secrets again . sara loved to ride her bike . she had a pink bike with a basket and a bell . she liked to pedal fast and feel the wind in her hair . she also liked to share her bike with her friends . she was very generous .

one day , sara went to the park with her mom and dad . she saw a new girl sitting on a bench . she looked sad and lonely . sara wanted to make her happy . she rode her bike to the bench and said hello . the girl smiled and said her name was lily .

" do you want to ride my bike ? " sara asked . " it is very fun and easy . i can show you how to pedal and ring the bell . "

lily nodded and thanked sara . she got on the bike and sara helped her balance . they rode around the park together , laughing and talking . sara was glad she made a new friend .

after a while , sara and lily were tired . they parked the bike near the bench and sat down . sara 's mom and dad came over and gave them some juice and cookies . they said it was time to go home .

