the dragon said , " taste the story ? what does that mean ? "

sara said , " it means to enjoy the story . to feel the story . to imagine the story . to learn from the story . to love the story . stories are yummy . they make us happy . they make us smart . they make us kind . they make us friends . "

the dragon said , " i want to taste the story . i want to be happy . i want to be smart . i want to be kind . i want to be your friend . "

sara said , " then let 's taste the story together . let 's start from the beginning . once upon a time , there was a princess and a dragon ... " lily and tom were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a lot of fog in the air . they could not see the trees or the houses very well . they thought it was fun to run and hide in the fog .

they ran to the park and found a big slide . they took turns to go down the slide and laugh . but then they heard a loud noise . it was a big truck that was coming to the park . the truck had a lot of food for a picnic . the truck driver did not see the fog . he did not see the slide . he drove over the slide and broke it .

lily and tom were very sad . they liked the slide . they wanted to play on it . they were also scared of the truck . they ran away from the park and looked for their mom . they found her at home . she was making cookies for them .

they told her what happened . she hugged them and said it was not their fault . she said the truck driver was confused by the fog . he did not mean to spoil their fun . she said they could have some cookies and play with their toys . she said maybe the fog would go away soon and they could go back to the park .

lily and tom felt better . they ate some cookies and played with their toys . they hoped the slide would be fixed soon . they still liked the fog , but they also liked the slide . they learned to be careful in the fog . they learned that sometimes things go wrong , but mom is always there to help . lily and ben are friends . they are in the same classroom . they like to play and learn together . but one day , they have a problem .

the teacher gives them a big paper . she says , " draw what you want to be when you grow up . " lily and ben think hard . lily wants to be a doctor . she draws a white coat and a stethoscope . ben wants to be a firefighter . he draws a red truck and a hose .

they show each other their drawings . they are proud of their work . but then they start to argue . lily says , " my job is better than yours . doctors help people who are sick . " ben says , " no , my job is better than yours . firefighters save people from fires . " they get angry and loud . they do not want to be friends anymore .

the teacher hears them . she comes to their table . she looks at their drawings . she smiles . she says , " you both did a great job . you both have good dreams . but you do not have to fight . you can be different and still be friends . doctors and firefighters can work together . they can help each other and the people who need them . "

lily and ben listen to the teacher . they feel sorry . they say sorry to each other . they hug and make up . they are friends again . they are happy . they are proud of their drawings and their friendship . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a thin cat named mittens . one day , lily 's mommy gave her a razor to help her shave her legs .

