but then , the ladder suddenly broke ! timmy fell down and hurt himself badly . his mom had to take him to the hospital . timmy learned that sometimes , even when we feel happy and brave , we need to be careful and listen to others ' advice . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play in the park with her friends . one day , lily and her friends saw dark clouds in the sky . they knew it was going to rain soon .

