from that day on , timmy 's friends knew that he was brave and always willing to help them out . they continued to play soccer in the park and timmy never kicked the ball too hard again . once upon a time , there was a boy who loved to talk . he talked all the time , even when he was supposed to be quiet . one day , he went to school and saw a big board with lots of pictures on it . it was a regular board , nothing special . but the boy wanted to talk about the board , so he started talking loudly .

the teacher asked him to be quiet , but he did n't listen . he kept talking about the board and pointing to the pictures . suddenly , the board fell off the wall and hit the boy on the head . he got hurt and had to go to the hospital . he learned that it 's important to listen to the teacher and be quiet sometimes .

the end . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy loved to play outside in his backyard . he had a big ball that he liked to throw and catch . one day , timmy saw a tall tree with a high branch . he wanted to climb up to the top to see the whole world .

but when timmy tried to climb the tree , he saw a big spike sticking out of the branch . he knew it would hurt him if he touched it . so , timmy decided to go back inside and ask his mom for help .

