one day , timmy 's mom had to go to work , so she told timmy to be a good boy and stay in his room . but timmy was feeling naughty and did n't want to listen to his mom . he snuck out of his room and went to the living room where he saw his mom 's jazz records .

timmy could n't resist the temptation and decided to play the records . he put on his favorite jazz record and started to dance . but then he heard his mom 's car pulling up in the driveway . he quickly turned off the record and ran back to his room .

when his mom came in , she asked timmy if he had been a good boy and stayed in his room . timmy felt guilty and decided to tell the truth . he said , " mommy , i was naughty . i played your jazz record when you told me not to . " his mom was surprised but happy that timmy told the truth .

from that day on , timmy learned his lesson and never played his mom 's records without permission . he would repeat to himself , " i will be a good boy and listen to my mom . " and whenever he heard jazz music , he would dance in his room with a big smile on his face . once upon a time , there were two friends , a monkey and a rabbit . they lived in a forest and played together every day . one day , they saw a snake on the ground . the snake was very long and had a shiny skin . the monkey and rabbit were scared , so they ran away .

