finally , when the sun rose in the morning , the fog had cleared and the sky was a beautiful blue again . the frightened little girl opened her eyes and smiled . all was right with the world again ! once upon a time there was a little girl called sue . sue was three and she was very mischievous . she had a big cardboard box and loved to play in it .

