after a while , lucy got very restless and wanted to explore more . she ran around the park until she was tired and ready to go home . her parents drove her back home and she smiled the whole way , thinking about all the fun things she did at the park . once upon a time , there lived a little boy called john . john was three years old and loved to explore and make new friends . one day , while walking in the park , he noticed a tall man . so he stopped and said hello .

