john thanked martin , put on the shirt , and ran off to show it to his friends . from that day onwards , martin and john became close friends and they still meet up in the park every weekend . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lola . she always wanted to help people . one day , a funny problem happened in her house . the lightbulb stopped working .

