when the bowl was safely on the table , the boy and his dad peeked inside . inside was a beautiful toy car with vibrant colors and shiny wheels ! the little boy cheered with delight and the dad scooped him up in a big gray hug . once upon a time there was a little girl . she had a brave spirit and wanted to do something amazing . she found a nice rug and knew it would be perfect for her great adventure .

