the fox was so happy ! and even though it was very slow , it was proud of its tail and the wink it was able to attach . today , timmy was in the kitchen . he wanted to make something . he saw some carrots and tomatoes . he took them and chopped them up . then he put them in a bowl and mixed them with dressing . he called it a salad !

