bob was very thankful for his friend . she had lent him the eraser right in time . with it , he was able to do very well on his test . once upon a time , there was a bald man . he was feeling really hungry and he looked around the kitchen to find something to eat . he saw a big bunch of celery and thought that he could eat it . he leaned down and picked it up . he liked the taste of the celery and ate it all .

the man then went outside to take a walk in the sunshine . he leaned against a big tree and felt himself relaxing . he closed his eyes and let the sunshine warm his face . it felt really good .

