he enjoyed his snack and decided that he should always keep some celery in the kitchen . that way , he 'd never have to go hungry again . once upon a time , there was a happy little girl . she loved to explore and was always looking for new things . one day , she decided to take a walk in the park . as she was walking , she saw something that made her face light up -- a big , blue balloon ! she was so excited that she began to run . when she reached the balloon , she stretched out both of her hands and grabbed it . the balloon felt so light and silky in her hands -- it was so much fun ! she could n't believe her luck !

