he told everyone that with hard work and determination , you can become the best at anything ! once upon a time , there was a wild dog . he was a black and white spotted dog and very adventurous . he always wanted to explore and see new things . one day , he was running around and he heard a noise coming from the garage . he stopped to listen and heard a mewing . he wondered what it was and slowly walked closer to the garage . he heard the noise again and stuck his nose to the garage door . inside the garage was a cute little kitten . he was meowing for help . the wild dog stepped back and barked . he barked and barked until a person came and opened the garage . the person was happy to see the little kitten . the wild dog wanted to make sure the kitten was safe , so he stayed and listened while the person talked to it . the person said they would find the kitten a home and the wild dog was relieved . he said goodbye to the kitten and ran away , feeling very happy that he had been able to help . once upon a time there was a special day . on that day the sun shone brightly and the birds sang happily . a little girl called sara was very excited because it was her birthday .

