mommy and sara stayed together , hugging and laughing . it was a very special moment that they would never forget . once upon a time , there was a small boy who liked to play with a spear . he liked the way it moved and sometimes he pretended to be a mighty hunter ! one day , the little boy was playing with his spear outside when he accidently threw it too far and lost it ! he was so sad and started crying .

