just then , mary 's mom said it was time to go . mary was sad to leave , but she knew she had to go home . she said goodbye to the ocean and started walking back .

mary had a wonderful day . she learned so much about the ocean and had a delicious snack to chew on too ! once upon a time , there was a little boy who loved to play games . one day , he saw a new game that he wanted to play with . but when he picked up the game , he saw that the box was all cut up . he was very troubled because he could n't play the game now .

