but he was sure to take it out for a few rides every now and then . and he was always eager to stay out on it , whenever he could . there was a loyal dog named spring . he loved springtime because he could go for long walks . one day , he heard a noise coming from the garden . he waited , and soon he saw a butterfly ! it was a beautiful butterfly with orange , yellow and blue wings . the butterfly was so happy to see spring , and it jumped up and down . spring and the butterfly flew around the garden together , until spring decided to take a nap in the sun .

after his nap , spring looked around and he saw a lot of little white flowers . the flowers were so fresh and so beautiful ! spring wanted to thank the flowers for being so loyal to him . so he ran up to them and gave them a big hug . everyone in the garden was amazed . they had never seen a loyal dog like spring before . and he was so thankful because the little white flowers made springtime even more special . once upon a time there was a bike . it belonged to a little girl but it was broken . she was sad because she could n't play with it . one day she found a man who said he could fix her bike . he worked hard and when he was done it was like new . the girl was very happy and she rode it all around the yard .

