the moral of the story is that we should always be careful and make sure the water we drink is clean and gentle . we should also listen to our parents and friends when they tell us to be careful . once upon a time , there was a clumsy little boy named timmy . one day , timmy was playing in his room , but he accidentally knocked over his toy box . " oh no ! " timmy shouted , as his toys spilled all over the floor .

