tim thinks . he feels sorry . he says , " i would feel sad . i do not want to make sam sad . i am sorry , sam . do you want to play with the helicopter ? " sam says , " yes , please . thank you , tim . i am sorry , too . do you want to play with the car ? " tim says , " yes , please . thank you , sam . let 's play together . "

