" stop ! " lily shouted . " you ca n't drink it ! it 's poison ! "

ben was confused . " poison ? but you said it was a potion ! "

lily nodded . " it is a potion , but only for me . for you , it 's poison . it will make you sick or hurt you . you have to make your own potion . "

ben was frustrated . he thought lily was being mean and selfish . he wanted to share the potion . he did n't believe it was poison . he thought lily was lying .

he grabbed the bottle from lily 's hand . he opened it and took a sip .

lily gasped . " ben , no ! you drank the poison ! "

ben felt a strange taste in his mouth . he felt dizzy and sick . he dropped the bottle and fell to the ground .

