she hugged ben and cried . " ben , ben , please wake up ! i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry ! i did n't want to hurt you ! "

ben opened his eyes . he saw lily 's face . he felt better . he smiled .

" lily , it 's okay . i 'm not hurt . it was just water and grass . it was not poison . "

