ben laughed too . he hugged lily back .

" lily , you 're silly too . you made poison . but i 'm glad you 're sorry . "

they got up and picked up the bottle . they poured out the water and grass . they filled it with fresh water and flowers .

they looked at each other and smiled .

" let 's make a new potion , " lily said . " a potion that can make us friends and happy and welcome . "

