they hug and then run inside . they drink hot chocolate and eat cookies . they are happy and warm . they share their new scarf . tom and amy were friends who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a big flood in the park . the water was brown and dirty and covered the grass and the swings . they wanted to see what was in the water , so they went closer .

