" no , my loves , we ca n't . the car is too much money . the price is high . we have to save our money for food and clothes and other things we need . " mom said .

but lily and tom did not listen . they urged their mom to buy the car . they said please and thank you and sorry and pretty please . they cried and whined and stamped their feet . they made a lot of noise .

" fine , fine , i 'll buy the car . but you have to share it and be good . and no more asking for toys , okay ? " mom said , feeling tired and sad . she took out her wallet and paid the man at the shop .

lily and tom were happy . they hugged their mom and thanked her . they took the car outside and started to play . but soon they had a problem . they both wanted to drive the car . they both wanted to honk the horn . they both wanted to stick the sticker .

" give me the car , it 's mine ! " lily said .

" no , it 's mine , i saw it first ! " tom said .

they pulled and pushed and fought over the car . they were fierce and mean . they scratched and bit and kicked each other . they broke the car and the sticker and the horn . they made a big mess .

mom heard the noise and came outside . she saw lily and tom and the car . she was angry and sad . she took the car and threw it in the trash . she scolded lily and tom and sent them to their room . she said they were naughty and selfish and spoiled . she said they wasted their money and hurt each other . she said they had no more toys and no more fun .

lily and tom were sorry . they cried and hugged and said sorry to each other . they said sorry to mom and asked for the car back . but it was too late . the car was gone . the shop was closed . the money was spent . they had nothing to play with . they had a bad ending . lily and ben went to the park with mom . they saw a big slide and ran to it . they wanted to go down the slide many times .

but there was a long line of kids waiting for the slide . lily and ben had to wait too . they felt bored and sad .

then they saw an elderly lady sitting on a bench near the slide . she had a big bag with her . she smiled at lily and ben and said , " hello , little ones . do you like the slide ? "

lily and ben nodded . they said , " yes , we do . but we have to wait a long time . "

the elderly lady said , " i have something for you in my bag . do you want to see ? "

lily and ben said , " yes , please ! "

the elderly lady opened her bag and took out two books . one was about animals and the other was about cars . she said , " these are for you . you can read them while you wait . they are very fun and colorful . "

lily and ben were very happy . they said , " thank you , thank you ! you are very kind ! "

they took the books and sat on the ground next to the bench . they looked at the pictures and the words . they learned new things and had fun .

the elderly lady watched them and smiled . she said , " you are very welcome . you are very smart and polite . "

she gave them a seat on the bench and a gift of books . she made them feel happy and grateful . they made her feel happy and appreciated . they became friends at the park . sam and lily are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they see a big puddle . it is wet and shiny .

" look , lily , a puddle ! " sam says . " let 's jump in it ! "

" ok , sam , that sounds fun ! " lily says . she takes off her shoes and socks . sam does the same .

they run to the puddle and jump in it . splash ! splash ! splash ! the water is cold and wet . they laugh and splash each other .

" sam , you are so wet ! " lily says . " your hair is wet , your shirt is wet , your pants are wet ! "

" so are you , lily ! " sam says . " you are wet from head to toe ! "

they jump and splash some more . they have a lot of fun .

then , they hear a voice . it is sam 's mom . she is looking for them .

" sam , lily , where are you ? " she calls .

" here , mom , we are here ! " sam says . he and lily get out of the puddle . they are dripping wet .

sam 's mom sees them . she is not happy .

" sam , lily , what are you doing ? " she asks . " you are wet and dirty ! you need to change your clothes ! "

" sorry , mom , we were playing in the puddle , " sam says . " it was fun ! "

" but , sam , you ca n't play in the puddle ! " sam 's mom says . " you will catch a cold ! and you will ruin your clothes ! these are not regular clothes , these are your nice clothes ! "

sam and lily look at their clothes . they are not regular clothes . they are their nice clothes . they wore them for a special occasion . they forgot .

" oops , we forgot , " sam says . " we are sorry , mom . "

sam 's mom sighs . she is not angry , but she is worried .

" come on , let 's go home , " she says . " i will show you how to dry your clothes and clean them . and you need to take a bath , too . "

sam and lily nod . they follow sam 's mom . they are still wet and dirty , but they are also happy . they had fun in the puddle . they learned something new . they will remember next time . anna loved to sing and dance . she wanted to be in the theater show with the big kids . but she was fearful of the stage . she thought everyone would laugh at her .

