they hug mom and smile . they are happy . they have a bulb . they have a pot . they have a mom . they have each other . sam and mia liked to play in the backyard . they had a big sandbox , a swing , and a slide . they also had a spray bottle that they filled with water . they liked to spray each other and the plants and the bugs .

one day , they saw a big truck parked in front of their house . it had a lot of lumber on it . lumber is wood that people use to build things . sam and mia wondered what the truck was doing there .

