they worked and played all day . by the evening , the new shed was done . it looked nice and strong . sam and mia were proud . they thanked the man and their dad . they said they liked the new shed . they said they liked to spray . they said they liked lumber . ben and tom are brothers . they like to play with cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . they make noises like vroom and beep when they move the cars .

