the car starts to make a loud noise . it is the alarm . it goes wooo wooo wooo . ben and tom are scared . they want to stop the alarm . they look for a button to turn it off . they see a big button with an r on it . they think it means " rest " . they press it .

the car starts to move . it is not resting . it is reversing . it goes back and back and back . ben and tom scream . they do not know how to stop the car . they see a wall behind them . it is getting closer and closer . they hit the wall . the car makes a big crash . the alarm stops . the car is broken . the wall is broken . ben and tom are hurt .

their dad hears the noise . he runs to the garage . he sees the car and the wall and the boys . he is very angry . he is also very sad . he has to pay a lot of money to fix the car and the wall . he has to take the boys to the doctor . he is bald , but he feels like he has lost more hair . he yells at ben and tom . he says they are very naughty and they can not play with cars anymore . ben and tom cry . they are sorry . they wish they had not played with the big car . they wish they had listened to their dad . they have learned a hard lesson . the end . will was a wise boy who liked to notice things . he noticed the sun and the moon , the birds and the bugs , the flowers and the trees . he noticed when his mom was happy or sad , when his dad was busy or bored , when his sister was nice or mean . he noticed everything .

