they kiss goodnight . they sleep tight . they dream sweet . sam was a poor boy who lived in a small house with his mom and dad . he had only one sock that he wore on his left foot . his right foot was always cold and dirty . he wished he had another sock , but his mom and dad had no money to buy him one .

