sam was afraid and tried to run away . but the driver caught him by his shirt and pulled him down . he took the socks from his pocket and threw them on the ground .

" these are not yours , kid . these are for the orphanage . you are a thief and a liar . go away and do n't come back ! " he shouted at sam .

sam felt ashamed and sad . he crawled away from the truck and ran back to his house . he cried and hugged his mom . he told her what happened and said he was sorry .

his mom was kind and gentle . she kissed his head and said , " it 's okay , sam . i know you were just curious and wanted something nice . but you ca n't take things that do n't belong to you . that 's wrong and hurtful . you have to be honest and respectful . maybe someday , someone will give you a pair of socks as a gift . but until then , you have to be happy with what you have . you have me and dad , and we love you very much . that 's more than many kids have . "

sam nodded and smiled . he felt better and hugged his mom back . he said , " i love you too , mom . you are the best mom in the world . and i do n't need socks . i have you . " lila and tom were playing in the park with their kites . they liked to see how high they could make them fly in the sky . but then they saw dark clouds and heard loud noises . it was a storm coming !

" let 's go home , lila ! " tom said . " the storm is scary ! "

but lila did not want to go . she wanted to keep playing with her kite . she thought the storm was fun .

" no , tom , let 's stay ! " lila said . " look , my kite can spin in the wind ! "

lila made her kite spin faster and faster . she did not see that the storm was getting closer and stronger . she did not hear tom calling her name .

suddenly , a big gust of wind blew lila 's kite away . it snapped the string and took the kite far , far away . lila was sad and scared . she had lost her kite and her friend .

" tom , tom , where are you ? " lila cried .

tom ran to lila and hugged her . he was glad she was safe .

" i 'm here , lila , i 'm here ! " tom said . " come on , let 's go home . the storm is bad . "

lila nodded and held tom 's hand . they ran to their home , where their mom and dad were waiting for them . they were alert and worried .

" lila , tom , are you okay ? " mom asked .

" yes , mom , we 're okay , " tom said .

but lila was still sad . she had lost her kite and learned a hard lesson .

" i 'm sorry , mom , i 'm sorry , tom , " lila said . " i was silly and did not listen . i should have gone home with you , tom . the storm was not fun , it was dangerous . "

mom and dad hugged lila and tom . they were proud of tom for being alert and caring . they were sorry for lila 's kite , but they were happy she was safe .

" it 's okay , lila , we love you , " mom said . " you made a mistake , but you learned from it . next time , you will be more alert and listen to your friend , right ? "

lila nodded and smiled . she was glad she had tom as her friend . she hoped she would find her kite again , or get a new one . she hoped the storm would go away soon , and the sun would come out again . she hoped they could play in the park again , but this time , be more alert and careful . tom was a cat who liked to play with yarn . he had a big ball of blue yarn that he found in the closet . he rolled it , chased it , and scratched it . he had so much fun with his blue yarn .

one day , he saw another ball of yarn in the closet . it was red and shiny . tom wanted to play with it too . he left his blue yarn on the floor and jumped to the red yarn . he rolled it , chased it , and scratched it . he had so much fun with his red yarn .

but then , he heard a loud noise . it was his owner , lisa . she came into the closet and saw the mess . she saw the blue yarn and the red yarn all tangled and ripped . she was angry . she scolded tom and took away both balls of yarn . she said , " tom , you are a bad cat . you can not have two balls of yarn . you have to share and take care of your things . you can not change your mind all the time . you have to be happy with what you have . "

tom felt sad and sorry . he realized he made a mistake . he wished he had not left his blue yarn . he wished he had not played with the red yarn . he wished he had listened to lisa . he looked at his paw and saw a bit of blue yarn stuck to his claw . he remembered how much he loved his blue yarn . he wanted it back .

he went to lisa and rubbed his head against her leg . he meowed softly and looked at her with his big eyes . he tried to say he was sorry and he wanted his blue yarn . lisa saw his paw and understood . she smiled and hugged him . she said , " tom , i forgive you . you are a good cat . you learned your lesson . you can have your blue yarn back . but you have to promise me you will not play with the red yarn again . you have to be loyal and grateful to your blue yarn . it is your friend . "

tom nodded and purred . he was happy and thankful . he took his blue yarn and played with it gently . he never looked at the red yarn again . he learned to be happy with what he had . he learned to not change his mind all the time . he learned to be loyal and grateful to his friend . he learned a moral value . tom and sam are brothers . they like to play in the house . one day , they find a big knob on the wall . they do not know what it does .

" let 's turn it ! " tom says . he is curious . sam is scared . he says , " no , do n't ! it might be bad ! "

but tom does not listen . he turns the knob all the way . suddenly , a loud noise comes from the knob . it is a powerful noise . it hurts their ears . it makes the lights go off . it makes the tv go off . it makes everything go off .

tom and sam are scared . they cry . they want their mom and dad . but their mom and dad are not home . they are at work . they do not know what tom and sam did .

the knob is broken . it can not be turned back . it made the power go off . the power will not come back . tom and sam are in trouble . they are in the dark . they are alone . they are sorry . they wish they did not turn the knob . ben and lily liked to play in the garden . they had a big box of toys and they could build anything they wanted . one day , they decided to build a castle with blocks and a sword with sticks and tape .

" look at my sword ! " ben said , holding up his stick . " it is long and sharp . i can fight the bad guys with it . "

