ben thought for a moment . he liked his sword very much , but he also liked lily . she was his friend and she always shared her toys with him . he decided to be generous and let her use his sword .

" okay , you can try it , " he said , handing her the stick . " but be careful , it is very strong . "

" thank you , ben , you are very generous , " lily said , smiling . she took the stick and pretended to swing it around . " i am a brave knight , too . i can help you protect the castle . "

they played together for a long time , having fun and making noises . they built a big castle with blocks and put a flag on top . they used their sword to fight the bad guys and save the princess . they were happy and proud of their work . they were good friends and good builders . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . but lily saw something that made her worry . it was a big dog with black fur and sharp teeth . the dog was on a leash , but it looked angry and loud .

" ben , look at that dog ! " lily said . " it is big and scary . i do n't like it . "

ben looked at the dog and smiled . " it is not scary , lily . it is just a dog . dogs are nice and friendly . they like to play and lick . maybe we can pet it . "

lily shook her head . " no , ben . we ca n't pet it . it might bite us or hurt us . we should stay away from it . "

ben did not listen to lily . he ran towards the dog and said , " hi , doggy ! do you want to play with me ? " he reached out his hand to touch the dog 's head .

the dog did not like ben . it growled and barked and snapped at ben 's hand . ben was scared and ran back to lily . he had a scratch on his hand and tears in his eyes .

" ow , ow , ow ! the dog bit me , lily ! it bit me ! " ben cried .

lily hugged ben and said , " i 'm sorry , ben . i told you the dog was scary . you should have listened to me . are you okay ? "

ben nodded and said , " i 'm okay , lily . but it hurts . can we go home ? "

lily said , " yes , ben . let 's go home . we can tell mom and dad what happened . they will make it better . "

lily and ben left the park . they held hands and walked to their home . they did not look at the big dog again . they learned to be careful and not worry . tom and lily liked to play with their dad 's microscope . they could see tiny things that they could not see with their eyes . one day , they found a little jar with some water and green things inside . they put some of the water on a slide and looked at it under the microscope .

" wow , look at those ! " tom said . " they are moving and swimming . what are they ? "

" i do n't know , " lily said . " maybe they are fish or bugs . they are very small . "

" they must be hungry , " tom said . " let 's feed them some bread crumbs . "

tom and lily broke some bread into tiny pieces and dropped them into the jar . they watched as the green things came closer and ate the bread . they looked happy and full .

" good job , kids , " their dad said , coming into the room . " you are feeding the algae . they are plants that live in water and make their own food from the sun . but they also like some extra nutrients sometimes . "

" algae ? " tom and lily repeated . " that 's a big word . what does it mean ? "

" it means green things that live in water , " their dad said , smiling . " you are very curious and smart . you are learning a lot from the microscope . it is a tool that helps us see the wonders of nature . "

" thank you , dad , " tom and lily said . " we love the microscope . and we love the algae . they are our friends . "

" you are welcome , kids , " their dad said . " you are very kind and gentle . you are taking good care of the algae . they are lucky to have you . "

tom and lily hugged their dad . they felt happy and proud . they had fed the algae and learned a new word . they had used the microscope and seen something amazing . they had listened to their dad and learned something wise . they had a lot of fun . lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they had a big sack with them . they put their toys and snacks in the sack .

" look , lily , a rainbow ! " tom said . he pointed to the sky . there was a clear rainbow with many colors . it was very pretty .

