tom nodded . he took the sack and held lily 's hand . they ran to the rainbow . they wanted to touch it and see what it was made of .

but when they got closer , they saw that the rainbow was not solid . it was just light and water . they could not touch it or hold it .

" oh , no , tom , the rainbow is gone ! " lily said . she was sad and confused .

tom hugged her . he said , " do n't be sad , lily . the rainbow is still there . we just ca n't see it from here . but we can see it from far away . it is a gift from the sun and the rain . they make the rainbow for us to enjoy . "

lily looked at tom . she said , " you are right , tom . the rainbow is a gift . it is very special . thank you for showing me the rainbow . "

they smiled and hugged . they put the sack on their backs and walked back to the park . they were happy and grateful . they had seen a wonderful rainbow . lily was a lucky girl . she had a big house , a nice family , and many toys . she liked to play with her dolls , her cars , and her books . but her favorite toy was her teddy bear . she called him brownie , and he was her best friend .

one day , lily 's mom said they had to go to the store . lily wanted to bring brownie with her , but her mom said no . " brownie is too old and dirty , " her mom said . " he might get lost or ripped in the store . you can play with him when we come back . "

lily was sad . she did not want to leave brownie alone . she hugged him and said , " do n't worry , brownie . i will be back soon . i love you . " she put him on her bed and followed her mom to the car .

at the store , lily saw many new and shiny toys . she saw dolls , cars , and books . she saw a big teddy bear that looked like brownie , but cleaner and softer . she wanted to touch it , but her mom said no . " you already have a teddy bear , lily , " her mom said . " you do n't need another one . let 's go pay for our things and go home . "

lily was confused . she did not understand why her mom did not let her have the new teddy bear . she asked her mom , " why ca n't i have the new teddy bear , mom ? he is so pretty and nice . brownie is old and dirty . he is not pretty and nice . "

her mom smiled and knelt down to lily 's level . she explained , " lily , you are a lucky girl . you have a teddy bear that loves you very much . brownie is old and dirty because you played with him a lot . that means he is special and has a lot of memories . the new teddy bear is pretty and nice , but he does not know you . he does not have a name or a story . he is just a toy . brownie is not just a toy . he is your friend . do you understand ? "

lily thought for a moment . she looked at the new teddy bear and then at her mom . she nodded and said , " i understand , mom . i love brownie . he is my friend . i do n't need the new teddy bear . i want to go home and play with brownie . "

her mom hugged her and said , " i 'm proud of you , lily . you are a smart and kind girl . let 's go home and play with brownie . " they walked to the car , holding hands . lily was happy . she was a lucky girl . lily and tom were friends . they liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big red balloon . it was tied to a bench . lily and tom wanted the balloon . they ran to the bench .

but a mean boy was there . he saw lily and tom . he did not want to share the balloon . he said , " this is my balloon . go away ! " he pulled the balloon hard . the string broke . the balloon flew away .

lily and tom were sad . they looked at the balloon . it went up and up . it went near the sun . the sun was very hot . the balloon got hot too . it popped . bang !

the mean boy was troubled . he did not have the balloon anymore . he was sorry . he said , " i am sorry . i was bad . can we be friends ? " lily and tom nodded . they forgave the mean boy .

they played together in the park . they did not need the balloon . they had fun . they were happy . mia likes to sing . she sings when she wakes up , when she eats , when she plays and when she goes to bed . she sings loud and happy songs that make her feel good .

but her brother leo does not like to sing . he is grumpy and quiet . he likes to read and draw and play with his cars . he does not like loud noises that hurt his ears .

one day , mia and leo are in the car with their mom . mia is singing a song about a rainbow and a unicorn . leo is reading a book about a dinosaur and a volcano . he does not want to hear mia 's song . he says , " mia , stop singing ! you are too loud and silly . you make my ears ache . "

mia feels sad and stops singing . she says , " but i like to sing . singing makes me happy . why are you so grumpy , leo ? "

leo says , " because i like to read . reading makes me smart . singing is for babies . you are a baby , mia . "

mia says , " no , i am not a baby . i am three years old . you are mean , leo . "

mom hears them and says , " mia and leo , please stop fighting . you are both good and special . you can like different things and still be nice to each other . mia , you can sing , but not too loud . leo , you can read , but not too rude . can you do that ? "

mia and leo nod and say , " yes , mom . "

mom says , " good . now , how about we all sing a song together ? a song that we all know and like . do you know the song about the wheels on the bus ? "

mia and leo say , " yes , mom . "

mom says , " ok , then . let 's sing it . the wheels on the bus go round and round , round and round , round and round ... "

mia and leo join mom and sing the song . mia sings happy and leo sings quiet . they both smile and have fun . they are not grumpy anymore . they are friends . ben and lily were playing in the bathroom . they saw a shiny thing on the sink . it was a razor . ben wanted to touch it .

" look , lily , a shiny thing ! " ben said .

