but ben did not listen . he reached for the razor . he felt a sharp pain in his finger . he cried out loud .

" ow , ow , ow ! it bit me ! " ben said .

lily ran to him . she saw blood on his finger . she was scared . she slapped the razor away . it fell on the floor .

" bad shiny thing ! go away ! " lily said .

she hugged ben . she tried to make him feel better .

" i 'm sorry , ben . are you okay ? " lily said .

ben nodded . he stopped crying . he looked at his finger . it had a small cut .

" it 's okay , lily . it 's just a little cut . it will heal soon . " ben said .

lily smiled . she was glad ben was okay . she took him to the kitchen . she gave him a band - aid and a cookie .

