" okay , lily . i will listen to you . next time , we will play with something else . something that does n't bite . " ben said .

they hugged each other . they were happy . they learned a lesson . they never played with the razor again . lisa and ben were playing in the park with their toys . they liked to pretend they were kings and queens of a big castle . lisa had a crown and a dress , and ben had a sword and a cape . they had many friends who were their knights and ladies .

one day , a new girl arrived at the park . she had long curly hair and a shiny bike . she saw lisa and ben and said , " hello , i 'm mia . can i play with you ? "

lisa and ben looked at her and smiled . they said , " sure , you can play with us . we are kings and queens of this castle . what do you want to be ? "

mia thought for a moment and said , " i want to be a queen too . i have a crown and a dress at home . can i go get them ? "

lisa and ben nodded . they said , " okay , you can be a queen too . but hurry back , we are going to have a tea party soon . "

mia said , " okay , i 'll be right back . " she rode her bike to her house and got her crown and dress . she was very organized and knew where to find them . she put them on and rode back to the park .

when she arrived , she saw lisa and ben waiting for her . they had set up a table and chairs with cups and plates and cookies . they had also invited their friends to join them . they said , " welcome , queen mia . we are happy you are here . come and sit with us and have some tea . "

mia was very happy . she said , " thank you , king lisa and king ben . you are very nice . i like your tea party . can we be friends ? "

lisa and ben said , " of course we can be friends . you are very nice too . we like your crown and dress . they are very pretty . "

they all sat down and had a tea party . they talked and laughed and shared their cookies . they had a lot of fun . they decided to play together every day . they were the best kings and queens of the park . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys . they have a big box of toys in their room . one day , they find a new toy in the box . it is a sheep . the sheep is white and soft . it has wool on its body .

" look , ben , a sheep ! " lily says . she picks up the sheep and hugs it .

" can i see ? " ben asks . he wants to touch the wool .

" okay , but be gentle , " lily says . she gives the sheep to ben .

ben feels the wool . it is warm and fluffy . he likes it . he sees a black mark on the wool . he wonders what it is .

" what is this ? " ben asks . he points to the mark .

" i do n't know , " lily says . she looks at the mark . " maybe it is dirt . "

" maybe we can wash it , " ben says . he thinks of a plan .

" let 's go to the bathroom , " he says . he takes the sheep and runs to the bathroom .

lily follows him . she is curious .

in the bathroom , ben fills the sink with water . he puts the sheep in the water . he rubs the wool with his hands . he tries to wash off the mark .

but the mark does not go away . it stays on the wool . ben is confused .

" why is the mark still there ? " he asks .

lily looks at the sheep . she sees something on the mark . it is a word . she can read some words . she reads the word on the mark .

" it says ' lazy ' , " she says .

" lazy ? " ben repeats . he does not know what it means .

" it means you do n't like to work or play , " lily explains . " you just want to sleep or watch tv . "

" like daddy ? " ben jokes .

lily laughs . she thinks of their daddy . he likes to nap on the couch .

