" maybe a bad person , " ben says . " or maybe a bad sheep . "

" a bad sheep ? " lily repeats . she is surprised .

" yes , maybe a bad sheep who was jealous of the sheep , " ben says . " maybe the bad sheep wanted to make the sheep feel bad . "

" that 's not nice , " lily says . she shakes her head .

" no , it 's not , " ben agrees . he takes the sheep out of the water . he dries it with a towel .

he gives the sheep back to lily . he has an idea .

" let 's make the sheep happy , " he says . " let 's give it a name and a home . "

" okay , " lily says . she smiles . she likes the idea .

she thinks of a name for the sheep .

