" fluffy is a good name , " he says .

they take fluffy to their room . they make a bed for fluffy with a blanket and a pillow . they put fluffy on the bed .

" welcome to your new home , fluffy , " lily says . she pets fluffy .

" we love you , fluffy , " ben says . he hugs fluffy .

fluffy feels happy . he feels the love of lily and ben . he does not care about the mark on his wool . he knows he is not lazy . he is just a sheep .

he closes his eyes and falls asleep . he dreams of green fields and blue skies . he dreams of lily and ben . he dreams of being their friend . lily and ben are going to the theater with mom and dad . they are very happy . they like to watch stories on the big screen . they feel excited and curious .

they get in the car and drive to the theater . they see many people and lights . they buy tickets and popcorn . they find their seats and wait for the story to start .

the story is about a princess and a dragon . the princess is fair and kind . the dragon is big and scary . the princess wants to help the dragon , but the dragon is angry and lonely . he roars and breathes fire .

lily and ben watch the story . they feel many things . they feel scared when the dragon roars . they feel sad when the princess cries . they feel happy when the princess and the dragon become friends . they feel amazed when the dragon flies .

the story ends and the lights come on . lily and ben clap their hands . they liked the story very much . they turn to mom and dad and say :

" mom , dad , that was a good story . can we watch it again ? "

mom and dad smile and hug them . they say :

" maybe another day , sweeties . we 're glad you enjoyed it . it was a fair and beautiful story . " lily liked to draw with her crayons . she had many colors and shapes to make on her paper . but she did not like to share her crayons with her brother ben . ben was younger and he did not know how to draw well . he broke the crayons and made them dull .

one day , lily found a sharp crayon in her box . it was red and shiny and made a thin line on the paper . lily was happy and wanted to draw a big heart with it . she did not want ben to see it or touch it .

but ben saw the sharp crayon and wanted to try it . he reached for it and said , " me want red ! "

lily pulled the crayon away and said , " no ! mine ! go away ! "

ben cried and tried to grab the crayon . lily pushed him and he fell on the floor . he bumped his head and it hurt . he cried louder and louder .

mom heard the noise and came to see what was wrong . she saw ben on the floor and lily with the sharp crayon . she was angry and said , " lily , what did you do ? why did you hurt your brother ? "

lily felt bad and said , " sorry , mom . i did not mean to hurt him . i just wanted to keep my sharp crayon . it is rare and i like it . "

mom said , " lily , i know you like your crayon , but you have to share with your brother . he is learning how to draw and he needs your help . you can teach him how to use the crayon gently and make nice pictures . sharing is caring , lily . do you understand ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , mom . i understand . i will share with ben and teach him how to draw . i am sorry , ben . do you want to draw with me ? "

ben stopped crying and said , " yes , lily . thank you . me want to draw with you . "

mom smiled and said , " that 's good , lily and ben . i am proud of you . now , let 's go and get a band - aid for ben 's head and some cookies for both of you . " lily and tom were best friends . they liked to play in the park every day . they liked to swing , slide and run . but sometimes they were careless . they did not look where they were going . they did not listen to their moms and dads .

one day , they were playing tag . lily was it . she ran after tom . tom ran fast . he did not see the big rock . he tripped and fell . he hurt his knee . he cried . his skin was red and bleeding .

lily ran to him . she felt sorry . she said , " i 'm sorry , tom . are you okay ? "

tom said , " no , it hurts . it hurts a lot . "

lily said , " let me help you . let me get a band - aid . mom has some in her bag . "

she ran to her mom . she said , " mom , tom fell . he needs a band - aid . can i have one ? "

mom said , " of course , dear . here you go . be careful next time . and tell tom to be careful too . "

lily took the band - aid . she ran back to tom . she put the band - aid on his knee . she said , " there , tom . it will be better soon . i 'm sorry i was careless . i did not mean to make you fall . "

tom said , " it 's okay , lily . i was careless too . i did not watch where i was going . thank you for the band - aid . you are a good friend . "

lily said , " you are welcome , tom . you are a good friend too . do you want to play some more ? "

tom said , " yes , i do . but let 's be careful . let 's remember to look and listen . "

lily said , " okay , tom . let 's do that . let 's have fun . "

they hugged . they smiled . they played . they were careful . they were happy . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to pretend they were knights and princesses . tom had a stick that he used as a sword . lily had a crown that she made from flowers .

" look , lily , i am a brave knight ! " tom said . he swung his sword at a tree . " i can fight any dragon or monster ! "

lily smiled . she liked to watch tom play . but she saw something that made her scared . a big dog was running towards them . it had sharp teeth and loud barks .

" tom , tom , watch out ! " lily shouted . she pointed at the dog . " there is a real monster ! "

tom turned around and saw the dog . he was scared too . he dropped his sword and ran to lily . they hugged each other and hoped the dog would go away .

but the dog did not go away . it came closer and closer . it sniffed tom 's sword and picked it up with its mouth . it wagged its tail and looked at tom and lily .

" maybe it is not a monster , " lily said . " maybe it is a normal dog that wants to play . "

tom was not sure . he did not like dogs . he thought they were mean and scary .

" go away , dog ! " tom said . he tried to sound brave , but his voice was small and shaky .

the dog did not listen . it came closer and licked tom 's face . tom felt its wet tongue and soft fur . he was surprised . the dog was not mean or scary . it was friendly and nice .

" hey , that tickles ! " tom said . he laughed and petted the dog . the dog wagged its tail and dropped the sword .

lily smiled . she was happy that tom and the dog were friends . she picked up the sword and gave it back to tom .

" here , tom , you can have your sword back , " lily said . " but maybe you can share it with the dog sometimes . he likes it too . "

tom nodded . he agreed to share his sword with the dog . he learned that not everything that looks different or scary is bad . sometimes , they can be good and fun .

the end . sara and lily are going to grandma 's house for the weekend . they are very happy . they want to pack their bags with their favorite things . sara loves her makeup . she has a pink lipstick , a blue eyeshadow and a glittery nail polish . she puts them in her bag . lily loves her dolls . she has a big doll , a small doll and a doll with a dress . she puts them in her bag .

but when they try to close their bags , they see a problem . their bags are too full . their things do not fit . sara and lily are sad . they do not want to leave anything behind . they ask mom for help . mom smiles and says , " you do not need to pack so many things . grandma has many toys and books for you to play with . and you can share your makeup and dolls with each other . why do n't you pick one thing each and put the rest back ? "

sara and lily think for a moment . they decide to keep their favorite things . sara keeps her pink lipstick . lily keeps her big doll . they put the rest back in their drawers . they close their bags . their things fit . sara and lily are happy . they hug mom and say , " thank you , mom . you are very smart . we are ready to go to grandma 's house . " mom hugs them back and says , " you are very welcome , my sweet girls . i am proud of you . let 's go to grandma 's house . " they get in the car and drive away . they are excited to see grandma . they know they will have a lot of fun . ben and mia were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a big tree with many leaves . they wanted to climb the tree and see the sky .

" can we climb the tree , please ? " ben asked his mom .

" be careful , okay ? the tree is very high and powerful . it can hurt you if you fall , " his mom said .

ben and mia nodded . they held each other 's hands and started to climb the tree . they felt the bark and the branches . they heard the birds and the wind . they climbed higher and higher until they reached the top .

" wow , look at that ! " mia said . she pointed to the clouds and the sun . " they are so pretty and bright ! "

" yes , they are ! " ben said . he smiled and hugged his sister . " we are so brave and strong ! "

they stayed on the tree for a long time . they talked and laughed and sang . they felt happy and free .

but then they heard their mom calling them . " ben , mia , it 's time to go home ! come down from the tree , please ! "

ben and mia looked at each other . they did not want to leave the tree . they liked it so much .

" can we stay a little longer , please ? " ben asked his mom .

" no , sweeties , it 's getting late and dark . you need to settle down and get ready for bed , " his mom said .

ben and mia sighed . they knew their mom was right . they said goodbye to the tree and thanked it for the fun . they climbed down carefully and ran to their mom . she hugged them and kissed them .

" did you have a good time on the tree ? " she asked .

" yes , we did ! it was the best tree ever ! " ben and mia said .

they walked home together , holding hands . they still felt the tree in their hearts . they dreamed of climbing it again . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the field near their house . they had a big box of toys that they could attach to each other . they made cars , planes , robots , and animals with their toys .

one day , they decided to have a race with their toy cars . they attached wheels , engines , and stickers to their cars . they made a track with stones and sticks . they were very competitive . they wanted to win the race .

" ready , set , go ! " lily shouted . they pushed their cars along the track . ben 's car was faster than lily 's . he zoomed ahead of her . lily tried to catch up , but she could not . she felt sad and angry .

" ha ha , i win ! " ben said . he lifted his car in the air . he smiled and laughed . he did not see the big rock in front of him . he tripped over the rock and fell down . his car flew out of his hand and broke into pieces .

" ow , ow , ow ! " ben cried . he scraped his knee and elbow . he looked at his car and saw the wheels , engines , and stickers scattered on the ground . he felt sad and angry .

lily ran to ben . she saw him crying and bleeding . she felt sorry for him . she forgot about the race . she hugged him and said , " are you okay , ben ? i 'm sorry you fell . i 'm sorry your car broke . do you want to share my car ? "

ben looked at lily . he saw her smile and her car . he felt better . he forgot about the race . he hugged her back and said , " thank you , lily . you are a good friend . i 'm sorry i was mean . yes , i want to share your car . "

they attached ben 's stickers to lily 's car . they made a new track with flowers and leaves . they played together and had fun . they were not competitive anymore . they were happy . tim and sam were friends who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a brilliant cat with shiny fur and bright eyes . the cat was sitting on a fence and looking at the birds .

" wow , look at that cat ! " tim said . " it is so pretty and smart . i want to pet it . "

" me too , " sam said . " but be careful . the cat might scratch you or run away . "

tim and sam walked slowly towards the fence . they tried to be quiet and friendly . they wanted to observe the cat and make it like them .

" hello , cat , " tim said softly . " we are nice . can we touch you ? "

the cat did not answer . it stared at tim and sam with a curious look . then it opened its mouth and made a loud noise .

" meow ! " the cat said . " go away ! this is my fence . you are not welcome here . "

tim and sam were scared . they did not expect the cat to be so mean and rude . they backed away from the fence and ran to their house .

they learned a lesson that day . they learned that not all cats are brilliant and friendly . some cats are selfish and nasty . they learned that they should not bother animals that do not want to be bothered . they learned that they should respect other creatures and their spaces . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big jeep in the park . the jeep is red and shiny . lily and ben want to see the jeep .

" can we go to the jeep ? " lily asks ben .

