ben hears lily . he runs after the jeep . he tries to catch the jeep . he kneels on the ground . he reaches for the jeep . but the jeep is too fast . the jeep goes out of the park . the jeep goes into the street . the jeep hits a car . the car hits a fire hydrant . the fire hydrant breaks . water sprays everywhere . the jeep , the car , and the fire hydrant are wet . lily , ben , and the people in the car are wet . they are also hurt and sad .

the police and the firemen come . they help the people . they fix the car and the fire hydrant . they take the jeep away . they talk to lily and ben . they are angry and disappointed .

" why did you play with the jeep ? the jeep is not a toy . you could have killed yourself or someone else . you caused a lot of damage and trouble . you are very naughty and foolish , " they say .

lily and ben are sorry . they cry and say sorry . they learn a lesson . they never play with things that are not theirs . they never touch things that they do not understand . they always listen to their friends . they always be careful and respectful . lila and sam are friends who like to sing and dance . they want to perform a show for their families . they practice in the garden , under the sun . they make up original songs and moves .

" let 's sing about the sun , how it makes us happy and warm , " lila says .

