they sing and dance , and have fun . they are ready to perform .

they invite their families to sit on the grass and watch . they say , " welcome to our show , we hope you like it . we will sing and dance about the sun . "

they perform their show , and their families clap and cheer . they are proud and happy .

they say , " thank you for watching , we love you . the sun is our friend , and so are you . " lily and tom were playing in the park . they saw a big fire in a house . smoke and ash came out of the windows . lily and tom were scared and ran to their mom .

