lily thought tom was being silly . she wanted to have fun and make a loud noise . she ran to the tower and climbed the stairs . tom followed her and tried to stop her .

" please , lily , do n't do it . it is not nice to tease the people . they will think something is wrong . you will get in trouble , " tom said .

but lily did not listen . she reached the bell and pulled the rope . the bell rang loudly and echoed in the park . lily laughed and clapped her hands . she thought it was funny .

but tom did not laugh . he was scared and sad . he knew lily was not being honest . she was not playing , she was being naughty . he hoped the people would not be too angry . he wished lily would say sorry . he did not want to lose his friend . ben and lily were playing in the living room . they liked to pretend they were pirates and the furniture was their ship . they had a big sofa , a small table , and some chairs . they used a blanket as a sail and a broom as a flag .

