they climbed on the sofa and pretended to steer the ship . they made noises like the wind and the waves . they waved to the birds and the fish . they had a lot of fun .

but they did not see that their mom was coming home . she had a lot of bags in her hands . she opened the door and saw the mess in the living room . she was very angry .

