they got off the sofa and went to hug their mom . they hoped she would not be too mad at them . they learned their lesson . they would not play pirates with the furniture again . ben and lily were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a big box of paints and brushes in the garage . they decided to be painters and make pictures on the walls .

