lily was scared . she tried to stop ben , but he pushed her away . he painted more and more , until the mirror was covered with colors .

then he heard a loud crack . he looked and saw that the mirror was broken . he saw pieces of glass and paint on the floor .

he felt sorry and sad . he said , " oh no , what did i do ? "

lily started to cry . she said , " you broke the mirror ! mommy will be very angry ! "

they heard footsteps . mommy was coming . they hid behind the couch .

