they ate their sandwiches and juice . they felt better . they learned their lesson . they were still painters , but they were careful painters . lily wanted to teach her doll how to drink wine . she saw her mom and dad drink wine sometimes , and they said it was good . lily found a bottle of wine in the kitchen and poured some in a cup . she brought the cup and the doll to her room .

