they smiled and kissed each other on the cheek . they were very happy .

but then , they heard a loud roar . it was a big dog that lived next door . the dog was angry and wanted to chase them . it jumped over the fence and ran towards them . lily and tom were frightened . they dropped their hands and ran away from the hedge .

