she took them inside and gave them some cookies and milk . they ate and drank and felt better . they thanked lily 's mom and said they loved her . she said she loved them too .

they decided to play marry again another day , but not near the hedge . they wanted to be happy and safe . they were best friends and they were happy . sara and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big bowl on a bench . the bowl is ugly . it has cracks and stains and a bad smell .

