they hold hands and skip away from the ugly bowl . they skip to the swings and the slide and the sandbox . they have fun and forget about the ugly bowl . they are happy . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the garden . they had a small patch of dirt where they planted some seeds . they watered them every day and watched them grow .

