they hugged and went to the table . they shared their food and their stories . they learned to appreciate their differences and their similarities . they were happy . tom likes to write . he writes with a crayon on paper . he writes his name , and his mom 's name , and his dog 's name . he writes big and small and fast and slow . he likes to write when the sun goes down . he likes to see the colors in the sky . he calls them sunset .

one day , tom wants to write outside . he takes his paper and crayon and goes to the yard . he sees a big fence . he thinks the fence is boring . he wants to write on the fence . he climbs on a chair and reaches the fence . he writes his name in red . he thinks it looks nice .

but the fence is not his fence . it is the neighbor 's fence . the neighbor is mean . he has a big dog . the dog is dangerous . it barks and growls and bites . the dog sees tom on the chair . the dog runs to the fence . it jumps and snaps at tom . tom is scared . he drops his crayon and paper . he falls off the chair . he runs to his house . he cries for his mom .

mom hears tom cry . she comes to the door . she sees tom and the dog and the fence . she is angry and worried . she yells at the dog and the neighbor . she hugs tom and takes him inside . she tells him he was wrong to write on the fence . she tells him he was lucky the dog did not catch him . she tells him he should never go near the fence again . she tells him the fence is dangerous .

tom is sorry . he says he is sorry to his mom and the neighbor and the dog . he says he will not write on the fence again . he says he will only write on paper . he says he will be careful and good . he says he loves his mom and his dog and his sunset . he says he does not love the fence . he says he is happy to be safe . he says he wants to write a new story . he asks his mom for a new crayon and paper . mom smiles and gives him a new crayon and paper . tom writes a new story . he writes about his mom and his dog and his sunset . he writes happy and nice and slow . he likes to write . anna and ben were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big truck with a picture of a rhinoceros on it . they wondered what a rhinoceros was and where it was going .

" let 's follow the truck and find out ! " ben said .

