they ran after the truck , but it was too fast for them . they lost sight of it near the zoo . they decided to go inside and look for the rhinoceros .

they saw many animals , like lions , monkeys , and elephants . but they did not see the rhinoceros . they asked a zookeeper , who pointed them to a big gate .

" the rhinoceros is in there , but you ca n't go in . it 's too dangerous . he 's new and he 's not used to people yet . he might get angry and hurt you , " the zookeeper said .

but anna and ben were curious and did not listen . they waited until the zookeeper left and sneaked into the gate . they saw a huge gray animal with a big horn on its nose . it was the rhinoceros !

they got closer and closer , until they were right in front of it . the rhinoceros saw them and snorted . he did not like strangers . he charged at them , making a loud noise .

anna and ben were scared and ran away . but the gate was closed and they could not get out . they were trapped with the rhinoceros . they looked for a place to hide , but there was none . they only saw a small hole in the wall .

" quick , let 's go in there ! " anna said .

they squeezed into the hole , but it was very tight . they could barely fit . they hoped the rhinoceros would not find them .

but the rhinoceros smelled them and followed them . he stuck his horn into the hole , trying to get them out . he pushed and pushed , but the hole was too small for him . he got his horn stuck in the hole . he could not move .

anna and ben heard the zookeeper coming back . he saw the rhinoceros and the hole and realized what had happened . he called for help and opened the gate .

" are you ok ? " he asked anna and ben , who crawled out of the hole .

" yes , we 're ok . but we 're sorry . we should have listened to you . we were wrong to go in there . we wo n't do it again , " they said .

the zookeeper was angry , but also relieved . he told them to go home and never come back without their parents . he also told them to learn more about rhinoceroses and respect them .

anna and ben nodded and ran away . they had learned their lesson . they had discovered the rhinoceros , but they had also discovered that some things are better left alone . tom and anna are friends . they like to play and watch movies . one day , they go to the theater with their moms . they want to see a funny movie with animals .

but when they get to the theater , they see a big sign . the sign says : " sorry , the movie is sold out . no more tickets . " tom and anna are upset . they really want to see the movie .

