they hug . they are happy . they take more photos of the park . they have fun . lily and tom were best friends . they liked to play in the park and pretend they were pirates . they had a big box that they used as a ship , and a flag with a skull on it . the skull was scary , but they were not afraid . they were successful pirates , and they had a lot of treasure .

