they hugged and smiled . they decided to play on the slide and the swings instead . they did not care about the monkey anymore . they were happy and quiet . tom and mia were playing in the garden . they liked to look for bugs and make houses for them . tom found a big beetle and put it in a jar . he showed it to mia and said , " look , i have a beetle . it is shiny and black . do you want to see ? "

