they hug the elephant and say good night . they go back to the house and get into bed . they fall asleep and dream of the elephant . the elephant dreams of them . they are happy . lily and max were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . they had a lot of fun . but then lily saw a big dog . she was scared of dogs . she ran to max and hugged him .

