they forgot about the dog . they forgot about the bag . they forgot about the bone . they forgot about the pond . they remembered their mom . they remembered her love . they remembered her comfort . they remembered to say thank you . ben and lily were twins who liked to play outside at night . they would look at the stars and the moon and make wishes . one night , ben saw a big , bright moon and wanted to have it . he pointed at the moon and said , " i want that ! give me the moon ! "

