they smiled at each other . they were happy . they liked playing in the jungle . they liked pretending they were explorers . they liked being together . tom and lily are twins . they like to play in their room . they have many toys and books and a big rug on the floor . the rug is soft and colorful . it has pictures of animals and flowers .

one day , tom and lily have a new idea . they want to make a tent with the rug . they take the rug from the floor and hang it on two chairs . they use clips to hold it tight . they crawl under the rug and pretend they are in a forest . they see birds and squirrels and rabbits . they make noises like the animals .

but then , their mom comes in . she sees the rug hanging on the chairs . she is not happy . she says the rug is not for hanging . she says the rug is for the floor . she says the clips can damage the rug . she takes the rug from the chairs and puts it back on the floor . she tells tom and lily to play with their toys and books instead .

tom and lily are sad . they liked their tent . they liked their forest . they liked their animals . they say sorry to their mom . they say they will not hang the rug again . they hug their mom and say they love her . they play with their toys and books . but they still miss their tent . ben and lily were playing in the snow . they made a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they were very happy .

but then they saw a fox . the fox was hungry and cold . he saw the snowman 's hat and scarf and wanted to take them .

" hello , fox , " ben said . " why are you here ? "

" i am cold and hungry , " the fox said . " can i have your snowman 's hat and scarf ? they look warm and nice . "

ben and lily looked at each other . they liked their snowman , but they also felt sorry for the fox .

" ok , fox , " lily said . " you can have the hat and scarf . but you have to be nice and not hurt anyone . "

the fox smiled and nodded . he took the hat and scarf and put them on . he felt warmer and happier .

" thank you , ben and lily , " the fox said . " you are very kind and generous . i will not forget your kindness . "

ben and lily smiled too . they felt good for helping the fox . they raised their hands and waved goodbye to the fox .

the moral of the story is : it is good to share and help others in need . tim and mia are friends . they like to play with blocks . they build towers and houses and bridges . they have fun .

one day , they want to make a big tower . they use all the blocks they have . the tower is very tall . but it is not stable . it wobbles and shakes .

" look at our tower ! " tim says . " it is so high ! "

" yes , but it is not strong , " mia says . " it will fall down soon . "

" how can we make it strong ? " tim asks .

" we need to support it , " mia says . " we need to put more blocks at the bottom and on the sides . then it will not move . "

they work together to support the tower . they find more blocks and add them to the base and the walls . the tower becomes stable . it does not wobble or shake anymore .

" wow , we did it ! " tim says . " our tower is stable now ! "

" yes , and it is still high ! " mia says . " we are good builders ! "

they are happy and proud . they hug each other . then they hear a funny noise . it is tim 's dog . he is barking and wagging his tail . he wants to play too .

" uh - oh , " tim says . " he likes blocks too . he might knock down our tower ! "

" quick , let 's hide it ! " mia says . " or he will make a mess ! "

they laugh and run to protect their tower . they play with the dog and the blocks . they have fun . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys . one day , they find a big box in the garage . it has many old things inside . they see a shiny toy car , a soft teddy bear , a colorful book , and a funny hat .

" wow , look at these ! " lily says . " they are so cool ! "

" let 's play with them ! " ben says . he grabs the toy car and makes vroom - vroom noises .

lily picks up the teddy bear and hugs it . she sees a tag on its ear . it says " original teddy " . she does not know what that means , but she likes the sound of it .

" hey , ben , look at this ! " she says . " this is an original teddy ! it must be very special ! "

ben looks at the tag . he does not care about it . he likes the toy car more .

" so what ? " he says . " it 's just a bear . i have a better idea . let 's sell these things and get some candy ! "

lily gasps . she does not want to sell the teddy . she loves it already .

" no , ben , we ca n't do that ! " she says . " these are not ours . they belong to mom and dad . they might be very old and important . and i want to keep the teddy . it 's so cute and soft ! "

ben does not listen . he is stubborn . he puts the toy car , the book , and the hat in a bag . he drags the bag to the street . he makes a sign that says " for sale " .

lily follows him . she is angry and sad . she tries to stop him .

" ben , stop ! you ca n't sell these things ! " she says . " please , give them back ! "

but ben does not stop . he sees a man walking by . the man has a cigarette in his mouth . he makes smoke . ben does not like the smoke . it smells bad and makes him cough . but he likes the man 's money .

" hey , mister , do you want to buy some toys ? " he says . " they are very original and cheap ! "

the man stops . he looks at the bag . he sees the toy car , the book , and the hat . he does not see the teddy . lily is hiding it behind her back .

" hmm , let me see , " the man says . he takes the toy car and examines it . he smiles . " this is a rare model . i collect toy cars . how much do you want for it ? "

ben thinks . he does not know how much the toy car is worth . he just wants some candy .

" five dollars , " he says .

the man laughs . he thinks ben is silly . he takes out his wallet . he gives ben five dollars . he takes the toy car .

" thank you , kid . you made a good deal , " he says . he walks away with the toy car and the smoke .

ben is happy . he has five dollars . he can buy a lot of candy .

" see , lily , i told you . selling is fun ! " he says . he runs to the candy store .

lily is not happy . she thinks ben is foolish . he sold a precious toy for nothing . she does not want candy . she wants the toy car back . she wants to give it to mom and dad . she thinks they will be proud of it .

she runs after the man . she calls him .

" mister , mister , wait ! " she says . " please , give us back the toy car . it 's not ours . it 's our parents ' . it 's very old and original . we made a mistake . we 're sorry ! "

but the man does not hear her . he is too far away . he disappears with the toy car and the smoke .

lily stops . she cries . she hugs the teddy . she wishes ben was here . she wishes he did not sell the toy car . she wishes he did not make smoke . she wishes he did not make a bad deal . tom and mia were friends . they liked to play with their toys and share their snacks . one day , tom got a new toy . it was an orange car that could make noises and move by itself . tom was very happy and wanted to show mia his car .

" look , mia , look ! " tom said . " i have a new car . it is orange and fast and loud . do you want to play with it ? "

mia looked at the car . she liked orange things . she liked fast things . she liked loud things . she wanted to play with the car too . but she was patient . she knew that tom wanted to play with his car first . she smiled and said , " wow , tom , your car is very nice . you are lucky . i can wait until you are done . "

tom smiled back . he was glad that mia was his friend . he liked to share with her . he said , " thank you , mia . you are very kind . you can play with my car too . but first , let me show you something . my car has a secret button . if you press it , something amazing happens . do you want to see ? "

mia nodded . she was curious . she wanted to see what the secret button did . she said , " yes , tom , i want to see . what does the secret button do ? "

tom said , " you will see . follow me . " he took his car and ran to the backyard . mia followed him . they went to the big tree where they liked to hide . tom said , " this is the perfect place . are you ready , mia ? "

mia said , " yes , tom , i am ready . show me the secret button . "

tom pressed the secret button . the car made a loud beep . then , it opened its doors and windows . out of the car came four orange balloons . they floated in the air and made funny shapes . tom and mia laughed and clapped . they grabbed the balloons and played with them . they had a lot of fun .

tom said , " do you like the balloons , mia ? "

mia said , " i love the balloons , tom . they are so pretty and funny . thank you for sharing your car with me . you are the best friend ever . "

tom said , " you are welcome , mia . you are the best friend ever too . i am happy that we can play together . let 's play some more . "

they hugged and played with the car and the balloons . they were very happy . they were the best friends ever . lila and tom were eager to go to the farm with their mom . they liked to see the animals and pick fruits from the trees . mom said they could pick some peaches today , if they were ripe and sweet .

they got to the farm and saw a big basket of peaches by the gate . mom asked the farmer if they could have some . the farmer nodded and said , " sure , you can have some . but be careful , some of them are sour . you have to smell them and feel them first . if they are soft and smell good , they are ripe . if they are hard and smell bad , they are sour . do you understand ? "

lila and tom nodded and said , " yes , we understand . " they wanted to repeat what the farmer said , to show they were listening . but they were too eager to try the peaches . they ran to the basket and grabbed some peaches . they did not smell them or feel them . they just bit into them .

lila bit into a ripe peach . it was juicy and sweet . she smiled and said , " mmm , this is a good peach . i like it . " tom bit into a sour peach . it was hard and bitter . he made a face and said , " yuck , this is a bad peach . i do n't like it . " he spit it out and threw it away .

mom saw what happened and said , " tom , you should have listened to the farmer . he told you how to find a ripe peach . you have to smell it and feel it first . can you repeat what he said ? " tom felt sorry and said , " yes , mom . he said , if it is soft and smells good , it is ripe . if it is hard and smells bad , it is sour . " mom said , " that 's right . next time , remember to do that . now , do you want to try another peach ? " tom nodded and said , " yes , please . i want a good peach like lila . " mom helped him find a ripe peach and gave it to him . he smelled it and felt it . it was soft and smelled good . he bit into it and said , " mmm , this is a good peach . i like it . " he smiled and hugged mom . lila smiled and hugged him . they both said , " thank you , mom . thank you , farmer . we like peaches . " lily and ben were playing in the snow . they made a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they had fun throwing snowballs at each other . but then they saw a big dog coming towards them . the dog had sharp teeth and a loud bark . it looked fierce .

" run , lily , run ! " ben shouted . he was scared of the dog . he thought the dog wanted to bite them .

but lily did not run . she stayed calm and smiled at the dog . she said , " hello , doggy . do you want to play with us ? you look cold and hungry . we have some cocoa and cookies at home . do you want to come with us ? "

the dog stopped barking . it wagged its tail and licked lily 's hand . it was not fierce . it was lonely and cold . it wanted to be friends .

lily and ben took the dog home . they gave it some cocoa and cookies . they named it snowy . they played with it and cuddled it . they asked their mom if they could keep it . their mom said yes , as long as they took good care of it .

lily and ben were happy . they learned that sometimes , the best way to deal with a scary situation is to be kind and suggest a solution . they also learned that you ca n't judge a book by its cover , or a dog by its bark . they made a new friend and had a warm and cozy winter . lily and sam like to play with their toy planes . they pretend to be pilots and fly around the house . one day , they find a big box in the garage . it has a picture of a real plane on it .

" wow , look at this ! " sam says . " maybe there is a plane inside ! "

