they start to take out the parts and look at the book . they try to match the pictures with the pieces . they use the tools to screw and hammer . they have fun making noises and pretending to fly .

but they do n't notice that their dad comes home . he is a real pilot and he bought the box to build a model plane . he sees the mess in the garage and gets angry .

