" yes , please ! " lily and sam say .

they hug their dad and follow him . they learn how to build a plane and have fun together . they are happy to be pilots with their dad . lily liked to read novels . she had many novels in her room . she liked to look at the words and the pictures . she liked to make up stories in her head .

one day , lily found a new novel on her bed . it was green and had a big dragon on the cover . lily was very happy . she wanted to read the novel right away . she opened the novel and started to read .

but then , her brother tom came into her room . tom was naughty . he liked to take lily 's things and make her angry . he saw the green novel and wanted to have it .

