they went to the shelf and picked out some novels . they sat on the bed and read them together . they did not fight . they did not scream . they were happy . sara is a big girl . she goes to school with other big kids . she likes to learn new things and play with her friends . but today , she feels different . she has a test in math . she does not like math . it is hard and boring .

she sits at her desk and looks at the paper . she sees numbers and signs . she does not know what they mean . she feels scared and sad . she wants to cry . she looks at her teacher . she wants to ask for help . but she thinks the teacher will be angry . she thinks the other kids will laugh . she feels alone .

she hears a voice next to her . it is ben . ben is her friend . he is good at math . he smiles at her and whispers . " do you need help ? " he asks . sara feels happy . she nods . ben helps her with the test . he shows her how to do the math . he explains the numbers and signs . he is kind and patient . sara feels better . she thanks ben . she finishes the test . she is proud of herself .

she gives the paper to the teacher . the teacher looks at it and smiles . she says , " good job , sara . you did well on the test . " she gives sara a sticker . sara feels happy . she runs to ben and hugs him . she says , " thank you , ben . you are a good friend . " ben hugs her back . he says , " you are welcome , sara . you are a good friend too . " they go to play with the other kids . they have fun . they are different , but they are friends . mia and leo were playing with their toy cars . they made a maze with their blocks and tried to drive their cars through it . mia had a pink car and leo had a blue car .

" look , i can go fast ! " leo said . he pushed his car hard and zoomed through the maze . he knocked over some blocks and made a hole in the wall .

" hey , stop ! " mia said . " you broke the maze ! it was delicate ! "

" i do n't care . it 's boring . i want to play something else . " leo said . he threw his car on the floor and lay down on the couch .

mia was angry . she liked the maze . she worked hard to make it . she picked up her car and looked at the broken blocks . she had an idea .

she fixed the maze and made it harder . she added more turns and dead ends . she smiled and said , " leo , do you want to try the maze again ? i made it more fun . "

leo was curious . he got up from the couch and took his car . he tried to drive through the maze , but he got stuck . he could n't find the way out . he got frustrated and started to cry .

" mia , help me ! i ca n't do it ! " leo said .

mia laughed and said , " now you know how i felt . you have to be careful with the maze . it 's delicate . and you have to be nice to me . i 'm your sister . "

leo realized he was wrong . he said , " i 'm sorry , mia . you 're right . can you show me how to do it ? "

mia nodded and said , " sure . come on , i 'll help you . we can play together . "

they hugged and smiled . they drove their cars through the maze and had fun . they learned to share and respect each other . they were happy . sara likes to draw pictures with her crayons . she has many colors and she makes animals and flowers and houses . she is very happy when she draws .

one day , she draws a big picture of a rainbow on the floor . she uses all her crayons and makes it very bright . she is very proud of her picture and she wants to show it to her mom .

she runs to the kitchen and says , " mom , mom , come and see my picture ! " mom is busy making cookies and she says , " okay , sara , i will come in a minute . "

sara waits and waits , but mom does not come . she gets bored and she sees her ball . she likes to play with her ball and she kicks it . the ball bounces and rolls and hits her picture .

sara gasps and runs to her picture . she sees that the ball has made a big smudge on the rainbow . she is very sad and she cries . she says , " oh no , my picture is not clean anymore ! "

mom hears sara crying and she comes to the living room . she sees sara and her picture and she says , " oh , sara , what happened ? " sara tells mom what happened and she says , " i 'm sorry , mom , i wanted to show you my picture , but now it is not clean . "

mom hugs sara and says , " it 's okay , sara , i 'm sorry too . your picture is still very beautiful , even with the smudge . you are very talented and i love your picture . and i love you . "

sara smiles and says , " thank you , mom , i love you too . " mom says , " why do n't we hang your picture on the wall , so we can see it every day ? " sara says , " yes , please , mom , that would be nice . "

mom gets some tape and they go to the wall . mom lifts sara up and sara puts her picture on the wall . they step back and look at it . they both smile and say , " wow , what a wonderful picture ! " they hug and go to the kitchen to eat some cookies . ben and mia like to play with trains . they have a big train set with tracks and bridges and tunnels . they make the trains go fast and slow and make noises like choo - choo .

one day , they see a real train outside their window . it is a steam train , with white smoke coming out of its chimney . it looks old and shiny and loud . ben and mia want to see it up close .

they ask their mom if they can go to the train station . mom says yes , but they have to be careful and hold her hand . they put on their coats and shoes and go outside . they walk to the train station , following the steam in the sky .

at the train station , they see the steam train waiting on the platform . it is bigger than their toy trains , and has many cars behind it . the driver is wearing a hat and a scarf . he sees ben and mia and smiles .

" hello , little ones , " he says . " do you like my train ? "

" yes , we do ! " ben and mia say . " can we see inside ? "

" sure , you can , " the driver says . " but only for a minute . we have to go soon . "

he lets them climb up the steps and shows them the engine . he explains how he makes the fire and the water and the steam . he lets them pull the whistle and hear the loud sound . ben and mia are amazed and happy .

" thank you , mr. driver , " they say . " you are very helpful and kind . "

" you 're welcome , kids , " the driver says . " but now you have to go . the train is ready to leave . "

he helps them down the steps and waves goodbye . ben and mia wave back and hold their mom 's hand . they watch the steam train go away , with a loud choo - choo and a puff of smoke . they feel sad , but also glad . they have seen a real steam train , and made a new friend . one day , a little girl named mia went to the park with her mom . she saw a big slide and wanted to go on it . but there was a problem . the slide was too high for her to climb by herself .

she looked around and saw a nice lady with a big hat and a long dress . the lady smiled at her and said , " do you want to go on the slide , little one ? "

" yes , please ! " mia said .

the lady said , " i can help you . i am a witch , and i have magic . i can lift you up with my wand . "

mia was not afraid of the witch . she thought she was kind and fun . she said , " thank you , witch ! "

the witch waved her wand and said a magic word . mia felt herself float in the air and land on the top of the slide . she was so happy . she slid down the slide and laughed .

the witch clapped her hands and said , " you are welcome , little one . have fun ! "

mia ran to her mom and told her what happened . her mom was surprised , but she was glad that mia was happy . she said , " that was very nice of the witch . maybe you can say hello to her again next time . "

mia nodded and hugged her mom . she liked the park , and she liked the witch . she hoped to see her again soon . sara and ben are twins . they like to play in the snow in winter . they make snowmen and snowballs and snow forts . they wear warm hats and coats and boots and gloves .

one day , they go outside and see a big pile of snow . they run to it and start to dig a tunnel . they take turns to go inside and out . they have fun .

but then , sara hears a loud yell . she looks up and sees a big dog . the dog is barking and running to the pile of snow . sara is scared . she yells to ben .

" ben , ben , come out ! there is a big dog ! "

ben hears sara and crawls out of the tunnel . he sees the dog too . he is scared too . he grabs sara 's hand and they run to the house . the dog chases them and jumps on the pile of snow . the tunnel collapses .

sara and ben reach the door and go inside . they slam the door and lock it . they are safe . they hug each other and breathe hard .

" are you okay , sara ? " ben asks .

" yes , i am okay , ben . are you okay ? " sara asks .

" yes , i am okay , sara . that was a bad dog . he ruined our tunnel . " ben says .

" i know . he was a bad dog . he scared us . " sara says .

they look out the window and see the dog running away . they are glad . they are glad he is gone . they are glad they have each other . they are glad they are warm and cozy .

they smile and say , " we love winter . but we love each other more . " anna and ben are friends . they like to play with dolls and cars . one day , they find a big box in the garage . it is full of old clothes and hats and shoes .

" wow , look at this ! " anna says . she picks up a long coat with brown fur . " it is so soft and warm ! "

" can i try it ? " ben asks . he likes fur too . he thinks it feels like his teddy bear .

" sure , here you go . " anna gives him the coat . she finds a hat with feathers and puts it on her head . " how do i look ? "

" you look funny ! " ben laughs . he wraps the coat around him . " and i look like a bear ! "

they giggle and pretend to be animals . they roar and growl and jump around . they have a lot of fun .

then , they hear a voice . it is anna 's mom . she comes into the garage .

" anna , ben , what are you doing ? " she asks . she sees them in the old clothes . she smiles .

" we are playing with the box ! " anna says . " we found some original things ! "

" yes , you did ! " anna 's mom says . " those are my grandma 's clothes . she used to wear them a long time ago . they are very special to me . "

