" that 's okay , sweetie . i 'm glad you like them . but you have to be careful with them . they are old and fragile . and you have to ask me before you use them , okay ? "

" okay , mom . " anna says . she gives her mom a hug . " we are sorry . "

" me too . " ben says . he takes off the coat . " they are very nice . "

" thank you , ben . " anna 's mom says . she hugs him too . " you are very nice too . now , why do n't you put the clothes back in the box and come inside ? i have some cookies for you . "

" yay , cookies ! " anna and ben say . they put the clothes back in the box and follow anna 's mom . they are still friends . and they still like fur . but they also like cookies . and they also like anna 's mom . she is very original . lily and ben were eager to see the king . they had never seen a king before . they wore their best clothes and held their mother 's hand . they walked to the big castle where the king lived .

when they got to the castle , they saw many people waiting in a line . they heard music and trumpets . they saw flags and flowers . they waited for their turn to meet the king .

finally , they reached the door of the king 's room . a man in a red coat opened the door and said , " welcome to the king 's palace . please , come in . " lily and ben followed their mother inside .

they saw the king sitting on a big chair . he wore a crown and a robe . he had a long beard and a kind smile . he looked at lily and ben and said , " hello , little ones . what are your names ? "

lily and ben were shy , but they answered , " i 'm lily and this is ben . we are happy to see you , king . "

the king nodded and said , " i 'm happy to see you too , lily and ben . you are very brave and polite . do you want a gift from me ? "

lily and ben nodded eagerly . the king gave them each a small toy . lily got a doll and ben got a horse . they thanked the king and hugged him .

the king said , " you 're welcome , my dear children . i hope you enjoy your toys and have a good day . goodbye , lily and ben . "

lily and ben said goodbye to the king and left the room . they were very happy and proud . they showed their toys to their mother and to each other . they had met the king and he was very nice . they would never forget this day . lily loved to play doctor with her toys . she had a white coat , a stethoscope , and a bag of tools . she liked to check their ears , their eyes , and their hearts . she was a very good doctor , and her toys were very patient .

one day , she found a new toy in her room . it was a fluffy bunny with long ears and a pink nose . lily was very excited . she wanted to make the bunny her new patient . she put the bunny on her bed and gave it a name . she called it hoppy .

lily started to examine hoppy . she looked at his ears , his eyes , and his nose . she listened to his heart with her stethoscope . she said , " hoppy , you are very healthy . but i need to check one more thing . i need to see how high you can raise your arms . "

lily took hoppy 's arms and tried to raise them up . but hoppy 's arms did not move . they were sewn to his body . lily was surprised . she tried again , but hoppy 's arms still did not move . lily was confused . she said , " hoppy , why ca n't you raise your arms ? do n't you want to play with me ? "

lily did not know that hoppy was not a normal toy . he was a special toy . he had a secret . he had a button on his belly . when lily pressed the button , hoppy 's arms would raise up and he would say , " i love you , lily ! "

but lily did not see the button . she did not hear hoppy 's voice . she only saw his arms that did not move . she felt sad . she thought hoppy did not like her . she said , " hoppy , i 'm sorry . i do n't want to hurt you . i just want to be your friend . "

lily put hoppy down and hugged him . she said , " hoppy , you are very soft and cute . i like you very much . please , raise your arms and hug me back . "

lily did not know that when she hugged hoppy , she pressed the button on his belly . she did not expect what happened next . hoppy 's arms raised up and wrapped around her . he said , " i love you , lily ! "

lily was shocked . she looked at hoppy 's face . he smiled at her . she heard his voice . she said , " hoppy , you can talk ! you can raise your arms ! you love me ! "

lily was very happy . she hugged hoppy again . she said , " i love you too , hoppy ! you are the best toy ever ! you are my new patient and my new friend ! "

