the moral of the story is : you should not take things that are not yours . you should share and care . you should say sorry and be kind . lily was a compassionate girl who loved animals . she had a pet rabbit named fluffy who was white and soft . she liked to hug fluffy and feed him carrots and lettuce . fluffy liked lily too and would hop around her room and lick her face .

