they are not cold anymore . they are full and happy . they love mom . they love their tower . they love playing with blocks . they are having a good day . tom and lily were playing cops and robbers in the yard . tom was the cop and lily was the robber . tom had a toy gun and lily had a bag of candy . tom chased lily around the trees and the swings . he shouted , " stop , robber , or i will shoot ! "

