then they started a new game of hide and seek , with the bird as their helper . they had a lot of fun and made a new friend . tom and lily were twins who liked to play with their toys . they had a lot of toys , but their favorite was a magic wand that could make things happen . they got the wand from their grandma , who said it was a special gift . she told them to only use it for good things , and not to let anyone else see it .

