they helped mommy clean up the broken vase . they learned their lesson . they promised to be good and not make up weird stories . they hoped mommy would forgive them and let them play with their toys again . tommy loved to collect stamps . he had many stamps from different places and colors . he kept them in a big book that he showed to his friends . he was very proud of his stamps .

one day , he went to the park with his mom and his sister , lily . he brought his book of stamps with him . he wanted to show them to his new friend , ben , who also liked stamps . he left his book on a bench while he played with ben .

lily saw the book of stamps and was curious . she opened it and looked at the stamps . she liked the ones that had animals on them . she took one stamp that had a lion on it and put it in her pocket . she thought it was pretty and wanted to own it .

tommy came back to the bench and saw his book of stamps . he opened it and looked for his lion stamp . he could not find it . he was very worried . he asked his mom and ben if they saw his stamp . they said no . he looked around the park , but he could not see it . he was very sad . he thought he lost his stamp .

lily saw that tommy was sad and felt bad . she remembered that she had his stamp in her pocket . she took it out and gave it to him . she said , " i 'm sorry , tommy . i took your stamp . i liked it and wanted to own it . but it is yours . here you go . "

