they hugged and put the stamp back in the book . they went to play with ben and showed him their stamps . they had a lot of fun . they were happy . lily liked to cook . she had a small kitchen with pots and pans and spoons . she also had a big apron with flowers on it . she liked to make soup and cake and salad for her toys .

