lily smiled . she was happy that ben agreed to play with her . she did n't mind letting him choose the color of the cake . she hoped he would like it .

they went to the kitchen and put on their aprons . lily gave ben a bowl and a spoon . she showed him how to mix the flour and the eggs and the sugar . she let him add some food coloring to make the cake blue .

they put the cake in the oven and waited . they smelled the sweet aroma of the cake . they heard the timer beep .

