they took out the cake and put it on a plate . they cut two slices and gave one to each other . they took a bite and smiled .

" mmm , this is good , " ben said . " you 're a good cook , lily . "

" thank you , ben , " lily said . " you 're a good helper . and i like your bicycle . it 's cool . "

they finished their cake and cleaned up the kitchen . they put on their shoes and went outside . they took turns riding the bicycle and doing tricks . they had fun .

they played until it was time to go home . they hugged and said goodbye .

