one day , they decided to play a game of hide and seek . anna was the seeker and ben was the hider . ben ran into the cabin and looked for a good hiding spot . he saw the sack of toys and had an idea . he emptied the sack and crawled inside . he pulled the sack over his head and lay still on the floor .

anna counted to ten and then went to look for ben . she searched the woods , but she could not find him . she thought he must be in the cabin . she opened the door and looked around . she saw the fireplace , the window , and the sack of toys . she did not see ben . she was puzzled . she walked over to the sack and kicked it lightly . she heard a muffled sound .

