from that day on , lily loved cauliflower and always asked her mom to buy it at the store . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to read books , but she did n't have any new books to read . one day , her mom said , " lily , i have a surprise for you . i ordered some new books for you and they will be delivered to our house today . "

