they wished they had never opened the fridge . they wished they had played a nice game instead . they wished mom was not so mad . they wished they could go back in time and change everything . but they could not . it was too late . the end . tom and lily are friends . they like to play with toys and books . one day , they find a big book with pictures of volcanoes . volcanoes are mountains that can make fire and smoke . they are very powerful and loud .

