the closet was dark and quiet . anna could not see anything . she could only hear her own breathing . she started to feel scared . she wondered if tom was still looking for her or if he forgot about her . she wanted to call out to him , but she was afraid he would hear her and find her . she wanted to win the game . she tried to be brave and stay in the closet .

tom looked for anna in every room . he could not find her anywhere . he was impressed by how well she hid . he started to worry that she might be lost or hurt . he called out to her , but he did not hear any answer . he decided to check the closet in her room . he opened the door and saw anna sitting in the dark . she looked scared and sad . he said , " anna , i found you ! you are very good at hiding , but you do not have to be afraid . the closet is not a scary place . it is just a place to keep your clothes and toys . come out and play with me . "

anna was happy to see tom . she ran out of the closet and hugged him . she said , " tom , i was scared in the closet . it was dark and lonely . i did not like it . i am sorry i hid there . i do not want to play hide and seek anymore . can we play something else ? "

tom smiled and said , " sure , anna . we can play something else . how about we play with your dolls or your blocks ? and next time , do not hide in the closet . it is not fun to be scared . it is better to be safe and happy . "

