tom said , " i love you too , anna . you are a good sister . come on , let 's go play . "

they went to play with anna 's dolls and blocks . they had fun and laughed together . they learned that hiding in the closet is not a good idea . they learned that playing with each other is more fun . they learned to be brave and kind . they were happy . lila liked to play on the beach . she liked to dig in the sand and look for shells . one day , she saw a crab in a hole . she wanted to catch it and make it her friend .

