lila learned a lesson . she learned that crabs are not easy to catch . she learned that water can rise and splash . she learned that sometimes it is better to let go and play with something else . she still liked the beach , but she did not poke crabs anymore . ben and lily like to build with blocks . they have many blocks of different colors and shapes . they can make houses , towers , cars , and animals with their blocks . they have fun playing with their blocks every day .

