tom did not listen . he wanted to see more . he ran into the new path . lily followed him . she did not want to be alone .

they walked and walked . the new path was long and twisted . they did not see the park anymore . they only saw more dark and dirty things . they heard strange noises .

" tom , i want to go back , " lily said . " i do n't like it here . i 'm scared . "

tom did not answer . he was looking at something on the ground . it was a big bag . it was brown and wet . it had holes in it .

" look , lily , what 's in here ? " tom said . he opened the bag .

lily screamed . she saw what was in the bag . it was a dead cat . it was rotting . it had no eyes . it had worms on it .

tom screamed too . he dropped the bag . he tried to run away . but he slipped on the wet ground . he fell on the rotting cat . the worms crawled on him .

lily ran away . she cried for help . she wanted to find the park . she wanted to find her mom . she wanted to forget what she saw .

but she could not . she could still see the rotting cat . she could still hear tom 's scream . she could still smell the bad smell .

she was lost . she was alone . she was frightened . tom and mia are playing in the park . they see a big red balloon on a string . they want to have it .

" look , a balloon ! " tom says . " let 's get it ! "

they run to the balloon . but the string is too high . they can not reach it .

" maybe we can jump , " mia says . she tries to jump , but she is too small .

tom has an idea . he sees a bench near the balloon . he says , " let 's climb on the bench . then we can get the balloon . "

they climb on the bench . they stretch their arms . they touch the string . they pull the balloon down .

" yay , we got it ! " mia says . she is happy .

tom is happy too . he says , " let 's tie the balloon to the bench . then it wo n't fly away . "

he makes a knot with the string . he ties the balloon to the bench .

but then , a big wind comes . it blows the balloon hard . the balloon pops . it makes a loud noise .

" pop ! " tom and mia say . they are scared .

they cover their ears . they cover their mouths . they see the balloon pieces on the ground .

they are sad . they say , " bye , balloon . "

they hug each other . they go to find their mom . she has a snack for them . she says , " do n't be sad . you can have another balloon another day . "

they smile . they say , " thank you , mom . "

they eat their snack . they play some more . they have fun . anna and ben like to play with tubes . they have many tubes of different colors and sizes . they like to put the tubes together and make shapes and tunnels .

one day , they find a big tube in the garage . it is green and shiny . anna wants to play with it . she says , " this is my tube . i can fit inside it . it is fun . "

ben wants to play with it too . he says , " no , this is my tube . i can fit inside it too . it is mine . "

they both try to fit inside the tube at the same time . they push and pull and squeeze . but the tube is too small for both of them . they get stuck in the tube . they can not move . they feel sad and angry .

they start to cry and shout . they make a lot of noise . they say , " help ! help ! get us out of here ! "

mom hears the noise . she comes to the garage . she sees anna and ben in the tube . she says , " oh , no ! what have you done ? you are both in trouble . you have to share the tube . you can not be selfish . "

she pulls the tube and frees anna and ben . they come out of the tube . they are red and sweaty . they say , " sorry , mom . sorry , anna . sorry , ben . "

mom says , " it 's okay . i 'm glad you are safe . but next time , you have to ask before you take something . and you have to take turns and play nicely . do you understand ? "

anna and ben nod . they say , " yes , mom . we understand . we will share the tube . we will be friends . "

mom smiles . she says , " good . now , go and wash your faces . then you can play with the tube again . but be careful and have fun . "

anna and ben hug mom . they say , " thank you , mom . we love you . "

they go and wash their faces . then they go back to the garage . they play with the tube again . but this time , they take turns and fit inside it one by one . they make shapes and tunnels . they laugh and have fun . they are happy . lily and tom are friends . they like to play and learn together . one day , they have to do some work for school . they have to draw a picture of their favorite animal .

lily loves cats . she draws a big cat with soft fur and green eyes . she is very proud of her work . she shows it to tom .

" wow , lily , your cat is very nice . you are very intelligent , " tom says .

tom loves dogs . he draws a small dog with brown spots and a wagging tail . he is not very happy with his work . he thinks his dog is ugly . he does not show it to lily .

lily asks , " tom , can i see your dog ? i am sure it is very nice too . "

tom feels shy . he does not want lily to see his dog . he covers his work with his hand .

" no , lily , you can not see my dog . it is very bad . i am not intelligent , " tom says .

lily feels sad . she wants to help tom . she says , " tom , please do not cover your work . let me see your dog . i am your friend . i will not laugh at you . i will help you . "

tom trusts lily . he moves his hand and shows his work to lily .

lily smiles . she says , " tom , your dog is very nice . you are very intelligent . you just need to practice more . look , i can show you how to make your dog better . you can add some ears , a nose , and a collar . then your dog will look more like a real dog . "

tom listens to lily . he follows her advice . he adds some ears , a nose , and a collar to his dog . he sees that his dog looks better . he feels happy .

" thank you , lily . you are very kind . you are a good friend . i like your cat and your dog , " tom says .

lily and tom hug . they are happy . they have finished their work . they have learned something new . they have helped each other .

the moral of the story is : do not be afraid to show your work . do not be ashamed of your mistakes . do not cover your work . ask for help when you need it . help others when you can . be kind and friendly . you are intelligent . you can learn and improve . anna and ben are twins . they like to play outside with their toys . today they have a new toy : an aeroplane . it is big and red and can fly in the air . anna and ben are very happy .

they take the aeroplane to the park . they run and laugh and throw the aeroplane in the sky . the aeroplane makes a loud noise and flies very high . anna and ben clap their hands and cheer .

but then something bad happens . the aeroplane flies too far and lands on a big tree . anna and ben can not reach it . they try to climb the tree , but it is too tall and hard . they cry and call for help .

" help , help , our aeroplane is stuck ! " they scream .

a man hears them and comes to see . he is not a nice man . he is mean and greedy . he sees the aeroplane and wants it for himself . he climbs the tree and takes the aeroplane . he does not give it back to anna and ben . he runs away with it .

" hey , that is our aeroplane , give it back ! " they scream .

but the man does not listen . he laughs and says , " too bad , it is mine now . you are too small and weak to stop me . go away and cry , you silly kids . "

anna and ben are very sad and angry . they have lost their new toy . they have no one to help them . they sit on the ground and cry . they wish they had never played with the aeroplane . they wish they had stayed at home and played with their healthy fruits . anna loved to play her flute . she had a small flute that made pretty sounds when she blew into it . she liked to play songs for her family and friends . sometimes she played with other children who had drums or bells or guitars .

one day , anna went to the park with her mom and dad . she brought her flute with her . she saw some big kids playing on the swings and slides . she wanted to play with them . she walked over to them and said , " hi , i 'm anna . do you want to hear me play my flute ? "

the big kids looked at her and laughed . they said , " that 's not a flute , that 's a toy . you ca n't play music with that . you 're too little to play with us . go away , baby . "

anna felt very sad and embarrassed . she ran back to her mom and dad , who hugged her and said , " do n't listen to them , anna . you 're not a baby , you 're a big girl . and your flute is beautiful . you play very well . we 're proud of you . "

anna smiled and said , " thank you , mom and dad . i love you . and i love my flute . someday , i will grow and have a bigger flute . and i will play for everyone who likes music . " tom was a rabbit who liked to eat celery . he ate celery every day for breakfast , lunch and dinner . he liked the green and crunchy celery very much . he did not like to share his celery with anyone .

one day , tom saw a big and yellow carrot in the garden . he thought the carrot looked very tasty . he wanted to try the carrot . he left his celery behind and ran to the carrot . he did not see the trap that the farmer had set .

the trap snapped on tom 's leg and hurt him a lot . he cried and cried , but no one came to help him . he was stuck in the trap . he could not move . he could not eat . he could not go back to his celery .

he looked at his celery and felt very sad . he wished he had not left his celery . he wished he had shared his celery with his friends . he missed his celery and his friends . he learned that celery was better than carrot , and sharing was better than being greedy .

but it was too late . the farmer came and took tom away . he put tom in a cage and sold him to a pet shop . tom never saw his celery or his friends again . he had a bad ending . sam was a patient boy . he liked to play with his toys and read his books . he did not like to kick or hit or yell . he was honest and kind to everyone .

one day , he went to the park with his mom . he saw a big slide and wanted to try it . he waited in line behind some other kids . he was patient and waited for his turn .

but then , a mean boy came and pushed him . the mean boy wanted to go first . he kicked sam in the leg and made him fall . sam was hurt and sad . he cried and told his mom what happened .

" are you okay , sam ? " his mom asked . she hugged him and checked his leg . " that was not nice of that boy . he should not kick you . you did nothing wrong . "

" i know , mom , " sam said . " i was patient and honest . why did he kick me ? "

" sometimes , people do bad things because they are angry or selfish or scared . they do not know how to be patient and honest . they need to learn how to be kind and share . but you , sam , you are a good boy . you do not kick or lie or hurt others . you are patient and honest and brave . i am proud of you . "

sam smiled and hugged his mom . he felt better . he decided to forgive the mean boy and try the slide again . he was patient and waited for his turn . he had fun and made some new friends . he was happy . lily and ben were playing with paint in the garden . they had many colors and brushes . they wanted to make a big picture on the wall . they were having fun .

but then they heard a loud noise . it was dad coming home from work . he was bald and he did not like paint . he always said paint was messy and bad . lily and ben panicked . they tried to hide the paint and the brushes . they ran to the other side of the garden .

dad saw the wall . it was full of paint . there were red and blue and green and yellow spots everywhere . he was very angry . he shouted , " who did this ? who made this mess ? "

lily and ben were scared . they did not want to get in trouble . they did not know what to say . they looked at each other .

then ben had an idea . he pointed at the cat . the cat was sleeping under a tree . it had some paint on its fur . ben said , " it was the cat , dad . the cat did it . the cat likes paint . "

dad looked at the cat . he did not believe ben . he knew ben was lying . he said , " nice try , ben . but i know it was you and lily . you have paint on your hands and clothes . and the cat does not have a brush . you are in big trouble , young man . and so are you , lily . come here right now . " tim and sue like to ride their bikes . they have red bikes with two wheels and pedals . they wear helmets and gloves to be safe . they ride on the sidewalk and say hello to the people and dogs they see .

one day , they see a big hill . tim says , " let 's go up the hill ! it will be fun ! " sue says , " ok , but be careful . the hill is steep and the road is busy . " they start to pedal hard and go up the hill . they feel the wind in their hair and the sun on their faces .

when they reach the top , they see a beautiful view . they see the park , the lake , the bridge , and the city . they smile and say , " wow , this is amazing ! " they decide to go down the hill and enjoy the ride .

but they do not know that the hill is too steep and the road is too busy . they go too fast and lose control of their bikes . they try to squeeze the brakes , but they do not work . they scream and panic . they can not stop or turn . they see a big truck coming their way . the truck driver sees them and honks his horn . he tries to swerve , but it is too late .

tim and sue crash into the truck . they fly off their bikes and hit the ground . they feel a lot of pain and blood . they cry and call for help . but no one can help them . they are too hurt . they close their eyes and do not wake up .

the end . tim and sam are friends . they like to collect rocks . they have a big box of rocks at home . they want to find more rocks . they go to the park with a bag .

at the park , they see many rocks . some are big , some are small , some are shiny , some are dull . they run to the rocks and start to fill their bag . they are happy .

but tim is clumsy . he trips over a rock and falls . he hurts his knee . he cries . sam hears him and runs to him . he sees tim 's knee is bleeding . he says , " are you okay , tim ? "

tim says , " no , i 'm not okay . i hurt my knee . it 's bad . i want to go home . "

sam says , " do n't worry , tim . i 'll help you . here , take my hand . we 'll go home together . we can come back another day to collect more rocks . "

tim says , " thank you , sam . you are a good friend . i 'm sorry i was clumsy . "

sam says , " it 's okay , tim . everyone is clumsy sometimes . the important thing is to help each other when we are hurt . that 's what friends do . "

they walk home slowly , holding hands . they still have their bag of rocks . they are still happy .

the moral value of the story is : friendship is more valuable than collecting things . friends should help each other when they are in trouble . being clumsy is not a bad thing , as long as you learn from your mistakes . tom and lily are friends . they like to play with toys and draw pictures . one day , they find a big box of crayons . they want to color a big paper .

tom picks a yellow crayon . he likes yellow . he thinks yellow is the best color . he starts to color the sun . lily picks a green crayon . she likes green . she thinks green is the best color . she starts to color the grass .

but then , they both want to color the same thing . they want to color the flower . tom says , " the flower is yellow . i will color it yellow . " lily says , " no , the flower is green . i will color it green . " they disagree . they start to argue . they pull the paper . they make a big tear .

they stop and look at the paper . they see the tear . they feel sad . they say , " sorry , tom . sorry , lily . " they hug . they decide to share the crayons . they color the flower with yellow and green . they think the flower is pretty . they are happy . they are friends . lisa likes to write . she writes with crayons on paper . she writes her name , and her mom 's name , and her dog 's name . she writes big and small , and with many colors . she is happy when she writes .

one day , lisa finds a bowl in the kitchen . it is a big bowl , and it is shiny . lisa thinks it is pretty . she wants to write on it . she takes a crayon and writes on the bowl . she writes " lisa loves mom " . she smiles .

but mom is not happy . she sees the bowl and sees the crayon . she is angry . she says , " lisa , why did you write on the bowl ? this is not paper . this is a bowl . you made it dirty . you have to clean it now . "

lisa is sad . she did not know she did something bad . she says , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to write something nice for you . i love you , mom . " she starts to cry .

mom sees lisa 's tears . she feels sorry . she is compassionate . she says , " i love you too , lisa . i know you did not mean to hurt the bowl . but you have to be careful . you can only write on paper , not on other things . do you understand ? " she hugs lisa .

lisa nods . she says , " i understand , mom . i will only write on paper . can i help you clean the bowl ? " she wipes her eyes .

mom says , " yes , you can . thank you , lisa . you are a good girl . and you are a good writer . but next time , write on paper , okay ? " she smiles .

lisa says , " okay , mom . i will . " she smiles too . she and mom clean the bowl together . they are happy . anna and ben like to pretend . they have many books with pictures of animals , cars , and places . they choose a book and make up stories about what they see .

one day , they pick a book with a big lion on the cover . anna says , " let 's pretend we are in the jungle and we meet the lion . he is very dangerous and hungry . what do we do ? "

ben thinks for a moment and says , " we can pretend we are brave explorers and we have a net and a stick . we can catch the lion and take him to the zoo . then he will not hurt anyone . "

anna nods and says , " that sounds fun . but we have to be careful and quiet . the lion might hear us and roar . "

they open the book and look at the pictures of the jungle . they imagine they are walking among the trees and plants . they see birds , monkeys , and snakes . they make noises like the animals .

they turn the page and see the lion . he is lying on a rock , sunning himself . he looks big and strong . his fur is yellow and brown . his teeth are sharp and white .

anna and ben pretend they are hiding behind a bush . they whisper to each other .

" are you ready ? " ben asks .

" yes , i am , " anna says .

they pretend they throw the net over the lion and run to him with the stick . they pretend they tie the net and lift the lion . they pretend they carry him to a truck and drive to the zoo .

they close the book and smile . they are proud of their adventure . they hug each other and say , " we did it ! we caught the lion ! "

they put the book back on the shelf and look for another one . they wonder what they will pretend next . anna and ben are friends . they like to play together . they have a big box of toys . they can make many things with the toys .

one day , they decide to play space . they use the toys to build a rocket , a moon , and some stars . they put on helmets and suits . they are ready to go .

" are you ready , ben ? " anna asks .

" yes , anna . let 's go to space ! " ben says .

they get inside the rocket . they count down . " three , two , one , blast off ! " they pretend the rocket flies up and up . they see the moon and the stars . they are happy .

they land on the moon . they get out of the rocket . they jump and bounce . they see a strange creature . it has four eyes , six legs , and a long tail . it is green and fuzzy . it is unique .

" hello , who are you ? " anna says .

" i am zee . i live on the moon . who are you ? " the creature says .

" we are anna and ben . we come from earth . we are playing space , " ben says .

" wow , that is fun . can i play with you ? " zee says .

" sure , you can . you are our new friend , " anna says .

they play together . they have a lot of fun . they believe they are in space . they are happy . lily and max were playing with their toys in the living room . they had a big rocket that they pretended to fly to the moon . they made loud noises and had fun .

" look , lily , i can make the rocket go faster ! " max said , pushing a button .

" wow , max , that 's cool ! " lily said , clapping her hands .

but then , they heard their mom calling them . " lily , max , it 's time for bed . come on , you two , you have school tomorrow . "

lily and max groaned . they did n't want to stop playing . they wanted to stay up and fly to the moon .

" please , mom , can we play a little longer ? " lily asked .

" no , sweetie , you need to sleep . you 're very sleepy and you 'll be tired in the morning . come on , put away your toys and brush your teeth . " mom said .

lily and max knew that mom was right , but they still felt sad . they put away their toys and went to the bathroom . they brushed their teeth and put on their pajamas .

mom tucked them in their beds and gave them a kiss . " good night , lily . good night , max . i love you very much . " she said .

" good night , mom . we love you too . " lily and max said .

mom turned off the light and left the room . lily and max looked at each other . they still wanted to play with their rocket .

" i have an idea , lily . let 's pretend that our bed is a rocket and we 're going to the moon . " max whispered .

" ok , max . that sounds fun . " lily whispered back .

they pulled the blanket over their heads and pretended that it was a cover for their rocket . they made noises and imagined that they were flying to the moon . they saw stars and planets and aliens .

they had fun , but soon they felt very sleepy . their eyes closed and they fell asleep .

they dreamed of the moon and the rocket and the adventure .

the next morning , they woke up happy and refreshed . they got ready for school and told mom about their dream .

mom smiled and hugged them . " i 'm glad you had a nice dream . but remember , playing is good , but sleeping is important too . you need to sleep to grow and learn and be healthy . " she said .

lily and max nodded . they understood . they loved playing , but they also loved sleeping .

they kissed mom and went to school . they were ready for a new day .

the end .

the moral value of the story is : sleeping is important for children 's health and well - being . lily loved to paint . she had many colors and brushes and papers . she liked to make pictures of flowers and animals and people . sometimes she gave her paintings to her mom and dad and they put them on the wall .

one day , lily 's mom took her to a big place with many buildings and people . mom said it was a university . she said she had to talk to some people there and lily could come with her . lily was curious and excited . she wanted to see the university .

mom brought lily to a big room with many chairs and a big screen . she said it was a lecture hall . she said she had to give a talk there and lily could sit in the front row and watch . lily nodded and smiled . she wanted to see mom 's talk .

mom gave lily a bag with some snacks and a coloring book and some crayons . she said lily could color quietly while she talked . lily said okay and hugged mom . mom went to the front and started to talk .

lily opened the bag and saw the coloring book . it had many pictures of dinosaurs and planets and cars . lily liked dinosaurs and planets and cars . she took out a crayon and started to color . she used many colors and made the dinosaurs and planets and cars look pretty .

but soon lily got bored . she wanted to paint , not color . she looked around and saw a big white board behind mom . it had some words and numbers on it . lily thought it looked like a big paper . she had an idea .

she got up from her seat and walked to the front . she took a marker from the table and went to the white board . she started to paint on it . she painted a big flower and a big sun and a big smiley face . she used many colors and made the white board look pretty .

mom did not see lily . she was busy talking and looking at the screen . the people in the chairs did see lily . they started to whisper and giggle and point . some of them took out their phones and took pictures . lily did not notice . she was happy painting .

mom finished her talk and turned around . she saw lily and the white board . she gasped and dropped her papers . she felt very embarrassed . she ran to lily and took the marker from her hand . she said , " lily , what are you doing ? you ca n't paint on the white board ! "

lily looked at mom and said , " but mom , i wanted to paint . i made it pretty . do you like it ? "

mom looked at lily and the white board . she saw the big flower and the big sun and the big smiley face . she saw the many colors and the happy strokes . she saw lily 's innocent eyes and sweet smile . she felt a mix of emotions . she said , " lily , i love you . but you ca n't paint on the white board . it 's not a paper . it 's for writing and teaching . you have to ask before you use it . do you understand ? "

lily nodded and said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i did n't know . i wo n't do it again . can we go home now ? "

mom hugged lily and said , " yes , we can go home now . but first , we have to clean the white board . and then , we have to say sorry to the people . and then , we have to laugh about it . because it 's a funny story . and you are a very creative girl . "

lily smiled and said , " okay , mom . i love you too . and i love to paint . " jill and tom were gifted kids . they liked to solve puzzles and riddles . one day , they found a big box in the attic . it had a lock and a note . the note said : " to open the box , you must solve this riddle : what has a face and two hands , but no arms or legs ? "

jill and tom thought hard . they looked around the attic . they saw many things , but none of them matched the riddle . then , tom saw something on the wall . it was a clock . it had a face and two hands , but no arms or legs .

" jill , i know the answer ! " tom said . " it 's a clock ! "

" good job , tom ! " jill said . " let 's try it ! "

they ran to the box and typed " clock " on the lock . the lock clicked and the box opened . inside , there was a shiny red ball . it looked like a toy .

" wow , look at this ! " jill said . " it 's so pretty ! "

she reached for the ball , but as soon as she touched it , the ball exploded . there was a loud bang and a flash of light . jill and tom screamed . the explosion hurt them badly . they fell to the floor , bleeding and crying . the ball was not a toy . it was a trap . someone had left it there to hurt them . jill and tom had solved the riddle , but they had not solved the trap . they had made a big mistake . they wished they had never found the box . lila and ben were playing with their new toys . they had a flashlight and a doll . the flashlight could glow in the dark and the doll had a cute dress and a handle to make her talk .

" look , ben , i can make the doll say hello ! " lila said . she pulled the handle and the doll said , " hello , i 'm dolly . do you want to be my friend ? "

