" sure , here you go . " lila gave the doll to ben . he pulled the handle and the doll said , " hello , i 'm dolly . do you want to be my friend ? "

ben smiled and hugged the doll . " you 're so cute , dolly . i want to be your friend . "

lila felt sad . she wanted the doll back . she grabbed the flashlight and said , " i have a better toy . look , i can make the flashlight glow ! "

she turned on the flashlight and pointed it at the wall . the wall became bright and yellow . " see ? it 's fun ! "

ben looked at the flashlight and then at the doll . he liked both toys . he did n't want to give up either . he said , " no , i like the doll more . she can talk and she 's cute . you can have the flashlight . "

lila felt angry . she did n't want the flashlight . she wanted the doll . she said , " no , i want the doll too . give her to me ! "

she tried to take the doll from ben , but he held on tight . they started to pull and tug . the doll and the flashlight were in the middle . they heard a loud snap and a pop .

the doll 's handle broke off and the flashlight 's bulb burst . the doll stopped talking and the flashlight stopped glowing . they were both broken .

