they hold hands and walk to the ladder . tom goes first . he puts his foot on the first rung and pulls himself up . mia follows him . they go higher and higher .

they reach the top of the ladder . they look around . they see the sky , the trees , the birds , and the neighbor 's cat .

" wow ! " tom says . " this is cool ! "

" meow ! " the cat says . it is sitting on the edge of the roof . it looks scared .

" look , a cat ! " mia says . " it needs help ! "

tom and mia are helpful . they want to help the cat . they crawl to the cat and try to pet it .

" come here , kitty ! " tom says . " do n't be afraid ! "

the cat is afraid . it hisses and scratches tom 's hand . tom cries out . he lets go of the cat and falls back . he slips off the ladder and falls to the ground .

" tom ! " mia screams . she is scared . she wants to help tom .

