lila was sad . she was scared . she was ashamed . she wished she had not climbed the cliff . she wished she had not delayed tom . she wished she had saved tom . she wished tom was alive . anna and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and eat snacks . they have many toys , but their favorite is a big train set . it has many tracks , cars , and a station . they can make the train go fast or slow , and make noises with a button .

