lily and tom shook their heads . they did not want to try broccoli again . they took their cookie and banana and went back to the living room . they ate their snack and played with their toys . they were happy , but they still did not like broccoli . sara liked to grow flowers in her garden . she had many seeds and pots and dirt . she watered them every day and sang to them . she wanted to make her garden very pretty and fancy .

