but the next day , the flower was bigger and wider . it took up a lot of space in the garden . it pushed the other flowers away . sara was worried and sad . she did not want to hurt the big flower , but she also did not want to lose her other flowers .

she asked her mom for help . her mom said the big flower was a sunflower . it liked the sun and grew very fast . she said they could move the sunflower to a bigger pot and put it in a sunny spot . then it would not bother the other flowers and still be happy .

sara liked that idea . she and her mom got a big pot and some dirt and carefully moved the sunflower . they put it in a sunny spot and watered it . sara gave it a hug and said sorry for moving it . the sunflower smiled and nodded . it was still fancy and pretty , but now it had more room to grow . sara was happy and so were her other flowers . anna and ben were friends who liked to play with blocks . they wanted to build a big tower with all the blocks they had . they worked hard and put block on top of block until the tower was very tall .

