they smile and hug . they sit under the tree and play with their toys . they are happy . they have a secret . they know how to make each other laugh . lily liked hockey . she had a hockey stick and a ball . she played hockey with her dad in the yard . she hit the ball hard and fast . she smiled when she scored a goal .

