mommy wiped his tears and his nose . she smiled and kissed him .

" it 's okay , ben . it was an accident . you did not mean to make a mess . but you should not play with things that are not yours . you should ask first . and you should say sorry to lily . she is your sister and she loves you . do you love her ? "

" yes , i love her , " ben said , nodding .

" then let 's go and find her and make up . maybe we can clean the mess together and have a real tea party . how does that sound ? "

ben smiled and nodded . he felt better . he took his doll and followed mommy . he hoped lily would forgive him . he did not want to play with the powder anymore . it was dull and itchy . he wanted to play with his sister and his doll . they were fun and nice . sam likes to jog with his dad in the park . they jog fast and slow , up and down , and around the trees . sam feels happy and strong when he jogs . he likes to see the birds , the flowers , and the other people in the park .

one day , sam sees a man with a whistle in his mouth . the man is wearing a blue shirt and shorts . he is jogging with a big group of people . they are all following the man with the whistle . sam is curious . he asks his dad , " who is that man ? why does he have a whistle ? "

his dad says , " that man is a coach . he helps the people jog better . he blows the whistle to tell them when to start and stop , and how fast to go . he is a jolly man . he likes to make jokes and sing songs with the people . do you want to say hello to him ? "

sam nods . he and his dad jog closer to the man with the whistle . the man sees them and smiles . he blows the whistle and says , " hello , little jogger ! what is your name ? "

