they hugged the pig and waved to the man . they got back in the truck and drove home . they were proud and happy . they had delivered the pig to the market . they had done a good job . they had helped each other . they loved each other . they were a good team . tom and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see an enormous ball . it is red and shiny . it has many spikes on it .

