they play with the doll and the car . they pretend they are heroes . they have fun . mom is happy . she hugs them both . she says they are good twins . lily and sam were playing by the river . they wanted to make a raft with some sticks and rope . lily was bossy . she told sam what to do .

" sam , you tie this stick to that stick . i will tie this stick to that stick . then we will have a raft . "

