he took his rope and ran away . lily was sad . she said , " sam , come back . i 'm sorry . i did n't mean to be mean . i just wanted to make a raft . "

but sam did not hear her . he found another place to play . he tied some sticks together and made his own raft . he put it in the water and climbed on it . he said , " this is my raft . i made it by myself . it is better than lily 's raft . "

he paddled away with his hands . he saw some ducks and some fish . he had fun .

