the dog wants to . it likes tim and sam . it likes to play with them .

they play together . they have fun . they share the balls . they are friends .

the end . lily liked to write stories . she had a big book and a red pen . she wrote about animals and people and places . she wrote every day .

one day , she wrote a story about a crocodile . the crocodile was poor . he had no friends and no food . he was sad and lonely . he wanted to be happy .

lily showed her story to her brother , ben . ben was older and mean . he laughed at her story . he said , " that is a silly story . crocodiles are not poor . they are big and strong and scary . they eat other animals . they do not need friends . they are happy . "

lily felt bad . she said , " no , ben . that is not true . crocodiles can be poor too . they can be sad and lonely too . they can want friends too . they can be happy too . "

ben did not listen . he took her book and her pen . he said , " you do not know how to write stories . you are too little . i will write a better story . a story about a brave and smart and cool boy . a boy like me . "

he ran away with her book and her pen . lily cried . she wanted her book and her pen back . she wanted to write more stories . she wanted to make the crocodile happy . she did not like ben . he was mean . sara and ben are twins . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big rock . it is cold and gray .

" let 's climb the rock ! " sara says .

" no , it is too high . we might fall . " ben says .

sara does not listen . she runs to the rock and starts to climb . ben follows her . he is scared .

they reach the top of the rock . they can see the whole park . it is a nice sight .

" wow , look at that ! " sara says .

but then , they hear a loud noise . it is a dog . it is barking and running to the rock . it wants to play .

" help ! a dog ! " ben says .

he is afraid of dogs . he tries to get down from the rock . but he slips and hurts his knee .

" ow ! ow ! ow ! " he cries .

sara hears him . she looks down and sees him . she also sees the dog .

" ben , are you okay ? " she says .

she is worried . she wants to help him . but she does not know how to get down .

the dog reaches the rock . it jumps and tries to climb . it is friendly . but sara and ben do not know that . they think it is angry .

" go away , dog ! " sara says .

she throws a stick at it . the dog thinks it is a game . it catches the stick and wags its tail .

" good dog , good dog ! " a voice says .

it is a man . he is the owner of the dog . he sees sara and ben on the rock .

" hey , kids , what are you doing up there ? " he says .

he is nice . he calls the dog and holds its leash .

" come on , rex , let 's go . " he says .

he walks to the rock and helps sara and ben to get down .

" thank you , mister . " sara says .

she is sorry for throwing the stick .

" sorry , dog . " ben says .

he is sorry for being scared .

" that 's okay , kids . rex is a good dog . he just wanted to play . " the man says .

he smiles and pets the dog .

" do you want to pet him ? " he asks .

sara and ben nod . they are curious . they touch the dog . it is soft and warm .

" hello , rex . " sara says .

" nice dog . " ben says .

the dog licks their faces . it is happy .

sara and ben laugh . they are not afraid anymore . they like the dog .

they say goodbye to the man and the dog . they go back to their mom . she is waiting for them .

" did you have fun , kids ? " she asks .

" yes , mom . we climbed a rock . we saw a sight . we met a dog . " sara says .

" we learned a lesson . we were brave . we made a friend . " ben says .

they hug their mom . she is proud of them .

they go home . they are tired . they sleep well . they dream of the rock , the sight , and the dog . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play near the sea . one day , they saw a big rock with many oysters on it . they wanted to eat the oysters , but they did not know how to open them .

they found a stick and tried to hit the oysters with it . but the oysters were hard and did not break . tom and sam got angry and hit harder and harder . they did not see the big wave coming behind them .

the wave was very big and very fast . it hit the rock and the boys and the oysters . it made a loud noise and a lot of water . tom and sam were scared and wet . they tried to swim to the shore , but the water was too strong . they could not breathe and they could not see .

the wave took them far away from the shore and from their home . they never saw their mom and dad again . the oysters were safe on the rock . they did not care about the boys . the boys were bad and they got punished . the oysters were good and they did not . the end . sara and ben are playing in the park . they like to run and jump and slide . they see a big plane in the sky . it is very loud and fast .

" look , look , a plane ! " sara says . she points to the sky . ben looks up too . he sees the plane . it is white and blue and red .

" wow , a plane ! " ben says . he likes planes . he wants to fly in a plane one day .

the plane flies away . sara and ben keep playing . they see a bird , a dog , and a flower . they have fun .

then they see another plane . it is not like the first plane . it is smaller and slower . it is pink and purple and yellow . it has a funny shape .

" look , look , another plane ! " sara says . she points to the sky again . ben looks up again . he sees the pink plane . it is very pretty and shiny .

" wow , another plane ! " ben says . he likes the pink plane . he thinks it is a toy plane .

the pink plane flies closer . sara and ben hear a voice . it is a girl . she is in the pink plane . she says hello .

" hello , hello , i am lily ! " the girl says . she smiles and waves . she is flying the pink plane . it is her toy plane . she has a remote control .

" hello , hello , we are sara and ben ! " sara and ben say . they smile and wave back . they are surprised and happy . they want to play with lily and her pink plane . sara liked to draw with her crayons . she had many colors to choose from . she drew a house , a sun , a tree and a cat . she was very happy with her picture . she showed it to her mom and dad . they said it was charming .

one day , sara found a new crayon in her box . it was shiny and silver . she wondered what it would do . she tried to draw with it , but it did not make any color . she rubbed it harder on the paper , but nothing happened . she felt curious and frustrated .

she decided to see what would happen if she put the crayon near the candle on the table . she thought maybe it would melt and make a color . she reached for the crayon and the candle . but she was not careful . she touched the flame with her finger . it hurt a lot . she screamed and dropped the crayon . it landed on the paper and started to burn . the paper turned black and smoky . the fire alarm went off . sara was scared and sorry .

her mom and dad came running . they saw the fire and the crayon . they put out the fire with water . they hugged sara and checked her finger . it was red and sore . they put some cream and a bandage on it . they told sara that the crayon was not a crayon . it was a sparkler . it was for making sparks , not colors . it was dangerous to play with it . they said they were sorry they left it in the box . they said they loved her and they were glad she was okay .

sara felt sad and ashamed . she said she was sorry too . she said she did not know it was a sparkler . she said she just wanted to make a color . she said she liked her picture and she did not want to burn it . she said she would never play with fire again . she asked if they still liked her picture . they said they did . they said it was still charming , even with the burn . they said they were proud of her for being brave and honest . they said they would help her make a new picture tomorrow . they kissed her and tucked her in bed . sara felt better and sleepy . she dreamed of crayons and colors . lily was sick . she felt hot and tired . mommy gave her a thermometer to put in her mouth . lily did not like it . it was hard and cold .

mommy looked at the thermometer and said , " oh , lily , you have a fever . you need to rest and drink water . " she gave lily a hug and a cup of water . lily drank some water and lay down on the couch .

mommy went to the kitchen to make some soup . lily heard a noise outside . she looked out the window and saw her friend sam . sam was riding his bike . he looked happy and great .

lily wanted to play with sam . she got up from the couch and ran to the door . she opened the door and called , " sam , sam , come here ! "

sam heard lily and stopped his bike . he saw lily at the door . he smiled and said , " hi , lily , do you want to play ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , yes , i want to play ! " she pointed to her bike in the garage . she said , " let 's ride our bikes ! "

sam shook his head and said , " no , lily , you ca n't play . you are sick . you need to stay inside and get better . "

lily felt sad and angry . she said , " no , i 'm not sick . i 'm fine . see ? " she took the thermometer from her mouth and showed it to sam .

sam looked at the thermometer and said , " lily , that 's not good . that means you have a fever . you need to go back to the couch and rest . "

lily did not listen . she said , " no , no , no ! " she threw the thermometer on the ground and ran to her bike . she got on her bike and said , " come on , sam , let 's go ! "

sam did not follow . he said , " lily , stop ! you are making a mistake . you are hurting yourself . you need to listen to mommy and me . we care about you . "

lily did not hear . she rode her bike away from sam . she felt dizzy and weak . she fell off her bike and scraped her knee . she cried and cried .

mommy heard lily cry and ran outside . she saw lily on the ground and sam by her side . she said , " oh , lily , what happened ? are you okay ? "

lily looked at mommy and said , " i 'm sorry , mommy . i was bad . i wanted to play with sam . i did not listen to you . i threw the thermometer and rode my bike . i fell and hurt my knee . "

mommy picked up lily and hugged her . she said , " it 's okay , lily . i 'm not mad . i 'm glad you are sorry . i love you . but you need to be careful . you need to do what i say . i say it because i want you to be healthy and happy . "

lily nodded and said , " i love you , mommy . i will do what you say . i will rest and drink water . i will not play with sam until i 'm better . "

mommy smiled and said , " that 's good , lily . that 's very good . you are a good girl . sam is a good friend . he tried to help you . you should say thank you to him . "

lily looked at sam and said , " thank you , sam . you are a good friend . i 'm sorry i did not listen to you . i hope you can play with me another day . "

sam smiled and said , " you 're welcome , lily . you are a good friend , too . i 'm sorry you are sick . i hope you get better soon . i will play with you another day . "

mommy and lily went back inside . mommy gave lily some soup and a band - aid . lily ate some soup and put the band - aid on her knee . she felt a little better . she said , " mommy , can i have a story ? "

mommy said , " of course , lily . you can have a story . what story do you want ? "

lily said , " i want a story about a girl who listens to her mommy and plays with her friend and has a great day . "

mommy said , " okay , lily . i will tell you a story about that . but first , let me get the thermometer . we need to check your fever again . "

lily said , " okay , mommy . i will take the thermometer . i will not throw it . i will be good . "

mommy said , " that 's my lily . you are a good girl . i 'm proud of you . "

mommy and lily hugged and kissed . they sat on the couch and read a story . lily felt warm and cozy . she smiled and said , " i love you , mommy . you are the best . "

mommy said sam and mia were playing in the garden . they liked to look at the flowers and the bugs . they saw a big green plant with many sharp points . sam said , " what is that ? "

mia said , " that is a cactus . it is a plant that lives in the hot and dry places . it has points to keep away the animals that want to eat it . "

sam was curious . he wanted to touch the cactus . he said , " can i touch it ? maybe it is soft . "

mia said , " no , sam , do n't touch it . it will hurt you . the points are very scary . they can make you bleed . "

but sam did not listen . he reached out his hand and touched the cactus . he felt a sharp pain . he cried out , " ow , ow , ow ! it hurts , it hurts ! "

mia ran to him and said , " i told you not to touch it , sam . you are silly . come , let me help you . we have to take out the points from your hand . then we have to put some cream on it . it will make you feel better . "

sam said , " i 'm sorry , mia . i was silly . i will not touch the cactus again . it is not good to eat . it is scary and bad . "

mia said , " it 's okay , sam . i forgive you . but you have to be careful next time . there are many things in the garden that are not good to eat . they can make you sick or hurt you . you have to ask me or mom or dad before you try anything new . "

sam said , " okay , mia . i will ask you or mom or dad . you are a good sister . you know a lot of things . thank you for helping me . "

mia said , " you are welcome , sam . you are a good brother . you are brave and curious . but sometimes you have to listen to me . i love you . "

they hugged each other and went inside to get some cream and a band - aid . they learned a lesson about the cactus . they decided to play with something else next time . anna and ben are friends . they like to play with their toys and their dog , max . max is a big dog . he is brown and furry . he likes to run and jump and bark .

one day , anna and ben want to know how much max weighs . they have a scale in the bathroom . they ask max to come with them . max follows them , wagging his tail .

" max , sit on the scale , " anna says . she is bossy . she likes to tell max what to do .

max looks at the scale . he does not like it . it is hard and cold . he does not want to sit on it .

" no , max , sit ! " ben says . he is also bossy . he tries to push max on the scale .

max growls . he does not like to be pushed . he jumps off the scale and runs away .

" come back , max ! " anna and ben shout . they chase max around the house .

max is faster than them . he hides under the bed . he does not want to play with the scale . he wants to play with his ball .

anna and ben find max under the bed . they see his ball next to him .

" max , we are sorry , " anna says . " we did not mean to make you angry . "

" we just wanted to know how much you weigh , " ben says . " you are a big dog . "

max wags his tail . he forgives them . he likes anna and ben . they are his friends .

" can we play with your ball ? " anna asks .

max barks . he is happy . he likes to play with his ball .

he gives them his ball . they throw it and he fetches it . they have fun .

they forget about the scale . they do not care how much max weighs . they love him . he is a good dog . ben is a dog who likes to run and play . he has a big yard with a fence . he can see many things from his yard , like cars , birds , and people . sometimes he barks at them , but he is not mean .

one day , ben sees a new thing in his yard . it is small and gray and has a long tail . it is a mouse . ben is curious and wants to catch it . he runs after it , but the mouse is fast and smart . it hides under a rock , then under a bush , then under a pile of leaves .

ben does not give up . he digs and sniffs and chases the mouse . he follows it to the east , where the sun rises . he thinks he is successful when he sees the mouse run into a hole in the fence . he bites the fence , but it is hard and hurts his teeth . he hears a squeak from the other side . the mouse is safe and laughs at him .

ben is sad and tired . he goes back to his house and lies down on his bed . he thinks the mouse is too clever for him . he decides he does not like mice . he likes bones and balls and his family . he falls asleep and dreams of happy things . tommy was very sleepy . he had played a lot with his toys and his friends . he wanted to go to bed and have a nice dream . but his mom said he had to go to the store with her . she needed to buy some milk and eggs .

tommy did not want to go to the store . he wanted to stay at home and cuddle with his teddy bear . he put his teddy bear in his pocket and followed his mom . he hoped she would be quick .

at the store , tommy saw many things . he saw fruits and vegetables and candy and cookies . he saw other people and other kids . he felt bored and tired . he yawned and rubbed his eyes .

" mom , can we go home now ? " he asked .

" not yet , sweetie . we have to pay first . come on , let 's go to the cashier . " his mom said .

they walked to the cashier . tommy saw a big man with a funny hat and a big smile . he looked at tommy and said , " hello , little boy . what do you have in your pocket ? "

tommy felt shy . he did not want to talk to the big man . he tried to hide his pocket with his hand . but the big man reached out and pulled out his teddy bear .

" look , everyone ! he has a teddy bear in his pocket ! how cute ! " the big man said . he laughed and showed the teddy bear to the other people . they laughed too .

tommy felt very embarrassed . he wanted his teddy bear back . he wanted to go home . he wanted to cry .

" mom , make him stop ! " he said .

his mom saw that tommy was upset . she took the teddy bear from the big man and gave it back to tommy . she hugged him and said , " i 'm sorry , honey . he was just trying to be nice . he did n't mean to make you feel bad . you do n't have to be embarrassed . it 's okay to have a teddy bear . i love you . "

tommy felt a little better . he hugged his mom and his teddy bear . he said , " i love you too , mom . can we go home now ? "

" yes , we can . let 's go home and get some rest . you must be very sleepy . " his mom said .

they paid for their things and left the store . tommy was glad to leave the big man and the other people behind . he was still sleepy , but he was also happy . he had his mom and his teddy bear with him . he knew they would always make him feel safe and loved . mia and ben were best friends . they liked to play with dolls and cars and books . one day , they found a big box in the garage . it had many old things inside . mia saw a shiny necklace with a heart . ben saw a hat with a feather .

" look , mia , this hat is so cool ! it has style ! " ben said . he put the hat on his head and smiled .

