soon , the little girl and the bald ghost were the best of friends . together , they made smiles and happy marks all over the world . once upon a time there were two best friends , joe and jill , who always enjoyed spending time together . they were playing in the park one day and came across a big , beautiful statue . jill wanted to climb up and see it , but joe was worried he might be too dizzy so high up .

