the tears made jack feel bad , so he changed his mind . he shared the money with john , so they could both be happy .

the moral of this story is that it 's better to be kind and share with others than to do something foolish . once upon a time there was a little boy . his name was tom and he was three years old . tom loved to play with his toys and make jokes .

