then they see a big tree with a hole in it . they think maybe there is some mud in the hole . they run to the tree and look inside .

they see a big surprise . there is a nest with four baby birds in it . the baby birds are hungry and noisy . they open their mouths and raise their heads . they want food .

tom and lily are happy . they forget about the mud . they want to help the baby birds . they look for worms and bugs and berries . they bring them to the hole and feed the baby birds . the baby birds are happy and quiet . they close their mouths and lower their heads . they want to sleep .

