the dog likes the biscuit . he eats it and licks his lips . he snuggles with lily and ben . they pet him and hug him . they say he is a good dog . they ask him his name . he barks again . lily and ben think he says spot .

lily and ben decide to keep spot as their pet . they make him a bed out of a blanket . they play with him and tell him stories . they are happy . they have a new friend . they love to pretend . lily and ben were playing in the yard . they liked to run and jump and laugh . they saw a big fence at the end of the yard . the fence was brown and tall and had holes in it .

