mia and leo went back to their house . they did not have the ball of yarn anymore . but they still had their cat and snake . they decided to play with them instead . they also decided to be more careful and to share . they learned their lesson from the ball of yarn . lily was a little girl who liked to play with her dolls . she had many dolls , but her favorite one was a queen doll . the queen doll had a shiny crown , a long dress and a big smile . lily loved to pretend that she was the queen and her dolls were her friends .

