when the princess arrived , the king was overjoyed . he put on the necklace with a huge smile . the king said , " thank you for completing this special task . i am the luckiest king in the world ! " and the princess and king lived happily ever after . john was a three - year - old who loved animals . he would always stare in amazement at the lily pond in his backyard . one day , john noticed a helpless little insect in the pond . it was trying to climb over a lily pad but could n't make it .

