john listened carefully while the mechanic talked and later he skipped happily back home . he could n't wait to tell his dad the news . when john got home , his dad was sad . he said the mechanic had fixed the car , but it cost too much money . he did n't have enough money to pay the mechanic 's bill .

john was very sad and troubled . he sat in the garden and watched as his dad 's car drove away . he never skipped again . once upon a time , there was a boy named paul . he wanted to go to the hospital . he asked his mom for permission but she said no , so he had a plan .

paul put rags and hay into a box and then he buried it outside . then he pretended to be very sick and he said he had a sour stomach . his mom did n't know what to do , so she took him to the hospital .

the hospital doctors checked him out , but they said he was fine . his mom was confused until they remembered the box outside . they dug it up and opened it , and inside they found a toy car . paul laughed and laughed !

his mom could n't be mad . she gave him a big hug and told him to never play that game again . so paul promised and he never did . the end . once upon a time there were two friends , jack and hank . they loved to play together and explore the world .

one day they were on a big adventure . they were running and jumping and having lots of fun .

suddenly , they heard something . jack said , " what do you think that noise is ? "

hank replied , " i do n't know , let 's go check it out ! "

so , the two friends began walking towards the noise . it was getting louder and louder .

when they finally reached the source of the noise , they looked around in amazement . it was a tough world with its own rules . there were big rock walls , a river , and a waterfall . it was beautiful .

jack and hank could n't help but smile . it was an amazing place . but then they heard a voice .

" stop , " the voice said . " this world is tough , so be careful . "

the two friends listened to the voice , and remembered to be careful . they enjoyed their time in the tough world , but when the sun began to set , jack and hank knew it was time to go home . once upon a time there was a little girl called katy . katy lived in a big house with her grandma . one summer day , katy wanted to explore the garden , but grandma said she had to stay inside .

" no , i wo n't let you go out there ! " said grandma

katy was very sad , but she decided to listen to her grandma . after a while , katy heard something coming from outside . she got curious and went to the window to have a peak . she saw the wind was blowing gently and the leaves were falling from the trees .

" look katy , the leaves are hidden in the garden ! can you collect them ? " asked grandma .

katy was so happy about it . she grabbed a basket and went to the garden . katy collected all the leaves she could find , and she arranged them in different shapes .

the moral of the story is that if we listen to our elders , we can discover ideas and find joy in something as simple as leaves falling from the trees . once there was a boy named joe who was always curious . one night , when his parents were out , joe decided to get a candle . he found the candle in a drawer and was so excited .

he lit the candle and was amazed to see the flickering light . he wanted to show his friend , so he quickly ran to their house .

when he got there , his friend said , " wow , joe , who gave you that candle ? " joe replied , " i got it ! i found it in my house ! " his friend was surprised , and asked , " was n't your mom mad when you got the candle ? " joe felt embarrassed and did n't know what to say .

his friend came to the rescue and said , " joe , i think it 's ok for you to get a candle , but next time you should ask your mom first . " joe was relieved and was really happy that his friend had helped him . he thanked his friend and said , " i will make sure i ask my mom first next time ! " lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to swing on the swings and slide on the slide . they also liked to hang from the monkey bars and pretend they were monkeys .

one day , they saw a new thing in the park . it was a big rope with a loop at the end . it was hanging from a tree . lily and tom wondered what it was for .

" maybe it is for jumping , " lily said .

" or for flying , " tom said .

they decided to try it . lily went first . she put her foot in the loop and pulled the rope . she felt the rope lift her up . she felt happy and excited .

" look at me , tom ! i am flying ! " she shouted .

tom clapped his hands and cheered . he wanted to try it too . he waited for lily to come down . but lily did not come down . she was stuck . the loop was too tight around her foot . she could not get it off . she started to cry .

" help me , tom ! i am stuck ! " she cried .

tom ran to the tree . he tried to pull the rope . but the rope was too high and too strong . he could not reach it . he felt scared and worried .

" help ! help ! " he yelled .

a man heard them . he was walking his dog in the park . he saw lily and tom . he saw the rope . he knew what it was for . it was not for playing . it was for catching animals . it was a trap . he felt angry and sorry .

he ran to the tree . he had a knife . he cut the rope . he freed lily . he lifted her down . he checked her foot . it was red and sore . but it was not broken . he felt relieved and glad .

" are you okay , little girl ? " he asked .

lily nodded . she hugged him . she thanked him . she felt safe and grateful .

tom hugged lily . he hugged the man . he thanked him too . he felt happy and thankful .

the man smiled . he told them to be careful . he told them not to play with the rope . he told them it was dangerous . he told them it was a trap . he felt kind and helpful .

lily and tom felt guilty . they knew they did a bad thing . they knew they should not have played with the rope . they knew they could have been hurt . they felt sorry and ashamed .

they said sorry to the man . they said sorry to each other . they said sorry to the animals . they felt sorry and sorry .

they learned a lesson . they learned to be safe . they learned to be smart . they learned to be good . they felt better and better . lily loved to play with her toy boat . she liked to pretend she was a sailor and explore the sea . she had a lovely blue hat and a red scarf that her grandma gave her .

one day , she took her boat to the park and put it in the pond . she watched it sail with the wind and smiled . but then , a big duck came and bit the boat . the boat broke and sank . lily was very sad and cried .

a boy saw lily and came to help . he had a tool box and a big smile . he said , " do n't cry , i can fix your boat . i like to fix things . what is your name ? "

lily sniffed and said , " i 'm lily . thank you for helping me . i love my boat . it was a gift from my grandpa . he was a sailor too . "

the boy nodded and said , " i 'm tom . my dad is a sailor . he taught me how to fix boats . come , let 's get your boat out of the water and see what we can do . "

tom and lily worked together to fix the boat . they used glue , tape , and paint . they made the boat look like new . lily was very happy and hugged tom . she said , " you are very kind and smart . you fixed my boat . do you want to be my friend ? "

tom smiled and said , " yes , i do . you are very sweet and brave . you love your boat . do you want to play with me ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , i do . let 's play sailors and explore the sea . "

they put the boat back in the pond and watched it sail . they had a lot of fun and became good friends . they both had lovely hats and scarves and toy boats . they both loved to be sailors . sara liked cream very much . she saw a big jar of cream on the shelf in the kitchen . she wanted to get some cream and eat it . she climbed on a chair and reached for the jar . but the jar was too heavy and slippery . it fell from her hand and broke on the floor . cream and glass went everywhere .

sara was scared and sad . she did not know what to do . she heard her mom coming . she knew her mom would be angry . she tried to hide under the table . but her mom saw her and the mess . her mom was very angry . she shouted at sara and said she was a bad girl . she said she had to clean up the mess and go to her room . she did not give sara any hug or kiss .

sara felt helpless and alone . she cried and cried . she wished she had not tried to get the cream . she wished her mom would love her . she wished she had a friend . but she had no one . she was very unhappy . the end . lila and ben were playing with their new toy , a magic wand that could make things shrink . they had fun making their dolls , cars and books smaller and smaller , and putting them in a shoe box .

" let 's try it on something big ! " ben said . he pointed the wand at the window and said the magic word . " shrink ! "

the window became very small , like a stamp . lila and ben gasped . they could see the sky through the tiny hole , but it looked very far away .

" oops ! how do we make it big again ? " lila asked .

" i do n't know . maybe we can find the instructions in the box . " ben said . he ran to the closet where they had left the box . but when he opened the door , he saw that the box was gone .

" where is it ? " he cried .

lila looked around and saw their cat , fluffy , playing with something on the floor . it was the box , and it was very fragile . fluffy had ripped it open with his claws and teeth , and had scattered the pieces all over the carpet .

" fluffy , no ! " lila shouted . she ran to the cat and tried to grab the box , but it was too late . fluffy had chewed up the instructions and swallowed them .

lila and ben looked at each other in horror . they had no way to fix the window , and no way to make their toys big again . they had ruined everything with their magic wand . they started to cry . ben and lily went to the zoo with mom and dad . they saw many animals , like lions , monkeys , and giraffes . but ben and lily wanted to see the penguins most of all . they liked how the penguins looked , with their black and white feathers and their funny beaks .

" can we go to the penguins now ? " ben asked mom .

" not yet , sweetie . we have to wait for the bell to ring . then the penguins will come out and swim and play , " mom said .

ben and lily were impatient . they did not like to wait . they wanted to see the penguins right away . they looked at the big clock on the wall . it showed the time . it was almost time for the bell to ring .

" come on , come on , hurry up , clock ! " lily said .

" maybe we can make the bell ring faster if we clap our hands , " ben said .

they started to clap their hands loudly . they hoped the bell would hear them and ring sooner . but the bell did not ring . it was still quiet .

" maybe the bell is broken , " ben said .

" maybe the penguins are sleeping , " lily said .

they felt sad . they thought they would not see the penguins today .

but then , they heard a loud sound . it was the bell ! it rang and rang and rang . ben and lily jumped up and down . they were happy . the bell was not broken . the penguins were not sleeping .

" let 's go , let 's go , let 's go ! " they shouted .

they ran to the penguin pool with mom and dad . they saw the penguins come out of their house . they saw them slide on the ice , dive in the water , and chase each other . they saw them flap their wings , shake their tails , and make funny noises .

ben and lily laughed and clapped . they loved the penguins . they watched them for a long time . they forgot about the clock and the bell . they only cared about the penguins . they had a lot of fun at the zoo . lily and ben were friends who liked to play outside . they had a big ball that was orange and black . it was a basketball . they liked to bounce it and throw it and catch it .

one day , they saw a big hoop on a pole near the park . it was very high . lily and ben wanted to try to put the ball in the hoop . they thought it would be fun .

they took turns to bounce the ball and jump . they tried to reach the hoop , but it was too high . they could not put the ball in the hoop . they felt sad .

then , they saw a friendly dog running towards them . it was brown and white and had a long tail . it was harmless . it wanted to play with them . it barked and wagged its tail .

" hi , doggy ! " lily said . " do you want to play with us ? "

the dog nodded and licked lily 's face . it made her giggle . ben threw the ball and the dog ran after it . it caught the ball in its mouth and brought it back . it dropped the ball and waited for ben to throw it again .

lily and ben smiled . they forgot about the hoop . they had fun playing with the dog and the ball . they made a new friend . they were happy . lily and max were playing in the snow . they made a snowman and a snow fort . they threw snowballs at each other and laughed . they were having fun .

but then the sky became dark and the wind became cold . lily and max felt cold too . they needed to go inside . they looked for their cabin . their cabin was huge and warm . it had a fireplace and a sofa and a big bed .

but they could not see their cabin . they only saw trees and snow . they were lost . they were scared . they hugged each other and cried .

" where is our cabin ? " lily asked .

" i do n't know , " max said . " maybe we walked too far . maybe we should shout for help . "

they shouted as loud as they could . " help ! help ! we are lost ! we need our cabin ! "

but no one heard them . they shouted again and again . but no one came .

they were about to give up when they heard a bark . they looked up and saw a dog . the dog was big and furry . it had a collar and a tag . it said " rex " .

" hello , rex , " lily said . " can you help us ? can you find our cabin ? "

rex wagged his tail and barked . he sniffed the air and ran . lily and max followed him . they hoped he knew the way .

rex ran fast and smart . he followed the tracks and the signs . he led them to their cabin . he barked and scratched the door .

lily and max saw their cabin . they were so happy . they ran to the door and opened it . they saw their mom and dad . they were so worried .

" lily ! max ! where were you ? " their mom and dad said . " we were looking for you . we were so scared . "

" we were playing in the snow . but then we got lost . we could not find our cabin . we needed help . but then rex came . he helped us . he found our cabin . he is a good dog , " lily and max said .

they hugged their mom and dad . they thanked rex . they gave him a treat and a pat . they went inside their cabin . they warmed up by the fireplace . they cuddled on the sofa . they felt safe and cozy .

they learned a lesson . they should not go too far from their cabin . they should always stay together . they should always listen to their mom and dad . and they should always be nice to rex . he was their hero . he was their friend . ella and ben were twins who liked to play outside . they had a big yard with a swing , a slide and a sandbox . they also had a dog named spot who was very friendly and liked to chase balls .

one morning , ella and ben woke up very early . they looked out the window and saw the sky was pink and orange . they knew it was sunrise , when the sun comes up and makes the day bright . they wanted to see the sunrise better , so they put on their shoes and ran outside .

they saw the sun peeking over the hills and shining on the flowers and the grass . they felt the warm air and heard the birds singing . they smiled and said , " wow , the sunrise is so pretty ! "

they decided to play on the swing and the slide , and they called spot to join them . they had a lot of fun , until they heard a loud scream from the house . they stopped and looked at each other , scared . they wondered who was screaming and why .

they ran back to the house and saw their grandma standing on the porch . she was elderly , with white hair and glasses . she looked angry and scared . she pointed at the kitchen and said , " there 's a mouse in the kitchen ! it ran under the table and scared me ! help me get rid of it ! "

ella and ben looked at each other and giggled . they thought a mouse was not so scary , but they knew their grandma did not like them . they said , " do n't worry , grandma , we 'll help you . come on , spot , let 's catch the mouse ! "

they ran into the kitchen , followed by spot , who barked and wagged his tail . they looked under the table and saw a small brown mouse with a long tail . it squeaked and ran away , but spot was faster . he chased the mouse and caught it in his mouth . he brought it back to ella and ben , who praised him and petted him .

they showed the mouse to their grandma , who said , " thank you , ella and ben , and thank you , spot . you are very brave and smart . now , please take the mouse outside and let it go . i do n't want it in my house ! "

they nodded and said , " okay , grandma , we will . but can we have some breakfast first ? we are hungry from playing and helping . "

their grandma smiled and said , " of course , you can . you deserve some pancakes and juice . come on , let 's go to the dining room . and do n't forget to wash your hands ! "

they washed their hands and went to the dining room , where they ate their pancakes and juice . they told their grandma about the sunrise and how beautiful it was . they asked her if she wanted to see it with them next time . she said , " maybe , if you wake me up gently and not with a scream ! "

they laughed and hugged their grandma . they said , " we love you , grandma , and we love the sunrise . and we love spot , too . he 's a good dog . "

they finished their breakfast and went outside again , with spot . they let the mouse go in the grass , where it ran away . they waved goodbye to the mouse and said , " have a nice day , mouse . and do n't come back to our house ! "

they played some more on the swing and the slide , and watched the sun go higher in the sky . they felt happy and proud . they had a good morning . tom and mia are twins . they like to play in the park with their mom and dad . they have a big blanket to sit on and eat snacks . they also have a ball , a kite and some books .

one day , they see a big dog in the park . the dog is brown and furry . it looks tough and strong . it runs fast and barks loud . tom and mia are scared of the dog . they rush to their mom and dad and hide behind the blanket .

" mom , dad , help ! there is a big dog ! " tom cries .

" shh , it 's okay . the dog wo n't hurt you . he is just playing , " mom says .

" but he is so big and tough . he might bite us , " mia says .

" no , he wo n't . he is a friendly dog . he just wants to say hello . look , he has a collar and a leash . his owner is over there . he is calling him , " dad says .

tom and mia peek from behind the blanket . they see a man waving and whistling . the dog hears him and runs to him . the man pets the dog and puts the leash on him . he smiles and walks away .

" see ? the dog is gone . he was not mean . he was just curious . do you want to play some more ? " mom asks .

tom and mia nod . they feel better . they come out from behind the blanket . they pick up their ball , their kite and their books . they play in the park with their mom and dad . they have fun . they are not scared of the dog anymore . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys in their room . sometimes they share , sometimes they fight . one day , they find a big blanket in the closet . it is soft and warm and has many colors .

" wow , look at this blanket ! " lily says . " it is so pretty ! i want to use it for my dolls . "

" no , i want to use it for my cars ! " ben says . " it is so big ! i can make a road with it . "

they both pull the blanket and try to take it . the blanket makes a loud rip sound . lily and ben stop and look at the blanket . it has a big hole in the middle . they feel sad and sorry .

" mommy , mommy ! " they cry . " we broke the blanket ! "

mommy comes to their room and sees the blanket . she is not happy . she asks them what they did .

" we wanted to play with the blanket , but we fought over it and ripped it , " lily says .

" we are sorry , mommy , " ben says .

mommy sighs and hugs them . she says , " i know you are sorry , but you have to learn to be generous . generous means you share and care for others . the blanket was a gift from grandma . she made it with love for you . she was generous to give you the blanket . how do you think she would feel if she saw the blanket now ? "

lily and ben think about grandma . they love grandma . they do n't want to make her sad .

" we feel bad , mommy , " lily says . " we want to make grandma happy . "

" can we fix the blanket , mommy ? " ben asks .

mommy smiles and says , " yes , we can try to fix the blanket . but first , you have to say sorry to each other and promise to be generous from now on . "

lily and ben hug each other and say sorry . they promise to be generous and share the blanket . mommy gets some needles and threads and helps them sew the hole . the blanket is not as good as before , but it is still soft and warm and has many colors . lily and ben thank mommy and say they love her . they also make a card for grandma and say they love her and are sorry for the blanket . they hope she will forgive them and be proud of them . they are happy to be generous . sara was a dancer who loved to shine . she wore a pink dress and pink shoes and danced with joy . she liked to show off her moves and make everyone look at her .

one day , she went to a big dance show with other dancers . she wanted to be the best and the brightest . she did not care about the other dancers . she pushed and bumped them to get to the front . she did not say sorry or smile .

the other dancers were sad and angry . they did not want to dance with sara . they moved away from her and left her alone . sara felt lonely and confused . she did not understand why they did not like her .

then , she saw a little girl in the audience . the girl was wearing a pink dress and pink shoes , just like sara . but the girl was not happy . she was crying . sara asked her why she was crying . the girl said that she wanted to be a dancer , but she had hurt her leg and could not dance . she said that she loved to watch the other dancers , but sara had blocked her view and made them unhappy .

sara felt sorry for the girl . she realized that she had been selfish and rude . she wanted to make the girl happy . she gave her a hug and a smile . she asked the other dancers to join her . she said that she was sorry and that she wanted to share the dance with them . the other dancers forgave her and welcomed her . they danced together in a circle , with sara and the girl in the middle . they all shone with joy and friendship .

the moral of the story is that being a good dancer is not only about being bright and beautiful , but also about being kind and respectful . sharing and caring make everyone happy . tom was lonely . he had no friends to play with . he lived in a big house with his mom and dad , but they were always busy . he wished he had a dog or a cat or a bird to keep him company .

one day , he heard a noise in the backyard . he ran to the window and saw a little kitten . it was gray and white and had blue eyes . it looked scared and hungry . tom opened the door and went outside . he called to the kitten , " hello , little kitty . do you want to be my friend ? "

the kitten meowed and came closer . tom smiled and picked it up . it was soft and warm . he hugged it and said , " you are so cute . what is your name ? " the kitten purred and licked his face . tom laughed and said , " i will call you fluffy . do you like that name ? "

tom took fluffy inside . he gave him some milk and some tuna from the faucet . he made a bed for him out of a blanket and a pillow . he played with him with a ball of yarn and a feather . he was very happy . he said to fluffy , " you are the best friend ever . i am not lonely anymore . i love you , fluffy . "

fluffy loved tom too . he snuggled with him and followed him everywhere . he was not scared or hungry anymore . he said to tom , " you are the best friend ever . i am not lonely anymore . i love you , tom . "

tom and fluffy were very happy . they remembered the day they met and thanked each other . they were the best friends ever . sara and ben were very happy . they were going to the theater with mom and dad . they liked to watch shows with songs and jokes . they put on their nice clothes and got in the car .

at the theater , they saw many people . some people were loud and some were quiet . sara and ben held mom and dad 's hands . they were careful not to get lost . they found their seats and waited for the show to start .

the show was about a princess and a dragon . sara and ben liked the princess . she was pretty and kind . they did not like the dragon . he was big and mean . he wanted to eat the princess . sara and ben were scared .

the princess had a friend , a knight . he was brave and strong . he came to save the princess from the dragon . he had a sword and a shield . he fought the dragon . sara and ben cheered for the knight .

but the dragon was too fast and too smart . he breathed fire and burned the knight 's shield . he bit the knight 's sword and broke it . he grabbed the knight and threw him away . he roared and laughed . he took the princess and flew away . sara and ben were sad .

the show was over . the people clapped and left . sara and ben did not clap . they did not like the show . they wanted the knight to win and the princess to be safe . they looked at mom and dad . they saw that mom and dad were frowning too . they hugged mom and dad and cried . they wished they had not gone to the theater . ben had a parrot named polly . polly was a good parrot . she could talk and sing and make funny noises . ben loved polly very much .

one day , ben and polly were playing in the backyard . ben threw a ball and polly flew after it . but polly flew too fast and hit a tree . polly fell to the ground and cried . ben ran to polly and picked her up .

" polly , are you okay ? " ben asked . he saw that polly had a cut on her wing . it was red and hurt . ben felt sad and scared .

" polly hurt , polly hurt ! " polly said . she was in pain and scared too .

ben hugged polly and said , " do n't worry , polly . i will help you . we will go to the vet . the vet will make you better . you are my best friend , polly . i love you . "

ben took polly inside and told his mom what happened . his mom said , " oh , poor polly . let 's go to the vet right away . he will fix polly 's wing . you are a good boy , ben . you care for polly . "

ben and his mom got in the car and drove to the vet . the vet was a nice man . he looked at polly 's wing and said , " polly has a small cut . it is not bad . i will clean it and put a bandage on it . polly will be fine . she just needs some rest and love . "

the vet cleaned polly 's wing and put a bandage on it . he gave polly a treat and said , " you are a brave parrot , polly . you will heal soon . you have a good friend , ben . he loves you . "

polly smiled and said , " thank you , vet . thank you , ben . i love you too . "

ben and his mom took polly home . ben put polly in her cage and gave her some water and food . he said , " polly , you are my best friend . i am sorry you got hurt . i will never quit playing with you . i will always be with you . "

polly said , " ben , you are my best friend too . i am happy you helped me . i will never quit talking to you . i will always love you . " tom and lily were at the beach with their mom and dad . they liked to play in the sand and splash in the water . they saw a big boat with a funny name : ancient shark . they asked their dad what it meant .

" it 's a boat that looks for old things under the sea . things that were there a long time ago , before we were born . like pots and coins and bones . they are called ancient things , " dad explained .

" can we go on the boat , dad ? please ? " tom and lily begged .

" sorry , kids . the boat is not for visitors . it 's only for people who work there . they have special tools and machines to find the ancient things . like this one , " dad pointed to a hose that was attached to the boat . " it can spray water very hard and make the sand move away . "

tom and lily were curious . they wanted to see how the hose worked . they waited until dad was busy talking to mom and sneaked to the boat . they climbed on the deck and found the hose . tom turned the knob and the hose started to spray water everywhere .

" wow , this is fun ! " tom shouted .

" be careful , tom ! you might break something ! " lily warned .

but tom did not listen . he sprayed the water at the boat , at the sand , at the sky . he sprayed the water at a big metal box that was on the boat . the box had a lock on it , but the water was so strong that it broke the lock and opened the box .

inside the box , there was something that made tom and lily scream . it was a big , gray , scary shark . it had sharp teeth and a fin . it was not alive , but it looked very real . it was an ancient shark that the boat people had found under the sea .

" help ! help ! " tom and lily cried .

the boat people heard them and ran to the deck . they saw the hose , the box , and the shark . they were very angry .

" what are you doing here ? how did you get on the boat ? do you know how much this shark is worth ? it 's a rare fossil ! you could have damaged it ! " one of them yelled .

tom and lily were very sorry . they did not mean to cause trouble . they just wanted to see the hose . they apologized to the boat people and ran back to their dad and mom . they told them what happened and promised to never go on the boat again .

dad and mom were not happy . they scolded tom and lily for being naughty and dangerous . they said they had to respect other people 's work and property . they said they had to be more careful and listen to them .

tom and lily felt bad . they learned their lesson . they said they were sorry and hugged their dad and mom . they decided to play in the sand and splash in the water instead . they did not want to see the ancient shark ever again . lily and tom were playing in the park with their ball . they liked to kick the ball to each other and run after it . they were having fun and laughing .

but then a big dog came . the dog was barking and running towards them . lily and tom were scared . they thought the dog was a threat . they dropped the ball and ran away .

" help ! help ! " they shouted . " the dog is coming ! "

a man heard them and came to see . he was the dog 's owner . he saw the ball and picked it up . he called the dog and gave it the ball .

" do n't be afraid , " he said to lily and tom . " the dog is not a threat . he just wanted to play with the ball . he is friendly and gentle . see , he is wagging his tail . "

lily and tom stopped running and looked at the dog . the dog was licking the ball and wagging his tail . he did not look angry or mean . he looked happy and playful .

" can we play with him ? " lily asked .

" sure , you can , " the man said . " his name is rex . he likes to share his ball . you can throw it and he will fetch it . he is a good dog . "

lily and tom smiled . they went closer to the dog and petted him . he licked their hands and nuzzled their faces . he was soft and warm .

" hello , rex , " they said . " we are sorry we were scared of you . you are a nice dog . "

