mom hugged them back and said , " you are welcome , my loves . you are the best , too . " lily liked to play in the pool with her plastic toys . she had a plastic duck , a plastic fish and a plastic frog . she liked to make them swim and dive in the water . she pretended they were her friends and talked to them .

one day , lily saw a big plastic ball in the pool . it was red and shiny and had stars on it . lily wanted to play with the ball . she asked her mom if she could have it . her mom said yes , but she had to be careful . the ball was very big and could float away .

