the wolf opened the cave and let lila and ben out . they gave him some of their cookies and pies , and they ate together and talked . they became friends and learned to share and respect each other . they never forgot the lesson that the wolf taught them .

the moral of the story is : you should share and respect others who need help . you should not be rude and mean to anyone . you should not judge others by their appearance . you should be kind and forgiving . you should make friends with different kinds of people . lila and ben were twins who liked to play with their toys . but they did not like to clean their room . they left their toys everywhere and made a big mess . their mom was not happy . she said , " you have to clean your room before you can go outside . cleaning is good for you and your toys . "

