they hugged and kissed and went home . they had a fun and special day . they learned a lot and made a new friend . they dreamed of the butterfly and the log and the pond . they were happy and grateful . the end . tim and sue are twins . they like to play together . they have a big box of toys in their room . sometimes they share , sometimes they fight .

