lily was happy . she smiled and hugged mom . she said , " thank you , mom , thank you . you are the best mom ever . "

mom and lily went into the shop . mom paid for the doll and gave it to lily . lily hugged the doll and said , " hello , doll . i 'm lily . you are my new friend . "

mom and lily left the shop . they walked to the bank . lily held the doll in her arms . she did not notice the man who followed them . he had a mask and a gun . he wanted to rob the bank . he saw mom 's purse . he thought it had a lot of money . he decided to take it .

he ran after mom and lily . he grabbed mom 's purse . he said , " give me that . it 's mine now . "

mom screamed . she tried to get her purse back . she said , " no , no . leave us alone . help , help . "

lily was scared . she dropped the doll . she cried . she said , " mom , mom . what 's happening ? "

the man pushed mom to the ground . he ran away with the purse . he did not see the police car that was coming . the police saw him . they chased him . they caught him . they took him to jail .

mom and lily were safe . the police gave mom her purse back . they said , " are you okay , ma'am ? we 're sorry this happened to you . he 's a bad man . he wo n't hurt you anymore . "

mom thanked the police . she hugged lily . she said , " we 're okay , sweetie . we 're okay . do n't worry . he 's gone now . "

lily looked for her doll . she saw it on the sidewalk . she ran to get it . she said , " doll , doll . i 'm sorry i dropped you . are you okay ? "

the doll was okay . it had a small tear on its dress . lily did not mind . she said , " it 's okay , doll . you are still pretty . i love you . "

mom and lily went home . they did not go to the bank . they did not need to . they had each other . they were happy . lila was sad . she wanted to play with her friends , but they were far away . she could not see them or hug them . she could only talk to them on the network . the network was a big screen that showed their faces and voices . but it was not the same as being with them .

she sighed and looked out the window . she saw a wide road with many cars . she saw a park with trees and swings . she saw a shop with toys and books . she wished she could go outside and have fun . but she could not . she had to stay inside and be safe .

she heard a knock on the door . she ran to open it . she saw her grandma and grandpa . they were wearing masks and gloves . they smiled and waved at her . they had a big bag with them .

" hello , lila ! " they said . " we have a surprise for you ! "

lila was happy . she loved her grandma and grandpa . she wondered what the surprise was . she hoped it was something fun .

they came inside and put the bag on the table . they took off their masks and gloves . they hugged and kissed lila . they said they missed her a lot .

" we have something for you , lila , " grandma said . " we know you are bored and lonely . so we brought you some friends ! "

she opened the bag and took out some stuffed animals . there was a bear , a rabbit , a cat , and a dog . they were soft and cute . they had bright eyes and noses .

lila gasped and clapped her hands . she loved stuffed animals . she hugged them and thanked her grandma and grandpa . she said they were the best friends ever .

she put them on the couch and played with them . she gave them names and voices . she made them talk and laugh . she pretended they were having a tea party .

she looked at the network and saw her friends . they were also playing with their toys . they waved and smiled at her . they said they liked her new friends .

lila smiled and waved back . she said she liked their toys too . she said she was happy to see them . she said she hoped they could play together soon .

she sighed and looked at her grandma and grandpa . they were watching her and smiling . they said they were proud of her . they said they loved her very much .

lila felt warm and cozy . she had her family and her friends . she had her stuffed animals and her network . she was not sad anymore . she was happy . tom and anna are friends . they live on the same street . they like to play in the park and ride their bikes . they are happy .

one day , tom gets a new bike . it is big and red and shiny . he shows it to anna . anna likes the bike , but she feels jealous . she wants a new bike too . her bike is small and blue and old .

tom says , " do you want to try my bike ? " anna says , " no , thank you . " she is angry and sad . she does not want to play with tom . she goes home .

tom does not understand . he likes anna . he wants to share his bike . he follows anna to her house . he knocks on the door . anna 's mom opens the door . she sees tom and his bike .

she says , " hello , tom . what a nice bike you have . did you grow a lot ? " tom says , " yes , i did . my dad bought me this bike for my birthday . it is fun to ride . " anna 's mom says , " that 's wonderful . happy birthday , tom . "

she calls anna . she says , " anna , come here . tom is here . he wants to play with you . he has a new bike . maybe you can try it . " anna comes to the door . she sees tom and his bike . she feels sorry . she was not nice to tom . she says , " hi , tom . i 'm sorry . i was jealous of your bike . it is very cool . can i try it ? " tom says , " sure , you can . i do n't mind . you are my friend . " anna says , " thank you , tom . you are my friend too . " they smile . they hug . they go to the park . they take turns riding the bike . they have fun . they are happy . lila liked to solve puzzles . she had many puzzles with animals , shapes , and colors . she was good at finding the right pieces and putting them together . she wanted a new puzzle that was harder and more fun .

one day , her mom gave her a big box with a picture of the ocean on it . lila was happy and excited . she opened the box and saw many blue pieces . she thought it would be easy to make the ocean . she started to sort the pieces by color and shape .

but soon , lila was confused . she could not find any pieces that matched . all the pieces looked the same . she tried to fit them together , but they did not work . she felt frustrated and sad . she did not like this puzzle . she wanted to give up .

her mom saw her and came to help . she smiled and said , " this puzzle is different , lila . it is not like your other puzzles . it is a special puzzle that has a secret . do you want to know the secret ? "

lila nodded . she wanted to know the secret . maybe it would help her solve the puzzle .

her mom said , " the secret is that the pieces are not only blue . they have other colors hidden under the blue . you have to scratch the blue with your fingernail to see the other colors . then you can find the pieces that match . do you want to try ? "

lila was curious . she scratched a piece with her fingernail and saw a green color . she scratched another piece and saw a yellow color . she looked at the box and saw that the ocean had many colors , not only blue . there were fish , plants , rocks , and shells . she realized that the puzzle was not only the ocean , but also what was in the ocean .

she smiled and said , " this puzzle is amazing , mom . thank you for giving it to me . i want to solve it and see the ocean . "

her mom hugged her and said , " you 're welcome , lila . i 'm glad you like it . i 'm sure you can solve it and see the ocean . you are a smart and brave girl . you can do anything you set your mind to . "

lila felt happy and proud . she scratched more pieces and found more colors . she started to put them together and see the ocean . she did not give up . she solved the puzzle . ben and sam are brothers . they like to play with their dad 's tools . they find a big box of tools in the garage . they open the box and see many shiny things .

" look , a hammer ! " ben says . he grabs the hammer and swings it in the air .

" i want the hammer ! " sam says . he tries to take the hammer from ben .

" no , it 's mine ! " ben says . he holds the hammer tight .

they start to fight over the hammer . they pull and push and shout .

" stop ! " their dad says . he comes into the garage and sees the boys . he is angry .

" what are you doing with my tools ? " he asks . he takes the hammer from ben .

" these are not toys . they are dangerous . you could hurt yourself or each other . "

he looks at the box and sees a dull knife . he picks it up and shows it to the boys .

" see this knife ? it is dull . it ca n't cut anything . it is useless . do you want this tool ? "

the boys shake their heads . they do n't want the dull knife . they want the shiny hammer .

" then you have to learn how to use tools properly . and you have to share and be nice to each other . do you understand ? "

the boys nod . they are sorry . they hug their dad and say sorry .

" ok , i forgive you . but you have to promise me to never play with my tools again without asking me . and if you want to learn about tools , i can teach you some day . deal ? "

the boys agree . they say deal . they smile and go back to the house . they decide to play with their blocks instead . they make a big tower and a bridge . they have fun . they are happy . sam and ben are friends . they like to play with cars and blocks . one day , they go to the park with their moms . they see a big slide . they want to go on the slide .

they run to the slide , but there is a long line of kids . sam and ben have to wait . they feel bored and sad . they want to go on the slide now .

" can we go first ? " sam asks a big boy in front of them .

" no , you ca n't . you have to wait like everyone else , " the big boy says . he is tough and mean . he pushes sam and ben back .

sam and ben feel angry and scared . they do n't like the big boy . they look at their moms . their moms see what is happening . they come to help sam and ben .

" hey , do n't push them . they are smaller than you . you have to be nice and share , " sam 's mom says to the big boy .

" yeah , that 's not fair . you have to wait your turn like everyone else , " ben 's mom says to the big boy .

the big boy feels ashamed and sorry . he says sorry to sam and ben . he lets them go in front of him . sam and ben feel happy and grateful . they say thank you to the big boy . they go on the slide . they have fun . they make friends with the big boy . they play with cars and blocks . they have a good day at the park . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park and look for treasure . one day , they found a shiny box under a big tree . they opened it and saw many pretty things inside .

" wow , look at this ! " lily said , holding a necklace with a blue stone . " it is so shiny and blue . i want it ! "

" no , i want it ! " ben said , grabbing the necklace from lily . " it is mine . you can have something else . "

they started to fight over the necklace . they pulled and tugged and shouted . the necklace broke and the blue stone fell to the ground .

" oh no ! " lily cried . " you broke it ! you broke the treasure ! "

" i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry ! " ben said . " maybe we can fix it . let me see . "

he picked up the blue stone and tried to put it back on the necklace . but he dropped it and it rolled away . a big dog saw it and ran after it . the dog caught the blue stone in his mouth and ran away .

" hey , come back ! " lily and ben yelled . " that is our treasure ! "

they chased the dog , but he was too fast . he disappeared behind a fence . lily and ben stopped and looked at each other . they were sad and angry .

" you are a bad friend ! " lily said . " you broke the treasure and lost it . i do n't want to play with you anymore ! "

" you are a bad friend too ! " ben said . " you were greedy and selfish . you wanted the treasure all for yourself ! "

they turned away and walked in different directions . they did not talk to each other again . they lost their treasure and their friendship . they were very unhappy . lily and ben were twins who liked to visit their grandma on the farm . grandma had a big patch of pumpkins that she grew every year . she said they were good for pies and soup and carving faces .

one day , lily and ben wanted to help grandma pick the pumpkins . they put on their boots and hats and followed her to the patch . the sun was very hot and the wind was very harsh . grandma said they had to be careful not to hurt the pumpkins or themselves .

lily saw a big , round pumpkin that looked perfect . she ran to it and tried to lift it . but it was too heavy and she fell down . the pumpkin rolled away and hit a scarecrow . the scarecrow fell over and scared a crow . the crow flew away and knocked over a bucket . the bucket spilled water on a cat . the cat hissed and scratched ben , who was nearby .

ben cried and lily cried . grandma came and hugged them . she said it was okay , they were just accidents . she said they could still help her by washing the pumpkins and making faces on them . she said they would have fun and forget the bad things .

lily and ben smiled and nodded . they followed grandma to the house . they washed the pumpkins and made funny faces on them . they laughed and forgot the sun and the wind and the scarecrow and the crow and the bucket and the cat . they were happy to visit their grandma and her patch of pumpkins . ben likes to play basketball . he has a big ball that he can bounce and throw . he goes to the park with his mom and dad . he sees a hoop and a net . he wants to try to put the ball in the net .

he sees a girl who is also playing basketball . she has a small ball that she can bounce and throw . she is good at putting the ball in the net . ben wants to play with her . he says , " hi , i am ben . can i play with you ? "

the girl says , " hi , i am mia . sure , you can play with me . do you want to take turns or play together ? "

ben says , " i want to play together . we can help each other . "

mia says , " ok , let 's play together . we can pass the ball and shoot the ball . "

ben and mia play basketball . they have fun . they are good at sharing and helping . they are warm and happy . they make a new friend .

the moral value of the story is that playing together is better than playing alone , and that sharing and helping are good ways to make friends . the foreshadowing or setup and payoff is that ben sees a hoop and a net , which leads to him meeting mia and playing basketball with her . lily and tom were twins . they liked to play with their toys in the living room . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big white bear . the bear was soft and cuddly , and they named him snowy .

one day , mom said , " lily and tom , i have to go to the store . be good and do n't make a mess . i will be back soon . " she gave them a kiss and left .

lily and tom nodded and said , " okay , mom . " they continued to play with snowy . they pretended he was a king , a pirate , and a superhero . they had a lot of fun .

but then , tom had an idea . he saw a bottle of red paint on the table . he said , " lily , let 's make snowy more colorful . he is too white . red is a nice color . "

lily said , " no , tom . that is a bad idea . mom will be mad . and snowy will be sad . he likes to be white . white is a useful color . it goes with everything . "

tom said , " no , lily . you are silly . red is a better color . it is bright and happy . and snowy will be happy too . he will look like a fire truck or a strawberry . come on , let 's do it . "

lily said , " no , tom . stop . do n't spoil snowy . he is our friend . we love him . "

but tom did not listen . he grabbed the bottle of paint and poured it all over snowy . the paint dripped and splashed on the bear , the carpet , and the couch . snowy was no longer white . he was red and wet and sticky .

lily cried , " tom , what did you do ? you ruined snowy . and the living room . mom will be very angry . and snowy will be very sad . you are a bad brother . "

tom looked at what he did . he felt sorry . he said , " lily , i 'm sorry . i was wrong . i thought it would be fun . but it was not . it was a big mistake . i 'm sorry , snowy . i 'm sorry , lily . i 'm sorry , mom . "

lily said , " tom , you have to fix this . you have to clean up . and you have to say sorry to snowy and mom . and you have to be nice to snowy . he is still our friend . he is still our bear . "

tom said , " okay , lily . i will . i will try to make it better . i hope snowy and mom will forgive me . and i hope you will too . "

they hugged each other and snowy . they got some towels and water and tried to clean up the mess . they hoped mom would not be too mad . they learned a lesson . they learned to be careful with their toys and their paint . and they learned to love their white bear . lily and max were brother and sister . they liked to go on trips with their mom and dad . one day , they went to the zoo . they saw many animals , like lions , monkeys , and giraffes .

lily wanted to see the penguins . she asked her mom , " can we go to the penguins , please ? " her mom said , " yes , we can . but first , we have to wait for your dad and max . they are looking at the snakes . "

lily did not like to wait . she was bored . she saw a playful squirrel near a tree . she ran after it . she did not listen to her mom , who called her name .

max saw lily run away . he was worried . he told his dad , " dad , lily is gone . she chased a squirrel . " his dad said , " oh no , we have to find her . come on , max , let 's go . "

they looked for lily everywhere . they asked the zookeepers , the other visitors , and the animals . but no one knew where lily was . lily was lost . she was scared . she cried .

then , she heard a familiar voice . it was her mom . she ran to her and hugged her . her mom was happy to see her , but also angry . she said , " lily , why did you run away ? you could have been hurt . you made us all worry . you have to stay with us on trips . do you understand ? "

lily nodded . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to see the penguins . but i saw a squirrel and i forgot . i wo n't do it again . i love you , mom . "

her mom said , " i love you too , lily . but you have to be careful and listen . the zoo is a big place . you can get lost easily . next time , ask me before you go anywhere . ok ? "

lily said , " ok , mom . can we go to the penguins now ? "

her mom smiled . she said , " yes , we can . but first , let 's find your dad and max . they are looking for you too . "

they found them near the snake house . they hugged and said sorry . then , they went to the penguins together . they had fun watching them swim and slide . lily learned her lesson . she never ran away again . she always asked her mom before she did anything . she was a good girl . sara and ben are playing with blocks . they want to build a big tower . sara has a ruler . she likes to measure the blocks . she says , " this block is ten inches long . this block is eight inches long . this block is six inches long . "

ben does not have a ruler . he does not like to measure the blocks . he says , " i do n't care how long the blocks are . i just want to stack them up . look , my tower is taller than yours . "

sara is not happy . she says , " your tower is not strong . it will fall down . you need to measure the blocks and make them even . then your tower will be strong and tall . "

ben does not listen . he keeps stacking the blocks . he says , " my tower is the best . it is the highest . it can touch the sky . "

suddenly , the tower falls down . the blocks make a loud noise . they scatter all over the floor . ben is sad . he says , " oh no , my tower is gone . it was so beautiful . now it is broken . "

sara feels sorry for ben . she says , " do n't cry , ben . we can build another tower . we can work together . we can measure the blocks and make them even . we can also write a message on the top block . we can say , ' this is our tower . we made it with love . ' "

ben smiles . he says , " thank you , sara . you are a good friend . i like your idea . let 's build another tower . let 's write a message . let 's make it with love . "

sara and ben hug . they pick up the blocks . they start to build another tower . they measure the blocks and make them even . they write a message on the top block . they make it with love . they are happy . jill and ben wanted to make a cake for mom . they put on aprons and went to the kitchen . they saw a big bowl of chocolate on the table . it looked yummy .

" can we use this chocolate for the cake ? " jill asked .

