they put the bowl in the microwave and turned it on . they did not know how long to melt it for . they waited and waited . they smelled something bad .

" oh no , the chocolate is burning ! " jill cried .

they opened the microwave and saw a black mess . smoke came out . the fire alarm beeped . mom ran into the kitchen .

" what have you done ? " mom shouted . " you ruined the chocolate and the microwave ! and look at this mess ! you are not tidy at all ! "

she was very angry . she took off their aprons and sent them to their room . they did not get to make a cake for mom . they felt sad and sorry . lily liked to climb . she climbed on chairs , on tables , on beds , on trees . she climbed everywhere she could . one day , she saw a big hill with a track on it . the track was green and had many flowers . lily wanted to climb the hill and see the flowers .

she asked her mom if she could go . her mom said yes , but she had to be careful and stay on the track . lily said okay and put on her shoes and hat . she took her water bottle and her teddy bear . she was ready to climb .

she started to walk on the track . it was not too hard , but it was not too easy . she saw many things on the way . she saw birds , and bugs , and rocks , and sticks . she picked some flowers and gave them to her teddy bear . she said hello to everyone she met . she was having fun .

she climbed and climbed until she reached the top of the hill . she was very happy . she saw the whole world from there . she saw the sky , and the sun , and the clouds . she saw the trees , and the grass , and the river . she saw her house , and her mom , and her dog . she waved to them . she felt very big .

she sat on the grass and drank some water . she hugged her teddy bear and thanked him for coming with her . she looked at the flowers and smiled . she was proud of herself . she had climbed the hill and seen the track . she had done it . she was a climber . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big white slide . they want to try it .

