but ben does not listen . he takes the file and opens it . he takes out some papers and starts to cut them with scissors . he makes snowflakes and stars and hearts .

" ben , stop ! " mia says . " you are making a mess . mom will be angry . put the papers back in the file . "

but ben does not listen . he keeps cutting and cutting . he laughs and says , " this is fun . look at my art . do you want to join me ? "

mia shakes her head . she is scared . she says , " no , thank you . i will stay here . i will not touch the file . i will wait for mom . "

soon , mom comes back . she sees the file and the papers . she sees ben and mia . she is very angry . she says , " ben , what have you done ? you have ruined my file . this file is important . it has my work . how could you do this ? "

ben is quiet . he is sorry . he says , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to play with the papers . i thought they were pretty . i did n't mean to ruin your file . "

mom says , " sorry is not enough , ben . you have to learn to respect other people 's things . you have to ask before you touch . you have to be careful and clean . you have to say sorry and help me fix the file . "

ben nods . he says , " i 'm sorry , mom . i will help you fix the file . i will not touch your things without asking . i will be careful and clean . i will respect your work . "

mom says , " thank you , ben . i appreciate your help . i forgive you . but do n't do it again . "

ben says , " i wo n't , mom . i promise . "

mom looks at mia . she says , " mia , thank you for staying here . thank you for not touching the file . thank you for being a good friend . you did the right thing . "

mia smiles . she says , " you 're welcome , mom . i 'm glad you 're not angry with me . i 'm sorry for ben . i tried to stop him . i hope you can fix the file . "

mom says , " i can , mia . do n't worry . it will take some time , but i can do it . come on , let 's go to the kitchen . i have some cookies for you . you can share them with ben . he needs a hug . "

ben and mia follow mom . they hug and eat cookies . they are sorry and happy . they learn a lesson . they respect mom 's work . they respect each other . they are good friends . tom and lily were playing in the garden . they saw a big jar of powder on the table . they wanted to see what it was .

