" sure , here you go , " tom said . he gave her a big handful of powder .

but he was not nice . he pinched her hand hard . lily cried out in pain .

" ow , tom , that hurts ! why did you pinch me ? " lily said .

" because i wanted to make you cry . it 's funny , " tom said . he laughed .

lily was very sad and angry . she threw the powder in his face . tom screamed and rubbed his eyes .

" ow , lily , that hurts ! why did you throw powder at me ? " tom said .

" because you pinched me . it 's not funny , " lily said . she ran away .

tom was very sad and scared . he could not see well . the powder was in his eyes . it burned and stung . he cried for help .

but no one came . the jar of powder was not for playing . it was for cleaning . it was very strong and bad for the eyes . tom had made a big mistake . he wished he had not pinched lily . he wished he had been jolly and nice . but it was too late . he had hurt himself and his friend . he was very sorry . lily liked to draw with her crayons . she had many colors and made pretty pictures on paper . one day , she saw a shiny thing on the table . it was a knife that her uncle used to cut bread . lily wanted to use it to draw too . she thought it would make sharp lines .

she reached for the knife , but her uncle saw her and stopped her . " no , lily , that is not for drawing . that is a knife . it is very sharp and can hurt you . look , it can cut the bread , but it can also cut your finger . ouch ! " he showed her how the knife made a slice in the bread and a small cut on his finger . he put a band - aid on his finger and gave lily a hug .

lily felt sorry for her uncle . she did not want to hurt him or herself . she said , " i 'm sorry , uncle . i did not know . i just wanted to draw with the shiny thing . can i have a crayon instead ? " her uncle smiled and said , " of course , lily . here , you can have this red crayon . it is your favorite color , right ? you can draw anything you want with it , but be careful not to break it . it is not sharp like the knife , but it can still make a mess . "

lily took the crayon and thanked her uncle . she went back to her paper and drew a heart for him . she wrote , " i love you , uncle " with the crayon . she gave him the picture and he put it on the fridge . he said , " i love you too , lily . you are very sweet and smart . you learned a good lesson today . knives are not for drawing , they are for cutting . crayons are for drawing , they are for making art . and hugs are for loving , they are for making happy . "

lily felt happy and proud . she learned something new and made her uncle happy . she also learned that drawing with a knife would be uncomfortable and dangerous . she decided to always use crayons for drawing and to always listen to her uncle . he was very kind and wise . she gave him another hug and said , " you are the best uncle ever . " he said , " you are the best niece ever . " they laughed and drew some more pictures together . lily and max were hungry . they wanted to eat a sandwich . but there was only one sandwich left in the kitchen .

" i saw it first ! " lily said . " it is mine ! "

" no , it is mine ! " max said . " i am bigger and stronger ! "

they both grabbed the sandwich and pulled hard . the sandwich broke in half . some cheese and ham fell on the floor .

" oh no ! " lily and max said . " now the sandwich is ruined ! "

they looked at each other and felt sad . they did not want to fight . they wanted to share .

" sorry , lily , " max said . " you can have the bigger half . "

" sorry , max , " lily said . " you can have the cheese and ham . "

they hugged and smiled . they ate their sandwich together . it was still tasty .

mom came into the kitchen . she saw lily and max eating their sandwich . she saw the cheese and ham on the floor . she was not happy .

" what happened here ? " mom asked . " who made this mess ? "

