sam feels sad . he wants to see the world and make new friends . he looks at the map and points to a blue shape .

" what about this nation ? it is big and blue and has stars . can we go there ? " he asks .

lily smiles . " that is our nation . it is called america . we live here . we can go anywhere we want in america . we can see mountains and rivers and cities and farms . we can meet many people who speak our language and share our flag . we can do many things in america . "

sam feels happy . he likes his nation . he hugs lily and says , " you are right . america is cool . let us play america . you can be the president and i can be the astronaut . we can do anything we want in america . " lily and ben are twins . they like to play in the garden . one day , they see a big basket of fruit on the table . they want to eat some fruit .

" can we have some fruit , mom ? " lily asks .

" not now , dear . it is almost time for lunch . you can have some fruit after lunch , " mom says .

but lily and ben are very hungry . they wait until mom goes inside . then they run to the table and grab some fruit . they hide behind the bushes and eat the fruit .

" yum , this is good ! " ben says .

" yes , it is . but we have to be quiet . mom will be angry if she finds out , " lily says .

they eat more fruit . they eat apples , bananas , oranges , and grapes . they eat so much that they feel full and sleepy . they lie down on the grass and close their eyes .

mom comes out of the house . she sees the empty basket and the fruit peels on the ground . she looks around and sees lily and ben behind the bushes . they are lying on the grass and snoring .

" oh , you naughty twins ! you ate all the fruit ! " mom says .

she is not very angry . she smiles and shakes her head . she covers them with a blanket and lets them sleep . she thinks they are cute and funny . she loves them very much . lila and tom were playing in the kitchen . they wanted to make a cake for mom . they found some flour , some eggs , some milk and some sugar . they mixed them in a big bowl .

" can i stir the cake ? " asked tom .

" ok , but be careful , " said lila . " do n't spill it . "

tom took the spoon and stirred the cake . he saw a small jar on the counter . it had a picture of a cow on it . he thought it was butter .

" look , lila , i found some butter , " he said . " let 's put it in the cake . "

he opened the jar and poured some of it in the bowl . lila looked at the jar . it was not butter . it was salt .

" tom , no ! " she cried . " that 's not butter , that 's salt . you ruined the cake . "

tom looked at the jar . he saw the word " salt " . he felt bad .

" i 'm sorry , lila , " he said . " i did n't know . can we fix it ? "

lila shook her head . " no , we ca n't . the cake will be sour and yucky . mom wo n't like it . "

she started to cry . tom hugged her .

" i 'm sorry , lila , " he said again . " i love you . maybe we can make another cake . "

lila sniffed . " i love you too , tom , " she said . " maybe we can . but first , we have to clean up this mess . "

they took the bowl and the jar to the sink . they washed them with water and soap . they wiped the counter with a cloth . they threw away the eggshells and the paper . they hoped mom would n't notice .

they decided to make another cake . this time , they asked dad for help . he showed them how to measure the ingredients and how to use the oven . he also gave them some chocolate chips and some sprinkles . they made a delicious cake for mom . she was very happy and proud . she gave them a big hug and a kiss . she said they were the best bakers in the world . lila and tom smiled . they learned a lesson . they learned to read the labels and to yield to each other . they also learned that salt is not butter . lily and ben are playing in the park . they find a big box under a tree . they open the box and see a radio inside . the radio is old and dirty , but it has many buttons and colors .

" wow , a radio ! " lily says . " maybe it can play music . "

she picks up the radio and tries to turn it on . but nothing happens . the radio is silent and still .

" maybe it needs new batteries , " ben says . " or maybe it is broken . "

he takes the radio from lily and shakes it hard . he hopes to make it work . but the radio only makes a loud noise . it sounds like a bee .

" ouch , that hurts my ears ! " lily says . she covers her ears with her hands .

ben drops the radio on the ground . he is scared of the noise . the radio stops making the noise , but it starts to smoke .

" oh no , the radio is on fire ! " ben says . he and lily run away from the box . they look for help .

a man sees them and comes to them . he is a firefighter . he has a big hat and a hose . he sees the smoke and the fire . he puts out the fire with water .

" are you kids okay ? " he asks . " what were you doing with that old radio ? "

lily and ben tell him about the box and the radio . they say they are sorry for making the fire .

the firefighter smiles . he is not angry . he is glad they are safe .

" that was a very old and dangerous radio , " he says . " it had wires and chemicals inside . you should never shake or play with things like that . you could get hurt or start a bigger fire . "

he shows them his truck and his tools . he tells them about his job and how he helps people .

lily and ben are amazed . they think the firefighter is very brave and cool . they thank him for saving them and the park .

" you are very lucky kids , " he says . " you learned a valuable lesson today . and you made a new friend . "

he gives them each a sticker and a hug . he tells them to be careful and have fun .

lily and ben wave goodbye to him . they are happy and grateful . they think they are lucky too . they learned a lot from the radio . but they decide to play with something else . tom and lily are friends . they like to play with toys . today , tom will visit lily at her house . he brings his toy car and his toy bear .

" hello , tom ! " lily says when she opens the door . " come in , come in ! i have many toys to show you ! "

tom and lily go to lily 's room . they see a big toy box with many toys inside . lily takes out her toy doll and her toy train . tom and lily share their toys and play together . they make the toys talk and move . they have fun .

after a while , tom and lily feel sleepy . they yawn and rub their eyes . they put their toys back in the toy box .

" tom , do you want to take a nap with me ? " lily asks . " we can sleep on my bed . it is soft and warm . "

" okay , lily , " tom says . " i am sleepy too . but can i bring my toy bear ? he helps me sleep . "

" sure , tom , " lily says . " you can bring your toy bear . i will bring my toy doll . they can be friends too . "

tom and lily go to lily 's bed . they hug their toys and snuggle under the blanket . they close their eyes and fall asleep . they dream of playing with toys again . lily and ben love to pick blueberries in the summer . they go with mom and dad to the big field where the blueberry bushes grow . they each have a basket to fill with the juicy , sweet berries .

lily and ben run from bush to bush , looking for the biggest and ripest blueberries . they pop some in their mouths and some in their baskets . they laugh and sing as they pick .

but then , lily sees something that makes her pause . she sees a fat , furry animal hiding under a bush . it has a black nose , a long tail , and sharp teeth . it is a raccoon !

lily is scared of the raccoon . she drops her basket and runs to mom and dad . she cries , " mom , dad , there is a raccoon ! it wants to eat our blueberries ! "

mom and dad come to see what is wrong . they see the raccoon , too . they are not scared . they say , " do n't worry , lily . the raccoon is not going to hurt you . he is just hungry , like you . he likes blueberries , too . let 's share some with him . "

they take some blueberries from their baskets and toss them to the raccoon . the raccoon sniffs them and then eats them happily . he wags his tail and makes a soft noise . he says thank you in his own way .

lily and ben smile . they are not scared anymore . they think the raccoon is cute and funny . they say , " you 're welcome , raccoon . enjoy the blueberries . we have enough for everyone . "

they pick up their baskets and go back to picking blueberries . they have a fun and friendly day in the field . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big red pepper on a bench . lily wanted to eat it , but ben said no .

" that pepper is not for us . it is for someone else . maybe it is spicy and will hurt our mouths . let 's play with the ball instead , " ben said .

but lily did not listen . she was curious and hungry . she took the pepper and bit it . it was very spicy and hot . lily felt a fire in her mouth and tears in her eyes . she spit out the pepper and shouted .

" ow , ow , ow ! this pepper is bad ! it hurts me ! help , help ! " lily cried .

ben ran to her and tried to help . he gave her some water and hugged her . he was sorry for his friend . he wanted to make her feel better .

but then , a man came to the bench . he was angry and scary . he had a big beard and a loud voice . he saw the pepper on the ground and lily and ben .

" hey , you little thieves ! that was my pepper ! you stole it from me ! how dare you ! i will teach you a lesson ! " the man shouted .

he grabbed the pepper and threw it at lily and ben . it hit lily on the head and ben on the chest . they both fell down and cried . the man laughed and walked away .

lily and ben were hurt and sad . they wished they had never seen the pepper . they learned that some things are different and not good for them . they also learned to listen to each other and not take what is not theirs . they hoped someone would come and help them . but no one did . they were alone and scared in the park . the end . lily and ben were going to visit their grandma . they had to pack their bags with clothes and toys . lily was curious about what grandma had in her house . she wanted to see her books , her dolls , and her garden . ben was more interested in playing with grandma 's dog , rex .

" are you ready , lily ? " ben asked . he had already packed his bag and was waiting by the door .

" not yet , ben . i have to pack my favorite teddy bear . he likes to travel with me , " lily said . she looked for her teddy bear in her room , but she could not find him . she felt sad and worried .

" where is teddy ? " she asked herself . she looked under the bed , in the closet , and in the drawers . she did not see teddy anywhere .

" maybe he is hiding , " ben said . he came to help lily look for teddy . he was a good brother . he liked to make lily happy .

they searched all over the room , but they still could not find teddy . lily was about to cry . she loved teddy very much . she did not want to leave him behind .

" maybe he is in the living room , " ben said . he had an idea . he took lily 's hand and led her to the living room . there , on the sofa , they saw teddy . he was sitting next to a big suitcase .

" teddy ! " lily exclaimed . she ran to the sofa and hugged teddy . she was so happy to see him . she kissed his nose and whispered in his ear . " i missed you , teddy . i 'm glad you 're here . "

teddy smiled . he had a surprise for lily . he opened the suitcase and showed her what was inside . it was full of books , dolls , and flowers . they were all gifts from grandma . she had sent them ahead of time for lily and ben .

" wow ! " lily said . she was amazed by the gifts . she thanked grandma in her heart . she was very excited to see her .

" look , ben . grandma sent us these . are n't they wonderful ? " lily said . she showed ben the gifts . ben was also happy . he saw a ball , a car , and a bone . they were for him and rex .

" awesome ! " ben said . he thanked grandma too . he was eager to play with rex .

lily and ben packed their bags with their clothes , toys , and gifts . they were ready to go . they said goodbye to their mom and dad . they got in the car with teddy and drove to grandma 's house . they felt a victory . they had found teddy and received gifts . they were curious about what else grandma had for them . they could not wait to see her . they knew they would have a lot of fun . tom and anna loved to visit their grandpa 's farm . they liked to feed the chickens , pet the cows and ride the horses . but their favorite animal was spot , the loyal dog . spot always followed them around and played with them .

one day , grandpa told them he had to go to town for a while and asked them to watch the farm . he said , " be careful , kids . do n't go near the pond . it 's deep and dangerous . and do n't let spot run away . he 's a good dog , but he likes to chase rabbits . promise me you 'll stay safe and keep an eye on spot . "

tom and anna nodded and said , " we promise , grandpa . we 'll be good and take care of spot . "

grandpa smiled and left . tom and anna decided to play hide and seek in the barn . they took turns counting and hiding . spot joined them and barked happily . they had a lot of fun .

but then , tom saw a rabbit hopping outside the barn . he thought it would be fun to catch it . he forgot about his promise and ran after it . spot saw him and followed him . anna heard them and shouted , " tom , stop ! come back ! you 're breaking your promise ! "

but tom and spot did n't listen . they chased the rabbit across the field , towards the pond . anna ran after them , hoping to stop them . she was scared and worried .

what do you think will happen next ? will tom and spot catch the rabbit ? will they fall into the pond ? will anna reach them in time ? will grandpa be angry or proud ? how will the story end ? tommy loved his mother very much . she was kind and humble and always helped him . she taught him how to pray every night before bed . she said that praying was talking to god and asking him for good things .

one day , tommy 's mother got very sick . she had to go to the hospital and stay there for a long time . tommy was sad and scared . he missed his mother and wanted her to come home . he prayed every night for her to get better .

one night , tommy heard a knock on the door . he ran to open it and saw his father . his father had a big smile on his face and a surprise behind his back . he said , " tommy , i have some good news for you . your mother is coming home tomorrow . she is feeling much better . and i have a gift for you from her . "

tommy was so happy that he hugged his father and jumped up and down . he wondered what the gift was . his father showed him a small box wrapped in shiny paper . he said , " your mother made this for you while she was in the hospital . she said it was a special way to say thank you for your prayers . "

tommy opened the box and saw a beautiful necklace with a cross pendant . he recognized it as the one his mother always wore . he felt a warm feeling in his heart . he said , " thank you , father . thank you , mother . thank you , god . i love you all . "

he put the necklace around his neck and felt his mother 's love . he prayed again and thanked god for his mother 's recovery and his father 's support . he felt happy and peaceful . he knew that his mother was humble and faithful and that god had heard her prayers and his . he hoped that he could be like her when he grew up . lily liked to look at the stars at night . she wondered what they were and how far they were . one night , she saw a bright light in the sky . it was a comet , her dad told her . a comet was a big rock that flew very fast and had a long tail .

" wow , it 's so pretty ! " lily said . " can we send it a message ? "

her dad smiled and hugged her . " how do you want to send it a message ? " he asked .

lily thought for a moment . she ran to her room and came back with a flashlight . she turned it on and off , making dots and dashes . she was trying to use morse code , a way of talking with lights that her dad had taught her .

" i 'm saying hello , comet . i 'm lily . i hope you are not troubled , " she said .

her dad was impressed by her effort . he helped her with the code and said , " that 's very kind of you , lily . maybe the comet will hear you and be happy . "

they watched the comet for a while , until it disappeared behind the clouds . lily felt a warm feeling in her heart . she hoped the comet was not troubled , and that it would come back someday . she said good night to the stars and the comet , and went to bed with a smile . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park with their toys . one day , they saw a big red balloon tied to a bench . it looked very high and shiny .

" wow , look at that balloon ! " lily said . " i want to touch it ! "

" me too ! " ben said . " let 's go and get it ! "

they ran to the bench and tried to reach the balloon . but it was too high for them . they jumped and stretched , but they could not touch it .

" maybe we can use this stick , " lily said . she picked up a long stick from the ground and tried to poke the balloon . but the stick was too short .

" maybe we can use this rock , " ben said . he picked up a big rock and tried to throw it at the balloon . but the rock was too heavy .

they were about to give up , when they saw a man walking towards them . he was holding a big bag of candy .

" hello , kids , " the man said . " do you like candy ? "

" yes , we do ! " lily and ben said .

" i have a reward for you , " the man said . " if you can squeeze this balloon and make it pop , i will give you some candy . "

lily and ben were very excited . they wanted the candy and the balloon . they took the balloon from the man and tried to squeeze it . but it was very hard and did not pop .

" try harder , " the man said . " you can do it ! "

lily and ben squeezed harder and harder . they did not notice that the man was smiling in a bad way . he had a pin in his hand . he was waiting for the right moment to pop the balloon himself and scare them .

but before he could do that , a dog came running to the bench . it saw the candy and wanted some . it barked and jumped on the man . the man dropped the pin and the candy . the dog grabbed the candy and ran away .

lily and ben saw what happened . they realized that the man was not nice . he wanted to trick them and make them sad . they felt angry and scared .

they let go of the balloon and ran away from the man . they found their toys and hugged them . they were glad that they still had each other .

the moral of the story is : do n't trust strangers who offer you rewards . they might have bad intentions . stick with your friends and be careful . tom and lily were playing in the sand . they had a new bucket and a big shovel . they wanted to make a sand castle . they dug and dug and filled the bucket with sand . then they turned the bucket over and lifted it up . a nice sand tower came out .

" wow , look at our castle ! " lily said . " it is so big and pretty ! "

tom nodded . he was happy . he wanted to make the castle bigger . he saw some shells and stones nearby . he ran to get them . he thought they would make good decorations .

but he did not see the big wave coming . the wave was fast and strong . it reached the sand castle and knocked it down . the sand tower fell and the sand scattered everywhere .

" tom , tom , watch out ! " lily shouted . she saw the wave and ran away . she hoped tom was safe .

tom heard lily and turned around . he saw the wave and the sand castle . he was sad and scared . he dropped the shells and stones and ran to lily . he reached her just in time . the wave washed over their feet and took their bucket and shovel away .

" are you okay , tom ? " lily asked . she hugged him .

tom nodded . he was okay , but he was still sad . he looked at the sand castle . it was gone . he felt like crying .

" i 'm sorry , lily , " he said . " our castle is gone . and our new bucket and shovel too . "

lily felt sorry too . she liked the castle and the bucket and shovel . but she liked tom more . she smiled and kissed him .

" it 's okay , tom , " she said . " we can make another castle . and we can find another bucket and shovel . or we can play something else . as long as we are together , we can have fun . "

tom smiled too . he felt better . he kissed lily back .

" you 're right , lily , " he said . " you 're the best . let 's go and play something else . "

they held hands and ran to find a new game . they forgot about the wave and the sand castle . they were happy again . lily and tom were playing in the park with their ball . they liked to kick the ball to each other and run after it . sometimes they missed the ball and it rolled away . then they had to chase it before it went too far .

one time , the ball went near the road . lily ran after it , but she did not look both ways . she did not see the big car coming fast . the car hit lily and she fell down . she did not get up . she was very still and quiet .

tom was scared . he ran to lily and tried to wake her up . he shouted , " lily , lily , wake up ! are you okay ? " but lily did not answer . tom saw blood on lily 's head and leg . he cried and hugged lily .

a lady saw what happened . she called for help . she said , " there 's been an accident . a little girl is hurt . please send an ambulance . " she came to tom and lily and tried to comfort them . she said , " do n't worry , sweetie . help is coming . you are very brave . "

soon , the ambulance came . it had a loud siren and flashing lights . two men got out . they had white clothes and bags . they came to lily and checked her . they said , " she 's alive , but she 's very cold . we need to take her to the hospital . " they put lily on a stretcher and carried her to the ambulance . they said to tom , " do you want to come with us ? you can sit with your sister . " tom nodded . he wanted to be with lily . he hoped she would be okay . he got in the ambulance and held lily 's hand . the ambulance drove away . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park and tell jokes to each other . one day , they saw a big dog in the park . the dog was barking and running towards them . lily was scared and ran away . ben was brave and stayed to protect lily .

he shouted at the dog and threw a stick . the dog chased the stick and left them alone . lily came back and hugged ben . she said , " thank you for protecting me . you are a good friend . " ben smiled and said , " you are welcome . you are a good friend too . "

they went to the swings and had fun . they saw a bird on a tree . the bird was not moving or singing . lily asked , " is the bird dead ? " ben nodded and said , " yes , the bird is dead . it is sad . " lily said , " can we tell a joke to the bird ? maybe it will make it happy . " ben said , " ok , let 's try . "

they went to the tree and told a joke to the bird . they said , " why did the chicken cross the road ? to get to the other side ! " they laughed and hoped the bird would laugh too . but the bird did not laugh . it was still dead . lily and ben felt sorry for the bird . they said , " goodbye , bird . we hope you are happy in heaven . "

they learned that jokes can make people happy , but they can not make dead things alive . they also learned that protecting someone is a good thing to do . they decided to be kind to animals and people , and to tell jokes to make them smile . they were happy and good friends . lily and ben were friends . they liked to play with toys and run in the park . one day , they found a drain in the grass . it was big and round and had holes .

" look , a drain ! " lily said . " let 's see what 's inside . "

she put her hand in the drain and felt something soft and furry . she pulled it out and saw a kitten . it was black and white and had blue eyes . it meowed and licked her hand .

" wow , a kitten ! " ben said . " it 's so cute . can i hold it ? "

lily shook her head . " no , it 's mine . i found it . i love it . "

ben felt jealous . he wanted the kitten too . he tried to grab it from lily , but she held it tight . they started to fight and yell .

" give me the kitten ! "

" no , it 's mine ! "

" let go ! "

" stop it ! "

the kitten was scared . it scratched and bit them . it jumped out of lily 's arms and ran away . it ran back to the drain and hid inside .

lily and ben stopped fighting . they looked at the drain and saw the kitten 's eyes . they felt sad and sorry . they had lost the kitten .

they tried to call it and reach it , but it was too late . the kitten did not come out . it did not trust them . it did not love them .

the end . anna and ben are playing in the park . they like to swing , slide and run . anna sees a small bird on a tree . she points to it and says , " look , ben , a bird ! "

ben looks at the bird and asks , " what is the bird doing ? "

anna says , " the bird is singing . it is happy . "

ben says , " can we sing with the bird ? "

anna says , " yes , let 's try . la , la , la ! "

they start to sing with the bird . the bird likes their song . it flies closer to them and lands on the swing . anna and ben are excited . they say , " hello , bird ! "

the bird says , " hello , anna and ben ! you have nice voices . do you want to play with me ? "

anna and ben say , " yes , we do ! "

the bird says , " ok , follow me . i will show you something fun . "

the bird flies to the slide . anna and ben run after it . they climb the ladder and slide down . the bird slides with them . they laugh and have fun .

the bird says , " do you want to see something else ? "

anna and ben say , " yes , please ! "

the bird flies to the seesaw . anna and ben follow it . they sit on the seesaw and bounce up and down . the bird sits on the middle and balances . they giggle and have fun .

the bird says , " do you want to see one more thing ? "

anna and ben say , " yes , yes , yes ! "

the bird flies to the sandbox . anna and ben follow it . they dig and build with the sand . the bird helps them . they make a castle and a moat . they are proud and have fun .

the bird says , " you are very good at playing . i have a question for you . do you want to be my friends ? "

anna and ben say , " of course , we do ! you are very nice and fun . we like you a lot . "

the bird says , " i like you too . you are my new friends . can i give you a hug ? "

anna and ben say , " yes , you can ! "

the bird flies to them and hugs them . they hug the bird back . they are happy and have fun .

but then , they hear a voice . it is their mom . she says , " anna , ben , it is time to go home . come on , let 's go . "

anna and ben say , " oh , no , we have to go . but we do n't want to leave the bird . "

the bird says , " do n't be sad . i will be here tomorrow . you can come and play with me again . i will wait for you . "

anna and ben say , " ok , we will come back . we promise . goodbye , bird . we love you . "

the bird says , " goodbye , anna and ben . i love you too . "

they wave to the bird and run to their mom . they tell her about their new friend . she smiles and says , " that sounds wonderful . i 'm glad you had fun . maybe we can bring some seeds for the bird tomorrow . "

anna and ben say , " yes , let 's do that . the bird will like that . "

they get in the car and go home . they are tired but happy . they fall asleep and dream of the bird . they ca n't wait to see it again . tim and sam are friends . they like to play with toys . one day , they see a big drum in the shop . the drum is red and shiny . it makes a loud noise when you hit it .

" wow , look at that drum ! " tim says . " i want to play with it . "

" me too , " sam says . " but it is too much money . we do not have enough money . "

they look at the price tag . it says fifty dollars . that is a lot of money for a drum .

they feel sad . they walk away from the shop .

then they see a printer in the library . the printer is black and square . it makes a soft noise when you push a button . it can print pictures and words on paper .

" look at that printer ! " sam says . " i want to print something . "

" me too , " tim says . " but we do not have a library card . we can not use the printer . "

they look at the sign . it says you need a library card to use the printer .

they feel sad . they walk away from the library .

then they see a garage sale in the street . the garage sale has many things . some things are old and broken . some things are new and cheap .

" look at that garage sale ! " tim says . " maybe we can find something to play with . "

" me too , " sam says . " let 's go and see . "

they run to the garage sale . they look at the things . they see books and games and clothes and toys .

then they see a drum . the drum is blue and plastic . it is not shiny . it is not loud . it is cheap . it says five dollars .

" look at that drum ! " tim says . " it is cheap . we have enough money . "

" me too , " sam says . " let 's buy it . "

they take the drum to the lady . the lady smiles . she takes their money . she gives them the drum .

" thank you , " tim says .

" thank you , " sam says .

they are happy . they run to the park . they take turns to play with the drum . they make music . they have fun . they are friends . anna loved her new dress . it was pink and had lovely buttons on the front . she wanted to show it to her friend lily , who lived next door . she put on her dress and ran outside .

" hi , lily ! " anna said . " look at my dress ! do you like it ? "

lily smiled . she liked anna 's dress too . it was very pretty . " yes , i like it . can i touch the buttons ? " she asked .

" sure , you can touch them . but be careful . they are not very strong . my mom said they might fall off if i pull them too hard , " anna said .

lily nodded . she touched the buttons gently . they felt smooth and shiny . she wanted to open one of them , just to see what was inside . she thought it would be fun . she did not listen to anna 's warning .

she pulled one of the buttons hard . it popped off the dress and flew into the air . anna gasped . she saw her button flying away . she felt sad and angry .

" lily ! why did you do that ? you broke my dress ! you are a bad friend ! " anna shouted .

lily felt sorry . she did not mean to break anna 's dress . she just wanted to play . she saw the button landing on the grass . she ran to get it .

" i 'm sorry , anna . i did not know it would happen . here , i found your button . can we fix it ? " lily said .

anna looked at lily . she saw that lily was sorry . she saw that lily had her button . she felt a little better . she still liked lily . she decided to forgive her .

" maybe we can fix it . let 's go to my mom . she can help us . but next time , do n't pull my buttons , okay ? " anna said .

" okay , i wo n't . i 'm sorry , anna . you are a good friend , " lily said .

they hugged and went to anna 's mom . she helped them sew the button back on the dress . anna and lily were happy again . they played with their dolls and forgot about the button . they learned to be careful with their clothes and their friends . anna and ben are twins . they like to go to the market with their mom . they see many things at the market : fruits , vegetables , bread , cheese , flowers , and toys . sometimes , mom lets them choose one thing to buy .

one day , they see a big teddy bear at the market . it is brown and soft and has a red bow . anna and ben both want the teddy bear . they tug on mom 's hand and point to the teddy bear .

" mom , mom , can we have the teddy bear ? please , please , please ! " they say .

mom looks at the teddy bear and smiles . she says , " it is a very nice teddy bear , but it is also very expensive . we only have enough money for food today . maybe another day , we can buy the teddy bear . "

anna and ben feel sad . they really want the teddy bear . they start to cry and whine . they say , " no , no , no ! we want the teddy bear now ! you are a bad mom ! you spoil our fun ! "

mom feels angry and hurt . she says , " stop it , anna and ben ! you are being rude and selfish . you should be grateful for what you have . you should not spoil the food we need . you should not spoil the market for other people . you should be compassionate and share with each other . "

anna and ben look at mom and see her frown . they see the other people at the market stare at them . they see the teddy bear and feel ashamed . they realize they have been wrong . they say , " sorry , mom . we are sorry for being rude and selfish . we do not need the teddy bear . we have each other . we love you , mom . "

mom hugs anna and ben and says , " i love you , too , anna and ben . i am glad you are sorry and compassionate . let 's go home and have some lunch . maybe we can make a teddy bear with some old clothes and buttons later . "

anna and ben smile and nod . they hold mom 's hand and walk home . they do not cry or whine anymore . they are happy and compassionate . tom and anna were playing in the yard when they saw a big bird . it was a turkey . the turkey had brown feathers and a red thing on its head . it made a loud sound : " gobble , gobble ! "

tom and anna were fearful of the turkey . they ran to the house and told their mom . " mom , mom , there is a big bird in the yard ! it is scary ! " they said .

mom looked out the window and saw the turkey . she smiled and said , " do n't be fearful , tom and anna . that is a turkey . it is not scary . it is a friend . it came from the farm next door . it is looking for food . "

tom and anna did not understand . they asked , " how is it a friend ? how do you know ? "

mom said , " i know because i talked to the farmer . he said the turkey is very nice and gentle . he said we can feed it some corn and carrots . do you want to try ? "

tom and anna nodded . they got some corn and carrots from the kitchen and followed mom to the yard . the turkey saw them and came closer . it was curious and hungry . it ate the corn and carrots from their hands . it made a soft sound : " purr , purr ! "

tom and anna were not fearful anymore . they were happy and surprised . they petted the turkey and said , " hello , turkey . you are a friend . we understand you now . " the turkey wagged its tail and said , " gobble , gobble ! " tom and lily were playing in the garden . they had a big bucket of sand and some toy cars . they liked to make roads and bridges and tunnels for their cars . sometimes they pretended that their cars were sick and needed a nurse .

" look , this car has a broken wheel ! " lily said , holding a red car . " we need to fix it ! "

" i know , i know ! " tom said , grabbing a blue car . " i will be the nurse and you will be the driver . come to my hospital ! "

tom and lily ran to a corner of the garden , where tom had made a small hole in the sand . he put his car inside the hole and covered it with more sand .

" there , now the car is buried and it will get better soon , " he said proudly .

" but how will we find it again ? " lily asked , worried .

" do n't worry , i marked the spot with a stick , " tom said , pointing to a thin stick that stuck out of the sand .

lily nodded , but she was not sure . she thought that burying a car was a strange way to fix it . she wondered if the car was not scared and helpless under the sand . she wished she could dig it out and hug it .

" can we play something else ? " she asked tom .

" okay , okay , " tom said , seeing that lily was not happy . " let 's play catch ! "

he took out his car from the hole and threw it to lily . lily caught it and threw it back . they laughed and ran around the garden , forgetting about the buried car . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big hill . they want to climb it and see what is on the other side .

they run up the hill , holding hands . they are happy and excited . they reach the top and look around . they see a lot of green trees and flowers . they also see a big lake . the lake is shiny and blue . it has white mist on it . the mist looks like smoke .

they hear a loud roar . they turn and see a big , hairy animal . it has four legs , a long tail and a big head . it has sharp teeth and claws . it is a lion . the lion is angry and hungry . it sees tim and sam and wants to eat them .

tim and sam are scared . they scream and run down the hill . they wave their arms and shout for help . they hope someone will hear them and save them .

a man hears them and sees the lion . he has a big stick . he runs to the hill and hits the lion with the stick . the lion is hurt and runs away . the man is brave and strong . he is a park ranger . he helps tim and sam and takes them to their mom and dad . they are safe and happy . they hug the man and thank him . they wave goodbye to the man and the hill . they never want to see the lion again . tom is a boy who likes to play with cars . he has many cars of different colors and sizes . he likes to make them go fast and make loud noises . one day , he goes to the park with his mom and dad . he brings his favorite car , a red one with big wheels .

at the park , he sees a girl who is playing with a doll . she has long hair and a pink dress . she smiles at tom and says hello . tom says hello back and shows her his car . she says it is nice and asks if she can touch it . tom says yes and gives her his car . she makes it go fast and makes loud noises too . tom laughs and thinks she is fun .

they play together for a while , and then they decide to go on the slide . they take turns going down the slide and then run back up . tom goes first and then the girl follows . but when she reaches the bottom , she bumps her head on tom 's car , which he left on the ground . she cries and holds her head . tom feels bad and says sorry . he picks up his car and gives it to her . he says it is hers now and he hopes she feels better .

the girl stops crying and smiles . she says thank you and hugs tom . she says he is nice and she likes him . she asks him what his name is . he says he is tom and asks her what her name is . she says she is lily and says they are friends now . tom agrees and says they are friends . they hug again and then go to their moms and dads . they tell them they met a new friend and show them their toys . their moms and dads are happy and say they are proud of them . they say they can play together again next time . tom and lily are happy and say goodbye . they wave and smile as they leave the park . anna likes to go to the gym with her mom . the gym has many things to play with . anna likes to jump on the big mat , swing on the rope , and roll on the ball . she has fun with her mom and the other kids .

one day , anna finds a pink gum in her mom 's bag . she thinks it is candy . she puts it in her mouth and chews it . it is sweet and sticky . she likes it . she chews and chews and chews .

but then , the gum gets stuck in her hair . she tries to pull it out , but it hurts . she cries . her mom hears her and comes to help . she sees the gum in anna 's hair . she is not happy . she says , " anna , you should not chew gum . it is not good for your teeth and your hair . where did you get it ? "

anna feels sorry . she says , " i found it in your bag . i thought it was candy . i 'm sorry , mom . "

her mom hugs her and says , " it 's okay , anna . i forgive you . but next time , ask me before you take something from my bag . and do n't chew gum . it is not for kids . now let 's go to the bathroom and try to get the gum out of your hair . " sam and lily were playing hide and seek in the park . sam was the seeker and lily was the hider . lily ran to a big tree and hid behind a branch . she thought sam would not find her there .

sam looked around and saw the branch moving . he smiled and walked to the tree . he said , " i see you , lily ! you are hiding behind the branch ! " he pulled the branch and revealed lily .

lily was scared and angry . she said , " no , sam ! that was not fair ! you cheated ! you are a bad seeker ! " she pushed sam and ran away .

sam was hurt and sad . he said , " lily , wait ! i did not cheat ! i just saw the branch ! i am sorry ! come back ! " he chased after lily .

but lily did not listen . she ran to the road and did not look for cars . a big car came and hit lily . lily fell down and did not get up . sam saw what happened and screamed . he ran to lily and cried . he said , " lily , lily , please wake up ! i love you ! i am sorry ! please wake up ! " but lily did not wake up . she was gone . sam was alone and very sad . he wished he had not pulled the branch . he wished he had been more careful . he wished he had been more comfortable . he wished he had been more kind . tim and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . they like to slide , swing and run . but tim is careless . he does not look where he goes . he does not listen to mia .

one day , they see a big tree . the tree has a hole . tim wants to see what is in the hole . he leans over the hole . he puts his head inside . mia says , " tim , be careful ! the hole is dark and deep . you might fall in ! "

but tim does not listen . he leans more and more . he wants to see more and more . he does not hear mia . he does not hear a growl . he does not see a big tooth .

suddenly , a raccoon jumps out of the hole . the raccoon is angry . the raccoon bites tim 's nose . tim screams . he falls back . he cries . mia runs to him . she helps him . she says , " tim , i told you to be careful ! now you have a big bite on your nose . it hurts . it bleeds . we have to go to the doctor . "

tim is sorry . he says , " mia , you are right . i was careless . i did not look . i did not listen . i was silly . i am sorry . please forgive me . "

mia says , " tim , i forgive you . but you have to learn . you have to be careful . you have to look . you have to listen . you have to be smart . or you will get hurt again . "

the moral of the story is : be careful and listen to your friends . or you might get bitten by a raccoon . lily and ben were playing in the garden . they liked to run and jump and laugh . they saw a big tree with yellow fruits . they did not know what they were .

" look , ben , what are those ? " lily asked .

" i do n't know , lily . let 's pick one and see , " ben said .

they ran to the tree and reached for a fruit . it was round and hard and had a green leaf . they pulled it and it came off .

" wow , it 's heavy , " lily said .

" let 's smell it , " ben said .

they brought the fruit to their noses and sniffed . it had a strong and sour smell .

" yuck , it smells bad , " lily said .

" maybe it tastes good , " ben said .

he opened his mouth and bit the fruit . he made a funny face and spit it out .

" ow , ow , ow , it hurts , it hurts , " he cried .

lily dropped the fruit and ran to him .

" ben , are you okay ? what 's wrong ? " she asked .

" it 's sour , it 's sour , it burns my tongue , " he said .

lily hugged him and tried to comfort him .

" shh , shh , it 's okay , ben . it 's just a bad fruit . we wo n't eat it again , " she said .

they heard a voice from the house .

" kids , what are you doing ? come inside , it 's time for lunch , " their mom called .

they looked at each other and nodded .

" okay , mom , we 're coming , " they said .

they left the fruit on the ground and ran to the house . they did not want to see the unknown fruit again . they hoped their mom had something sweet and yummy for lunch . they learned to stop and ask before they tried new things . lily was a kid who liked to play with her toys . she had many toys , but her favorite was a soft bear . she always hugged her bear and took it everywhere . she named her bear bobo .

one day , lily went to the park with her mom and bobo . she saw other kids playing on the swings , the slide and the sandbox . she wanted to join them , but she did not want to leave bobo alone . she asked her mom what to do .

her mom said , " you can set bobo on the bench and play with the other kids . i will watch him for you . do n't worry , he will be safe and happy . "

lily thought about it . she loved bobo , but she also wanted to have fun . she decided to listen to her mom . she set bobo on the bench and gave him a kiss . then she ran to the swings and the slide and the sandbox . she made new friends and had a great time .

when it was time to go home , lily ran back to the bench . she saw bobo waiting for her with a smile . she picked him up and hugged him . she thanked her mom for watching him . she learned that she could share her toys and still love them . she also learned that she could try new things and still be herself . she was happy and proud . she and bobo went home together . lily and sam are friends . they like to play in the snow . they make a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they give him a carrot nose and two coal eyes .

