" no , he likes the snow and the ice . he is happy here . " sam says . " but we are cold . let 's go inside and have some hot cocoa . "

they run to lily 's house . they knock on the door . lily 's mom opens it . she smiles and hugs them .

" hello , lily and sam . you look very cold . come in , i have some hot cocoa for you . " she says .

" thank you , mom . we made a nice snowman outside . he is complete . can we show you later ? " lily asks .

" of course , dear . i would love to see your snowman . but first , warm up and drink your cocoa . " she says .

lily and sam sit on the couch . they sip their cocoa . they feel warm and cozy . they talk about their snowman and their other snow games . they are happy . they are friends . tom was a pilot who liked to fly his blue plane in the sky . he was very good at flying and he had many friends who flew with him . one day , his blue plane had a problem . it made a loud noise and smoke came out of it . tom was scared and he landed his blue plane on a big field .

" help ! help ! " tom shouted . " my blue plane is broken ! i need to repair it ! "

he saw a man who was working on a red truck . the man heard tom and came to see him .

" hello , little pilot , " the man said . " what is wrong with your blue plane ? "

" my blue plane is broken , " tom said . " it made a loud noise and smoke came out of it . can you help me repair it ? "

the man looked at tom 's blue plane and smiled .

" sure , i can help you , " the man said . " i am a mechanic . i know how to fix things . let me see what i can do . "

the man took some tools from his red truck and went to work on tom 's blue plane . he checked the engine , the wings , the wheels and the propeller . he fixed the problem and cleaned the smoke . he gave tom a thumbs up .

" your blue plane is good to go , " the man said . " you can fly again . "

tom was very happy and thanked the man .

" thank you , mechanic , " tom said . " you are very kind and smart . you saved my blue plane . "

the man smiled and waved .

" you are welcome , little pilot , " the man said . " you are very brave and good . you landed your blue plane safely . have fun flying . "

tom got back into his blue plane and started the engine . it sounded good and smooth . he waved to the man and took off . he flew his blue plane in the sky and joined his friends . he was very happy and proud . he loved his blue plane and he loved flying . lily and mom went to the store . lily saw a teddy bear . she liked the teddy bear . she asked mom , " can i buy the teddy bear ? "

mom said , " yes , you can buy the teddy bear . but you have to use your own money . you have been saving your money for a long time . do you want to spend it on the teddy bear ? "

lily thought for a moment . she had a lot of money in her piggy bank . she wanted to buy something special . she nodded and said , " yes , i want to buy the teddy bear . he is soft and cute . i will hug him every night . "

mom smiled and said , " okay , let 's go to the cashier . you have to give him your money and he will give you the teddy bear . "

lily and mom walked to the cashier . lily took out her money and counted it . she gave it to the cashier . the cashier said , " thank you , lily . you are very helpful . here is your teddy bear . enjoy ! "

lily took the teddy bear and hugged him . she was very happy . she said , " thank you , mom . thank you , cashier . i love my teddy bear . he is my new friend . "

mom hugged lily and said , " you 're welcome , lily . i 'm proud of you . you worked hard to save your money . you made a good choice . i love you . "

lily and mom left the store . lily held her teddy bear close . she felt warm and cozy . she said , " i love you , too , mom . and i love you , teddy bear . you are the best . " sara and tom were playing in the yard . they liked to run and jump and hide behind the trees . but they did not like to share their toys . sara had a ball and tom had a car . they both wanted to play with both toys .

" give me the ball ! " tom said .

