they pulled and pushed and shouted . they did not see their mom watching them from the window . she was not happy . she came out and took the ball and the car .

" stop fighting ! " she said . " you are being mean and selfish . you need to learn to share and be kind . you are punished . you can not play with these toys for the rest of the day . go to your rooms and think about what you did . "

sara and tom felt sad and sorry . they did not want to lose their toys . they did not want to make their mom angry . they went to their rooms and sat on their beds . they thought about how they could be better friends .

after a while , sara knocked on tom 's door . she said , " i 'm sorry , tom . i was wrong . i should have let you play with the ball . can we share it tomorrow ? "

tom opened the door . he said , " i 'm sorry , too , sara . i should have let you play with the car . can we share it tomorrow ? "

they hugged and smiled . they learned their lesson . they decided to be nice and share their toys from now on . they knew that sharing was caring . they hoped their mom would forgive them and let them play in the yard again . lily and sam are playing cops and robbers in the park . lily is the cop and sam is the robber . lily chases sam around the trees and the swings , but sam is very fast and clever . he hides behind a bench and waits for lily to pass by .

" stop , robber ! you are under arrest ! " lily shouts , holding a stick like a gun .

