they hug and say they are sorry . they do not want the diamond anymore . they see a cute dog in the park . it is brown and fluffy . it wags its tail and licks their faces . jill and ben laugh and pet the dog . they forget about the diamond . they are happy . lily liked to dance and sing . she wanted to perform for her family and friends . she practiced every day in her room . she made a pretty dress and a shiny crown . she was very happy .

one day , she saw a big poster on the wall . it said : " talent show . come and show your skills . win a prize . " lily wanted to join the show . she thought she could win . she told her mom and dad . they said : " ok , but you have to be nice and fair to the other kids . "

lily went to the show . she saw many kids . they had different skills . some could play music , some could draw , some could tell jokes . lily thought : " i am better than them . i will win for sure . " she did not say hello or smile to the other kids . she was rude and mean .

when it was her turn , she went on the stage . she danced and sang . she did very well . she looked at the judges . she hoped they would like her . but then , she saw something . there was a big black spot on her dress . she did not know how it got there . she felt very bad . she stopped dancing and singing . she ran off the stage . she cried .

the judges gave the prize to another kid . he could juggle balls and make funny faces . he was very good . he was also very kind . he shared his prize with the other kids . he said : " we all did great . we are all friends . " the other kids cheered and clapped . they hugged him and thanked him .

lily learned a lesson . she learned that being good is more important than being the best . she learned that being nice and fair is better than being rude and mean . she learned that having friends is more valuable than having a prize . she said sorry to the other kids . she asked them to be her friends . they said yes . they invited her to play with them . she was very happy . lily and max were playing with pastels . they liked to draw on the big paper with the soft colors . lily made a flower and max made a car . they were happy and proud of their pictures .

" look , lily , i made a fast car ! " max said , showing his picture to lily .

" wow , max , your car is very nice ! " lily said , smiling . " look , i made a flower for you ! "

" thank you , lily , your flower is very pretty ! " max said , taking the flower picture . he gave lily a hug .

they decided to hang their pictures on the wall . they got some tape and a chair . lily climbed on the chair and taped her flower . max climbed on the chair and taped his car . but the chair was not very stable . it wobbled and max lost his balance . he stumbled and fell off the chair . he landed on the floor with a thud .

" ow , ow , ow ! " max cried , holding his knee . it was red and sore .

lily ran to max and helped him up . she saw his knee and felt sorry for him .

" are you okay , max ? " lily asked , worried .

" it hurts , lily , it hurts ! " max said , tears in his eyes .

lily hugged max and kissed his knee . she got a band - aid and put it on his knee . she rubbed his back and sang a song .

" it 's okay , max , it 's okay . you are brave and strong . the band - aid will make it better . i love you , max , i love you . "

max felt better . he smiled and hugged lily back . he thanked her for the band - aid and the song . he told her he loved her too .

they looked at their pictures on the wall . they were still smooth and bright . they were happy and proud of their pictures . they were happy and proud of each other . lily and ben were playing in the garden . they liked to dig in the dirt and look for bugs . they had a big bucket full of worms and beetles . they were very happy .

but then they saw a big dog . the dog was black and had rough fur . it had sharp teeth and a loud bark . it ran towards them , wagging its tail . lily and ben were scared . they dropped their bucket and ran to the house .

" help ! help ! " they shouted . " there is a big dog ! "

they reached the door and tried to open it . but it was locked . their mom had gone to the store and had locked the door . she had told them to stay in the garden until she came back . she had given them the key , but they had left it in the bucket .

they banged on the door and cried . the dog was getting closer . it looked hungry and angry . it growled and jumped .

" go away , dog ! " lily said . " we do n't want to play with you ! "

but the dog did not listen . it wanted to play with them . or maybe eat them .

suddenly , they heard a car . it was their mom . she had come back from the store . she saw the dog and the children . she honked the horn and shouted .

" shoo , dog ! shoo ! "

the dog was startled . it stopped jumping and looked at the car . it saw the mom and decided to run away . it did not like loud noises and angry people .

lily and ben were relieved . they hugged their mom and thanked her . she unlocked the door and took them inside . she gave them cookies and milk . she also gave them the key .

" next time , keep the key with you , " she said . " and do n't play with strange dogs . they can be dangerous . "

lily and ben nodded . they learned their lesson . they were glad their mom was there to save them . they smiled and ate their cookies . they did not frown anymore . ben and lily were playing in the yard . they liked to dig holes and find things . sometimes they found rocks , sometimes they found worms , sometimes they found nothing .

one day , they found a screw . it was shiny and hard and had a pointy end . ben wanted to keep it , but lily wanted to see it .

" give me the screw , ben ! " lily said .

" no , it 's mine ! " ben said .

they pulled and tugged on the screw , but it did not come loose . they got angry and shouted at each other .

" let go , lily ! "

" let go , ben ! "

suddenly , they heard a loud noise . it was their dad , coming home from work . he parked his car in the driveway and got out . he saw ben and lily fighting over the screw .

" hey , what are you two doing ? " he asked .

ben and lily stopped and looked at him . they felt ashamed and scared . they knew they were in trouble .

they let go of the screw and ran to their dad . they hugged him and said they were sorry .

" it 's okay , kids . i 'm glad you 're happy to see me . but why were you fighting over a screw ? " he asked .

they told him they found it in the yard and they both wanted it .

he smiled and picked up the screw . he looked at it and said , " do you know what this is ? this is a special screw . it belongs to my toolbox . i must have dropped it when i fixed the fence . it 's not a toy , it 's a tool . you have to be careful with it . it can hurt you if you poke yourself or someone else with it . "

he showed them how the screw worked . he said it was used to join things together , like wood or metal . he said he needed it for his next project .

" can we help you , dad ? " ben and lily asked .

" sure , you can . but first , you have to promise me something . no more fighting over screws , okay ? and no more digging holes in the yard . you might stumble and fall , or hit a pipe or a wire . that 's dangerous . you can dig in the sandbox instead . that 's safer and more fun . deal ? "

" deal ! " ben and lily said .

they gave their dad the screw and followed him to the garage . they helped him find his toolbox and his other tools . they were happy and excited . they forgot about their fight and their cold hands . they learned something new and had fun with their dad . lily loved animals . she wanted to be a veterinarian when she grew up . she liked to play with her stuffed animals and pretend they were sick or hurt . she would give them medicine and bandages and make them feel better .

one day , lily found a big box in the garage . it was full of old clothes and hats and jewelry . lily had an idea . she decided to decorate her stuffed animals with the things in the box . she thought they would look pretty and fancy .

she put a dress on her teddy bear , a hat on her bunny , a necklace on her giraffe , and a scarf on her monkey . she was very happy with her work . she brought them to the living room to show her mom .

but her mom was not happy . she saw the box and the clothes and the jewelry and she was angry . she said , " lily , what have you done ? these are not your things . these are grandma 's things . she was very wealthy and she gave them to me . they are very old and valuable . you ca n't play with them . you have to take them off your animals right now . "

lily was sad and confused . she did n't know they were grandma 's things . she did n't know they were old and valuable . she just wanted to decorate her animals . she said , " but mom , i was just playing . i wanted to make them look pretty and fancy . i wanted to be a veterinarian and help them . "

mom sighed . she saw that lily did n't mean any harm . she said , " i know , honey . i know you love animals and you want to be a veterinarian . but you ca n't use these things to decorate them . they are not toys . they are special and they have to be taken care of . why do n't we find some other things to decorate them with ? maybe some ribbons or stickers or buttons ? "

lily nodded . she understood . she said , " okay , mom . i 'm sorry . i did n't know . can we still play with them ? "

