mia , max , and the little bird became good friends . they played together every day , and the little bird always said , " thank you for helping me find my home . " once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim had a big , ugly mailbox in front of his house . it was old and had many colors . tim did not like the ugly mailbox , but his mom said it was important .

