together , they cleaned up the mess and then made cookies . lily learned to be patient and wait for her mom . they had fun making cookies , and the cookies were very yummy . from that day on , lily always waited for her mom to help her with new things . one day , a little girl named mia and her cat tim were playing in her room . mia liked to act like a big cat too . she would jump and run just like tim . they had lots of fun together .

