tom and sara went outside . they painted and played together . they had fun . they were nice to each other . they were happy . anna and ben were playing in the kitchen . they wanted to make a cake , but they did not know how . they took some flour , some eggs , some milk , and some sugar from the cupboard . they mixed them all in a big bowl . they made a big mess .

" look , we made cake batter ! " ben said .

" let 's put it in the oven ! " anna said .

they carried the bowl to the oven . but the bowl was too heavy for them . they struggled to hold it . they dropped the bowl on the floor . the batter splashed everywhere .

" oh no ! " anna and ben said .

they heard their mom coming . they were scared . they ran to the sink . they tried to wash their hands and faces . but the sink was too high for them . they could not reach the water . they got more batter on their clothes .

" what is going on here ? " mom said . she saw the mess in the kitchen . she saw anna and ben in the sink . she was angry .

" anna , ben , what did you do ? " mom said .

anna and ben looked at each other . they did not want to lie . they wanted to be honest .

" mom , we are sorry . we wanted to make a cake . but we did not know how . we made a big mess . we tried to clean it . but we could not . we are sorry , mom . " anna and ben said .

mom sighed . she was not happy . but she saw that anna and ben were honest . she saw that they were sorry .

" anna , ben , i appreciate that you are honest . but you should not play in the kitchen without asking me . you could have hurt yourselves . and you wasted a lot of food . next time , if you want to make a cake , ask me first . i will help you . and you will learn how to do it right . do you understand ? " mom said .

" yes , mom . we understand . we are sorry , mom . " anna and ben said .

mom hugged them . she was not angry anymore . she was glad that they were honest .

