they cleaned up the mess . they made a real cake . they ate it together . they were happy . they learned to be honest . and to ask for help . and to not play in the kitchen . ben and mia liked to play with blocks . they made big structures with different shapes and colors . they were proud of their creations and showed them to their mom and dad .

one day , they had a new friend over . his name was leo and he also liked blocks . he wanted to join ben and mia and make a structure with them . but leo did not know how to share . he took blocks from ben and mia without asking . he said he needed them for his structure .

ben and mia did not like that . they asked leo to stop and give back their blocks . but leo did not listen . he said his structure was better and bigger than theirs . he laughed at their structures and said they were silly and small .

ben and mia felt sad and angry . they did not want to play with leo anymore . they told him to go away and leave their blocks alone . but leo did not care . he kept taking blocks and making his structure taller and taller .

then , something happened . leo 's structure was too tall and unstable . it wobbled and fell down with a loud crash . all the blocks scattered on the floor . leo was surprised and scared . he looked at his broken structure and cried .

ben and mia saw what happened . they felt sorry for leo . they knew how it felt to lose a structure . they also knew how to be kind and helpful . they went to leo and said , " it 's okay , leo . we can help you . we can make a new structure together . but you have to share and be nice . do you want to be our friend ? "

leo nodded and wiped his tears . he said , " i 'm sorry , ben and mia . i was mean and greedy . i embarrassed myself . i want to be your friend . can you teach me how to make a good structure ? "

ben and mia smiled and hugged leo . they said , " sure , leo . we can teach you . we have many blocks and many ideas . we can make a useful structure that we can all enjoy . come on , let 's play ! " ben and lily were playing in the yard . they liked to run and jump and roll on the grass . they saw a big pile of leaves that their dad had made with a rake . the rake was a tool with a long stick and many teeth that could move the leaves .

" let 's jump in the leaves ! " ben said . he ran towards the pile and jumped with a big smile . he landed on the soft leaves and laughed .

" me too ! " lily said . she followed ben and tried to jump , but she stumbled on the rake . she fell down and hurt her knee . she cried and held her knee .

" ow , ow , ow ! " she said . " the rake is bad ! it made me fall ! "

ben heard lily and got out of the leaves . he ran to her and hugged her . he saw the blood on her knee and felt sorry for her .

" do n't cry , lily , " he said . " the rake is not bad . it was just in the way . i will get mom . she will make it better . she is dependable . she always helps us when we are hurt . "

he helped lily stand up and walked with her to the house . he called for mom and told her what happened . mom came and took lily to the bathroom . she cleaned her knee and put a band - aid on it . she kissed her and hugged her .

" there , there , " she said . " you are brave , lily . you will be fine . the rake did not mean to hurt you . it was an accident . next time , be careful where you step . "

lily nodded and smiled . she felt better . she thanked mom and ben . she hugged them and said she loved them .

" can we go back to the leaves ? " she asked .

" sure , " mom said . " but watch out for the rake . and have fun . "

ben and lily went back to the yard . they jumped in the leaves and played . they were happy . they forgot about the rake . they only remembered the fun . lily liked to make things with paper and glue . she had a big box of paper in different colors and shapes . she wanted to make a mask for her face . she looked at the paper and picked a yellow one . she cut out a circle for the face and two triangles for the ears . she glued them together and made holes for the eyes and the mouth . she was very happy with her mask . she put it on and looked in the mirror . she smiled and said , " i am a lion ! "

she wanted to show her mask to her mom and dad . she ran to the living room , where they were watching tv . she roared and said , " look at me ! i am a lion ! " but they did not look at her . they were looking at the tv with big eyes and open mouths . lily was confused . why were they not looking at her ? why were they not smiling ? she looked at the tv and saw a picture of a big fire . the fire was in a building near their home . she heard a loud noise and saw smoke outside the window . she was scared . she took off her mask and said , " mom , dad , what is happening ? "

mom and dad hugged her and said , " do n't worry , lily . there is a fire , but we are safe . the firefighters are coming to put out the fire . we have to stay inside and wait for them . we are proud of you for making your mask . it is very nice . but now is not the time to play . now is the time to be calm and quiet . " lily nodded and hugged them back . she understood . she put her mask on the table and sat with them on the couch . she watched the tv and hoped the fire would go away soon . she was glad she had completed her mask , but she wished she could show it to them later . tim and kim are twins . they like to play outside . but today , the sky is gloomy . it is dark and gray . it might rain soon .

" let 's go for a walk , " tim says . " maybe we can find something fun . "

" ok , " kim says . " but we need to take a cloth . if it rains , we can cover our heads . "

they put on their shoes and jackets . they take a big cloth from the closet . they hold hands and walk out the door .

they walk down the street . they see a dog , a bird , and a flower . they say hello to them . they are happy .

but then , they hear a loud noise . it is thunder . they see a flash . it is lightning . they are scared .

" it 's going to rain ! " kim says . " let 's go back home ! "

they turn around and run . but the rain starts to fall . it is wet and cold . they use the cloth to cover their heads . but the cloth is not enough . they are still wet and cold .

they reach their home . they open the door . they see their mom . she is smiling .

" hello , my little ones , " she says . " you look like two wet rats . come here , i have some warm towels for you . "

she hugs them and dries them . she gives them some hot chocolate and cookies . she tells them a story . they are cozy and happy .

they forget about the gloomy sky . they love their mom . they love each other . they are twins . sara and ben like to play with cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . they make roads and bridges with blocks and books . they have fun zooming and honking .

one day , sara finds a big bottle of oil in the kitchen . she thinks it is water . she wants to make a lake for her cars . she takes the bottle and carries it to her room . it is very heavy . she struggles to hold it . she does not see the lid is loose .

when she gets to her room , she puts the bottle on the floor . she tries to open it . but the oil spills out . it makes a big mess . it covers the floor and the cars and the blocks . it is slippery and sticky . sara is shocked . she does not know what to do .

ben hears sara scream . he runs to her room . he sees the oil and the mess . he is angry . he says , " sara , what did you do ? you ruined our cars and our roads . this is not water . this is oil . it is bad for cars . it is hard to clean . mom and dad will be mad . "

sara starts to cry . she says , " i 'm sorry , ben . i did not know . i wanted to make a lake . i thought it was water . i struggled to carry it . it spilled by itself . i did not mean to make a mess . please do n't be mad at me . "

ben sees sara is sad . he feels sorry for her . he says , " it 's okay , sara . i 'm not mad at you . you made a mistake . we all make mistakes . we can clean it up together . mom and dad will understand . they love us . everything will be fine . "

sara and ben hug . they get some towels and paper and soap . they try to clean the oil and the mess . it is hard work . but they help each other . they also wash their cars and their blocks . they make them shiny and clean . they are happy again .

they learn a lesson . they learn to be careful with things they do n't know . they learn to say sorry and forgive . they learn to work together . they are fine . tom was a rude boy . he did not like to share his toys or say sorry . he liked to lie and make up stories . he said he had a big dragon in his room and a magic wand that could do anything . he said he was the king of the world and everyone had to do what he said .

one day , he found a bottle in the kitchen . it had a skull and crossbones on it . he did not know what that meant . he thought it was a drink for kings . he wanted to show off to his friends . he took the bottle and ran outside .

he saw his friends playing in the park . he said , " look what i have ! it is a special drink for kings . it makes me strong and smart and brave . do you want some ? " his friends were curious . they wanted to see the bottle . tom opened it and smelled it . it smelled bad . he did not care . he said , " it is supposed to smell bad . it is poison . only kings can drink poison and not get sick . watch me ! "

he lifted the bottle to his mouth and took a sip . he felt a burning in his throat and his stomach . he dropped the bottle and fell to the ground . he screamed and cried . his friends were scared . they ran to get help . they found a grown - up and told him what happened . the grown - up called an ambulance and took tom to the hospital .

tom was very sick . he had to stay in the hospital for a long time . he learned that poison was not a drink for kings . he learned that lying was not a good thing to do . he learned that being rude was not a way to make friends . he said sorry to his friends and to his parents . he promised to be a good boy from then on . he never lied or drank poison again . one day , a curious boy named ben found a big chamber in his house . he did not know what was in the chamber , but he wanted to see . he opened the door and went inside . he saw many things that he did not know . he saw books , pictures , tools , and toys . he wanted to use them all .

he picked up a book and tried to read it , but he did not know the words . he picked up a picture and tried to draw on it , but he made a mess . he picked up a tool and tried to fix something , but he broke it . he picked up a toy and tried to play with it , but he lost a part . he did not care . he just wanted to use everything .

but then , he heard a loud noise . it was his dad . he came to the chamber and saw what ben had done . he was very angry . he said , " ben , what have you done ? you have used all my things without asking . you have ruined my book , my picture , my tool , and my toy . you have been very naughty . you have to learn to respect other people 's things . you have to say sorry and help me clean up . "

ben felt very bad . he realized that he had been wrong . he said , " i 'm sorry , dad . i was curious . i wanted to see what was in the chamber . i did not mean to use your things and make a mess . i will help you clean up . i will not do it again . "

dad hugged ben and said , " i forgive you , son . i know you were curious , but you have to be careful . you have to ask before you use something that is not yours . you have to be gentle and respectful . you have to learn from your mistakes . that is how you grow up . "

ben nodded and said , " i understand , dad . i will try to be better . i love you . "

they smiled and started to clean up the chamber together . ben learned a valuable lesson that day . he learned to respect other people 's things and to use them wisely . he also learned to say sorry and to make up for his mistakes . he was still curious , but he was also more careful and responsible . he was a good boy . lily was restless . she did not want to sleep . she wanted to play with her toys and books . but mommy said it was bedtime and turned off the light . lily lay in her bed and looked at the dark room . she saw a big wardrobe in the corner . she wondered what was inside .

she got out of her bed and walked to the wardrobe . she opened the door and saw many clothes and shoes . she touched them and felt the soft and rough fabrics . she smelled the perfume and soap . she heard a noise and saw a small box . she opened the box and found a necklace with shiny stones . she put it on and felt like a princess .

she heard mommy 's voice outside the door . " lily , are you still awake ? " mommy asked . lily was scared . she did not want mommy to see her with the necklace . she did not want mommy to be angry . she hid behind the clothes and hoped mommy would not find her .

mommy opened the door and turned on the light . she looked at the bed and saw it was empty . she looked around the room and saw the wardrobe . she walked to the wardrobe and opened the door . she saw lily crouching behind the clothes . she saw the necklace on her neck .

" lily , what are you doing ? " mommy asked . lily looked at mommy and realized she was caught . she felt sorry and ashamed . she took off the necklace and gave it to mommy . she said in a small voice , " i 'm sorry , mommy . i just wanted to see what was in the wardrobe . i liked the necklace . it was pretty . "

mommy looked at lily and sighed . she was not angry , but she was disappointed . she said , " lily , you know you should not take things that are not yours . the necklace belongs to grandma . she gave it to me as a gift . it is very special and old . you could have broken it or lost it . you should have asked me first . "

lily nodded and said , " i know , mommy . i was wrong . i wo n't do it again . i 'm sorry , mommy . i love you . "

mommy hugged lily and said , " i love you too , lily . i forgive you . but you have to go to sleep now . it is very late and you have school tomorrow . come on , let 's go back to your bed . "

mommy took lily to her bed and tucked her in . she kissed her goodnight and turned off the light . lily closed her eyes and felt sleepy . she dreamed of grandma and the necklace . she hoped grandma would not be mad at her . she hoped mommy would let her see the necklace again . she hoped she would be a good girl . one day , a girl named lily went to the park with her mom . she saw a big basket full of flowers on a bench . she liked the flowers very much . she wanted to take some home .

she asked her mom , " mom , can i have some flowers from the basket ? "

her mom said , " no , lily . those flowers are not ours . they belong to someone else . we should not take what is not ours . that is not nice . "

but lily did not listen to her mom . she waited until her mom was not looking . then she ran to the bench and grabbed some flowers from the basket . she hid them in her coat .

she thought she was very clever . she thought the flowers were very pretty .

but when she got home , she saw that the flowers were not pretty at all . they were ugly . they had bugs and dirt on them . they smelled bad . they made her coat dirty too .

she felt very bad . she wished she had listened to her mom . she realized that taking what is not hers was wrong . she learned that being greedy can make things become ugly .

she said to her mom , " mom , i am sorry . i took some flowers from the basket in the park . but they were ugly and dirty . i did not like them . i will not do that again . "

her mom hugged her and said , " i am glad you are sorry , lily . i forgive you . next time , you should ask before you take something . and you should appreciate what you have . that is what makes things beautiful . " tom and lily were best friends . they liked to play in the park with their toys . one day , they saw a big dog with a red collar . the dog looked sad and hungry .

" hello , dog , " tom said . " do you want to play with us ? "

the dog wagged its tail and came closer . lily was scared of the dog . she hid behind tom .

" tom , stay away from the dog , " she said . " he might bite you . "

tom shook his head . " no , lily , he is a nice dog . he just needs some love . look , he has a name . it says rex on his collar . "

tom reached out his hand and petted rex . rex licked tom 's face and made him laugh . lily saw that rex was friendly and came out from behind tom .

" hi , rex , " she said . " you are a good dog . do you want some of our snacks ? "

lily and tom shared their cookies and juice with rex . rex ate and drank happily . he felt warm and full .

" thank you , kids , " rex said . " you are very compassionate . you made me feel better . "

lily and tom smiled . they were happy to help rex .

" where do you live , rex ? " tom asked . " do you have a home ? "

rex looked sad again . he shook his head . " no , i do n't have a home . i ran away from my old home . they were mean to me . they hit me and gave me no food . they put a weight on my neck and tied me to a tree . "

lily and tom gasped . they felt sorry for rex .

" that 's awful , rex , " lily said . " you do n't deserve that . you deserve a better home . "

tom nodded . " yes , rex , you do . why do n't you come with us ? we can take you to our home . our mom and dad will love you . they will give you a bed and a bowl and a toy . they will take care of you . "

rex looked hopeful . he wagged his tail again . " really ? you would do that for me ? "

lily and tom nodded . they held rex 's collar and led him to their home . rex followed them happily . he felt safe and loved .

the end . tom and sue are twins . they share a room and a crib . they like to play with their toys and books . but when it is night , they have to go to sleep .

one night , tom does not want to sleep . he wants to stay up and read his book . he says to sue , " sue , let us sack the crib . we can make a tent with the blanket . then we can read under the light . "

sue thinks this is a fun idea . she says , " ok , tom , let us sack the crib . but we have to be quiet . mom and dad will be mad if they hear us . "

they sack the crib . they pull the blanket over the bars . they crawl under the blanket . they turn on the light . they read their book .

but they do not hear mom and dad coming . mom and dad open the door . they see the tent . they see the light . they are not happy .

