they sack the crib . they turn off the light . they go to sleep . they dream of books and tents . sam liked to help his mom in the kitchen . he was very organized . he put the spoons in one drawer , the forks in another , and the knives in a safe place . he also liked to wash the fruits and vegetables . he scrubbed them with water and soap until they were shiny and clean .

one day , his mom asked him to wash some potatoes . she wanted to make mashed potatoes for dinner . sam was happy to help . he took the potatoes from the bag and put them in the sink . he turned on the faucet and grabbed the soap .

" sam , can you answer the phone ? " his mom called from the living room . " it 's ringing . "

