" mom , can i answer the phone later ? " he asked .

" no , sam , you have to answer it now . it might be important . maybe it 's grandma or dad . just dry your hands and pick it up . i 'll come and help you with the potatoes in a minute . "

sam nodded . he dried his hands with a towel and ran to the phone . he picked it up and said hello .

