sam smiled . he liked talking to grandma . she always asked him about his day and told him stories .

" i 'm good , grandma . i 'm helping mom in the kitchen . we 're making mashed potatoes . i like mashed potatoes . they 're yummy . "

" that 's wonderful , sam . you 're such a good helper . i like mashed potatoes too . maybe i 'll come over for dinner someday and we can eat them together . "

" i 'd like that , grandma . i miss you . "

" i miss you too , sam . i love you . can i talk to mom ? "

" sure , grandma . hold on . i 'll get her . "

sam put the phone on the counter and ran to the living room . he found his mom on the couch , reading a book .

" mom , it 's grandma . she wants to talk to you . she 's on the phone . "

" thank you , sam . you 're very organized . you did a great job washing the potatoes and answering the phone . i 'm proud of you . "

sam hugged his mom . he felt happy . he liked helping his mom and talking to his grandma . he hoped they would have mashed potatoes for dinner soon . tim and sam were friends who liked to play with toys . one day , they found a big bag full of old toys in the attic . they were very happy and took the bag to their room .

" look , sam , there are so many toys here ! cars , trains , dolls , puzzles , and more ! " tim said .

" yes , tim , they are very fun ! let 's try them all ! " sam said .

they opened the bag and took out the toys . some of the toys were broken or dirty , but they did not care . they played with them for a long time , making noise and mess .

but then , tim 's mom came to their room . she was not happy . she saw the bag and the toys and said :

" tim , sam , what are you doing ? these toys are not yours . they belong to your grandpa . he gave them to me when i was little . they are very special and old . you should not play with them like that . you should be careful and respectful . look , you broke some of them and made them dirty . how do you think your grandpa would feel ? "

tim and sam felt bad . they did not know the toys were so important . they said :

" we are sorry , mom . we did not know . we just wanted to play . we did not mean to hurt the toys . "

tim 's mom said :

" i know , boys . but you should always ask before you take something that is not yours . and you should treat things with care and love . these toys are part of our family history . they have memories and stories . they need to be restored and cleaned . do you want to help me do that ? "

tim and sam nodded . they wanted to make up for their mistake . they said :

" yes , mom . we want to help . we want to restore the toys and make them nice again . we want to learn about them and their stories . we want to make you and grandpa happy . "

tim 's mom smiled . she said :

" thank you , boys . that is very kind and patient of you . i am proud of you . come on , let 's go to the attic and find the tools and materials we need . and then , i will tell you some stories about these toys and how your grandpa and i played with them when we were little . "

tim and sam followed their mom . they felt sorry , but also curious and excited . they learned a lesson that day . they learned to respect and value the things that belong to others . they learned to restore and care for the things that are old and special . and they learned to listen and enjoy the stories that connect them to their family . sara and tom are playing with blocks . they like to build towers and houses and cars . sara has a big red block that she wants to put on top of her tower . tom sees the red block and wants it too . he tries to take it from sara 's hand .

