they tried to read the words . they did not understand them . they got bored . they decided to hop on the book . they thought it was a game .

they hopped and hopped . they made the book dirty and torn . they did not care . they laughed and laughed .

but then , they heard a voice . it was the librarian . she had followed them . she was angry .

" hey , you two ! what are you doing with my dictionary ? that is not a toy ! that is a very important book ! you have ruined it ! " she shouted .

