tim and sam were scared . they cried . they wished they had listened to sam . they wished they had not taken the book . they wished they had not hopped on it . they learned a hard lesson . tom likes to write . he writes with his crayons on paper . he writes his name , and his mom 's name , and his dad 's name . he writes big and small and many colors .

one day , tom gets a letter from his uncle . his uncle lives far away , in another country . tom is happy to see the letter . he opens it and sees a picture of his uncle and a note . the note says : " hello , tom . i miss you and i love you . how are you ? what do you like to do ? write to me soon . your uncle . "

tom wants to write back to his uncle . he asks his mom for help . his mom gives him a new paper and an envelope . she helps him write his address and his uncle 's address . she says : " now you can write whatever you want to your uncle . he will be happy to hear from you . "

tom thinks for a moment . then he writes with his crayons on the paper . he writes : " hi , uncle . i am good . i like to write . i write a lot . i write to you . i miss you and i love you . tom . " he draws a heart and a smiley face . he puts the paper in the envelope and seals it . he gives it to his mom . he says : " mom , can you send this to my uncle ? "

his mom smiles and hugs him . she says : " of course , tom . you are a very good writer . your uncle will be very happy to get your letter . you are a very sweet boy . " tom feels proud and happy . he hopes his uncle will write to him again soon . he likes to write . lily and ben like to play in the maze . the maze is big and green . it has many paths and walls . lily and ben try to find the way out .

" come on , ben , this way ! " lily says . she runs to the left . ben follows her . he likes to run with lily .

but lily runs too fast . she does not see the hole . she falls into the hole . she cries . " ow , ow , ow ! help me , ben ! "

