they smile . they are happy . they play in the maze again . they are careful . they do not fall . they have fun . mia loved to paint . she had many colors to choose from , but her favorite was yellow . yellow was the color of the sun , the flowers and the bananas . she was very enthusiastic when she painted with yellow .

one day , she decided to paint a big picture for her mom . she took a big piece of paper and a big brush . she dipped the brush in the yellow paint and started to make strokes and swirls . she wanted to make a happy picture with yellow .

she painted for a long time , until the paper was full of yellow . she was very proud of her work . she looked around for a place to put it . she saw the wall in the living room . it was white and boring . she thought it would look better with yellow .

she ran to the wall with her picture and tried to stick it with tape . but the tape did not work . the picture fell to the floor . she was sad . she wanted to show her mom her yellow picture .

she had an idea . she took her brush and dipped it in the yellow paint again . she reached up and painted on the wall . she made strokes and swirls like on the paper . she smiled . she thought the wall looked much better with yellow .

she heard her mom coming . she ran to the door and shouted , " mom , look what i did ! i painted a yellow picture for you ! " she was very enthusiastic . she hoped her mom would like it . lily and tom were playing with blocks in the living room . they liked to build towers and houses and cars with the blocks . lily was bossy and always told tom what to do . she said , " tom , give me that blue block . i need it for my house . and do n't touch my tower , it 's very tall and pretty . "

