lily and tom started to argue . they pulled and pushed the blocks . they raised their voices and made a lot of noise . they did not hear their mom coming from the kitchen . she was holding a tray of cookies and milk . she wanted to give them a snack and a hug .

but when she saw lily and tom fighting , she was very angry . she said , " lily and tom , stop it right now ! you are being very rude and naughty . you are not sharing and you are not listening . you are making a mess and a noise . and you are breaking the blocks ! "

lily and tom stopped and looked at their mom . they saw that some of the blocks were broken . they had snapped and cracked when they pulled and pushed them . they felt very sorry and ashamed . they said , " mom , we are sorry . we broke the blocks . we were not nice to each other . we are sorry . "

mom put down the tray and sighed . she said , " lily and tom , i 'm glad you are sorry . but you have to be more careful and kind . the blocks are not yours . they belong to the school . you have to return them tomorrow . and you have to say sorry to your teacher and your friends . and you have to help me fix the blocks . do you understand ? "

lily and tom nodded . they said , " yes , mom , we understand . we will say sorry and we will help you fix the blocks . and we will share and listen and be nice to each other . we promise . "

mom smiled and hugged them . she said , " that 's good . i love you both . now , let 's have some cookies and milk . they are warm and sweet . and you are cold and hungry . come on , let 's go to the kitchen . " anna and ben went to the zoo with mom and dad . they saw many animals , like lions , monkeys , and birds . anna liked the birds best . they had many colors and made funny sounds .

