the monkey did not wave back . he just stared at ben .

the end . lily was a kid who liked to rush . she always ran fast to the park , to the store , to the school . she did not like to wait or walk slow . she wanted to see and do everything .

one day , lily saw a big red ball in the window of a shop . she wanted the ball very much . she asked her mom to buy it for her . her mom said no . she said the ball was too cheap . it would break soon and make lily sad .

lily was angry . she did not listen to her mom . she ran into the shop and took the ball . she did not pay for it . she rushed out of the door with the ball in her hands .

but she did not see the car that was coming fast . the car hit lily and the ball . lily fell down and hurt her leg . the ball popped and flew away . lily cried and cried . her mom came and hugged her . she said she was sorry and took her to the doctor .

lily learned a lesson . she learned that rushing is not good . she learned that cheap things are not good . she learned that listening to her mom is good . she said sorry to her mom and to the shop . she said she would not rush or take things again . she said she would be a good kid . tom and lily are going to a hotel with their mom and dad . they are very happy because they have never been to a hotel before . they pack their bags with their toys , books and clothes . they also bring a big jar of cookies that mom baked for them . they are sweet and crunchy .

when they get to the hotel , they see a big building with many windows and doors . a man in a uniform helps them with their bags . he smiles and says , " welcome to the hotel . i hope you enjoy your stay . " he takes them to a big room with two beds , a tv and a bathroom . tom and lily jump on the beds and turn on the tv . they see cartoons and laugh .

mom and dad say , " we are going to the restaurant for dinner . do you want to come with us or stay in the room ? " tom and lily look at each other and say , " we want to stay in the room . we have cookies and cartoons . " mom and dad say , " ok , but be good and do n't make a mess . we will be back soon . " they give them a hug and a kiss and leave .

tom and lily eat some cookies and watch some cartoons . they are having fun . but after a while , they get bored . they decide to play a game . they raise their hands and say , " let 's pretend we are superheroes . i am super tom and you are super lily . we have to save the world from bad guys . " they put on their capes and masks and run around the room . they make noises and jump on the beds .

but they are too loud and too wild . they knock over a lamp and break a vase . they spill some juice on the carpet and make a stain . they do n't notice that the man in the uniform is knocking on the door . he opens the door and sees the mess . he is angry and says , " what are you doing ? this is a hotel , not a playground . you have to be quiet and respectful . where are your parents ? " tom and lily are scared and sorry . they lower their hands and say , " we are sorry , sir . we were just playing . our parents are at the restaurant . please do n't be mad at us . " the man in the uniform sighs and says , " i will call your parents and tell them to come back . you have to clean up this mess and apologize . and no more cookies and cartoons for you . you have to go to bed . " tom and lily nod and say , " yes , sir . we are sorry , sir . " they start to clean up the mess and wait for their parents . they wish they had gone to the restaurant with them . they learn their lesson . they are not superheroes . they are just kids . one day , lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . they saw a big hill with many trees and flowers . they wanted to explore it .

" let 's go to the hill , " lily said . " maybe we can find something fun . "

" ok , " ben said . " but be careful . there might be monsters there . "

lily and ben ran to the hill . they climbed up and down . they smelled the flowers and touched the leaves . they heard a strange noise .

" what is that ? " lily asked . " it sounds like a growl . "

" maybe it 's a monster , " ben said . " let 's hide behind this rock . "

they hid behind the rock and peeked out . they saw a big , furry , mysterious creature . it had horns , claws and teeth . it was looking for something .

" shh , do n't make a sound , " ben whispered . " maybe it will go away . "

but the creature did not go away . it came closer and closer to the rock . lily and ben were scared . they wanted to run , but they were trapped .

" help , help ! " lily shouted . " there 's a monster ! "

the creature heard lily 's shout . it turned around and saw them . it roared and ran towards them .

lily and ben screamed . they thought they were going to be eaten .

but then , they heard another shout .

" hey , stop that ! " it was lily 's dad . he had followed them to the hill . he saw the creature and threw a stick at it .

the creature was scared of lily 's dad . it ran away into the woods .

lily and ben ran to lily 's dad . they hugged him and thanked him .

" you 're welcome , " lily 's dad said . " but you should n't go to the hill alone . it 's dangerous . that creature was a bear . it could have hurt you . "

lily and ben nodded . they learned their lesson . they never went to the hill again without lily 's dad . they were happy and safe . lily and tom were playing with paper . they liked to fold it and make shapes . lily made a hat , and tom made a boat . they put them on the table and smiled .

