the moral value of the story is : you should respect other people 's things and ask before you touch them . you should also apologize and make up for your mistakes . you should use your creativity in appropriate ways . ben and sam are brothers . they like to play with toys . one day , they find a pistol in their dad 's closet . it is shiny and black .

