they hug mom and each other . they are happy . they learned a lesson . they will try to be fair and not fight over things . they will share and play nicely . they will love their sock and their coins . and their mom . the end . ben and lily liked to play in the garden . they had a big box of books that they could read or look at . one day , they found a very big book with many words in it . it was a dictionary .

