they put the dictionary back in the box and picked another book . it was a story about a cat and a mouse . they liked it better . it had words they knew and pictures they liked . they read and laughed together . they had fun in the garden . lily and max were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they got a big package from their grandma . they were very happy and ran to open it . inside , they found two new dolls , one for each of them .

