they hugged and took the ship to the living room . they played with it happily and had fun . they sailed to different places and had adventures . they learned to share and be kind . they were the best pirates ever . tom liked to play golf with his dad . they had a bag with sticks and balls . they hit the balls with the sticks and tried to make them go in a hole . tom had a small stick and a small ball . his dad had a big stick and a big ball .

