lily and tom cried . they felt sorry and scared . they wished they had not opened the box . they wished they had listened to their mom . they wished they had a regular day . they did not like surprises anymore . lila and ben are playing in the park . they like to slide on the big slide . lila has a pink dress and ben has a blue shirt . they take turns to slide down .

