they have fun in the park . they learn to yield and share . they are happy . anna loved ponies . she had many pony toys in her room . she played with them every day . she wished she had a real pony to ride and hug .

one day , anna 's mom said , " i have a surprise for you , anna . come with me to the car . " anna was excited . she wondered what the surprise was . she hoped it was a pony .

