anna nodded . she ran to the pony and hugged him . he nuzzled her hair and snorted . anna felt happy . she thanked her mom and said , " i love you , coco . you are the best surprise ever . " lily and ben are friends . they like to play with their toys . but today they have a quarrel . they both want the same toy . it is a long fur snake that can make noise .

