they hug and make up . they decide to share the snake . they take turns to play with it . they make it slither and curl . they laugh and have fun .

they are friends again . they are happy . sara and ben were playing in the living room . they liked to draw pictures with crayons and paper . sara drew a big flower with many colors . ben drew a funny face with a big nose and ears . they were happy with their pictures .

then they heard mommy coming home . they wanted to show her their pictures . but they forgot to clean up the crayons . they left them on the couch and on the floor . mommy did not like that . she always told them to put away their toys .

