they started to panic . they looked for the box . but they could not find it . they had too many crayons . they could not hold them all . some of them fell from their hands . they rolled under the table and behind the chair .

mommy opened the door . she saw the mess . she saw the crayons . she saw the pictures . she was not happy . she had a terrible face . she said in a loud voice :

" sara ! ben ! what have you done ? look at this mess . look at these crayons . look at these pictures . how many times have i told you to clean up after yourselves ? this is not how we treat our home . you are in big trouble , young ones . "

sara and ben felt very bad . they wanted to make mommy happy . they wanted to show her their pictures . they did not mean to make a mess . they said in a small voice :

