she hugged them and kissed them and made them calm down .

" listen , my dears , i know you are having fun , but you have to be careful and kind . you ca n't destroy each other 's things . that 's not nice . and you ca n't destroy your life by fighting . that 's not good . you have to share and help and love each other . that 's what makes life happy and beautiful . do you understand ? " she said .

tom and mia nodded , feeling sorry and ashamed .

" we 're sorry , grandma , " they said .

they hugged her and said they loved her .

