she helped them pick up the blocks and the doll and fix them .

then she said , " why do n't we make a new city together ? and we can put the doll in it too . how does that sound ? "

tom and mia agreed and said it sounded fun .

they followed grandma to the floor and started to build a new city with her .

they played and laughed and talked and had a good time .

they did not destroy anything anymore .

they made life happy and beautiful . anna and ben were playing outside in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide on the grass . but the sky was getting dark and the wind was getting cold . anna felt a shiver on her arms .

