ben looked at the sky and nodded . " yes , let 's go . but first , we need to put on our jackets . they will keep us warm . "

he took out his blue jacket from his backpack and put it on . he helped anna put on her pink jacket . she zipped it up and felt better .

" ben , why do we need jackets ? " she wondered .

ben smiled and tried to explain . " jackets are like blankets . they cover us and make us feel cozy . they also protect us from the wind and the rain . the wind and the rain can make us sick if we do n't wear jackets . "

anna nodded . she understood . she liked her jacket . it was soft and fluffy and had a hood . she pulled the hood over her head and pretended to be a mighty lion . she roared and chased ben .

" rawr ! i 'm a mighty lion ! you ca n't catch me ! " she shouted .

ben laughed and ran after her . he pretended to be a mighty tiger . he growled and pounced on her .

