they played and giggled until they reached their home . they hugged and said goodbye . they were happy and warm in their jackets . they thanked their jackets for being so nice . tim and kim were twins who liked to play in the yard . one day , they saw a big truck with a lot of black rocks on it . they wondered what the rocks were .

