she closed the box and put it in her car . she kissed tom and lily goodbye . she told them to have a nice trip and to say hello to grandma and grandpa .

tom and lily waved at her . they felt a little better . they knew snowy was in good hands . they hoped he would not miss them too much .

they followed mom and dad to the gate . they boarded the plane . they buckled their seat belts . they looked out the window . they saw the airport getting smaller and smaller . they wondered what grandma and grandpa 's place was like . they were excited and curious . they were also a little scared . they had never been on a plane before .

they held each other 's hands . they closed their eyes . they thought of snowy . they whispered , " we love you , snowy . see you soon . " anna and ben were twins who lived in a big house with their wealthy parents . they had many toys and clothes and books , but they were not happy . they wanted to go outside and play with other children , but their parents said it was too cold and foggy .

one day , they saw a big hole in the fence that surrounded their house . they decided to sneak out and explore the world . they put on their coats and hats and ran through the hole . they saw a park with swings and slides and a pond . they also saw many children laughing and running and playing .

" hello , can we play with you ? " anna asked a girl with curly hair and a red dress .

" sure , what 's your name ? " the girl said .

" i 'm anna and this is my brother ben . we live in that big house over there , " anna said , pointing to their house .

" wow , you must be very wealthy , " the girl said . " i 'm lily and i live in that small house over there , " she said , pointing to a house that looked old and worn .

" wealthy ? what does that mean ? " ben asked .

" it means you have a lot of money and things , " lily said .

" oh , we do n't care about money and things . we just want to have fun and make friends , " ben said .

" then you are very lucky , " lily said . " come on , let 's play ! "

anna and ben had a lot of fun with lily and the other children . they swung on the swings , slid on the slides , and fed the ducks in the pond . they forgot about the time and the cold and the fog .

but soon , the mist became thicker and darker . they could not see their house or lily 's house anymore . they could only see each other and the park .

" we should go back , " anna said . " our parents will be worried . "

" ok , let 's go , " ben said .

they said goodbye to lily and the other children and thanked them for playing with them . they ran back to the hole in the fence , but they could not find it . the mist was too thick . they were lost .

they started to cry and call for help . they wished they had never left their house . they wished they had listened to their parents .

then , they heard a familiar voice .

" anna ! ben ! where are you ? " their father shouted .

" daddy ! daddy ! we 're here ! " anna and ben shouted back .

their father found them and hugged them . he was angry and relieved . he took them back to their house and scolded them for running away . he also told them he loved them and was glad they were safe .

anna and ben felt sorry and happy . they said they were sorry and they loved him too . they also told him about lily and the other children and the park . they asked him if they could play with them again .

their father smiled and said , " maybe , but only if you ask me first and if the weather is clear . no more mist adventures , ok ? "

" ok , daddy , " anna and ben said .

they learned their lesson and never ran away again . they also made friends with lily and the other children and played with them often . they realized that being wealthy was not as important as being happy and having fun . and they lived happily ever after .

the end . sara and ben like to play with cardboard . they cut it into shapes and colors . they make a game with it . they have to match the shapes and colors .

sara picks up a thin cardboard . it is red and round . she looks for another thin cardboard that is red and round . she finds one on the floor . she puts them together . she says , " i matched them ! "

ben picks up a thick cardboard . it is blue and square . he looks for another thick cardboard that is blue and square . he does not find one . he sees a thin cardboard that is blue and square . he tries to put them together . they do not fit . he says , " they do not match ! "

sara says , " you have to find the same shape and the same color and the same thickness . then they match . "

ben says , " oh , i see . thank you , sara . " he looks for another thick cardboard that is blue and square . he finds one on the table . he puts them together . he says , " i matched them ! "

sara and ben smile . they keep playing with cardboard . they have fun matching them . anna loves to look at the stars at night . she thinks they are very pretty and shiny . she wants to know more about them . she asks her mom , " what are the stars , mom ? "

her mom says , " the stars are very far away . they are like big balls of fire in the sky . they are part of the universe . the universe is everything that is out there , beyond the earth . "

anna says , " wow , the universe is very big . can we go there , mom ? "

her mom says , " no , we ca n't go there , anna . it is too far and too dangerous . we can only see it from here . "

anna is sad . she wants to see the universe up close . she thinks of a plan . she says , " mom , can i invite some friends over tomorrow ? "

her mom says , " sure , anna . who do you want to invite ? "

anna says , " i want to invite ben and lily . they like the stars too . we can play together and make a rocket . "

her mom says , " okay , anna . that sounds like fun . but remember , you can only play in the backyard . you ca n't go anywhere else . "

anna says , " okay , mom . thank you . "

the next day , anna , ben and lily play in the backyard . they use cardboard boxes , paper , tape and crayons to make a rocket . they pretend to be astronauts and explore the universe . they have a lot of fun .

but then , anna sees a big hill behind the fence . she thinks , " maybe we can see the stars better from there . maybe we can even touch them . " she says to ben and lily , " hey , let 's go to the hill . we can take our rocket with us . "

ben and lily say , " but anna , we ca n't go there . your mom said we can only play in the backyard . we might get lost or hurt . "

anna says , " do n't be scared . it will be fun . come on , let 's go . "

she grabs the rocket and runs to the fence . she tries to climb over it . but the fence is too high and the rocket is too heavy . she falls down and hurts her knee . she cries .

ben and lily run to her and help her up . they say , " anna , are you okay ? we told you not to go there . you should listen to your mom . she knows what is best for you . "

anna says , " i 'm sorry . i was wrong . i just wanted to see the universe . but i guess it is too big for us . we are too small . "

ben and lily say , " it 's okay , anna . we understand . we like the universe too . but we can still see it from here . and we can still play with our rocket . we are your friends . we love you . "

they hug anna and take her back to the backyard . they put a band - aid on her knee and give her some juice . they continue to play and have fun . they look at the stars and smile . they are happy . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with cars and balls . but tom has a new toy . it is a mop . tom says it is a magic mop . he can make it fly and talk . sam does not have a mop . he is jealous of tom .

one day , tom and sam go to the park . tom brings his mop . he shows sam how he can make it fly and talk . he says , " mop , mop , mop , go up and down . mop , mop , mop , make a funny sound . " the mop flies up and down and makes a funny sound . sam thinks it is not fair . he wants to play with the mop .

sam says , " tom , can i try your mop ? " tom says , " no , it is my mop . you can play with your ball . " sam is angry . he waits for tom to look away . then he grabs the mop and runs away . he says , " ha , ha , ha , now i have the mop . mop , mop , mop , go up and down . mop , mop , mop , make a funny sound . "

but the mop does not fly or talk . it is just a mop . sam is confused . he looks at the mop . he sees a button . he pushes the button . the mop makes a loud noise . it is not a funny sound . it is a siren . the mop is not a magic mop . it is a mop that tom 's dad uses for work . he is a fireman .

tom hears the siren . he sees sam with his mop . he is angry . he runs after sam . he says , " sam , give me back my mop . it is not a toy . it is my dad 's mop . he needs it for work . you are a bad friend . "

sam is scared . he sees tom coming . he sees a fire truck coming . he sees tom 's dad coming . he says , " sorry , tom , sorry , tom 's dad , i did not know . i was jealous of your mop . i wanted to play with it . please do n't be mad at me . "

tom 's dad takes the mop . he says , " sam , you should not take things that are not yours . you could have caused a lot of trouble . you are lucky that there is no fire today . you should say sorry to tom and share your toys with him . "

sam says sorry to tom . he says , " tom , i am sorry . i was a bad friend . can we still be friends ? " tom says , " yes , sam , we can still be friends . but you have to share your toys with me too . " sam says , " ok , tom , i will share my toys with you . do you want to play with my ball ? " tom says , " yes , sam , i want to play with your ball . and you can play with my cars . " they hug and play with their toys . they are friends again . anna and ben are playing in the garden . they dig a big hole with their shovels . they want to find a treasure .

" look , i found a root ! " ben says . he pulls a long brown thing out of the dirt . " maybe it is a snake ! "

anna laughs . " that is not a snake , silly . that is a root . it is part of a plant . it helps the plant drink water . "

ben is not sure . he thinks the root looks like a snake . he wants to keep it . he puts it in his pocket .

" come on , ben . let 's finish our hole . maybe we will find something else . " anna says . she is bossy . she likes to tell ben what to do .

ben nods . he follows anna . he digs some more . he hopes to find a real snake . he likes snakes . he thinks they are cool . he does not like roots . he thinks they are boring . sara and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big sign . the sign says : " help us find the hidden treasure . pass the test and win a prize . "

sara and ben are curious . they want to find the treasure and win the prize . they go to the sign and see a man . the man smiles and says : " hello , kids . do you want to play the game ? "

sara and ben nod . the man says : " the game is easy . you have to answer three questions . if you answer them right , you can look for the treasure . are you ready ? "

sara and ben say : " yes , we are ready . "

the man asks the first question : " what is the color of the sky ? "

sara and ben say : " blue . "

the man says : " that 's right . good job . here is the second question : what is the name of the animal that says ' woof ' ? "

sara and ben say : " dog . "

the man says : " that 's right . well done . here is the last question : what is the shape of a ball ? "

sara and ben say : " round . "

the man says : " that 's right . you are very smart . you passed the test . now you can look for the treasure . the treasure is hidden in the park . here is a clue : it is under something that swings . "

sara and ben thank the man and run to the park . they look for something that swings . they see a swing set . they look under the swings . they see a box . they open the box . they see a lot of candy . they are very happy . they found the treasure . they share the candy and enjoy the prize . they had a lot of fun . tom and sam were best friends . they liked to play and have fun . one day , they went to the park with their moms . there was a big pool in the park . tom and sam wanted to swim in the pool .

" can we swim , mom ? " tom asked .

" sure , but you have to wear your swim hats and stay close to us , " tom 's mom said .

" ok , mom , " tom said . he put on his swim hat . it was blue and had a shark on it . he thought it made him look mighty .

sam put on his swim hat too . it was red and had a star on it . he thought it made him look cool .

tom and sam ran to the pool . they jumped in and splashed each other . they laughed and had fun . they felt the water on their skin . it was cold and wet .

but then , something bad happened . tom 's swim hat came off . it floated away from him . he tried to catch it , but it was too far . he felt scared . he did not want to lose his swim hat . he liked his swim hat .

" help , sam ! help ! " tom shouted .

sam heard tom . he saw his swim hat . he swam to get it . he was fast and brave . he reached the swim hat . he grabbed it with his hand . he swam back to tom . he gave him his swim hat .

" here , tom . here is your swim hat , " sam said .

" thank you , sam . you are a good friend , " tom said .

he put on his swim hat again . he felt happy and safe . he hugged sam .

tom 's mom and sam 's mom saw what happened . they were proud of their boys . they clapped and cheered .

" good job , sam ! you are a mighty swimmer ! " sam 's mom said .

" good job , tom ! you are a smart swimmer ! " tom 's mom said .

tom and sam smiled . they felt good . they were best friends . they locked their hands and swam together . they had more fun . they loved to swim . tom and lily were playing in the yard . they liked to dig in the dirt and make mud pies . they did not like to wash their hands or faces . they said they were not filthy , just having fun .

one day , they found a shiny pin in the dirt . they wanted to keep it and play with it . they did not know that the pin was sharp and could hurt them . they did not know that the pin was dirty and could make them sick .

they took the pin to their room and hid it under their bed . they did not tell their mom or dad . they thought they were smart and sneaky . they did not know that they were foolish and naughty .

the next day , they wanted to play with the pin again . they lifted the bed and looked for it . but they could not find it . they searched and searched , but the pin was gone . they were sad and angry .

