they boarded the plane and found their seats . they buckled their seat belts and listened to the instructions . they looked out the window and saw the clouds . they were ready for their adventure . lily and ben were friends who liked to play with blocks . they made towers and houses and cars with the blocks . but sometimes , lily was jealous of ben . she wanted to have more blocks than him , or make bigger towers than him , or have the prettiest colors . she did not like to share or say nice things .

