they said they loved them too . they said they would never go into the hole again . they said they would always listen to their mom and dad .

they went back to sleep , and dreamed of happy things . lily was a cheerful girl who liked to play with her toys and talk to her friends . she had a big dream of becoming a dancer when she grew up . she always danced in her room and showed her moves to her mom and dad .

