they ride their bikes on the grass and the dirt . they have fun going fast and making turns . they are happy and proud . they are good friends . lily liked to talk to her plant . she gave it water and sun and said nice things to it . she hoped the plant would reply , but it never did . it only grew green leaves and sometimes flowers .

