they hug and go to play with the laser and the paper things . they have a lot of fun and laugh together . they are happy and good brothers . tom and anna were twins . they liked to play together , but sometimes they fought . one day , they had a big fight over a toy . tom wanted to play with the toy , but anna said it was hers . they pulled and pushed and shouted .

" give me the toy , it 's mine ! " tom said .

