sara is sad . she says , " i 'm sorry , mom . i like to write . i wanted to show you my name . "

mom hugs sara and says , " i know , sara . i love your name . and i love your writing . but you have to write on the right things . the bowl is not the right thing . the paper is the right thing . do you understand ? "

sara nods and says , " yes , mom . i understand . i will write on paper only . can i have some soup ? "

mom smiles and says , " yes , sara . you can have some soup . you are a good girl . and a good writer . and a dependable daughter . i love you . "

sara smiles and says , " i love you too , mom . and i love soup . and writing . " lila and ben are friends . they like to play catch with a ball . they throw the ball to each other and run after it . they have fun .

one day , they see a new kid in the park . he wears a mask on his face . he looks scary . he has a big ball . he throws it at lila and ben . he wants to play catch with them . but he does not ask . he just throws .

lila and ben are scared . they do not want to play with the new kid . they want to play by themselves . they are independent . they run away from the new kid . they hide behind a tree .

the new kid follows them . he finds them behind the tree . he says , " why do you run away ? i want to play with you . i am lonely . my mask is not scary . it is funny . look , it has a nose and a mouth and eyes . it is a clown mask . do you like clowns ? "

lila and ben look at the new kid . they see his mask . it is not scary . it is funny . they laugh . they say , " we are sorry . we did not know . we thought you were scary . we like clowns . we like to play catch . do you want to be our friend ? "

the new kid smiles . he says , " yes , i want to be your friend . my name is sam . what are your names ? "

