lila and ben say , " yes , you can share your ball with us . we can take turns . we can have fun . "

they play catch with sam 's ball . they throw it to each other and run after it . they have fun . they are friends . anna likes to clap . she claps when she is happy . she claps when she hears music . she claps when she sees something funny .

one day , anna wants to take a shower . she asks her mom to help her . her mom turns on the water and puts some soap on a sponge . she rubs the sponge on anna 's hair and body . anna feels the water and the bubbles . she thinks it is fun .

anna looks at the shower curtain . it is colorful . it has many shapes and animals on it . she sees a red circle , a blue square , a yellow star , a green frog , and a pink pig . she points at each one and says their names . she claps for each one . she likes the colorful shower curtain .

her mom says it is time to get out of the shower . she wraps anna in a big towel . she dries her hair and body . she puts on some lotion and a clean dress . she hugs anna and says she is proud of her .

anna smiles and says thank you . she feels warm and cozy . she claps for her mom . she likes to take a shower . lily and ben were playing with their dolls in the garden . they liked to make up stories and act them out . lily was the princess and ben was the knight . they had a castle made of cardboard and a dragon made of paper .

" help me , help me ! " lily cried . " the dragon is coming to eat me ! "

" i will save you , princess ! " ben shouted . he ran towards the dragon and pretended to fight it with his sword . he made loud noises and moved his arms .

but then , he tripped over a rock and fell down . he hurt his knee and it started to bleed . he felt a lot of pain and began to cry .

lily heard him and ran to him . she dropped her doll and hugged him . she tried to make him feel better .

" do n't cry , ben . it 's just a little cut . i will get a band - aid for you . you are very brave . "

she smiled at him and kissed his cheek . ben stopped crying and smiled back . he felt a little better .

but then , they heard a voice from the fence .

" what are you doing , kids ? why are you crying ? what is that dragon ? "

it was mrs. jones , their nosy neighbor . she always wanted to know everything . she looked over the fence and saw their game .

