they looked at each other and had an idea . they picked up their dragon and threw it at her . it hit her face and made her scream .

" go away , mrs. jones ! this is our game ! you are not welcome here ! "

they shouted and laughed . they ran back to their castle and continued their story . they were happy and had fun . they forgot about the pain and the nosy neighbor . tommy loved his bicycle . it was red and shiny and had a bell . he liked to ride it around the park with his friends . one day , he saw a new bicycle in the park . it was enormous . it had big wheels and a basket and a horn . tommy wanted to try it .

he went to the boy who owned the bicycle . " can i ride your bicycle ? " he asked .

the boy shook his head . " no , this is my bicycle . go away . "

tommy felt sad and angry . he wanted to ride the enormous bicycle . he thought of a plan . he waited until the boy was not looking . then he ran to the bicycle and jumped on it . he pushed the horn and it made a loud noise .

" hey , that 's my bicycle ! " the boy shouted . he ran after tommy .

tommy pedaled fast . he felt happy and excited . he rode the bicycle around the park . he did not see the hole in the ground . he hit the hole and fell off the bicycle . he scraped his knee and his elbow . he cried .

the boy caught up with him . he took his bicycle back . he looked at tommy . he saw his tears and his scrapes . he felt sorry for him .

" are you okay ? " he asked .

tommy nodded . he felt sorry too . he had been mean and selfish . he had taken the boy 's bicycle without asking .

" i 'm sorry , " he said . " i should not have taken your bicycle . it was wrong . "

the boy smiled . he had an idea . he held out his hand .

" it 's okay , " he said . " do you want to be friends ? "

tommy smiled too . he took his hand .

" yes , please , " he said .

the boy helped tommy up . he gave him a band - aid for his knee and his elbow . he let him ride his bicycle for a little while . they shared the horn and the basket . they had fun .

tommy learned a lesson . he learned to ask before he took something . he learned to be kind and share . he learned to make a new friend . he was happy . anna liked to play dress - up with her mom 's clothes . she found a pretty blouse in the closet and put it on . it was too big for her , but she did not care . she felt like a princess .

