her mom kissed her and said , " you are always pretty , anna . and the blouse is not important . i can wash it or buy a new one . but you are my precious girl , and i love you very much . come on , let 's clean your nose and put a band - aid on it . then we can have some cookies and milk , okay ? "

anna nodded and smiled . she felt better . she loved her mom too . she learned to be more careful with doors and clothes . she still liked to play dress - up , but she asked her mom first . her mom sometimes let her wear her old blouses , and they had fun together . ben and mia are friends . they like to play with a basketball . they bounce it , throw it , and catch it . they have fun together .

