they smile at each other and sip their lemonade . they feel happy and cool in the shade of the big tree . tom and lily were twins who liked to play and have fun . but sometimes they did not listen to their mom and dad . they made a mess in their room , they spilled their juice on the sofa , and they broke their toys . mom and dad were not happy . they said , " tom and lily , you have been very bad . you need to learn to be good . we will punish you . you have to do a hard task . "

tom and lily were scared . they did not want to be punished . they did not want to do a hard task . they said , " we are sorry , mom and dad . please do not punish us . please do not give us a hard task . we will be good from now on . "

mom and dad looked at tom and lily . they saw that they were sorry . but they also wanted them to learn a lesson . they said , " we love you , tom and lily . but you have to be responsible for your actions . you have to clean your room , wash the sofa , and fix your toys . that is your hard task . you have to do it by yourself . we will help you only if you ask nicely . "

tom and lily nodded . they knew they had to do their hard task . they went to their room and started to clean . they picked up their clothes , their books , and their toys . they put them in their drawers , their shelves , and their boxes . they found some glue and tape and tried to fix their broken toys . they worked hard and did not complain .

when they finished , they went to the living room and washed the sofa . they used a sponge , some soap , and some water . they rubbed the stain until it was gone . they dried the sofa with a towel . they worked hard and did not complain .

they went to mom and dad and said , " we did our hard task , mom and dad . we cleaned our room , we washed the sofa , and we fixed our toys . we are sorry for being bad . we will be good from now on . "

mom and dad smiled and hugged tom and lily . they said , " we are proud of you , tom and lily . you did your hard task very well . you showed us that you are sorry and that you can be good . we forgive you . you can play and have fun now . but remember to listen to us and to take care of your things . "

tom and lily said , " thank you , mom and dad . we love you . we will listen to you and take care of our things . " they went to play and have fun . they were happy . lily and tom are twins . they share a room and a big mattress . they like to play and jump on the mattress . but sometimes they make too much noise and mom gets angry .

one night , mom says , " it 's time for bed , lily and tom . stop jumping and listen to me . you need to sleep and be quiet . "

