they hear mom coming . they quickly pull the blanket over the mattress . they pretend to sleep . they hope mom wo n't notice the smelly spot . they feel sorry and scared . they wish they had listened to mom . tom and lily are friends . they like to play in the farm . they see many animals and plants . they see corn . corn is yellow and tall .

