" corn is good . corn is yummy . we like corn . "

they are friends . they play in the farm . they are happy . lily and sam liked to play in the tent in the garden . they pretended it was a castle or a spaceship or a cave . one day , they heard a strange noise inside the tent . it sounded like a growl or a snort .

