she leaves the bathroom . the boys play with the boats . they pretend to be sailors and go on adventures . they do not fight anymore . they are happy . tim and kim were friends who liked to print pictures . they had a big box of paper and crayons . they printed flowers , cars , stars and animals . they had fun and shared their pictures .

