he opened his big mouth and snapped at them . tim and kim screamed and ran away . but it was too late . the crocodile caught them and ate them . he was very happy . he liked the taste of tim and kim . he did not care about their pictures . he tore them and threw them away .

the end . lily was a bee who liked to fly very fast . she did not listen to her mom or dad , who told her to be careful and stay close to the hive . she wanted to see everything in the garden and the sky .

one day , she saw a big red flower that smelled very sweet . she flew towards it , but did not see the spider web that was in front of it . she got stuck in the sticky web and could not move . she was scared and cried for help .

" help me , help me ! " she buzzed .

sam was a bee who was flying nearby . he heard lily 's cry and flew to see what was wrong . he saw her trapped in the web and felt sorry for her .

