" thank you , sam , you are very kind , " lily said .

" you are welcome , lily , but you should be more careful . the garden and the sky are full of dangers . you should listen to your mom and dad and stay close to the hive , " sam said .

lily nodded and said sorry . she learned her lesson and never flew too far or too fast again . she and sam became good friends and flew together in the garden and the sky , but always close to the hive . lily and sam were playing with blocks . they wanted to make a temple like the one they saw in a book . they put many blocks on top of each other and made a big tower . they were happy with their temple .

