they are happy . they go back to the slide . they play some more . they sneeze some more . they laugh some more . they are lucky friends . anna and ben were playing in the park . they saw a big circle on the grass . it was made of stones and flowers . anna and ben ran to the circle . they wanted to see what was inside .

