he climbed on his sleigh and waved goodbye . the reindeer flew away with him . they vanished into the night . anna and ben closed their eyes and dreamed of snow . lily liked to fix things . she had a box of screws and a screwdriver . she would find broken toys and make them work again . she was very independent and did not need help .

