and they sing the song , holding hands , in the store . and they do n't care about the microphone . and they are happy . lily and tom were best friends . they liked to play in the park with their toys . one day , they found a big , hairy dog . the dog was friendly and wagged its tail . lily and tom wanted to pet the dog , but they were afraid .

