the fairy doll said , " i love you too , sara . you make me happy . thank you for lifting me and playing with me today . " lily and ben are playing hide and seek in the garden . lily counts to ten and then looks for ben . she sees a big bush with red flowers . she thinks ben might be hiding there . she walks to the bush and peeks behind it .

