they play with the laser and the crayon and have fun . they learn to share and wonder about the world . sara was a popular youth in her class . she had many friends who liked to play with her . she was good at sharing , singing and drawing . she also liked to chew gum , but she knew she had to spit it out before school .

one day , she forgot to spit out her gum and went to school with it in her mouth . she was sitting next to ben , who was her best friend . ben saw her chewing and whispered to her .

