he looked around and saw a jar on the shelf . it had a red label and a picture of a pepper . he reached for it and opened it . it smelled spicy .

" look , lily ! " he said . " this is spike . it will make the cake hot and tasty . let 's put some in the bowl . "

he poured some of the spike in the bowl and stirred some more .

" stir , stir , stir ! " he said . " now the cake is ready ! "

lily and ben put the bowl in the oven and turned it on . they waited for a while and then took the bowl out . it was hot and smelled funny .

