mom heard them and came to the kitchen . she saw the bowl , the jar and the mess . she was angry and worried .

" what did you do ? " she asked . " did you put spike in the cake ? that is not for cakes . that is for spicy food . it is very hot and can hurt you . you should not touch things you do not know . you should ask me first . you could have been hurt more . "

she gave them some water and some ice to cool their tongues . she hugged them and said , " i love you , but you have to be careful . next time , let me help you make a cake . ok ? "

lily and ben nodded . they were sorry and learned their lesson . they said , " we love you , mom . we are sorry . we will not do it again . can we still make a cake with you ? "

mom smiled and said , " of course . but no more spike . ok ? "

they said , " ok . no more spike . " and they hugged mom and helped her clean the kitchen . lily and ben were playing in the living room . they had many toys , but they liked to make their own games . they saw a big chair near the window . it was pretty , with flowers and cushions .

