they cuddled in the chair and pretended to be a happy family . they felt safe and happy . they did not want to leave their house . they played until it was time for dinner . lily and ben liked to play with their toy penguin . they named him pipo and gave him a red scarf . they took him everywhere they went , even to the park and the zoo . they loved pipo very much .

one day , they went to the beach with their mom and dad . they saw the big blue water and the white sand . they saw many birds and fish and shells . they wanted to show pipo the beach . they put him on a towel and ran to the water .

they splashed and swam and had fun . they forgot about pipo for a while . then they remembered and ran back to the towel . but pipo was not there . they looked around and saw a big bird with a wide mouth . it was a seagull . it had pipo in its beak . it was flying away with him .

