they gave the hat back to mama bird and said sorry again . mama bird was kind and forgiving . she thanked them and invited them to see her eggs hatch someday .

lily and tom learned a lesson . they learned to be humble and respectful . they learned to care about nature and its creatures . they learned to be good friends and share . they hugged each other and went to play somewhere else . anna and ben are friends who like to play in the park . they admire the birds and the flowers and the trees . they also like to run and jump and slide on the playground .

one day , they see a new boy in the park . he has long hair and a big hat and a loud voice . he is riding a bike with many colors and stickers . he goes very fast and makes wild noises .

