the dog is happy . he wags his tail and barks . he plays with the ball and with lily and ben . they have fun together .

lily and ben learn a lesson . they learn that jokes should be funny , not mean . they learn to behave and be kind to animals . they make a new friend . the dog is a good friend . he likes to play with the big red ball . ben likes to play the trumpet . he has a red trumpet that makes loud sounds . he likes to blow the trumpet in the morning , in the afternoon , and at night . he likes to make his mom and dad happy with his music .

one day , ben 's mom and dad have to go to work . they tell ben to stay with his grandma . they say they will be back soon . they give ben a hug and a kiss and say goodbye .

