he goes to his room and takes his trumpet . he blows the trumpet very hard . he wants his mom and dad to hear him . he wants them to come back .

his grandma hears the trumpet . she comes to his room . she says , " ben , why are you making so much noise ? you are hurting my ears . please stop blowing the trumpet . it is not nice . "

