his grandma says , " ben , that is not true . i like you very much . i like your trumpet too . but you have to play it softly . you have to be gentle with it . you have to respect other people 's ears . you have to wait for mom and dad . they will come back soon . they love you very much . they are proud of you and your trumpet . but they also have to work . they have to do important things . can you understand that ? "

ben thinks for a moment . he looks at his grandma . he sees her clear eyes . he sees her kind smile . he feels her warm hand . he says , " yes , grandma , i understand . i 'm sorry for making so much noise . i will play the trumpet softly . i will be gentle with it . i will respect your ears . i will wait for mom and dad . i love you , grandma . thank you for staying with me . "

