they shared the rest of the berries and enjoyed their snack . they were happy and good friends . tim likes to read books . he has many books with pictures and words . he can read some words by himself , but not all . he likes to ask his mom or dad to read with him .

one day , tim wants to read a book about sport . he likes sport . he likes to run and jump and kick a ball . he finds a book with a big ball on the cover . he thinks it is about sport . he opens the book and sees many words . he does not know the words . he feels frustrated .

he goes to his mom and says , " mom , can you read this book with me ? it is about sport . i like sport . " his mom looks at the book and smiles . she says , " tim , this book is not about sport . it is about math . it has numbers and shapes and problems . it is too hard for you right now . you can read it when you are older . "

tim is confused . he says , " but it has a ball on the cover . why does it have a ball if it is not about sport ? " his mom says , " the ball is a sphere . a sphere is a shape . it is a math word . the book uses the ball to teach you about spheres and other shapes . "

tim does not like math . he does not want to learn about spheres and other shapes . he wants to read about sport . he says , " i do n't like this book . i want a book about sport . do you have a book about sport ? " his mom says , " yes , i do . i have a book about soccer . it has pictures and words that you can read . do you want to read it with me ? " tim says , " yes , please . i love soccer . thank you , mom . " he gives his mom a hug and they go to the couch to read the book about soccer . tim is happy . he likes to read books with his mom . tom and lily were playing in the woods . they liked to look for bugs and flowers and make up stories . they saw a big hut made of sticks and leaves . they wanted to see what was inside .

