the doctor said tom was lucky . he said the bear could have hurt him more . he gave tom some medicine and a bandage . he told tom to rest and be careful . he told tom not to go in scary huts again . tom said he was sorry and he learned his lesson . he said he would listen to lily next time . lily said she was glad tom was okay . she said she would always be his friend . they hugged and went home . they played with their toys and read some books . they did not go in the woods again . lily and sam are friends . they like to play in the park . they have a ball . the ball is colorful . it has red , blue , yellow and green .

