" here i am , ben ! " lila shouted . she was hiding behind a tall tree . she saw ben coming and stuck out her tongue . she thought he could not find her . but he did . he reached the tree and grabbed her arm . he pinched her softly .

" ow , ben , that hurts ! " lila said . she pinched him back . they both laughed . they liked to pinch each other . it was a game .

" let 's go to the slide , lila , " ben said . he let go of her arm and took her hand . they walked to the slide . they could see it through the fog . it was big and shiny . they climbed up the ladder and slid down . they felt the wind in their hair and the fog on their faces . they smiled . they had fun . they loved the park , even in the fog . ben is a boy who likes to dig in the dirt . he has a shovel and a bucket . he digs and digs and finds many things . he finds rocks and worms and roots . he is happy .

one day , he digs and finds something new . it is brown and furry and has a long nose . it is a mole . the mole is scared of ben . it tries to run away . ben is curious . he wants to see the mole .

he puts the mole in his bucket and covers it with dirt . he thinks the mole will be his friend . he takes the bucket to his house . he shows the mole to his mom and dad . they are not happy . they say the mole belongs in the dirt . they say the mole is not a pet .

ben is sad . he likes the mole . he thinks the mole is clever . he thinks the mole can dig better than him . he wants to play with the mole . he does not want to let the mole go .

