they carried the bucket back to their home and showed it to their mom . their mom smiled and hugged them . " you are jolly boys who like to play in the forest ! " she said . " you filled the bucket with wonderful things ! " she put the bucket on the table and gave them a cookie . they ate the cookie and felt happy . they loved the forest and their mom . lily likes to play with her ball . she rolls it on the floor and catches it . she rolls it to her mom and dad and they roll it back . she rolls it to her dog and he chases it . lily is happy .

