tim and lily felt ashamed . they realized they had been foolish and reckless . they apologized to the fisherman and thanked him for saving them . they learned a lesson . they learned that being adventurous is good , but being smart and safe is better . they learned that trust is important , but so is caution . they learned that sometimes , fear is a friend , not an enemy . lily was a curious girl who liked to explore . today , she went to the park with her mom and saw a big pond with ducks and fish . she wanted to see them closer , so she ran to the edge of the pond and leaned over .

