lily and ben shrug . they do not care . they have each other . they have the sandbox and the seesaw . they have fun . they are happy . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with cardboard . they make houses , cars , and rockets with cardboard . they use crayons and stickers to decorate them .

one day , lily and ben find a big cardboard box in the garage . they are very happy . they want to make a castle with the box . they cut windows and doors with scissors . they draw bricks and flags with crayons . they stick flowers and stars with stickers .

