" yeah , go away , max ! you are very mean ! you made us sad ! " ben says .

max does not care . he laughs and runs away .

lily and ben look at their broken castle . they are very sad . they hug and comfort each other .

" it 's okay , lily . we can make another castle . we still have cardboard , " ben says .

" yes , ben . we can make a better castle . we still have crayons and stickers , " lily says .

they wipe their tears and smile . they are still friends . they still love each other . they still like to play with cardboard . tim and tom are brothers . they like to play with cars and blocks . but sometimes they fight . they fight over toys and snacks . they yell and hit each other . they hate when they fight .

one day , mom and dad tell them something . they say there is a war in another place . they say many people are hurt and sad . they say some people have no toys and no snacks . they say some people have no home and no family . they say war is very bad .

tim and tom listen . they feel sorry for the people . they ask mom and dad what they can do . mom and dad say they can pray and share . they say they can be kind and help . they say they can love and not hate .

tim and tom hug mom and dad . they say they want to do that . they look at each other . they say they are sorry for fighting . they say they want to be friends . they say they hate war and love peace . they smile and play together . they are happy . ben and mia were best friends . they liked to play in the park near their house . one day , they saw a big pole in the park . it was very tall and shiny . ben and mia wondered what it was for .

" let 's climb it ! " ben said . he was adventurous and liked to try new things .

" no , it 's too high ! " mia said . she was careful and liked to be safe .

" come on , it will be fun ! " ben said . he ran to the pole and grabbed it with his hands . he started to pull himself up .

mia watched him . she was scared for him . she thought he might fall and hurt himself . she wanted to stop him , but she did n't know how .

ben climbed higher and higher . he felt proud and happy . he thought he could see the whole park from up there . he wanted to reach the top .

but then , he saw something that made him scream . on top of the pole , there was a big nest . and in the nest , there was a big bird . it was angry and loud . it flapped its wings and pecked at ben .

" help ! help ! " ben shouted . he let go of the pole and slid down . he fell on the ground and cried .

