the bird flew away . it did n't like strangers in its home .

ben and mia learned a lesson . they decided to never climb the pole again . they thought it was better to play on the swings and the slide . they were still best friends . tim and lily are friends . they like to play in the garden . they have a big box of toys . they have dolls , cars , balls , and books . but today they want to play something new .

