" yes , they are ! " lily says .

they eat their carrots and talk . they are happy . they like to play farm . they like to play together . they are friends . lily was a big girl who liked to do things by herself . she was independent and did not need help from anyone . one day , she wanted to go for a walk in the park with her mom and dad . she put on her boots and coat and said , " i 'm ready ! "

her mom and dad smiled and said , " ok , let 's go . but stay close to us , lily . the park is big and there are many people and cars . "

lily nodded and followed them outside . she saw many puddles on the street . they looked shiny and fun . she wanted to jump in them and make a splash . she said , " look , puddles ! can i jump in them , please ? "

her mom and dad said , " no , lily . you will get wet and dirty . and you might slip and fall . puddles are not for jumping . they are for walking around . "

lily was not happy . she thought puddles were for jumping . she thought it was fun to get wet and dirty . she thought she was big enough to not slip and fall . she said , " but i want to jump in them . i 'm a big girl . i can do it by myself . "

she did not listen to her mom and dad . she ran away from them and jumped in a big puddle . she made a big splash and laughed . she felt independent and free .

but then she felt something else . she felt cold and wet . she felt mud on her boots and coat . she felt a pain in her knee . she had slipped and fallen in the puddle . she started to cry .

her mom and dad ran to her and picked her up . they hugged her and said , " oh , lily . are you ok ? you should have listened to us . puddles are not for jumping . they are for walking around . "

lily felt sorry and said , " i 'm sorry , mom and dad . i was wrong . puddles are not for jumping . they are for walking around . can you help me clean up ? "

her mom and dad said , " of course , lily . we love you . we will help you clean up . and next time , please stay close to us and listen to us . we know what is best for you . "

lily nodded and said , " ok , mom and dad . i love you too . and next time , i will stay close to you and listen to you . you are the best . " sam and lily were friends who liked to play together . they had different names , but they did not care . they liked to share their toys and help each other .

one day , a new boy came to their school . his name was ali and he came from a different nation . he had a different skin color , a different language , and a different way of dressing . some kids did not like him and said mean things to him .

sam and lily saw ali sitting alone at lunch . they decided to go and talk to him . they said hello and asked him his name . ali smiled and told them his name . he said he was new and did not have any friends .

sam and lily said they would be his friends . they asked him about his nation and what he liked to do . ali told them about his nation and his hobbies . he said he liked to play soccer and draw pictures . sam and lily said they liked those things too . they invited him to play with them after lunch .

the mean kids saw sam , lily , and ali playing together . they got angry and tried to stop them . they said sam and lily should not play with ali because he was different . they said ali did not belong here and should go back to his nation .

sam , lily , and ali did not listen to them . they said they did not care if ali was different . they said he was their friend and they liked him . they said being different was not bad , but good . they said they could learn from each other and have fun together .

the mean kids did not know what to say . they saw that sam , lily , and ali were happy and did not need them . they felt sad and lonely . they realized they were wrong and mean . they wished they could be friends with sam , lily , and ali too .

the moral of the story is : do not judge people by their names , nations , or differences . be kind and friendly to everyone . you can make new friends and learn new things from people who are different from you . anna liked math . she liked to count and add and take away . she had a math book with many pages and pictures . she did math every day with her mom or dad .

one day , anna saw a seed in a pot . it was small and brown . she asked her mom what it was . her mom said it was a flower seed . she said if anna watered it and gave it sun , it would grow into a beautiful flower .

anna wanted to see the flower . she watered the seed every day and put it near the window . she waited and waited . she did math while she waited . she counted the days and the drops of water .

after many days , anna saw a green sprout in the pot . she was happy . she watered it more and watched it grow . it grew taller and taller . it grew leaves and buds . she did more math . she added the leaves and the buds . she took away the days until the flower would bloom .

one morning , anna saw a bright color in the pot . it was a flower . it was big and yellow . it smelled sweet . anna was very happy . she ran to her mom and showed her the flower . her mom smiled and hugged her . she said anna did a good job . she said anna helped the flower grow with her water and sun and math . anna felt proud . she liked math and flowers . she liked to grow . anna and ben were playing in the park . they had a ball and a kite . they liked to run and throw the ball , and to watch the kite fly in the sky . they were having fun .

but then they saw a big dog . the dog was barking and running towards them . anna and ben were scared . they did not know the dog . they did not know if the dog was kind or mean .

