but ben did not want to go . he wanted to stay and play . he liked the dog . he thought the dog was kind and wanted to play too .

" no , let 's stay ! " ben said to anna . " the dog is nice . look , he has a tail and ears . he is like us ! "

anna and ben did not agree . they started to argue . they did not hear the dog coming closer .

the dog reached them . he sniffed them and licked them . he wagged his tail and barked . he wanted to play with them . he took the ball in his mouth and ran away . he set the ball on the grass and waited for them to chase him .

anna and ben stopped arguing . they saw the dog was kind . he was not mean . he was just lonely . they felt sorry for him .

" maybe you are right , ben , " anna said . " the dog is nice . he just wants to be our friend . "

