anna and ben ran after the dog . they played with him and the ball and the kite . they had more fun . they forgot their fear . they made a new friend . the dog was happy too . he had new friends . he was not lonely anymore . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big bag on a bench . they are curious . they want to see what is in the bag .

they run to the bench and look inside the bag . the bag is empty . there is nothing in the bag . lily and tom are sad . they wanted to find something fun or nice in the bag .

then , they hear a voice . it is a man . he is looking for his bag . he says , " hey , kids , have you seen my bag ? i left it here by mistake . it is very important to me . "

lily and tom turn around and see the man . he is wearing a blue shirt and a hat . he looks worried . lily and tom point to the bag on the bench . they say , " is this your bag , mister ? we found it here . it is empty . there is nothing in it . "

the man smiles and nods . he says , " yes , this is my bag . thank you for finding it . it is empty because i just took out my papers . they are very important to me . i need them for my work . you are very kind and honest , kids . you can have this as a reward . " he gives them a candy bar from his pocket .

lily and tom are happy . they say , " thank you , mister . you are very nice . we are sorry for looking in your bag . we were just curious . we hope you have a good day . " they take the candy bar and share it . they nod to the man and run back to play . they are glad they helped the man and got a treat . lily and tom were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big poster of a famous clown . the clown had a red nose , a big smile and curly hair . lily thought the clown was funny and wanted to see him . tom thought the clown was scary and wanted to run away .

" look , lily , it 's the famous clown ! he is coming to our town soon . do you want to go and see him ? " lily asked tom .

" no , lily , i do n't want to go . the clown is scary . he has a big nose and a big mouth . he might scare me or make me laugh too much . i do n't like clowns , " tom said .

" but , tom , the clown is not scary . he is funny and nice . he makes jokes and gives balloons . he might make you happy and not scared . please , tom , let 's go and see him , " lily said .

lily and tom argued for a while . they could not agree on whether to see the clown or not . then , they saw an old man walking by . the old man had a long beard , a hat and a cane . he looked at the poster and smiled .

" hello , children . do you like the famous clown ? " the old man asked .

lily and tom looked at the old man . they did not know him . they felt shy .

" hello , sir . i like the clown , but my brother does n't . he thinks the clown is scary , " lily said .

" is that so ? well , i have a secret to tell you . do you want to hear it ? " the old man said .

lily and tom nodded . they liked secrets .

the old man leaned closer and whispered in their ears .

" i am the famous clown . i just wear this old clothes and beard to hide . but when i go on stage , i put on my nose , my smile and my hair . and i make everyone laugh and have fun . do you want to come and see me ? " the old man said .

lily and tom gasped . they could not believe it . the old man was the famous clown . they looked at his eyes and saw they were twinkling . they looked at his mouth and saw it was smiling . they looked at his nose and saw it was red .

lily and tom laughed . they were not scared anymore . they were happy .

" yes , yes , we want to see you . you are not scary . you are funny and nice . you are the famous clown . thank you for telling us your secret , " lily and tom said .

the old man hugged them and gave them each a balloon . he winked at them and walked away .

lily and tom ran to their mom and dad . they told them the secret . they asked them to take them to see the famous clown . they were excited and curious .

the end . ben and sam are friends . they like to play with their club . their club is a big stick that they found in the park . they pretend that their club is a sword or a magic wand .

