they pull and push each other . they are angry and loud . they forget about their club .

a girl sees their club on the ground . she picks it up . she thinks it is a nice stick . she runs away with it .

ben and sam stop quarreling . they look for their club . they can not find it . they see the girl with their club . they run after her .

" hey , that is our club ! " ben shouts .

" give it back ! " sam shouts .

the girl is scared . she does not want to give back the club . she feels uncomfortable . she does not like to make ben and sam sad . she does not know what to do . lily and ben like to play in the park . they run and jump and laugh . they see a big lake with ducks and fish . lily and ben want to feed the ducks . they have some bread in a bag .

they go to the lake and tear the bread into small pieces . they throw the pieces to the ducks . the ducks are happy and quack . lily and ben are happy too . they watch the ducks eat the bread .

but then a big wind comes . it blows the bag away . lily and ben run after the bag . they want to get it back . but the wind is too fast . it takes the bag to the other side of the lake .

lily and ben are sad . they lost their bag . they sit on the grass and cry . they feel dizzy from running so much . they want to go home .

then they see a nice lady . she has a new bag of bread . she smiles and gives it to lily and ben . she says they can feed the ducks again . lily and ben are happy . they say thank you to the lady . they go back to the lake and feed the ducks . they forget about the wind and the lost bag . they have fun in the park . sam and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big slide . sam wants to go on the slide . he runs to the slide and climbs up the ladder . mia follows him .

" are you ready ? " sam asks mia . he looks down at the slide . it is very long and steep .

mia nods . she is not afraid . she likes to go fast . she sits next to sam on the slide .

" let 's go ! " sam says . he pushes off the slide with his feet . mia does the same . they slide down the slide together . they feel the wind in their hair and the sun on their faces . they laugh and scream .

at the bottom of the slide , they land on the soft grass . they roll over and look at each other . they are happy .

" that was fun ! " sam says .

" yes , it was ! " mia agrees .

they get up and dust off their clothes . they see a big swing . it has two seats and a heavy rope . they run to the swing . they want to play more . they climb on the seats and hold the rope . they swing back and forth . they feel the air lift them up and down . they smile and sing .

they have a good time in the park . they are friends . they like to play . lily and ben are young twins who like to play in the park . they have a big red ball that they can kick and throw . one day , they see a new slide in the park . it is shiny and blue and has a zip at the end . lily and ben want to try the slide .

they run to the slide and climb the steps . lily goes first . she sits on the slide and pushes herself down . she feels the wind in her hair and the sun on her face . she smiles and laughs as she goes faster and faster . she reaches the zip and flies off the slide . she lands on the soft grass and rolls over . she is happy and proud .

ben watches lily and claps his hands . he wants to have fun too . he sits on the slide and pushes himself down . he feels the wind in his hair and the sun on his face . he smiles and laughs as he goes faster and faster . he reaches the zip and flies off the slide . he lands on the soft grass and rolls over . he is happy and proud too .

lily and ben hug each other and giggle . they love the slide . they want to go again . they run to the steps and climb them . but then they see a big boy on the slide . he is older and taller than them . he has a mean face and a loud voice . he says , " this is my slide . go away . you are too young and small . "

lily and ben are scared and sad . they do n't want to fight . they just want to play . they look at each other and hold hands . they say , " please , can we share the slide ? it is fun for everyone . "

the big boy shakes his head and says , " no . this is my slide . you ca n't have it . " he reaches out and pinches ben on the arm . ben cries out and lets go of lily 's hand . he rubs his arm and tears fill his eyes .

lily is angry and brave . she says , " that is not nice . you hurt my brother . you are a bad boy . you ca n't pinch people . you have to be kind and fair . " she reaches out and pinches the big boy on the nose . the big boy yelps and lets go of the slide . he rubs his nose and tears fill his eyes .

lily and ben run to the slide and sit on it . they push themselves down and feel the wind and the sun . they smile and laugh as they go faster and faster . they reach the zip and fly off the slide . they land on the soft grass and roll over . they are happy and proud again .

they look at the big boy and say , " sorry , we pinched you . but you pinched us first . you have to be nice and share . the slide is for everyone . do you want to play with us ? "

