sara nodded and put snowy in her arms . she was ready to go to the store with her mom and dad . she wanted to show snowy the fruits , the toys , and the books . she was sure snowy would like them too . she was very happy today . lily and sam like to play in the park . they like to slide , run , and swing . swing is their favorite . they take turns to push each other on the swing . they go high and fast . they feel happy and free .

one day , they see a big bird in the sky . it is black and white . it has a long neck and a big beak . it makes a loud sound . lily and sam want to see the bird . they run after it . they leave the swing and the park .

the bird lands on a tree . lily and sam follow it . they do not see where they are going . they do not see the big fence . they do not see the sign that says " zoo " . they do not see the man in the blue shirt .

the man in the blue shirt sees them . he is angry . he says " stop ! you are not allowed here ! " he grabs lily and sam . he takes them to a small room . he locks the door . he says " you are in trouble . you have to stay here until your parents come . this is your cell . "

lily and sam are scared . they do not like the cell . it is dark and cold . it has no toys . it has no swing . they miss the park . they miss the swing . they cry and hug each other . they hope their parents will come soon . they hope the big bird will help them . they hope they can swing again . lily and tom were playing on the beach . they liked to make sand castles and look for shells . they saw something big and gray in the water . it was a whale .

