they ran to the water and saw the whale was not moving . it had a big hole in its side . it was dead .

" who hurt the whale ? " tom asked . " why is it dead ? "

" i do n't know , " lily said . " maybe a shark or a boat . it 's sad . "

they felt sorry for the whale . they wanted to help it .

