lily shook her head . " no , we ca n't . repairing is for toys and bikes , not for whales . whales are alive , like us . when they die , they do n't come back . "

tom was sad . he liked whales . he wished he could see a live whale .

" maybe we can say goodbye to the whale , " lily said . " maybe we can make it a flower crown . "

they picked some flowers and made a crown . they put it on the whale 's head . they said goodbye to the whale .

" goodbye , whale , " lily said . " we hope you had a good life . we hope you are happy in the sea . "

" goodbye , whale , " tom said . " we are sorry you are dead . we hope you have friends in the sea . "

they hugged the whale and left . they hoped the whale was not lonely . they hoped they would see a live whale someday . lily and tom were excited to see the fireplace in their grandma 's house . they liked how the fire made the room warm and bright . they wanted to touch the fire , but grandma said no .

" fire is hot and can hurt you , " grandma said . " you have to stay away from it and be careful . "

but lily and tom were curious and hungry . they saw some marshmallows on the table and had an idea . they took some sticks and put marshmallows on them . then they sneaked to the fireplace when grandma was not looking .

they tried to roast the marshmallows over the fire , but they did not know how to do it . the marshmallows got too close to the fire and burned . the fire also caught the sticks and made them smoke . lily and tom dropped the sticks and ran away . they were scared and sorry .

grandma smelled the smoke and came to the fireplace . she saw the burned sticks and marshmallows and the mess . she was angry and sad .

" what did you do ? " grandma asked . " i told you not to play with the fire . you could have started a big fire and hurt yourself and the house . "

lily and tom felt bad and said sorry . they hugged grandma and promised to listen to her next time .

grandma forgave them and said she loved them . she also said they could have some cookies and milk instead of marshmallows . she taught them how to roast marshmallows safely in the oven . lily and tom learned their lesson and enjoyed their snack .

the moral of the story is : fire is dangerous and you should not play with it . you should listen to your elders and follow their rules . they know what is best for you and want to keep you safe and happy . tom and anna are playing with clay . they like to make shapes and animals with their hands . tom wants to make a big snake . he takes a lot of clay and squeezes it hard . he makes a long and thin snake .

" look , anna , i made a snake ! " tom says . " it is very big and scary ! "

