they start to pull and push . the ball of clay falls to the ground . it breaks open . something shiny comes out . it is a ring . it is anna 's mother 's ring . she found it in her drawer . she wanted to make a gift for her mother .

" wow , wow , wow ! " tom says . " that is a beautiful ring ! where did you get it ? "

" it is my mother 's ring , " anna says . " i wanted to make her happy . i wanted to give her a surprise . "

tom feels sorry . he did not mean to break anna 's surprise . he helps her to pick up the pieces of clay . he helps her to clean the ring . he says he is sorry .

" i am sorry , anna , " tom says . " i did not know you had a ring . i did not know you wanted to make a gift . that is very nice of you . "

anna forgives tom . she says he is her friend . she says she will make another surprise . she says she will share the ring with him . they hug and smile . they play with clay again . they make more shapes and animals . they have fun . ben and mia were twins who liked to play in the garden . they had a big tree with many fruits . one day , they saw a green pear hanging from a branch . they wanted to eat it , but it was too high .

" let me get it ! " ben said . he climbed on a stool and reached for the pear . but the branch was hard and did not bend . ben pulled and pulled , but the pear did not come .

" let me try ! " mia said . she climbed on the stool and pushed ben aside . she grabbed the pear and tugged with all her might . but the branch was hard and did not break . mia pulled and pulled , but the pear did not move .

they were both angry and frustrated . they looked at each other and had an idea . they decided to work together . they both climbed on the stool and held the pear . they counted to three and pulled with all their strength .

" snap ! " the branch broke and the pear fell to the ground . ben and mia cheered and hugged each other . they picked up the pear and ran to the kitchen . they washed it and cut it in half . they shared it and ate it . it was sweet and juicy . they smiled and said , " this is the best pear ever ! " lily had a big bear that she loved very much . she hugged it every night and played with it every day . she never let anyone else touch it or share it . she was very selfish with her bear .

one day , lily went to the park with her mom and her bear . she saw a boy with a small bear that looked very old and dirty . the boy looked sad and lonely . lily felt sorry for him , but she did not want to give him her bear .

the boy saw lily 's bear and his eyes lit up . he walked over to her and asked , " can i play with your bear ? please ? " lily shook her head and said , " no , this is my bear . go away ! " she hugged her bear tighter and turned away . the boy felt hurt and angry . he said , " you are mean and selfish . i hate you and your bear ! " he ran away , crying .

