lily 's mom saw what happened and was very disappointed . she said , " lily , that was not nice . you should share your toys with others , especially if they have less than you . how would you feel if you had no bear and someone else had a big one and did not let you play with it ? " lily thought for a moment and realized she would feel very sad and lonely . she said , " i would feel bad , mom . i 'm sorry . i was selfish . "

lily 's mom smiled and said , " it 's okay , lily . you can still make it right . why do n't you go and find the boy and say you are sorry and ask him if he wants to play with your bear ? " lily nodded and said , " okay , mom . i will try . " she took her bear and ran after the boy . she hoped he would forgive her and be her friend . sara loved to play with her mom 's jewelry . she liked the shiny rings and necklaces and earrings . she wanted to be like her mom and wear them too . but her mom always told her to be careful , because some of the jewelry was rare and very old . she said they were gifts from her grandma and grandpa , who lived far away .

one day , sara was alone in her room . she saw her mom 's jewelry box on the dresser . she thought , maybe i can try on one ring , just for a little while . she opened the box and saw many pretty things . she picked a ring that had a blue stone . it sparkled in the light . she put it on her finger and felt happy .

