her mom smiled and said , " sure , sweetie . but only with me . and only if you promise to be careful . "

sara promised . she learned her lesson . she never picked her mom 's jewelry again without asking . she also learned to appreciate the rare and old things that her mom had . she hoped that one day , her mom would give her one of them as a gift . tim and sam were friends who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big dog with a long tail and sharp teeth . the dog was barking and running around . tim was fearful of the dog and wanted to go home . sam was not fearful and wanted to pet the dog .

