lily and ben are scared . they drop the sugar and jump off the chair . they run to their room and cry . they have a tummy ache . they have a bad ending . lily and ben liked to play in the woods . they liked to look for bugs and birds and flowers . one day , they saw a big log near a pond . it looked cool and dark and wet .

