the mailman comes back and sees the box under the tree . he is happy . he picks up the box and takes it to the right house . it is a birthday present for a little girl . she is very happy . she opens the box and sees a cute puppy . she loves the puppy . she thinks it is amazing . she hugs the puppy and thanks the mailman . sara and ben were playing in the kitchen . they saw a big bottle on the table . it was red and shiny . sara wanted to look at it .

