sam and lily take turns to show a card to each other . they say the name of the animal on the card . if the animal is bigger and fiercer than the other one , the player who shows the card wins . if the animals are the same or the other one is bigger and fiercer , the player who shows the card loses .

sam shows a card with a lion . he says , " lion ! " lily shows a card with a mouse . she says , " mouse ! " sam wins , because the lion is bigger and fiercer than the mouse . he smiles and says , " i win ! "

