sam and lily keep playing until they have no more cards . they count how many cards they have . sam has six cards . lily has six cards . they have the same number of cards . they say , " we tie ! "

sam and lily are happy . they hug and say , " we are both good at this game ! " they put the cards back in the box . they decide to play another game . they wonder what game to play next . lila and ben were playing in the garden . they liked to pretend they were explorers in the jungle . they used sticks as swords and hats as helmets . they ran and jumped and swung on the vines .

