they hugged and smiled . they learned a lesson that day . they learned not to judge things by their appearance . and they learned to welcome surprises and kindness . they had a wonderful time in the park . ben and lily are playing with their toys in the living room . they have a lot of cars , dolls , blocks and animals . ben likes to attach things together and make new toys . lily likes to pretend that her dolls are her friends and talk to them .

