the end . lily likes to exercise . she likes to jump , run , and dance . she is very flexible . she can bend her legs and arms in many ways . she can touch her toes and make a bridge .

one day , lily wants to exercise with her mom . but her mom is busy . she has to work on her computer . she tells lily to play by herself . lily is sad . she wants to exercise with her mom .

lily has an idea . she takes her mom 's yoga mat and puts it on the floor . she says , " mom , look at me . i can exercise like you . " she starts to do some poses . she stretches her arms and legs . she balances on one foot . she twists her body .

her mom looks at her and smiles . she says , " lily , you are amazing . you are so flexible . you can exercise very well . " she closes her computer and joins lily on the mat . she says , " let 's exercise together . i can learn from you . "

lily is happy . she hugs her mom and says , " thank you , mom . i love you . i love to exercise with you . " they exercise and have fun . they do not leave the mat until they are tired . they are both flexible and happy . sara was playing with her dolls in her room . she liked to make them talk and dress them up . she had a big dollhouse with many rooms and furniture . she pretended that her dolls were a family and they had fun together .

she heard her mom call her from the kitchen . " sara , dinner is ready ! come and wash your hands ! " mom said . sara put her dolls away and ran to the kitchen . she was hungry and wanted to eat .

she saw her dad sitting at the table . he looked pale and tired . he did not smile or talk . he just stared at his plate . sara noticed that he did not eat much . she wondered why he was so sad .

she sat next to him and gave him a hug . " dad , are you okay ? do you not like the dinner ? " she asked . she hoped he would feel better .

dad looked at her and forced a smile . he hugged her back and kissed her cheek . " i 'm fine , sweetie . the dinner is very good . mom made your favorite , spaghetti and meatballs . i 'm just a little sick . i have a headache and a sore throat . but i 'll be better soon . do n't worry about me . " he said .

sara felt sorry for her dad . she wanted him to be happy and healthy . she decided to share her dinner with him . she took a big forkful of spaghetti and meatballs and put it in his mouth . " here , dad . eat some more . it will make you strong and happy . i love you . " she said .

dad smiled again , this time more sincerely . he chewed and swallowed the food . he felt a little warmer and happier . he thanked sara and gave her another hug . he ate some more of his dinner . he told sara about his day at work and asked her about her dolls . they talked and laughed together .

mom watched them from the other side of the table . she felt relieved and proud . she knew sara was a kind and caring daughter . she knew dad would get better soon . she joined them in the conversation and enjoyed the dinner . they were a happy family . one day , a penguin named pip went to the park with his mom . he saw a big pond with many ducks and fish . he wanted to swim and play with them , but his mom said no . she said the pond was too deep and cold for penguins .

pip was sad and bored . he looked around and saw a green bucket and a shovel . he had an idea . he ran to the bucket and shovel and started to dig in the sand . he made a hole and then ran to the pond . he filled the bucket with water and poured it into the hole . he did this many times until the hole was full of water .

he was very happy . he had made his own pond . he jumped into the hole and splashed and swam . he pretended he was a duck and quacked . he pretended he was a fish and swam fast . he had so much fun .

his mom saw him and smiled . she was glad he was having fun . she joined him in the hole and hugged him . she said he was a clever and creative penguin . she said she loved him very much .

they played together in the hole until it was time to go home . they said goodbye to the ducks and fish and thanked them for sharing their water . they took the bucket and shovel and left the park . pip was very happy . he had made a new friend and a new pond . he said he wanted to come back again . his mom said yes . they walked home holding hands . tom and mia are friends . they like to play in the yard . the yard has grass , flowers , and a big tree . sometimes they see birds and bugs in the yard .

