they want to open the box and see the animal . but they remember what mom and dad said . they have to trust them .

they decide to go back downstairs and wait . they hope mom and dad will come soon and show them the surprise . they think it will be the best surprise ever . anna and ben were twins who liked to swim in the sea . they had a big boat with their dad and mom . one day , they saw a reef with many fish and corals . anna wanted to dive and see the reef up close . ben was scared and wanted to stay on the boat .

