" no , anna , i do n't want to dive . the reef is too deep and dark . maybe there are sharks or eels or crabs that can bite us . i want to stay on the boat and play with my toys , " ben said .

anna and ben disagreed . they both wanted to do different things . they started to argue and shout . their dad and mom heard them and came to see what was wrong .

