anna and ben thought for a moment . they both loved their dad and mom and wanted to make them happy . they also loved each other and did not want to fight . they decided to compromise and take turns . anna agreed to stay on the boat with ben for a while and play with his toys . ben agreed to dive with anna and their dad and mom for a while and see the reef . they hugged and said sorry . they had a fun and safe day at the sea . they learned a lot about the reef and the fish . they also learned to disagree without being mean . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with toys . one day , they find a big box in the garage . it has many modern toys inside . they are shiny and make noises .

