tim and jen ran away from the man . they were hurt and scared . they wished they never saw the coin . they wished they never made any wishes . they learned a hard lesson . they were very sad . lily and max are playing with magnets . they have many magnets of different colors and shapes . they stick them on the fridge and make funny pictures . lily likes the large red magnet best . it is round and shiny and very strong .

" look , max , i can make the magnet jump from the fridge to the spoon ! " lily says . she holds the magnet near the spoon and lets it go . the magnet snaps to the spoon with a loud click .

" wow , that 's cool ! " max says . he wants to try too . he takes the large red magnet from the spoon and holds it near a fork . but before he can let it go , he hears mom calling .

" kids , it 's time for lunch ! come to the table , please ! "

lily and max run to the kitchen . they are hungry and want to eat . but max forgets to put the magnet back on the fridge . he still holds it in his hand .

" oops , i still have the magnet ! " max whispers to lily . he does not want mom to see it . he thinks mom will be angry if he plays with magnets at the table .

" quick , hide it ! " lily whispers back . she looks around for a good place to hide the magnet . she sees a large yellow bowl on the table . it is full of salad . she thinks it is a good place to hide the magnet .

" put it in the bowl ! " lily says . she pushes the bowl towards max . max nods and drops the magnet in the bowl . he hopes mom will not notice .

mom comes to the table with a plate of sandwiches . she smiles and says , " here you go , kids . enjoy your lunch ! "

lily and max say , " thank you , mom ! " they start to eat their sandwiches . they are very tasty .

but then , something strange happens . the large red magnet in the bowl starts to move . it pulls the fork and the spoon from the table . it also pulls the knife and the napkin ring . they all fly into the bowl and stick to the magnet . the salad flies out of the bowl and lands on the floor .

lily and max gasp . they look at the bowl and see the magnet and the metal things . they look at mom and see her surprised face .

" what is going on here ? " mom asks . she sees the magnet and the metal things . she sees the salad on the floor . she is not angry , but she is very curious .

lily and max look at each other . they do not know what to say . they are sorry for making a mess . they are also amazed by the magnet . they think it is very powerful and very fun .

they decide to tell mom the truth . they say , " we were playing with magnets , mom . we hid the large red magnet in the bowl . we did not know it would do that . we are sorry , mom . "

mom listens to them . she is not angry , but she is very amused . she says , " well , that was a very interesting experiment , kids . but next time , please do not hide magnets in the salad . they are not good for eating . they are good for learning . let 's clean up the mess and then we can play with magnets some more . how does that sound ? "

lily and max smile . they say , " that sounds great , mom ! thank you , mom ! "

they help mom clean up the mess . they are careful not to touch the magnet . they put it back on the fridge . they finish their lunch . then they play with magnets some more . they learn a lot about magnets . they have a lot of fun . they think magnets are very cool . lila was a clever girl who liked to play with her hamster , mimi . mimi had a cage with a wheel , a house , and some food and water . lila liked to watch mimi run on the wheel and spin around and around .

one day , lila wanted to give mimi a treat . she found a carrot in the kitchen and cut a small piece for mimi . she opened the cage and put the carrot inside . mimi smelled the carrot and came out of her house . she nibbled on the carrot and made happy noises .

lila smiled and reached for mimi . she wanted to hold her and pet her . but mimi was scared of lila 's hand . she ran away from the carrot and back to her house . lila tried again and again , but mimi always ran away .

lila felt sad . she wanted to be friends with mimi . she thought of a plan . she took the wheel out of the cage and put it on the floor . she put the carrot on the wheel . she hoped mimi would come out and spin on the wheel and eat the carrot .

she opened the cage and waited . mimi smelled the carrot again and came out of her house . she saw the wheel on the floor and the carrot on the wheel . she was curious and hungry . she climbed on the wheel and started to spin . she reached for the carrot , but the carrot moved with the wheel . she spun faster and faster , but the carrot always stayed away .

lila laughed and clapped . she thought mimi was funny and cute . she gently picked up mimi and the wheel and put them back in the cage . she gave mimi a kiss and said , " you are a clever hamster , mimi . i love you . " mimi licked lila 's nose and cuddled with her . lila was happy . she and mimi were friends . tim and sue wanted to build a fort in the woods . they found some lumber that someone left behind . the lumber was heavy and hard to carry . they had to test each piece to see if it was good or bad .

