they left the woods and the lumber behind . the dog found the plank and chewed on it . it was happy . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play with their toys . they have many toys , but their favorite is a big cage with two birds inside . the birds are blue and yellow . they can sing and fly .

one day , tim and sam have a fight . they both want to play with the cage . tim says , " it is my turn . i want to make the birds sing . " sam says , " no , it is my turn . i want to make the birds fly . " they pull the cage from each other . they are very competitive .

the birds are scared . they do not like the noise and the shaking . they flap their wings and peck the bars . they want to get out of the cage . they tell tim and sam , " stop ! stop ! you are hurting us . let us go . we are not toys . we are alive . "

tim and sam hear the birds . they are surprised . they did not know the birds can talk . they feel sorry for the birds . they stop fighting . they say , " we are sorry , birds . we did not mean to hurt you . we will let you go . you can fly and sing in the sky . "

they open the cage and set the birds free . the birds are happy . they thank tim and sam . they say , " you are good boys . you learned your lesson . be kind to each other and to animals . goodbye . " they fly away and sing a beautiful song .

tim and sam hug each other . they say , " we are sorry , brother . we will not fight again . we will share our toys and play nicely . " they smile and go to play with their other toys . they are happy . anna was very happy . today was her birthday . she had a big cake with four candles . she had many presents from her family and friends . she had a new doll , a book , a ball , and a hat .

she wanted to thank everyone for her birthday . she hugged her mom and dad and said , " thank you for my cake and my presents . i love you very much . " she smiled at her grandma and grandpa and said , " thank you for my doll and my book . they are very pretty and fun . " she waved at her friends and said , " thank you for my ball and my hat . they are very cool and nice . "

but there was one more present that she did not see . it was hidden behind the sofa . it was a big box with a bow . her dad said , " anna , there is one more present for you . do you want to see what it is ? " anna nodded and ran to the sofa . she pulled the box and opened it .

inside the box , there was a puppy . it was brown and white and had a red collar . it wagged its tail and licked anna 's face . anna was very surprised and happy . she said , " wow , a puppy ! is it for me ? " her mom said , " yes , it is for you . we know you love animals and you are very kind and responsible . we think you are ready to have a pet . but you have to take good care of it . you have to feed it , walk it , play with it , and keep it healthy . "

