one day , she decided to have a fashion show with her dolls . she invited her brother ben to watch . she put her dolls on a table and gave them names . she said , " this is lily . she is wearing a pink dress and a yellow hat . she is very sweet . this is max . he is wearing a blue shirt and a green cap . he is very cool . this is zoe . she is wearing a purple skirt and a red scarf . she is very smart . "

ben clapped his hands and said , " wow , anna , you are very good at fashion . your dolls look great . can i play too ? "

