they go to their moms and tell them what happened . their moms help them clean up and get new clothes . then they go back to the park and play together . they share the slide and have fun . they are happy . jenny loves her dog , spot . spot is cute and soft and likes to play . jenny puts a collar on spot , with a tag that has her name and phone number . she wants spot to be safe and not get lost .

