they hug their human and then run to the sofa . they jump on it and flap their wings . they pretend to fly . they have fun . they are furry cats who can fly . ben and sam are friends . they like to play with cars and balls . one day , they see a big gray cat in the park . the cat has wide eyes and a long tail . ben and sam want to pet the cat .

