they took their toys and played together happily . they learned their lesson . they realized that being compassionate is better than being selfish . lily and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . they liked to make noises and pretend they were animals . lily was a lion and ben was a monkey . they roared and chattered and jumped around .

but daddy was working on his laptop at the table . he had a lot of papers and a frown on his face . he did not like the noises and the mess . he was grumpy .

