the moral of the story is : do not be selfish and greedy . do not hurt others with your actions . be kind and respectful . share and take turns . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . but then the sky became dark and the wind became cold . they heard a loud noise . it was thunder .

