tom smiled . he felt happy . he loved his mom . he loved his sister . he loved his coat . he was strong . but he was also kind . lily was a playful girl who liked to run and jump and sing . she had a new friend at school , his name was sam . sam was shy and quiet , he did not know how to play with the other kids . he liked to draw and read and watch the birds .

