they take turns swinging on the rope . they laugh and have fun . they are good friends . they enjoy the park . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play with their toys in their room . but sometimes they fight over the same toy . today they both want to play with the watch . the watch is shiny and makes noises . it is their dad 's watch , but he lets them play with it sometimes .

