they forget to fight . they forget to quit . they forget the timer . they only remember the watch . they are comfortable . they are happy . they are brothers . lily and tom were best friends . they liked to play with their bikes on the street . they wore helmets and looked both ways before they crossed . they had fun riding fast and making noises .

