they picked up the basket and left the tree . they met their friends on the way and gave them some fruits . their friends were very grateful and excited . they all played together and had a wonderful time .

the moral of the story is : sharing is caring . it is better to share what you have with others than to keep it for yourself and let it spoil . you will make others happy and have more friends . and you will also be thankful for what nature gives you . tom and sue are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big black dog . the dog is very thin and dirty . it has no collar or tag .

