they walk to the table where a lady gives them a form and a hat . the hat is blue , like the sign . tom puts it on and feels excited . he ca n't wait to play ball with his new friends . he thanks his dad for teaching him how to pitch . his dad hugs him and says , " you 're welcome , son . i 'm proud of you . have fun ! " anna and ben are twins . they like to play together and share their toys . sometimes they also have the same dreams at night .

