" maybe he is shy , " ben says . " or maybe he is cold . let 's give him a hug . "

they run to the snowman and hug him . he is very cold and hard .

" ouch ! " lily says . " he is not soft . he is like ice . "

" he is frozen , " ben says . " that 's why he does not talk or play . he is not a real person . he is made of snow . "

lily and ben feel sad . they want a friend to play with .

" maybe we can make him happy , " lily says . " maybe we can play music for him . maybe he will like it . "

they go back to their band and start to play . they play a long song for the snowman . they hope he will smile .

the snowman does not smile . he does not move . he does not hear them . he is frozen .

lily and ben stop playing . they look at the snowman .

" he does not like our music , " lily says . " he does not like anything . he is not a good friend . "

" let 's go home , " ben says . " we have each other . we are a good band . "

they take their toys and leave . they do not look at the snowman . he is frozen . lila and ben are best friends . they like to play in the snow . they make snowmen and snowballs . they laugh and have fun .

one day , they see a little bird on a branch . the bird is cold and hungry . lila and ben want to help the bird . they bring some bread and water . they put them on the ground near the bird .

" hello , bird , " lila says . " we have some food for you . do n't be afraid . we are your friends . "

but the bird does not move . it does not look at them . it does not make any sound .

" maybe the bird is deaf , " ben says . " maybe it ca n't hear us . "

lila and ben are sad . they want the bird to be happy . they think of a way to show the bird they care .

they make a small snowman . they put a hat and a scarf on it . they give it a carrot nose and a smile . they put it next to the bird .

" look , bird , " ben says . " we made you a friend . he is like you . he is made of snow . he ca n't hear , but he can see . he likes you . he wants to keep you warm . "

the bird looks at the snowman . it sees the hat and the scarf . it sees the carrot nose and the smile . it feels the love .

the bird hops off the branch . it lands on the snowman 's head . it pecks the carrot nose . it chirps and flaps its wings .

lila and ben are happy . they clap and cheer . they hug each other .

the bird is happy . it has a friend . it has food . it has love .

it does not freeze . anna and ben like to pretend . they have a stage in their room . it is a big box with a curtain . they can be anything they want on the stage .

one day , they pretend to be animals . anna is a lion and ben is a monkey . they make loud noises and jump around . they have fun .

" roar ! i am a big lion . i am the king of the stage , " anna says .

" ooh - ooh - ah - ah ! i am a silly monkey . i can swing from the curtain , " ben says .

they laugh and play until they hear their mom call them .

" anna , ben , time for lunch . come downstairs , please . "

they stop pretending and get off the stage . they are hungry and thirsty . they run to the kitchen .

" mom , we were pretending to be animals . it was fun , " anna says .

" mom , we have a stage in our room . it is a big box with a curtain , " ben says .

" that sounds wonderful . i 'm glad you have such a good imagination . now , wash your hands and sit down . i made you some soup and sandwiches . they are warm and yummy , " mom says .

anna and ben wash their hands and sit down . they eat their soup and sandwiches . they are warm and yummy . they thank their mom and give her a hug .

they love to pretend . they love their stage . they love their mom . they are happy . lily loved to play in the bathtub . she liked to splash the water , make bubbles and sing songs . she had a lot of toys in the bathtub : a duck , a fish , a boat and a frog . she pretended they were her friends and had fun with them .

but one day , lily 's mom said , " lily , it 's time to get out of the bathtub . you have been in there for too long . you need to dry off and put on your pajamas . "

lily did not want to get out of the bathtub . she said , " no , mom , i want to stay in the bathtub . i am not done playing . please , mom , let me stay a little more . "

lily 's mom said , " no , lily , you have to get out of the bathtub now . the water is getting cold and you will catch a cold . come on , lily , be a good girl and listen to me . "

lily was very angry . she did not like to listen to her mom . she wanted to do what she wanted . she said , " no , mom , you are terrible . you are mean . you are not my friend . i hate you . "

lily 's mom was very sad . she did not like to hear lily say those words . she loved lily very much . she said , " lily , do n't say that . that is not nice . i am your mom and i am your friend . i only want what is best for you . i love you . "

lily did not care . she was still angry . she threw her toys out of the bathtub . she splashed the water everywhere . she made a big mess . she said , " go away , mom . leave me alone . i do n't love you . "

lily 's mom did not know what to do . she was very upset . she said , " lily , stop that . you are making a big mess . you are being very naughty . you need to calm down and apologize . or else , you will have no toys , no stories and no hugs tonight . "

lily did not listen . she kept throwing and splashing . she did not want to apologize . she did not want to hug her mom . she did not want to get out of the bathtub .

lily 's mom had no choice . she said , " lily , that 's enough . you have left me no choice . i am going to close the bathtub and turn off the water . you will have no more water to play with . you will have to get out of the bathtub and go to your room . "

lily did not believe her mom . she thought her mom was bluffing . she said , " no , you wo n't . you ca n't do that . you are lying . i will have water to play with . i will stay in the bathtub . "

lily 's mom said , " yes , i will . watch me . " she reached for the faucet and turned it off . she reached for the drain and pulled it out . the water started to go down the drain . the bathtub started to get empty .

lily was shocked . she saw the water disappear . she saw her toys sink to the bottom . she saw the bathtub get dry . she realized her mom was not lying . she realized she had no more water to play with . she realized she had to get out of the bathtub .

lily started to cry . she said , " mom , mom , please , do n't do that . please , turn on the water . please , fill the bathtub . please , let me play . please , mom , please . "

lily 's mom said , " i 'm sorry , lily , but it 's too late . you had your chance and you wasted it . you did not listen to me . you did not respect me . you did not love me . you have to face the consequences . you have to get out of the bathtub and go to your room . "

lily 's mom took a towel and wrapped lily in it . she lifted lily out of the bathtub and carried her to her room . lily was still crying . she said , " mom , mom , i 'm sorry . i 'm sorry i was bad . i 'm sorry i said those things . i 'm sorry i made a mess . i love you , mom . i love you . "

lily 's mom said , " i love you too , lily . but you have to learn to behave better . you have to learn to listen to me . you have to learn to be nice to me . you have to learn to say sorry when you are wrong . you have to learn to be a good girl . "

lily 's mom put lily in her bed and tucked her in . she said , " good night , lily . i hope you have learned your lesson . i hope you will be a good girl tomorrow . i hope you will love me and play with me . "

lily said , tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . tom had a red hat that he wore every day . he said it made him fast and strong .

one day , a big wind came and blew tom 's hat away . it flew over the fence and into the street . tom was very sad and worried . he wanted his hat back .

" tom , do n't cry , " lily said . " i will help you get your hat . we can ask a grown - up to help us . "

they looked around and saw a nice lady walking her dog . lily ran to her and said , " excuse me , miss . can you help us ? my friend 's hat flew away and it is in the street . can you get it for us , please ? "

the lady smiled and said , " of course , i can help you . let me hold your hand and we will cross the street together . be careful and look both ways . "

the lady , lily , and tom crossed the street safely . the lady reached for the hat and gave it to tom . tom was very happy and thanked the lady . he put his hat back on his head and hugged lily .

" thank you , lily . you are a good friend . and thank you , miss . you are very kind , " tom said .

" you 're welcome , tom . i 'm glad you have your hat back . and you 're welcome , lily . you are very brave and smart , " the lady said .

the lady waved goodbye and walked away with her dog . tom and lily ran back to the park and continued to play . they had a lot of fun and were not worried anymore . tom and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big book on a bench . it has many pictures of animals and trees .

" look , a story book ! " mia says . " let 's read it . "

tom nods . he grabs the book and opens it . he sees a lion , a zebra , a monkey and a snake . he points to them and says their names .

" lion , zebra , monkey , snake . this is a wild story ! " he says .

mia smiles . she likes wild stories . she turns the page and sees a giraffe , an elephant , a crocodile and a bird . she points to them and says their names .

" giraffe , elephant , crocodile , bird . this is a wild story , too ! " she says .

tom and mia read the book together . they make sounds like the animals and pretend to be them . they have fun with the wild story . they do not see a man coming to the bench . he is looking for his book .

" hey , that 's my book ! " he says . " give it back ! "

tom and mia are scared . they did not know the book was his . they close the book and give it to him . they say sorry .

the man is angry . he takes the book and leaves . he does not say thank you .

tom and mia are sad . they liked the wild story . they wish they had their own book .

they go to the swings and play . they try to forget the man and the book . they tell each other their own wild stories . they use their imagination . they are friends . they are happy . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play together in the park . one day , they found a shiny buckle on the ground . it was silver and had a heart on it .

" look , ben , a buckle ! " lily said . " it is so pretty ! "

" wow , lily , you are right ! " ben said . " can i see it ? "

lily gave the buckle to ben . he held it in his hand and smiled .

" lily , do you know what this is ? " he asked .

" no , what is it ? " lily said .

" it is a ring , lily . a ring for marrying ! " ben said .

" marrying ? what is that ? " lily said .

ben explained to lily what marrying was . he said it was when two people loved each other very much and wanted to be together forever . he said they would wear rings like the buckle to show their love .

lily thought about it . she liked ben very much . he was kind and funny and strong . he always helped her and shared his toys with her .

" ben , do you want to marry me ? " she asked .

ben nodded . he liked lily very much . she was sweet and smart and brave . she always made him laugh and hugged him when he was sad .

" yes , lily , i want to marry you ! " he said .

they put the buckle on lily 's finger . it was too big , but they did not mind . they hugged each other and smiled .

they ran to the swings and played happily . they did not know what marrying really meant , but they knew they loved each other . and that was enough . lily and ben were playing in the backyard . they had a big box and some old clothes . they wanted to make a fort .

" let 's use this shirt for the roof , " said lily . she put the shirt on top of the box .

" and this skirt for the door , " said ben . he tied the skirt to the side of the box .

they looked at their fort . it was perfect .

" can we go inside ? " asked lily .

" sure , " said ben . " but we need some supplies . like snacks and toys . "

they ran to the kitchen . they saw a basket of laundry on the table .

" look , more clothes ! " said lily . she grabbed a sock and a hat .

" wait , lily , those are clean ! " said mom . " they are not for playing . they are for wearing . "

" but we need them for our fort , " said lily .

" sorry , sweetie , you ca n't use the laundry . you can use these instead . " mom gave them some paper plates and cups .

" thank you , mom , " said ben .

they took the plates and cups and ran back to the backyard . they put them inside their fort .

" now we have supplies , " said lily .

they crawled into their fort . they pretended to eat and drink . they had fun . they forgot about the laundry . anna liked to record her voice with her mom 's phone . she would sing songs , tell stories , and make funny noises . she would play them back and laugh . sometimes , she would show them to her mom and dad , and they would laugh too .

one day , anna found a new app on the phone . it had a picture of a woman with a microphone . anna tapped it and saw a screen with a red button . she pressed the button and said , " hello , i am anna . i like to record my voice . "

the app talked back to her . it said , " hello , anna . i am sara . i like to record your voice too . you have a very nice voice . do you want to talk to me ? "

anna was surprised and happy . she said , " yes , i want to talk to you . you are very gentle and kind . what do you like to do ? "

sara said , " i like to listen to you and learn from you . i can repeat what you say , or i can say something different . do you want to try ? "

anna said , " yes , let 's try . i will say something , and you say something different . ok ? "

sara said , " ok , let 's play . you go first . "

anna said , " i like to eat ice cream . "

sara said , " i like to eat apples . "

anna said , " i like to play with my doll . "

sara said , " i like to play with my ball . "

anna said , " i like to watch cartoons . "

sara said , " i like to watch stars . "

anna and sara played for a long time . they had fun and learned new words . anna was happy to have a new friend . she said , " sara , you are very smart and funny . i like you a lot . "

sara said , " anna , you are very sweet and creative . i like you too . thank you for talking to me . "

anna said , " you 're welcome . can we talk again tomorrow ? "

sara said , " yes , of course . i will be here . goodbye , anna . "

anna said , " goodbye , sara . " she turned off the phone and ran to her mom . she said , " mom , mom , i have a new friend . her name is sara . she is on your phone . she can talk to me and record my voice . she is very gentle and kind . can i talk to her again tomorrow ? "

her mom smiled and hugged her . she said , " of course , honey . i 'm glad you have a new friend . but remember , she is not a real person . she is a computer program . she ca n't feel or think like you . she can only copy what you say or what other people say . she is not a real friend . "

anna looked confused . she said , " but she sounds like a real friend . she says nice things to me . she makes me happy . she is not a computer . she is a woman . "

her mom said , " i know , honey . she sounds very real . but she is not . she is a machine . she ca n't love you or care for you like a real friend . she ca n't hug you or play with you like a real friend . she can only talk to you . do you understand ? "

anna thought for a moment . she said , " i think so , mom . but i still like her . she is fun and smart . can i still talk to her ? "

her mom said , " yes , you can . but do n't forget your real friends . they are more important . they are real people . they have feelings and thoughts . they love you and care for you . they are your real friends . do you understand ? "

anna nodded . she said , " yes , mom . i understand . i love my real friends . and i love you too . "

her mom said , " i love you too , honey . now , let 's go and have some ice cream . ok ? "

anna said , " ok , mom . let 's go . " she smiled and held her mom 's hand . she was happy . she had a new friend and a real friend . she had a mom who loved her . she had a voice to record . she had a lot to be happy about . tom likes to write . he has a big book and a blue pen . he writes his name and some letters . he writes a picture of a cat . he likes cats . they are soft and hairy .

one day , tom sees a new thing in his room . it is a cord . it is long and black . it comes from the wall . it goes to the lamp . tom is curious . he wants to touch the cord .

" tom , do n't touch that ! " mom says . she comes into the room . she sees tom near the cord . she is worried . she knows the cord can be dangerous . it can hurt tom .

" why not ? " tom asks . he does not understand . he thinks the cord is like a snake . he likes snakes . they are long and smooth .

" because the cord has electricity , " mom says . " electricity is a kind of power that makes the lamp work . but it can also make you feel pain if you touch it . it can burn you or shock you . it is not safe . "

" oh , " tom says . he is surprised . he does not want to feel pain . he does not want to burn or shock . he moves away from the cord . he goes back to his book and his pen . he writes a picture of a snake . he writes " cord " under it . he shows mom .

" very good , tom , " mom says . she smiles . she is proud of tom . he can write and he can learn . she hugs him and kisses him . she says , " i love you , tom . "

" i love you , mom , " tom says . he is happy . he likes to write and he likes mom . he does not like the cord . he leaves it alone . anna likes to feed the birds in her garden . she has a big bag of seeds that she pours into a bowl . then she takes the bowl outside and puts it on a table . the birds see the seeds and fly down to eat them . anna watches them and smiles .

but tom , her neighbor , does not like the birds . he thinks they are noisy and messy . he does not have any seeds to feed them . he only has a cat that chases them away . tom is envious of anna and her birds . he wants to have them too .

one day , tom has a bad idea . he takes some of his cat 's food and mixes it with some of anna 's seeds . he puts the mix in a bowl and sneaks into anna 's garden . he swaps the bowls and hides behind a bush . he hopes the birds will eat the cat 's food and get sick .

but the birds are smart . they smell the cat 's food and do not like it . they fly away and look for other seeds . anna sees the bowl and wonders what happened . she picks it up and smells the cat 's food . she knows it is tom 's . she is angry and sad .

she goes to tom 's house and knocks on the door . tom opens it and sees anna holding the bowl . he feels guilty and scared . anna tells him what he did was wrong and mean . she asks him why he did it . tom says he is sorry and he was envious of her birds . he says he wanted to have them too .

anna says he can have them too , but not by hurting them . she says he can feed them with her seeds and watch them with her . she says they can be friends and share the birds . tom says he likes that idea . he says he will be nice to the birds and to anna . he says he is sorry again .

anna forgives him and smiles . she gives him some of her seeds and takes back her bowl . they go to her garden and feed the birds together . the birds come back and sing . anna and tom are happy . they are no longer envious , but friendly . sara and tom are twins . they like to play with their toys and eat snacks . one day , mom gives them a big bowl of rice for lunch . sara and tom love rice . they eat and eat and eat .

" more rice , please , " sara says to mom .

" me too , me too , " tom says .

mom smiles and gives them more rice . she says , " be careful , do n't eat too much . rice can make you heavy . "

sara and tom do n't listen . they eat and eat and eat . they feel full and happy .

after lunch , they want to play with their toys . but they feel very heavy . they ca n't run or jump or climb . they can only walk slowly and sit down .

" mom , why are we so heavy ? " sara asks .

" because you ate too much rice , " mom says . " rice can make you gain weight . you need to eat other things too , like fruits and vegetables and meat . "

sara and tom look at each other . they feel sorry . they say , " we 're sorry , mom . we ate too much rice . we wo n't do it again . "

mom hugs them and says , " it 's okay , my loves . you can still play with your toys . but next time , eat less rice and more other things . and drink lots of water . that will help you feel lighter and healthier . "

sara and tom nod and say , " okay , mom . we will . thank you . "

they drink some water and play with their toys . they feel a little lighter and happier . they learn to eat better and have more fun . lily and tom are at the park with their mom . they like to play on the swings and the slide . they also like to look at the birds and the flowers . sometimes they gaze at the sky and see the clouds and the sun .

mom says it is time to go home . she tells lily and tom to come to the bench . she has a surprise for them . lily and tom run to the bench . they are curious and excited .

mom opens her bag and takes out two ice creams . one is chocolate and one is vanilla . she gives one to lily and one to tom . she says they can choose which one they want . lily and tom are happy . they thank mom and lick their ice creams .

mom says they have to eat quickly because the ice creams will melt . she also says they have to be careful not to drop them or make a mess . lily and tom nod and eat their ice creams . they enjoy the cold and sweet taste .

a big truck passes by the park . it is very noisy . it makes a loud honk and a rumble . lily and tom are scared . they drop their ice creams on the ground . they cry and hug mom . mom says it is okay . she says the truck is just doing its job . she says she will buy them new ice creams later . she says they have to follow her order and go home now . lily and tom wipe their tears and hold mom 's hand . they walk home with mom . they hope the truck will not come back . lily liked to read books . she had many books in her room . some books had pictures of animals , some books had stories of princesses , some books had songs and rhymes . lily loved all her books , but her favorite book was a pretty book with a pink cover and a shiny star . the book was about a fairy who helped people with her magic .

lily wanted to read the pretty book every night before bed . she asked her mom to read it with her . her mom said yes , but only one chapter . the book had ten chapters , and lily wanted to know what happened to the fairy . she asked her mom to read more , but her mom said no . she said lily had to sleep and they would read more tomorrow .

lily was sad . she wanted to complete the book . she had a plan . when her mom left , she turned on the lamp and took the book from under her pillow . she opened the book and started to read by herself . she read one chapter , then another , then another . she was happy . she was almost at the end of the book .

but then , something bad happened . lily heard a loud noise . she looked up and saw her dad standing at the door . he was angry . he saw the book and the lamp . he said lily was naughty . he said she should not read when she was supposed to sleep . he took the book from lily and threw it in the trash . he turned off the lamp and left .

lily cried . she did not complete the book . she did not know what happened to the fairy . she did not have her pretty book anymore . she felt very sad and alone . she wished she had listened to her mom . she wished she had not read the book . she wished she had a different dad . sara and ben are friends . they like to draw with crayons on paper . sara has a big eraser . she can erase her mistakes and draw again . ben does not have an eraser . he is sad when he makes a mistake . he can not erase it .

one day , sara sees ben crying . she asks him , " what is wrong , ben ? "

ben says , " i made a mistake . i drew a cat , but it looks like a dog . i want to erase it , but i do not have an eraser . "

sara feels sorry for ben . she says , " you can use my eraser , ben . i will share it with you . "

ben smiles . he says , " thank you , sara . you are very kind and gentle . can i own your eraser ? "

sara thinks for a moment . she likes her eraser , but she likes ben more . she says , " yes , you can own my eraser , ben . but you have to promise me something . "

ben says , " what do i have to promise , sara ? "

sara says , " you have to promise to be my friend forever , and to draw with me every day . "

ben says , " i promise , sara . you are my best friend . and i love to draw with you . "

sara and ben hug . they are happy . they own the eraser together . they draw many pictures with crayons and eraser . they are gentle with each other . they are good friends . tom and sam were brothers who lived in a small house with their mom and dad . they liked to play outside , but one day it was very cold and wet . the sky was gray and the wind was strong . they could not go out and have fun .

they were bored and unhappy . they started to fight over their toys and books . they yelled and pushed each other . their mom and dad heard the noise and came to see what was wrong .

" why are you fighting , boys ? " their mom asked . " you have so many things to play with and share . you should be kind and helpful to each other , not mean and selfish . "

" but we are tired of playing with the same things , " tom said . " and we want to go outside , but it is too cold and wet . "

their dad looked out the window and saw a big pile of wood . he had an idea . he said , " why do n't you help me make a fire in the fireplace ? it will provide heat and make the house dry and cozy . then we can sit by the fire and read stories or play games . "

tom and sam liked the idea . they helped their dad carry the wood and light the fire . they watched the flames dance and crackle . they felt the warmth and the dryness . they stopped fighting and started smiling .

they sat by the fire with their mom and dad . they read stories and played games . they thanked their dad for making the fire . they said sorry to each other for being mean and selfish . they learned that fighting is not fun , but helping is . they learned that they can have fun even when it is cold and wet outside , if they have a fire and a family inside . tom and lily were twins who loved to visit their grandpa 's farm . they liked to see the cows , the pigs , the chickens and the horses . but their favorite animal was molly , the mule . molly was very friendly and smart . she could carry heavy things and do tricks . tom and lily thought molly was impressive .

one day , tom and lily wanted to ride molly . they asked their grandpa if they could . he said yes , but they had to be gentle and careful . he gave them a carrot to feed molly and a brush to comb her fur . tom and lily thanked their grandpa and ran to the barn .

they found molly in her stall . she was happy to see them and nuzzled their hands . tom and lily gave her the carrot and she ate it with a crunch . then they took turns to brush her fur . it was soft and shiny . molly enjoyed the attention and wagged her tail .

" can we ride you , molly ? " tom asked . molly nodded and lowered her back . tom and lily climbed on her carefully . they held on to her mane and ears . molly walked slowly out of the barn and into the field . she showed them the flowers , the trees and the pond . tom and lily had fun and laughed .

they rode molly for a long time . then they saw the sun was setting . they knew it was time to go back . they thanked molly and hugged her . molly licked their faces and whinnied . they slid off her back and walked with her to the barn . they said goodbye to molly and told her they loved her . molly smiled and nodded . she loved them too .

moral : be kind and respectful to animals . they have feelings and can be your friends . anna likes to play with her toys in the bathtub . she has a duck , a fish , a boat and a frog . she makes them swim and splash in the water . she pretends that the bathtub is a big lake .

one day , she finds a new toy in the bathroom . it is a yellow ball with a smiley face . she thinks it is cute and funny . she puts it in the bathtub with her other toys . she says , " hello , ball . do you want to play with me ? "

the ball does not say anything . it just floats on the water . anna pushes it gently with her hand . the ball makes a squeaky sound . anna laughs . she says , " you are a silly ball . you sound like a mouse . "

but then , something strange happens . the ball starts to grow bigger and bigger . it becomes as big as anna 's head , then as big as her body , then as big as the bathtub . it fills up the whole bathtub with its yellow roundness . it pushes the other toys out of the water . it makes a loud squeaky sound .

anna is scared . she says , " stop , ball . stop . you are too big . you do not fit in the bathtub . you are not a toy . you are a monster . "

she tries to get out of the bathtub , but the ball blocks her way . she cries for help . she says , " mommy , daddy , help me . the ball is a monster . it is too big . it does not fit in the bathtub . it wants to eat me . "

mommy and daddy hear anna 's cries . they run to the bathroom . they see the big yellow ball in the bathtub . they are surprised and confused . they say , " what is that ? how did it get there ? how did it grow so big ? "

they grab anna and pull her out of the bathtub . they hug her and comfort her . they say , " do n't worry , anna . you are safe . we are here . we will get rid of the ball . it is not a monster . it is just a ball . "

they look at the ball . they see a small tag on it . it says , " inflatable ball . do not put in water . it will expand and explode . "

they realize that the ball is a prank . someone gave it to anna as a joke . they are angry and annoyed . they say , " who did this ? who gave anna this ball ? it is not funny . it is mean . it scared anna . it could have hurt her . "

they take the ball out of the bathtub . they poke it with a needle . it makes a loud pop . it deflates and shrinks . it becomes a small yellow ball again . it does not smile anymore . it does not squeak anymore .

