the children learned that sharing and being kind made their day more fun . they also learned to keep the spring and its veil clean . the moral of the story is to be kind , share , and take care of the things around you . once upon a time , in a lovely little town , there lived a kind girl named amy . she loved to help everyone . one day , while walking , she saw a bird with a hurt wing . the bird was sad and could not fly .

