the moral of the story is to always be kind and help others in need . when you suggest good things and work together , you can make a big difference in someone 's life . one day , a little guard dog was in his yard . he liked to get his ball and play . he was happy and did not know many things . this guard dog was not smart , but he was a good friend .

a big bird came to the yard . the bird wanted to play with the guard dog . the bird was not nice , but the guard dog did not know . the guard dog got his ball and gave it to the bird .

