" thank you , " said the lady , smiling now . tim felt happy that he could help . he waved goodbye and rode his bike to the park . once upon a time , in a regular town , there was a little girl named amy . amy loved to skip and play outside . every evening , she would go to the park and skip with her friends .

one day , amy went to the park to skip like she always did . but her friends were not there . she felt sad and lonely , but she decided to skip by herself . as she skipped , the sun began to set , and it started to get dark .

