in the end , tim won the race . he was so happy to keep the gold . ben was sad , but he learned that it was not nice to take things from others . tim shared a little bit of the gold with ben , and they became good friends . they played together in the garden every day . once upon a time , there was a little crab named tim . he lived near the wide sea . every day , he would play with his friends in the water . they liked to splash and have fun in the tide .

