but the bird missed the sky . it wanted to fly high again . so , it tried to fly back up . but the dizzy feeling came back . the bird fell down on the ground . it could not fly anymore . the bird was very sad . once upon a time , in a little house , lived a boy named tim . tim loved to play outside , but today , there was a big storm . the sky was dark , and the rain was heavy . tim was sad because he could not play outside .

