after a while , the storm went away . the sun came out , and tim could play outside again . he thanked his mom for letting him play inside . tim learned that even when things do n't go the way you want , you can still have fun . once upon a time , there was a pink human named lucy . she lived in a small house with her mom and dad . one day , lucy saw a big , pink balloon in her yard . she wanted to play with it .

