lucy learned that it is important to listen to her mom and not take things that are not hers . she also learned that sometimes , even when we try to do the right thing , things can still go wrong . but that does n't mean we should stop trying to do what is right . once upon a time , there was a young bird named tim . tim lived on a small island with his family . the island was very pretty with lots of trees and flowers .

