but the hippo was not alone anymore . he knew he had made a real friend that day , and that made him happy . he went back to the flower field every day , hoping the boy would come back . once upon a time , there was a large pizza . it had the most delicious smell and was covered in yummy toppings . the pizza was so big that it could feed everyone on the street .

