the girl and rubber became the best friends . they had tons of fun folding things together , and the forest never felt so happy . once upon a time there was a very naughty little girl . she liked to play and have fun , but she was always messy . one day the little girl decided to climb a pumpkin tree . she grabbed some of the pumpkins from the tree and started to climb up with them . the pumpkins were big and heavy , so the climbing was hard . but the little girl was determined . finally she reached the top of the tree . from up there she could see her whole town . it was amazing !

