they help sam to get to the tent . they share their toys and stories . they laugh and have a good time . they learn that everyone is different , but everyone can be friends . they learn that travel is not only about moving , but also about dreaming . lily had a bad fall from her bike . she hurt her arm and it was very sore . she cried and cried . her mom and dad took her to the hospital . they wanted to see if her arm was broken .

at the hospital , a nice lady with a white coat said , " hello , lily . i 'm dr. lee . i 'm going to help you . we need to take a picture of your arm with a special machine . it 's called an x - ray . it will not hurt you . it will just make a funny noise . can you be brave for me ? "

lily nodded . she was scared , but she wanted to be brave . she followed dr. lee to a small room . there was a big machine with a round part . dr. lee put lily 's arm on a table and put a black thing over it . she said , " this is to protect you from the x - ray . it 's like a blanket . now , i 'm going to stand behind a window and press a button . when i do , the machine will make a beep and a flash . you have to stay very still . can you do that ? "

lily said , " yes , i can . " she tried to stay very still . she heard the beep and saw the flash . she was surprised . it was not so bad . she did not feel anything .

dr. lee came back and smiled . she said , " good job , lily . you did great . let me see the picture of your arm . " she looked at a screen and said , " good news , lily . your arm is not broken . it 's just a little bruised . you will be fine . you just need some ice and a bandage . and maybe a sticker . do you like stickers ? "

lily smiled . she was happy . her arm was not broken . she said , " yes , i like stickers . thank you , dr. lee . you are very nice . "

dr. lee gave lily a sticker and a bandage . she said , " you 're welcome , lily . you are very brave . now , you can go home and rest . and be careful with your bike , okay ? "

lily said , " okay . thank you , bye . " she hugged her mom and dad . they said , " we 're proud of you , lily . you did very well . let 's go home and have some ice cream , okay ? "

lily said , " okay . i love ice cream . and i love you . " they left the hospital and went home . lily felt better . she did not yell or cry anymore . she was a brave girl . tim and sam were brothers who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a baby pigeon on the ground . it was alone and scared . it had no feathers and could not fly .

