tim and sam waved goodbye to fluffy . they were proud and happy too . they had raised a pigeon and helped him find his way . they hoped to see him again someday . lily was a strong girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a lot of dolls and cars and blocks . one day , she found a sharp scissors in her mom 's drawer . she wanted to cut some paper and make a picture for her mom .

