her mom heard her cry and ran to her room . she saw the scissors and the paper and the blood . she was scared and angry . she took the scissors away from lily and threw them in the trash . she said , " lily , what did you do ? you know you are not supposed to play with sharp things . they can hurt you . look at your finger . it is bleeding . you need a band - aid . "

