her mom said , " i love you too , lily . you are a good girl . next time , ask me before you use something sharp . i will help you make a picture for me . " ben likes to play with his blocks . he has many blocks of different colors and shapes . he can make towers , bridges , houses and more . he likes to solve problems with his blocks . he thinks it is fun .

one day , he wants to make a big rainbow with his blocks . he finds all the blocks that are red , orange , yellow , green , blue and purple . he puts them in a row on the floor . he makes a strip of each color . he is happy .

but then he sees a problem . his rainbow is not regular . some strips are longer than others . some strips are shorter than others . his rainbow looks crooked and messy . he is sad .

