he takes some blocks away from the longer strips . he adds some blocks to the shorter strips . he moves his blocks around until he has six strips that are the same . he makes his rainbow regular . he is happy .

he looks at his rainbow . he thinks it is beautiful . he smiles . he solved his problem with his blocks . he is proud . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play in the woods near their house . one day , they find a big cave . they want to see what is inside .

