lily and max smiled . they could n't wait to see mom and rose . they hoped they would like the flowers . they were glad dad told them the surprise . tom and amy were twins who liked to play at the park . they loved to slide on the big slide , but sometimes they had to wait for their turn . one day , they saw a new boy at the park who was sliding all by himself . he looked lonely and sad .

