ben nodded , but he looked scared . he said he had just moved to a new house and he did not have any friends .

tom and amy smiled and invited him to slide with them . they took turns and helped each other climb up the ladder . they had fun and laughed a lot . ben felt happy and grateful .

" thank you for being so nice to me , " he said .

