they taught him a spell they had learned from their grandma . they said it was a magic spell to make people cheerful . they held hands and said the spell together :

" slide , slide , slide with joy slide , slide , slide with love slide , slide , slide with friends slide , slide , slide and smile ! "

they felt a warm and fuzzy feeling in their hearts . they hugged and said goodbye . they promised to play again the next day .

the moral of the story is : be kind and friendly to others , especially those who are new or lonely . you can make them feel welcome and happy . you can also learn new things and have fun with them . friendship is a magic spell that makes everyone cheerful . lily was a shy girl who liked to draw and read . she did not have many friends at school , because she was afraid to talk to them . she wished she could be brave and make new friends .

one day , her class went on a trip to the mountain . lily was excited to see the big rocks and trees , but she was also nervous . she did not know anyone on the bus , and she sat by herself . she looked out the window and saw the mountain getting closer and closer .

when they arrived , the teacher told them to stay in groups and explore the mountain . lily followed the others , but she did not join any group . she walked by herself , looking at the flowers and birds . she felt lonely and sad .

she saw a small cave and decided to go inside . maybe she would find something interesting . she crawled into the cave and saw a shiny stone . she reached out to touch it , but then she heard a loud roar . she turned around and saw a big bear blocking the entrance . she was scared and screamed .

