they smiled and became friends . lily was not shy anymore . she learned that she could be brave and make friends . she enjoyed the rest of the trip to the mountain . she had fun and learned a lot . she was happy . lily and tom are twins . they like to play together . today , they want to dress up as cowboys and cowgirls . they find hats , boots , and scarves in their closet . they put them on and look at each other .

