they close their eyes and dream of horses and steaks . they are good twins . lily liked to make jelly with her mom . they used red juice and white powder and mixed them in a big pot . then they poured the jelly into small cups and put them in the fridge . lily liked to eat jelly when it was cold and wobbly .

one day , lily had an idea . she wanted to sell jelly to her friends . she asked her mom if she could take some jelly cups to the park . her mom said yes , but she told lily to be careful and not make a mess . lily put six jelly cups in a basket and went to the park .

at the park , lily saw ben and mia playing on the swings . she ran to them and showed them her jelly . " do you want to buy some jelly ? " she asked . " it is yummy and red and only one coin each . " ben and mia nodded . they gave lily two coins and took two jelly cups . they ate the jelly and said it was good .

