they played on the seesaw and had fun . they shared the jelly and laughed . lily forgot about the mess and the coins . she was happy . she learned that friends are better than jelly . sam likes to play with his tablet . he can watch videos , draw pictures and play games on the screen . sometimes the screen gets dirty with his fingers . then he has to wipe it with a cloth .

one day , sam was watching a video about lions . he saw how fierce they were . they had big teeth , loud roars and fast claws . sam wanted to be a lion too . he put on his lion mask and his lion tail . he ran around the room , pretending to hunt and chase .

he saw his tablet on the couch . he thought it was a zebra . he jumped on it and bit it with his mask . he heard a crack . he looked at the screen . it was broken . he saw lines and colors and nothing else . he was scared . he had broken his tablet .

he ran to his mom and showed her the tablet . he said he was sorry . he said he was a lion and he wanted to play . his mom was not happy . she said he had to be careful with his things . she said he had to pay for a new screen . she said he had to wipe his tears and say goodbye to his tablet .

sam was sad . he hugged his tablet and said goodbye . he said he was not a lion anymore . he said he was a boy . he said he would not break his things again . he said he would use his imagination instead . his mom hugged him and said she loved him . she said she would help him find a new tablet . she said he could still watch videos , draw pictures and play games . but he had to be gentle and respectful . sam nodded and said he understood . he said he loved his mom too . he said he would be a good boy . tom and lily are friends who like to play in the garden . they dig in the dirt and look for worms . they find many worms of different sizes and colors . they put them in a jar and give them names .

