they close the box and put a stamp on it . they run to the mailbox and put the box inside . they wave goodbye to stripy and hope that he will be happy with grandma . they go back to the garden and look for more worms . sara and ben are friends . they like to play together at school . today , they have a special day . they will go on a tour with their class . they will see many animals at the zoo .

