they see their mom and dad . they are looking for them . they are worried . they hug them and take them inside . they give them warm clothes and soup . they tell them the hill is not a volcano . it is a garbage dump . they burn the garbage sometimes . they say it is not safe to play near the hole .

sara and ben are sorry . they say they will not play near the hole again . they say they will listen to their mom and dad . they are happy to be safe and warm . they are not scared anymore . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they find a coin on the grass . it is shiny and round .

