they look at the coin and smile . they think it is magic . they share it with the man and tell him their story . he laughs and says , " what a lucky coin . you can keep it . maybe it will bring you more good things . "

lily and ben hug the man and say goodbye . they run back to the park and play . they are happy . they have a magic coin and a new friend . tom and mia are twins . they like to play and have fun . but sometimes they do not behave . they make a mess and do not listen to mom and dad .

one day , mom and dad say they have to take a shower . tom and mia do not want to take a shower . they say they are not dirty . they run away and hide in their room . they lock the door and laugh .

mom and dad are not happy . they knock on the door and tell tom and mia to come out . they say they have to take a shower or they will not get dessert . tom and mia do not care . they have a secret stash of candy in their closet . they eat some candy and make faces .

but the candy is not sweet . it is sour . it makes their tongues hurt and their eyes water . they spit out the candy and cry . they do not like sour candy . they want sweet candy . they want dessert .

they open the door and say they are sorry . they say they will take a shower and behave . mom and dad hug them and say they love them . they take them to the bathroom and help them wash . they give them towels and pajamas . they give them a sweet dessert and a kiss . tom and mia smile and say thank you . they are happy and clean . they go to bed and dream of sweet things . ben and sam were friends . they liked to play with toys . one day , they found a big toy car in the park . it was red and shiny . they wanted to play with it .

