when it was time to go home , the otter shook all the sand off her fur . she was ready to be on her way , but still felt dry from being on the beach all day . but in her heart , the otter felt that she had enjoyed a wonderful day . once upon a time there lived a little boy . he loved playing outdoors and exploring different places . one day , while walking along a path , he saw a big open field with a vine growing in the middle . he could n't help but take a closer look . when he walked up to the vine , it started to tremble and the little boy backed off a bit . he wondered what was wrong . he lay down on his belly to get a better look and he saw a small bunny nestled in the leaves of the vine . the little boy started to giggle . he asked the bunny why it was lying there . the bunny replied that it was scared but it did n't know why . the little boy reassured the bunny that everything was going to be okay and the bunny stopped trembling . the little boy then asked the bunny if it would like to be his friend . the bunny gladly agreed and the two of them played together all day . they had lots of fun exploring the open field and the vine . finally , the little boy went home feeling happy and content . from that day on , the bunny was always waiting for him to come back and play every day . once upon a time , there was an angel . the angel loved to teach . he taught about the world and being kind to each other . one day , the angel taught about being harmless . he said that all creatures should be gentle and look after each other .

