the big kid and ben played together on the swings for a long time . when it was time to go , they waved goodbye to each other . ben had a lot of fun at the park . whenever he thought about it , he remembered how heavy the red swing was and smiled . once upon a time , there was a black cat named pico . he lived with a family in a big house . one day , pico run away and chased a butterfly , far away from home . he did n't know it was dangerous to go that far .

