they learned their lesson and never went too far into the water again . they still liked to splash , but they always watched the tide and listened to their mom . tom and lily like to jog with their dad in the park . they wear their shoes and hats and follow dad on the path . sometimes they see birds and flowers and other people . they have fun and feel good .

