the dentist was a nice lady . she wore a white coat and a mask and gloves . she said hello to sara and mom . she asked sara to sit in a big chair . she said she would look at sara 's teeth and make them clean and healthy . sara tried to be brave and good . she opened her mouth and let the dentist look . the dentist used a small mirror and a metal tool . she said sara had a cavity . a cavity was a small hole in a tooth that made it hurt . sara felt scared .

" do n't worry , sara . i can fix your cavity . i will give you some medicine to make your tooth numb . then i will fill the hole with a special material . it will not hurt . it will be over soon . do you want to watch a cartoon on the tv ? " the dentist said .

sara nodded . she liked cartoons . she watched a cartoon about a dog and a cat who were friends . the dentist gave her some medicine in a small needle . sara felt a pinch . then she felt nothing . the dentist filled her cavity . sara did not feel anything . she was brave and good . the dentist was done .

