they hugged and thanked each other . they moved the fan to anna 's room . they turned it on and lay down on the bed . they felt the cool air and closed their eyes . they were happy . lily and ben were playing in the pool with their mom . they liked to splash and swim and pretend they were fish . lily wanted to dive like a dolphin , but she was scared . ben was brave and he dived all the time .

