they went back to the pool and played some more . they took turns diving and marching and having fun . they learned to respect each other and to share their skills . they were happy . ben and lily were twins who liked to play outside . they had a big yard with a swing , a slide and a sandbox . they also had a small house made of wood that their dad had built for them . it had a door , a window and a roof .

one day , ben and lily decided to play house . ben said he would be the dad and lily would be the mom . they took some toys and some snacks and went inside the house . ben said he would carry the toys and lily would carry the snacks . they put them on the floor and pretended to have a picnic .

but then , lily saw something on the roof . it was a big , black bird . it had shiny feathers and a sharp beak . it was a crow . lily did not like crows . she thought they were mean and noisy . she said to ben , " look , there is a crow on the roof . it is going to eat our snacks . go away , crow ! "

ben looked up and saw the crow . he was not afraid of crows . he thought they were smart and funny . he said to lily , " no , the crow is not going to eat our snacks . it is just curious . maybe it wants to play with us . hello , crow ! "

the crow heard ben and lily talking . it tilted its head and cawed . it was not interested in their snacks . it was interested in their toys . it saw a shiny car , a soft doll and a colorful ball . it wanted to have them . it was a spoiled crow . it flew down from the roof and grabbed the car with its beak . it flew back to the roof and dropped the car . it made a loud noise .

