the crow did not stop . it cawed again and looked for more toys . it was a greedy crow . it did not want to share . it did not want to play . it only wanted to take .

but then , something happened . the roof of the house was not very strong . it was made of thin wood and nails . it could not hold the weight of the crow and the toys . it started to crack and bend . it made a creaking noise .

