the crow heard them and felt ashamed . it realized it had been bad . it had been selfish . it had been rude . it had spoiled their fun . it did not want to be like that . it wanted to be nice . it wanted to be friends . it flew down from the roof and dropped the toys . it made a soft noise .

ben and lily saw the crow give back their toys . they were surprised . they said together , " look , the crow is sorry . it is giving back our toys . maybe it wants to be nice . maybe it wants to be friends . hello , crow ! "

