one day , the news was scary . they showed a big fire that was burning houses and trees . they said the fire was very close to where lily lived . lily was frightened . she hugged her dad and asked if they were safe .

dad said they had to remove some things from their house and go to a different place for a while . he said the firemen were working hard to stop the fire and they would come back when it was safe . he said they could take some of their favorite things , like lily 's teddy bear and her books .

lily helped her dad remove some clothes and toys and put them in a big bag . she also removed some photos and drawings and put them in a small box . she did not want to lose them . she was still frightened , but she was brave .

they got in the car and drove away from the fire . lily looked out the window and saw the smoke and the flames . she hoped the firemen would be okay . she hoped the animals and the people would be okay . she hoped her house would be okay . she held her teddy bear and her dad 's hand . she felt a little better . sam liked to play with his toy cars . he had many cars of different colors and shapes . he liked to make them zoom and crash on the floor . he also liked to record the sounds of his cars with his dad 's phone .

one day , he found a new car in his toy box . it was an enormous truck with big wheels and a loud horn . sam was very happy . he wanted to record the sound of the truck . he took his dad 's phone and pressed the red button .

" beep beep ! vroom vroom ! " sam said , making the truck sound . he held the phone close to the truck . he smiled and looked at the screen . he saw a picture of himself and the truck .

" wow , you have a nice truck , sam ! " a voice said . sam turned around and saw his dad . his dad was a mechanic . he fixed cars and trucks for people .

" hi , dad ! " sam said . " look , i 'm recording the truck sound ! "

" that 's very cool , sam ! " his dad said . " can i listen ? "

sam nodded and gave his dad the phone . his dad put the phone to his ear and heard the truck sound . he laughed and hugged sam .

" you 're very good at recording , sam ! " his dad said . " maybe you can be a mechanic like me when you grow up ! "

sam smiled and hugged his dad back . he liked his dad and his truck . he wanted to record more sounds with his dad . he was very happy . lily and ben love to swing at the park . they swing high and low , fast and slow . they laugh and sing and feel the wind in their hair . they swing every day after school , before they go home .

one day , mom and dad tell them they are going to camp for the weekend . lily and ben are excited . they have never been to camp before . they pack their bags and their toys and their blankets . they get in the car and drive to the woods .

at camp , they see a big lake and a lot of trees . they see a fire and a tent and a table . they see other kids and grown - ups . they say hello and make new friends . they play games and eat snacks and tell stories .

but lily and ben miss their swing . they look around and see no swing at camp . they feel sad and bored . they ask mom and dad if they can go back to the park . mom and dad say no , they have to stay at camp . they say camp is fun and they will like it .

lily and ben do not believe them . they walk away and look for something to do . they see a big hill and a long rope . they have an idea . they run to the hill and tie the rope to a branch . they make a swing . they sit on the rope and push each other . they swing high and low , fast and slow . they laugh and sing and feel the wind in their hair . they swing at camp , just like at the park .

mom and dad see them and smile . they are proud of lily and ben . they are happy they made their own swing . they join them and swing with them . they all have fun and enjoy camp . they learn that camp is fair and swing is everywhere . tom and mia were playing in the snow . they made a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they gave him a carrot nose and two buttons for eyes . they were very happy with their snowman .

" hello , mr. snowman ! " mia said . " do you like the snow ? "

the snowman did not say anything . he just smiled with his carrot nose .

" maybe he is cold , " tom said . " let 's go inside and have some hot chocolate . "

mia nodded . she was feeling cold too . they said goodbye to their snowman and ran to the house .

inside , their mom was waiting for them . she had made hot chocolate with marshmallows . she gave them each a cup and a cookie .

" did you have fun in the snow ? " she asked .

" yes , mom , " tom and mia said . " we made a snowman . he is very big and nice . "

" that 's wonderful , " mom said . " but you should not stay out too long . it is very icy outside . you might slip and fall . "

tom and mia drank their hot chocolate and ate their cookies . they felt warm and cozy . they yawned and rubbed their eyes .

" are you sleepy ? " mom asked .

" a little bit , " tom and mia said .

" then why do n't you go to bed ? " mom said . " you can see your snowman again tomorrow . "

tom and mia agreed . they hugged their mom and went to their room . they put on their pajamas and brushed their teeth . they climbed into their beds and snuggled under their blankets .

" good night , tom , " mia said .

" good night , mia , " tom said .

they closed their eyes and fell asleep . they dreamed of their snowman and the snow .

but they did not know that something was happening outside . something that would make them wonder in the morning . something that would change their snowman forever . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . but lily was not careful . she tripped on a rock and fell down . she hurt her knee and it was bleeding .

" ow , ow , ow ! " lily cried . " it hurts ! "

ben ran to her and saw the blood . he was scared . he wanted to help lily . he looked around and saw a tall lady with a bag . he ran to her and said , " please , please , help my friend . she is hurt . "

the tall lady was kind . she opened her bag and took out a bandage . she walked to lily and said , " do n't worry , little one . i am a nurse . i can make it better . "

she cleaned lily 's knee and put the bandage on it . she said , " there you go . you are brave . the bandage will stop the bleeding and protect your knee . it will heal soon . "

lily smiled and said , " thank you , nurse . you are nice . the bandage is pretty . it has stars on it . "

the nurse smiled and said , " you are welcome , lily . and you , ben , you are a good friend . you did the right thing to ask for help . "

ben smiled and said , " thank you , nurse . you are smart . you have a big bag with many things . "

the nurse said , " you are welcome , ben . now , you can play again . but be careful and have fun . "

lily and ben hugged the nurse and said , " bye , bye , nurse . you are the best . "

they ran back to the slide and played some more . they were happy . they had a bandage , a friend , and a nurse . tim and lily wanted to make a house for their toys . they found some old boxes and some pine cones in the yard . they thought the pine cones would be good for the roof .

" let 's measure the boxes and see how big we can make the house , " tim said . he took a stick and marked the length and width of each box on the ground .

lily nodded and helped him . she liked to measure things . she wanted to be a builder when she grew up .

they stacked the boxes on top of each other and made a big square . then they put some pine cones on the top to make a pointy roof . they cut out a door and some windows with scissors .

" look , we made a house ! " lily said . she was very proud of their work .

tim smiled and said , " yes , we did . it 's a very tall house . let 's put our toys inside and play . "

they ran to get their toys and brought them to the house . they had a lot of fun pretending to be the toy 's family .

but then , a strong wind came and blew the house over . the boxes fell apart and the pine cones rolled away . tim and lily were sad . they had worked hard to make the house .

" why did the wind do that ? " lily asked . she felt like crying .

tim hugged her and said , " i do n't know . maybe the wind was jealous of our house . or maybe it was too tall for the wind to pass by . "

he looked at the mess and said , " maybe we should make a smaller house next time . or use something stronger than boxes and pine cones . "

lily nodded and said , " yes , maybe we should . but we still had fun , right ? "

tim smiled and said , " yes , we did . and we learned something too . we learned that sometimes things do n't last , but we can always try again . "

they picked up their toys and went inside to have some cookies . they decided to make another house another day , but with different materials and a different design .

the end . tom and lily like to jog in the park . they jog fast and slow , and have fun . one day , they see a big red button on a tree . the button says " do not push " .

" wow , what is that ? " tom asks .

" i do n't know . maybe it makes something happen , " lily says .

they look at the button . they want to push it , but they also remember the words .

" let 's push it and see , " tom says .

" no , we should not . it says do not push . it might be bad , " lily says .

they argue . tom thinks it is fun to push the button . lily thinks it is wrong to push the button . they are not happy .

then , they hear a voice .

" hello , children . i am the park ranger . i see you found my button . do you know what it does ? "

they turn around and see a man in a green hat and shirt . he smiles at them .

" no , we do n't . what does it do ? " tom asks .

" it opens the gate to the animal zoo . if you push it , you can see the lions , and the monkeys , and the birds . but you have to be careful . the animals are not tame . they might bite or scratch you . that 's why it says do not push . only i can push it when i have the keys and the food for the animals , " the park ranger says .

tom and lily look at each other . they feel sorry for arguing . they also feel curious about the animals .

" can we see the animals with you ? " lily asks .

" sure , if you want . but you have to promise not to push the button without me . and you have to stay close to me and listen to me . do you promise ? " the park ranger asks .

they nod and say yes . they follow the park ranger to the gate . he pushes the button . the gate opens . they see the animals . they are happy . they thank the park ranger for showing them the animals . they learn a lot . they also learn to respect the words and the rules . they jog back to their home . they are friends again . lily and tom were friends who liked to play . one day , they found a big box in the attic . inside the box , there were many old things . lily saw a shiny shoe and took it out . she said , " look , tom , this is a pretty shoe . i want to wear it and be a princess . "

tom said , " no , lily , that is not a pretty shoe . that is an ancient shoe . it is very old and dirty . you should not wear it . it might break or hurt your foot . "

lily did not listen to tom . she put on the ancient shoe and tried to walk . but the shoe was too big and heavy for her . she tripped and fell down . she cried , " ow , ow , ow ! the shoe is bad ! it hurts my foot ! "

tom ran to help lily . he took off the ancient shoe and looked at her foot . it was red and swollen . he said , " i 'm sorry , lily . you are hurt . i told you not to wear the ancient shoe . it was not for playing . it was for looking . "

lily said , " i 'm sorry , tom . you were right . i was silly . i should have listened to you . the ancient shoe was not for me . it was for someone else . "

tom and lily hugged and said sorry . they put the ancient shoe back in the box and went downstairs . they learned a lesson . they learned to be careful with old things and to listen to their friends . tom and mia were playing in the pool with their raft . they liked to pretend they were pirates and explore the water . they had a flag , a hat and a sword made of foam .

" look , there is a big ship ! " mia said , pointing to a boat that was passing by . " let 's attack it and take their treasure ! "

" arrr , yes , let 's go ! " tom agreed , waving his sword . they paddled their raft towards the boat , making loud noises .

but the people on the boat did not like their game . they were angry and scared . they shouted at tom and mia to go away . they sprayed water at them with a hose . they threw things at them .

tom and mia were confused and sad . they did not understand why the people were so mean . they did not want to hurt them . they just wanted to have fun .

they turned their raft around and went back to the pool . they felt wet and cold and sore . they did not want to play pirates anymore .

their mom saw them and came to hug them . she asked them what happened . they told her about the boat and the people .

" i 'm sorry , my loves . they did not know you were playing . they thought you were trying to bother them . they were scared of your sword and your flag . they did not know they were toys . " mom said .

she took them to the shower and dried them with a towel . she gave them some cookies and milk . she told them they were brave and smart and kind .

she also told them they should be careful when they play near boats . she said they should always ask before they go near them . she said they should always be polite and friendly .

tom and mia nodded . they felt better . they hugged their mom and thanked her .

they went back to the pool with their raft . they decided to play a different game . they pretended they were dolphins and jumped and splashed in the water .

they had a lot of fun . they laughed and smiled . they applauded each other for their tricks .

the people on the boat saw them and smiled too . they waved and cheered . they apologized for their mistake . they gave them some candy and stickers .

tom and mia were happy and surprised . they waved and cheered back . they thanked them for their gifts .

they learned a lesson . they learned that sometimes people can be scared or angry , but they can also be nice and sorry . they learned that playing is fun , but being safe and respectful is important too .

they played until the sun went down . they had a great day . they loved their raft and their mom and each other . tom and mia liked to swim in the pool . they wore swim suits and goggles . they splashed and kicked and had fun .

one day , they saw a new boy sitting on the edge of the pool . he looked sad and scared . he did not have a swim suit or goggles .

" hi , what is your name ? " tom asked the boy .

" i am sam , " the boy said in a small voice .

" do you want to swim with us ? " mia asked .

" i do n't know how to swim , " sam said . " i am afraid of the water . "

tom and mia were thoughtful . they wanted to help sam . they had an idea .

" we can teach you how to swim , " tom said . " we can hold your hand and show you how to float and kick . "

" yes , and we can give you our goggles and a floaty , " mia said . " they will help you see and stay up . "

sam smiled a little . he liked tom and mia . they were kind and friendly .

" okay , i will try , " sam said .

tom and mia helped sam put on the goggles and the floaty . they held his hand and walked into the water . they spoke to him in a gentle voice and showed him how to swim .

soon , sam was swimming with tom and mia . he was not afraid anymore . he was happy and proud .

" thank you , tom and mia , " sam said . " you are the best swim teachers ever . "

" you are welcome , sam , " tom and mia said . " you are a great swimmer . we are glad you are our friend . " lily wanted to watch her favourite show on the big screen . she asked her mom if she could watch it .

" mom , can i watch the show with the pink pony and the rainbow ? " lily said .

" not now , lily . you have to do your homework first . then you can watch it , " mom said .

" but mom , i do n't like homework . it is boring and hard . i like the show . it is lovely and fun . please , mom , please ! " lily begged .

" i 'm sorry , lily , but you have to do your homework . it is important for you to learn . i will not permit you to watch the show until you finish your homework , " mom said .

lily was very sad and angry . she did not want to do her homework . she wanted to watch the show . she thought mom was not fair . she stomped her feet and cried .

" mom , you are mean ! you do n't love me ! you only love homework ! " lily shouted .

mom was hurt by lily 's words . she loved lily very much . she only wanted lily to do well in school . she hugged lily and tried to calm her down .

" lily , i love you more than anything . i do n't love homework . i love you . but homework is good for you . it helps you to grow and to know more things . if you do your homework , you will be proud of yourself . and i will be proud of you too . and then we can watch the show together . how does that sound ? " mom said .

lily sniffed and wiped her tears . she looked at mom 's face . she saw that mom was not mean . she was kind and caring . she felt sorry for shouting at mom .

" i 'm sorry , mom . i love you too . i will do my homework . and then we can watch the show . thank you , mom , " lily said .

mom smiled and kissed lily 's cheek . she helped lily with her homework . they finished it quickly . then they turned on the big screen and watched the show with the pink pony and the rainbow . they both enjoyed it . it was a lovely show . and they were a lovely family . tim and mia were playing in the park with their ball . they liked to kick the ball to each other and run after it . they were having fun .

suddenly , they heard a loud noise in the sky . they looked up and saw a big helicopter . it was flying very low and fast . it made a lot of wind and noise . tim and mia were scared . they dropped the ball and ran to their mom .

" mom , mom , what is that ? " tim asked , trembling .

" it 's a helicopter , tim . it 's a machine that can fly in the air . sometimes , it helps people who are hurt or in trouble , " mom explained .

" why is it flying so low and fast , mom ? " mia asked , trembling too .

" i do n't know , mia . maybe it 's looking for someone who needs help . maybe someone is lost or sick or hurt , " mom said .

" who is it , mom ? who needs help ? " tim and mia asked together .

mom hugged them and said , " i do n't know , my loves . but whoever it is , they are poor . they need our prayers and kindness . let 's hope the helicopter finds them and helps them . "

tim and mia nodded . they felt sorry for the poor person who needed help . they hoped the helicopter would make them better . they stopped trembling and held mom 's hand . they watched the helicopter fly away . they prayed for the poor person . they picked up their ball and played again . they were happy . lily liked to play princess . she had a pink dress , a shiny crown , and a wand . she liked to pretend she was the queen of a big castle . she told her friends what to do and how to play . she did not listen to them or share her toys .

one day , a new girl came to play . her name was mia . she had a blue dress , a starry crown , and a necklace . she wanted to play princess too . she asked lily if she could join her game . lily said no . she said she was the only princess and mia had to be a servant . mia felt sad and went to play with other toys .

lily saw mia playing with a cool train . she wanted to play with it too . she went to mia and said , " give me that train . i am the princess and you have to do what i say . " mia said no . she said , " you are not a nice princess . you are mean and bossy . you do not share or listen . you have to ask nicely if you want to play with my train . " lily got angry and tried to grab the train . mia held on to it and said , " stop it . you are hurting me . "

then , lily 's mom came and saw what was happening . she said , " lily , what are you doing ? why are you fighting with mia ? that is not how you play with your friends . " lily said , " but i am the princess and she has to do what i say . " lily 's mom said , " no , you are not . you are a little girl who needs to learn how to be kind and respectful . being a princess is not about telling others what to do . it is about being brave , fair , and caring . mia is a princess too , and so are all your friends . you have to share and listen and say sorry when you are wrong . "

lily felt ashamed and sorry . she looked at mia and saw that she had a scratch on her arm . she said , " i am sorry , mia . i was mean and bossy . i did not mean to hurt you . can i play with your train ? " mia nodded and smiled . she said , " it is okay , lily . i forgive you . yes , you can play with my train . do you want to be friends ? " lily nodded and hugged mia . she said , " yes , i want to be friends . you are a cool princess . can we play together ? " mia said , " yes , we can . let 's play princess and train . " they went to play and had fun .

lily learned a lesson that day . she learned that being a princess is not about being selfish and rude . it is about being kind and friendly . she learned that sharing and listening are important . she learned that she can have more fun when she plays with others . she learned that everyone can be a princess in their own way . lily and ben were bored . they had nothing to do . they looked at the tv , but it was not fun . they looked at their toys , but they did not want to play . they looked at each other , but they did not have any ideas .

" let 's go to the kitchen , " said lily . " maybe we can find something to eat . "

" ok , " said ben . " but we have to be quiet . mom is sleeping . "

they tiptoed to the kitchen . they saw a big bowl on the table . it had something white and fluffy inside . it looked yummy .

" let 's try it , " said lily . she took a spoon and dipped it in the bowl . she put it in her mouth . it was sweet and creamy . it was perfect .

" wow , this is good , " said ben . he took another spoon and did the same . he smiled and licked his lips .

they ate more and more . they did not notice that the bowl was getting empty . they did not notice that the white and fluffy thing was mom 's cake frosting . they did not notice that mom was waking up .

mom came to the kitchen . she saw the bowl . she saw the spoons . she saw the mess . she saw lily and ben . they had frosting all over their faces .

" what are you doing ? " she asked . she was not happy .

" we were hungry , " said lily . " we found this in the bowl . it was perfect . "

" that was not for you , " said mom . " that was for my cake . i was going to stir it and put it on the cake . now i have to make it again . "

lily and ben felt bad . they did not mean to ruin mom 's cake . they did not know it was frosting . they thought it was a snack .

" we are sorry , mom , " they said . " we did not know . we will help you make it again . "

mom sighed . she was still not happy , but she was not angry . she loved lily and ben . she knew they were curious and hungry . she knew they made a mistake .

" ok , " she said . " but next time , ask me before you eat something . and do n't touch the tv . it is not a toy . "

lily and ben nodded . they hugged mom and said they loved her . they learned their lesson . they helped mom stir the frosting and put it on the cake . they waited until it was ready . then they ate a slice each . it was perfect . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the garden . they have a big pool with water and toys . they splash and swim and have fun .

but mom says they have to wash before dinner . she fills the tub with warm water and bubbles . she says it is a luxury . anna and ben do not know what luxury means . they think it is a funny word .

anna likes to wash . she puts bubbles on her hair and nose . she sings a song . she says washing is fun . but ben does not like to wash . he says washing is boring . he wants to play more in the pool . he says he is not dirty .

anna and ben start to argue . anna says ben has to wash or he will smell bad . ben says anna is a baby who likes to wash too much . they yell and push each other . mom hears them and comes to the tub . she is not happy .

she says anna and ben have to stop fighting . she says washing is good for them . she says they are lucky to have water and bubbles . she says some children do not have these things . she says they should be grateful and kind .

anna and ben feel sorry . they say sorry to mom and to each other . they hug and kiss . they finish washing . they make bubbles with their mouths . they laugh and smile . they say washing is not so bad . they say they love mom and the luxury . they say they are ready for dinner . tom is a tall boy . he loves to play with his toys . he has a car , a ball , a bear and a train . he likes to make noises with his toys . vroom , vroom , bounce , bounce , roar , roar , choo , choo .

one day , tom hears a knock on the door . he runs to the door and opens it . he sees a girl with a big smile . she has a doll , a book , a cat and a bike . she says , " hi , i am ann . i live next door . can i play with you ? "

tom is happy . he says , " yes , you can . come in . i have many toys . you can share with me . " he shows ann his toys . ann likes tom 's toys . she says , " wow , you have a nice car , a big ball , a soft bear and a fast train . can i try them ? "

tom says , " sure , you can . and i can try your toys too . i like your doll , your book , your cat and your bike . can i hold them ? "

ann says , " of course , you can . we can take turns . we can have fun together . " they play with each other 's toys . they make noises with their toys . vroom , vroom , bounce , bounce , roar , roar , choo , choo , meow , meow , ring , ring , la , la .

they play for a long time . they laugh and talk . they become friends . they love to play with each other . they are happy . they do not want to stop playing . but then they hear their moms calling them . they have to go home . they say , " bye , bye . see you tomorrow . let 's play again . "

they hug each other . they close the door . they go to their homes . they smile . they think of each other . they are happy . they love to play with each other . lily and tom are friends . they like to play games . one day , they play a game with a scale . a scale can tell how much weight something has .

lily and tom take turns to put things on the scale . they want to see who can make the scale show a bigger number . lily puts a book on the scale . the scale shows five . tom puts a ball on the scale . the scale shows two . lily wins this round .

tom says , " let 's try again . " he puts a pillow on the scale . the scale shows one . lily puts a teddy bear on the scale . the scale shows three . lily wins again .

tom says , " one more time . " he puts a big box on the scale . the scale shows ten . lily thinks hard . she is very intelligent . she has an idea . she puts tom on the scale . the scale shows twenty . lily wins the game .

lily and tom laugh . they are happy . they hug each other . they are good friends . they like to play games . lila is a girl who likes to swim . she goes to the pool with her mom and dad . she puts on her pink swimsuit and her goggles . she jumps into the water and splashes .

lila swims with her arms and legs . she goes fast and slow . she swims under the water and sees the bubbles . she swims on top of the water and sees the sun . she has fun .

but then lila swims too much . she feels dizzy . she stops swimming and holds on to the edge of the pool . she tells her mom and dad that she is dizzy . they tell her to rest and drink some water . they give her a hug and a kiss .

lila feels better . she is not dizzy anymore . she smiles and says thank you . she is happy . she loves to swim . lily and ben were twins . they liked to play with their toys and books . but they did not like to share . sometimes they fought over who got what .

one day , their mom gave them a new vest each . they were blue and warm and soft . lily and ben were happy . they put on their vests and ran outside to play .

but then they saw a big puddle . it was shiny and wet and fun . lily wanted to jump in it . she said , " look , ben , a puddle ! let 's jump in it and splash ! "

ben shook his head . he said , " no , lily , we ca n't . mom said not to get our vests dirty . they are new and nice . we have to keep them clean . "

lily pouted . she said , " but i want to jump in the puddle . it looks like fun . you are no fun , ben . you are grumpy . "

ben crossed his arms . he said , " i am not grumpy . you are silly , lily . you do n't listen to mom . you will get wet and cold and sick . "

they argued and argued . they did not play . they did not have fun . they were both grumpy .

then their mom came outside . she saw them fighting . she said , " what is going on , lily and ben ? why are you not playing ? why are you so grumpy ? "

lily and ben told their mom what happened . they both wanted to do different things . they both wanted to be right .

their mom smiled . she said , " i see . well , i have an idea . why do n't you take off your vests and put them in the basket ? then you can jump in the puddle and splash . and when you are done , you can put on your vests again and they will be clean and warm . "

lily and ben liked their mom 's idea . they said , " okay , mom . thank you , mom . we are sorry , mom . "

they took off their vests and put them in the basket . then they ran to the puddle and jumped in it and splashed . they laughed and played . they had fun . they were not grumpy anymore . sara and ben like to play pirates . they have a big box that is their ship . they have hats and swords and a map . the map shows them where to find treasure .

one day , they find a shiny coin in the sand . sara is happy . she puts the coin in her pocket . ben is jealous . he wants the coin too . he tries to take it from sara . they fight .

" stop ! " says mom . " you have to share . pirates do n't fight with their friends . they work together . "

mom gives them a cloth . she tells them to wipe the coin . it is dirty . they wipe the coin . they see something on it . it is a picture of a star .

" look ! " says sara . " it is a clue . maybe it is part of the treasure . "

" maybe you are right , " says ben . " let 's look at the map . maybe the star is on it . "

they look at the map . they see a star . it is near a big tree . they run to the tree . they dig under it . they find a box . it is full of more coins and jewels .

" wow ! " says sara . " we found the treasure . we are the best pirates ever . "

" yes , we are , " says ben . " and we are the best friends too . i am sorry i was jealous . can we share the treasure ? "

" of course , " says sara . " sharing is fun . and so is playing pirates . "

they hug . they smile . they play with their treasure . mom is proud . she is happy . she loves her little pirates . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big book on a bench . the book is open . it has many pictures and words .

