the end . jackie was a little girl who loved to explore . one day she opened the door of her dad 's office . everything looked so strange . she saw lots of things and it was a bit scary . she noticed a big , messy desk . she decided to grab the pen that was on it and run away . suddenly , her dad saw her and yelled " what do you think you are doing in my office ? " jackie was so embarrassed , she quickly put the pen back and ran out of the room . she was never supposed to go into her dad 's office ever again ! once there was an enormous oak tree . it stood tall and strong , and shaded the ground beneath it . all the animals in the neighborhood liked to gather around it .

