the old man was very wise . he knew that parking his car in the dark was the best thing to do . from then on he always parked his car in the dark and it was always safe . one day there was a good van . two people got into the van and they drove off . soon , they came to a park . they got out and went over to a slide . they wanted to slide down but they resisted because it was too high . the two people kept looking around and eventually they saw a small slide . they decided it was good and they went to slide down it . they had fun going down the slide and they laughed a lot . then they went back to the van and drove home . once upon a time there was a boy called jack . he was 3 years old and he loved going swimming . one day , he asked his mum if he could borrow her belt . his mum said he could , so jack put the belt around his waist and went to the swimming pool .

