lily and ben heard spot 's cry . they ran to the yard and saw the dog and the car . they saw blood and fur . they were very sad and sorry . they had been bad . they had not taken care of spot . they had lost their sweet kitten . zoe loves waffles . she likes to eat them with honey and butter . every morning , her mom makes her a waffle for breakfast . zoe is happy .

