tom and sam are scared . they back away from the cobweb . they run to the door . they leave the old house . they do not want to play with the spider . they want to play with something else . something nice and fun . lily and tom were playing with a big net in the park . they liked to catch bugs and leaves with the net and look at them . they saw a butterfly with many colors and ran after it .

