mom smiles . she is happy . she sees lily and ben are happy too . she sees they learned something new . she sees they are friends again . she says , " i 'm proud of you . you are very smart and kind . i love you . " lily and ben are playing with their toy cars on the floor . they have a big box that they pretend is a garage . they take turns to drive their cars in and out of the box .

