the park was quiet and peaceful . tom and lily learned to share and play nicely . their moms were happy and proud . they all had a good day . anna and ben are playing in the garden . they see a bee flying near a flower . anna likes bees . she thinks they are pretty and make honey . ben is scared of bees . he thinks they are mean and sting .

