" you 're welcome , my loves . i 'm glad you like it , " mom says . she hugs them . she is happy too . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with cards . the cards have pictures of animals . tom and sam try to match the cards . if they find two cards with the same animal , they keep them . if not , they put them back .

one day , tom and sam are playing with cards on the floor . tom has a card with a lion . he looks for another card with a lion . he sees one on the table . he reaches for it . but he is not careful . he knocks over a vase . the vase falls and breaks . tom is scared .

