tom and sam love mom . they help mom clean up . they finish playing with cards . they match all the animals . they have fun . they are happy . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to climb the big slide and go down fast . they laughed and had fun .

but then they saw a stranger . he was a big man with a hat and a coat . he came near them and said , " hello , little ones . do you want some candy ? "

