their mom and dad hugged them and said , " you did the right thing . we are proud of you . you are brave and smart . the stranger was bad . he wanted to hurt you . but you are safe now . we love you . " tim and sam are brothers . they like to play with their ball . they bounce the ball on the grass , on the wall , and on the roof . they laugh and shout when the ball goes high and low .

