he heard a voice behind him . it was his mom . she looked angry . she said , " tom , what are you doing ? that 's my ring ! you ca n't stir the soup with it ! you ca n't eat the soup ! it 's not ready yet ! it 's too hot for you ! get down from the chair right now ! "

