his mom hugged him . she said , " it 's okay , tom . i 'm not mad at you . i 'm glad you did n't burn yourself . but you have to be careful . you ca n't touch the stove or the pot or the spoon . they are hot and dangerous . you have to wait until i say the soup is ready . then we can eat it together . okay ? "

