suddenly , they saw a light . it was their dad , who had followed them . he had a flashlight and a rope . he saw them in the hole and said , " what are you doing here ? this is a dangerous place . there are snakes and rats and other things that can hurt you . come on , i will help you out . "

he threw the rope down and told them to grab it . he was strong and flexible , and he pulled them up . they hugged him and said , " thank you , dad . we are sorry . we were playing a game of dare and we went too far . we will never do that again . "

he smiled and said , " i 'm glad you are safe . i know you like to have fun , but you have to be careful . there are some things that you should not dare to do . come on , let 's go back to the cabin . i have some cookies and milk for you . " anna and ben were twins who liked to play with their toys . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big screen that showed pictures and sounds . they could touch the screen and make things happen , like animals and colors and games .

one day , their mom said , " anna and ben , i have to go to the store . you can play with the screen , but be careful . it is delicate and can break . do not hit it or throw things at it . i will be back soon . "

anna and ben said , " okay , mom . we will be good . " they hugged their mom and watched her leave . then they turned on the screen and started to play .

anna liked to play with the animals . she touched the screen and made a cat meow , a dog bark , and a bird sing . she smiled and said , " look , ben , the animals are so cute and funny . "

ben liked to play with the colors . he touched the screen and made it change from red to blue to green to yellow . he laughed and said , " look , anna , the colors are so bright and pretty . "

they played for a while , but then they got bored . they wanted to try something new . they looked around and saw a ball , a pillow , and a book . they had an idea .

anna said , " ben , let 's play catch with the ball . maybe the screen will catch it too . "

ben said , " okay , anna , that sounds fun . but we have to be gentle . we do n't want to spoil the screen . "

they threw the ball to each other , and sometimes to the screen . the screen bounced the ball back , and made funny noises . anna and ben giggled and clapped .

but then , anna threw the ball too hard . it hit the screen with a loud bang . the screen cracked and went black . the pictures and sounds were gone .

anna and ben gasped and dropped the ball . they ran to the screen and touched it . it was cold and silent . they felt scared and sad .

they said , " oh no , oh no , we spoiled the screen . mom will be mad . what will we do ? "

they heard the door open . it was their mom . she saw the broken screen and the ball . she frowned and said , " anna and ben , what did you do ? you spoiled the screen . it was delicate and expensive . you were not careful . you were naughty . "

anna and ben cried and said , " we 're sorry , mom . we wanted to play catch with the screen . we did n't mean to spoil it . please do n't be mad . "

their mom sighed and said , " i 'm not mad , but i 'm disappointed . you should have listened to me . you should have respected the screen . now it 's ruined . you ca n't play with it anymore . you have to learn from your mistake . "

she hugged them and said , " i love you , anna and ben . but you have to be more responsible . next time , play with your toys that are not delicate . and do n't throw things at the screen . it 's not a toy . it 's a tool . "

anna and ben nodded and said , " we love you , mom . we 're sorry . we will be more responsible . we will play with our toys that are not delicate . and we wo n't throw things at the screen . we promise . "

their mom smiled and said , " that 's good . now , let 's go and have some cookies . and maybe we can read a book together . books are not delicate . they are durable . and they have pictures and words that can teach you many things . "

anna and ben smiled and said , " okay , mom . we like cookies . and we like books . books are fun . and they do n't spoil . " ben and lily were playing with their toys in the living room . ben had a big truck and lily had a doll . they were having fun , but then ben saw something on the floor . it was a worm . a long , slimy , disgusting worm .

" look , lily , a worm ! " ben said . he picked up the worm and held it in his hand . he wanted to show it to lily .

" yuck , ben , put it down ! " lily said . she did not like worms . she thought they were gross . she moved away from ben and hugged her doll .

" no , it 's cool , lily . look , it can wiggle ! " ben said . he moved his finger and made the worm wiggle . he laughed . he thought it was funny .

but then , the worm bit ben 's finger . ben felt a sharp pain . he dropped the worm and cried . his finger was bleeding . he ran to his mom , who was in the kitchen .

" mom , mom , the worm bit me ! " ben said . he showed his mom his finger .

" oh , ben , what did you do ? " his mom said . she took ben 's finger and washed it with water . she put a band - aid on it . she hugged ben and kissed his cheek .

" it 's okay , ben . i fixed your finger . it will heal soon . but do n't play with worms , okay ? they are not toys . they are disgusting . " his mom said .

" okay , mom . i 'm sorry . i wo n't play with worms again . " ben said . he felt better . he went back to the living room , where lily was waiting for him .

" i 'm sorry , lily . i did n't mean to scare you . do you want to play with me ? " ben said .

" okay , ben . but only if you play with your truck . no more worms . " lily said .

" okay , lily . no more worms . let 's play with our toys . " ben said .

they played with their toys and forgot about the worm . they were happy . lia and ben are friends . they like to play in the forest . they find a brown hut near a stream . the hut is old and has holes in the roof .

" let 's go inside and see what is there , " lia says .

