sara was not sad and lonely anymore . she had a friend and a group . she felt like she belonged . she felt welcome . lily was an adventurous girl who loved to play outside . she had a kite that was red and yellow and had a long tail . she liked to fly her kite in the park when the wind was strong .

one day , she saw a big hill near the park . she thought it would be fun to fly her kite from the top of the hill . she asked her mom if she could go there . her mom said no , because the hill was too far and too steep . she said it was not safe for lily to go there alone .

but lily did not listen to her mom . she waited until her mom was busy and then she took her kite and ran to the hill . she climbed up the hill and felt very proud . she thought she was very brave and smart .

she took out her kite and tried to fly it . but the wind was too strong and the kite was too big . the kite pulled lily and made her lose her balance . she fell down the hill and hurt her knee and her elbow . she cried and cried . she wished she had listened to her mom .

her mom heard her cry and ran to the hill . she saw lily and her kite on the ground . she was very worried and angry . she hugged lily and said , " i told you not to go to the hill . why did you not listen to me ? you could have been hurt very badly . you were not adventurous , you were foolish . "

lily felt sorry and ashamed . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to fly my kite from the hill . i thought it would be fun . i did not mean to disobey you . please forgive me . "

her mom said , " i forgive you , lily . but you have to learn to listen to me and to request permission before you do something dangerous . i love you and i want you to be safe and happy . next time , let 's fly your kite together in the park , okay ? "

lily nodded and said , " okay , mom . i love you too . thank you for being my mom . "

the moral of the story is : listen to your parents and request permission before you do something adventurous . they know what is best for you and they want you to be safe and happy . sara and tom were twins who liked to play outside . they loved to run , jump , and dig in the dirt . but they did not like to bathe . they thought it was boring and cold .

one day , their mom said , " sara and tom , it is time to bathe . you are very dirty and smelly . come inside now . "

sara and tom did not want to go . they said , " no , mom , we are not dirty . we are having fun . we want to stay outside . "

their mom said , " if you do not bathe , you will not get any food . you will be hungry and sad . and you will miss the surprise i have for you . "

sara and tom were curious . they liked surprises . they asked , " what surprise , mom ? what is it ? "

their mom said , " you will see . but you have to bathe first . hurry up , or the surprise will be gone . "

sara and tom decided to go inside . they did not want to miss the surprise . they hoped it was something good . maybe a toy , or a cake , or a book .

they took off their clothes and got into the tub . their mom poured water and soap on them . they rubbed their skin and hair . they made bubbles and splashed . they started to have fun . they forgot they did not like to bathe .

when they were clean and dry , their mom gave them towels and clothes . she said , " now you are ready for the surprise . follow me . "

she led them to the living room . there , on the couch , was a big , furry , brown dog . he had a collar and a tag that said , " rex " . he wagged his tail and licked their faces .

sara and tom were amazed . they loved dogs . they hugged and petted rex . they said , " wow , mom , this is the best surprise ever . thank you . can we keep him ? "

