sara and tom said , " we will love him and take care of him . we will play with him and feed him and bathe him . he is our ancient dog . "

their mom smiled and said , " i am proud of you , sara and tom . you are very kind and brave . now , let 's go to the kitchen and have some food . rex is hungry too . "

they all went to the kitchen and ate together . they were happy and full . they had a new family member . they learned that bathing was not so bad after all . and they looked forward to more surprises . lily and tom were twins . they liked to play with their toy cars . they had many cars of different colors and sizes . they pretended to drive them on the floor , on the sofa , and on the table .

