lily and tom nodded . they were still scared , but also curious . they watched the truck drive away . then they went to play on the swings . they forgot about the truck and had fun . they liked the park . timmy liked to number his toys . he had a journal where he wrote the names and numbers of his toys . he was very proud of his journal . he showed it to his mom and dad every day .

one day , timmy went to play with his friend lily . lily had many toys too , but she did not number them . she just played with them however she liked . timmy wanted to number lily 's toys and write them in his journal . he asked lily if he could do that .

