timmy and lily started to cry . they did not want to play with each other anymore . they wanted to go home . they did not know how to solve their problem . they needed some help . anna and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys , but they do not like to sort them . they leave their toys all over the floor , and their mom is not happy .

one day , mom says , " anna and ben , you need to sort your toys and put them in the boxes . if you do not sort your toys , you will not get any sweet treats after dinner . "

