they smile . they hold hands . they walk away . they are still friends . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to dig in the sand and look for treasures . sometimes they found shells , rocks , or coins . they put them in a bucket and pretended they were pirates .

one day , they saw something shiny in the sand . lily reached for it , but ben was faster . he grabbed it and held it up . it was a small , clear stone that sparkled in the sun .

