he held the stone up to his eye and looked at it . he saw the colors of the rainbow . he smiled . he thought it was beautiful .

lily shook her head . she felt sad . she realized that ben was not a good friend . he did not care about her . he only cared about the stone . she decided to leave him alone . she turned around and walked back to the sand . she hoped to find a real treasure . a treasure that was not rude . a treasure that she could share . anna and ben are twins . they like to watch television after lunch . they sit on the sofa and hold the remote . they press the buttons to change the channels .

one day , they see a show about animals . they see a big cat with stripes . it is a tiger . the tiger is in a cage . it looks sad . anna and ben feel sorry for the tiger .

