mom sighs . she is not happy . she tells the twins that they can not touch the television . it is not a real tiger . it is a picture . they can only watch it , not rub it .

she picks up the television and takes it to the garage . she says she will try to fix it later . she tells the twins to play with their toys instead . she gives them a hug and a kiss . she says she loves them , but they have to be careful .

anna and ben say they are sorry . they promise to be careful . they play with their toys and forget about the tiger . they hope mom can fix the television soon . they want to watch more shows about animals . but they will not try to rub them anymore . sara and her mom went to the park . sara liked to play on the swings and the slide . her mom sat on a bench and watched her . she had a big purse with snacks and water .

