the boy looked at sara and said , " so what ? it 's fun . you can slide faster when it 's wet . watch me . " he climbed up the slide and slid down . he went very fast and landed on the grass .

sara did not think it was fun . she thought it was dangerous and rude . she did not want to slide on the wet slide . she wanted to tell her mom . she ran to the bench where her mom was . but when she got there , she saw that her mom 's purse was wet too . the boy had splashed water on it when he slid down .

" oh no ! " sara cried . " mom , look ! your purse is wet . the boy did it . he made the slide wet too . he is a bad boy . "

her mom looked at her purse and frowned . she saw that her snacks and water were wet and soggy . she was not happy . she said , " that 's not nice at all . he should not do that . let 's go and talk to him . maybe he will say sorry and stop . "

sara and her mom went to the slide and found the boy . they told him that he was wrong to splash water on the slide and the purse . they asked him to say sorry and stop .

the boy looked at them and said , " sorry . i was just having fun . i did n't mean to make you mad . i wo n't do it again . "

sara and her mom accepted his apology and thanked him . they hoped he would be more careful and respectful next time . they decided to go to another part of the park where it was dry and clean . they had fun playing together and forgot about the wet slide and the wet purse . lily is a giraffe . she has a very long neck . she can eat leaves from the tall trees . she likes to be with her friends in the savanna . they are all giraffes too .

one day , lily sees a new animal . it is small and brown . it has a short neck and a long nose . it is an elephant . lily is curious . she wants to say hello . she walks to the elephant .

the elephant is friendly . he says hello to lily . he tells her his name is sam . he says he is looking for water . he is thirsty . he asks lily if she knows where to find water .

lily nods . she knows where to find water . there is a big lake near the trees . she tells sam to follow her . she leads him to the lake . sam is happy . he thanks lily . he drinks some water . he splashes some water on his nose .

lily and sam become friends . they talk and play . they learn about each other . they find out they have some things in common . they both like to eat plants . they both like to be kind . they both think their necks are important . lily 's neck helps her reach the leaves . sam 's neck helps him drink the water . they are proud of their necks . they are proud of their friendship . they are happy . anna loves roses . she likes to smell them and touch them . she has a rose garden in her backyard . she waters the roses every day .

one day , anna sees a new rose in her garden . it is big and red and shiny . it is the most beautiful rose she has ever seen . she runs to it and says , " hello , rose ! you are so great ! can i be your friend ? "

