they hoped that their uncle would find fluffy and bring it back . they missed their lovely sheep . they learned a lesson . they would never press a button without knowing what it does . ben and mia were playing by the river . they liked to watch the fish and the ducks . sometimes they saw an otter . the otter was fast and funny . he liked to slide on the rocks and splash in the water .

