but the eagle did not listen . he took the otter to his nest . ben and mia could not help the otter . they felt helpless . they wept for the otter . they hoped he would be okay . they wished they could see him again . they missed him very much . lila and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys in their room . but sometimes they fight over the toys . one day , lila wants to play with the train , but ben has it . lila tries to take it from him , but ben holds it tight .

