lila and max played guard together . they had fun . they were independent and strong , but also kind and fair . they were the best guards in the world . lily liked to help her mom cook in the kitchen . she had a small spoon and a small bowl . she could stir things in her bowl and pretend to make yummy food . mom gave her some cheese and some broccoli to stir in her bowl . lily liked cheese , but she did not like broccoli . she made a face and pushed the broccoli away .

