they went to the veterinarian , who was very kind and gentle . he looked at bella 's head and said , " you have a small cut , but nothing serious . i will clean it and put a bandage on it . it will heal soon . but you have to be careful when you bounce . do n't bounce too high or too fast , and watch out for branches and other things . bouncing is fun , but safety is important too . "

bella said , " thank you , veterinarian . i will be careful . i 'm sorry i was scared of you . you are a good person . "

the veterinarian said , " you 're welcome , bella . you are a brave bunny . and you have a good mom who cares for you . here , have a carrot . it 's delicious and good for you . "

