lila and ben are very happy . they put the coin in a box and hide it under the bed . they say , " we will polish it again tomorrow . maybe we will find more coins in the well . " they hug mom and go to sleep . tom and mia are friends . they like to play with toys . one day , tom finds a laser in his dad 's room . he thinks it is a fun toy . he takes it to mia 's house .

tom and mia play with the laser . they point it at things and make bright lights . they think it is funny . they laugh and have fun . they do not know that the laser is not a toy . it is a tool for dad 's work .

