tom and mia feel bad . they say sorry to mia 's mom and the cat . they help clean up the mess . they learn a lesson . they learn that they have to be careful with things they do not know . they learn that they have to ask before they take things . they learn that some things are not toys . they learn that playing with lasers is not funny . it is silly and risky . tom and lily liked to play with their toy boats in the pond . they had many boats of different colors and sizes . tom had a big navy boat that he was very proud of . lily had a small pink boat that she loved .

one day , tom saw lily 's boat and wanted to tease her . he said , " your boat is so silly and small . my boat is much better and stronger . your boat can not go fast or far . my boat can do anything . " lily felt sad and angry . she said , " no , your boat is not better . your boat is mean and rude . my boat is pretty and nice . my boat can go fast and far too . "

tom did not listen to lily . he took his navy boat and chased lily 's boat in the pond . he bumped into lily 's boat and made it spin and splash . he laughed and said , " ha ha , look at your boat . it is so weak and scared . my boat is so brave and smart . it can catch your boat easily . "

lily cried and said , " stop it , stop it . you are hurting my boat . you are not nice . you are not my friend . " she tried to get her boat back , but tom was too fast and strong . he kept bumping into lily 's boat and laughing .

then , something bad happened . tom 's navy boat hit a rock in the pond and broke . the rock made a hole in the boat and water came in . the boat sank and disappeared . tom was shocked and sad . he said , " oh no , oh no . my boat , my boat . it is gone , it is gone . " he looked for his boat , but he could not find it .

