lily learned that being clumsy can make a mess , but friends can help fix it . the moral of the story is : if you make a mistake , it 's okay to ask for help . once upon a time , there was a little bird named timmy . timmy loved to whistle all day long . he would whistle when he was happy , and he would whistle when he was sad . timmy 's whistling made the other birds in the forest happy too .

one day , timmy saw a big door with the word " exit " on it . he was very curious and impatient to see what was on the other side . so , timmy whistled a happy tune and went through the exit door .

