next , they went to the fruit area . mia 's mom asked her to help sort the fruits . mia put apples with apples , and oranges with oranges . she liked to sort things . when they were done , mia 's mom said , " thank you , mia . you are a great helper ! " mia smiled and felt proud of herself . they went home with their groceries , and mia could n't wait to help her mom again . one day , a little bird named tim was flying in the sky . he was fearful because he saw a big , mean cat . the cat was hiding behind a tree , watching tim . tim knew he needed to protect himself and his friends from the cat .

