the moral of the story is : smoking is bad for you and others . it is not cool or relaxing . it is stupid and harmful . friends are good for you and others . they are not silly or afraid . they are kind and helpful . friends are the best . ben and lily were playing in the park . they liked to swing on the ropes and slide on the slides . they saw a big rope hanging from a tree . it looked like fun .

