tom and jen are not scared anymore . they are curious . they go outside . they pet rex . they play with him . they make a new snowman and a new snow fort . they share their gloves and hats and boots with rex . they have more fun . lily and ben were playing in the pool . they liked to dive and splash and swim . they had a task to find the hidden toys that mom threw in the water . lily was good at diving . she could hold her breath for a long time and see the toys at the bottom . ben was not so good at diving . he was scared of the deep water and the dark .

