mom heard the noise . she ran to the living room . she saw the mess and the children . she was shocked and angry . she called dad . he came home quickly . he saw what happened . he was sorry and worried . he took lily and ben to the hospital . they had to get stitches and bandages . they had to stay in bed for a long time . they could not play with blocks anymore .

the moral of the story is : do not play with things you do not know . they can be dangerous and hurt you . always ask your parents before you use something new . they can tell you what it is and how to use it safely . they can supply you with the right toys and the right numbers . they can help you have fun and learn . they love you and want you to be happy and healthy . lily was a little girl who loved to play with her dolls . she had many dolls , but her favorite was anna , who had long hair and a pink dress . lily liked to pretend that anna was her sister and they had many adventures together .

