lily and max giggled and followed their mom home . they learned their lesson and never ran away again . they still liked dessert , but they always asked their mom first . sam and jen were twins who liked to play in the yard . they had a big box of junk that they used to make things . they made cars , robots , houses , and more . they had fun with their junk .

