anna and ben nodded and followed mom out of the truck . they decided that fancy toilets were not for them . they liked their simple toilets at home better . lily and max were playing in the park with their toy soldiers . they liked to pretend they were in a big army and march around the grass . they made loud noises with their mouths and waved their arms .

