they get to the station and see the big trains . sam and mia forget about the balloon . they are happy . they watch the trains go by and wave to the people . they do not sneeze . they do not need masks . they have fun . lily and tom are friends . they like to play outside . but today it is winter . it is very cold and white . lily and tom see snow on the ground and in the air .

