the dog does not listen . he is having fun . he does not know he is making ben and lily unhappy . he thinks they are his friends . he barks and wags his tail . he wants them to join him in the pond . tim and jen were playing with their toy cars in the park . they liked to make noises and pretend they were racing . but then a big boy came and took jen 's car . he said it was his now and ran away . jen was sad and angry . she wanted her car back .

tim had an idea . he saw a big truck near the fence . it had a long thing on the back . tim thought it looked like a missile . he told jen to follow him . they ran to the truck and climbed on it . tim found a button and pushed it . the missile flew off the truck and made a loud boom .

the big boy heard the boom and saw the smoke . he was scared and dropped jen 's car . he ran away too . tim and jen got the car back and smiled . they were happy and proud . they did not know that the missile was smelly . it was full of garbage and made a big mess . the truck driver was angry and shouted . he wanted his missile back . but tim and jen did not hear him . they ran back to the park and played with their toy cars . they did not steal anything again . sara liked to play with her dolls . she had many dolls , but her favorite was lily . lily had long hair , a pink dress , and shiny shoes . sara loved to brush lily 's hair and make her look pretty .

one day , sara saw a new doll in the store . the doll had pale skin , big eyes , and a red dress . sara wanted the doll very much . she asked her mom to buy the doll for her . her mom said no . she said sara had enough dolls and she should be happy with what she had . sara was angry . she cried and stomped her feet .

