they are happy . they kiss the rainbow . they are quick . they do not want the rainbow to go away . lily wanted to paint a picture of her dog , max . she took her red brush and dipped it in the paint . she tried to make a circle for max 's head , but it was hard . the brush was too big and the paint was too wet . she struggled to make the circle look like max .

