lily nodded and smiled . she loved painting with mommy . she picked up her red brush again and decided to paint a flower for max . she was happy and proud of her art . tom and mia went to the beach with mom and dad . they liked to play in the sand and make castles and holes . they also liked to splash in the water and look for shells and crabs .

one day , they saw a big empty bottle in the sand . tom picked it up and shook it . he heard something inside . he said , " look , mia , there is a secret in the bottle ! "

mia was curious . she said , " what is it , tom ? can we open it ? " tom nodded and twisted the cap . he pulled out a piece of paper . it had some words on it .

tom and mia could not read the words . they showed the paper to mom and dad . mom and dad looked at the paper and smiled . they said , " this is a joke , tom and mia . someone wrote a funny thing on the paper and put it in the bottle . do you want to hear it ? "

tom and mia said , " yes , please ! " mom and dad read the paper . it said , " why did the crab cross the road ? to get to the other tide ! " tom and mia did not understand the joke . they said , " what does that mean ? " mom and dad explained that the crab wanted to go to the water when it was high and low . tom and mia still did not get it . they said , " but why is that funny ? "

mom and dad laughed . they said , " it is funny because it sounds like another joke that people say . why did the chicken cross the road ? to get to the other side ! " tom and mia thought about it . they said , " oh , we get it now ! " then they laughed too . they thought the joke was silly and fun . they put the paper back in the bottle and buried it in the sand . they hoped someone else would find it and laugh too . sara and ben were friends . they liked to play together at the park . one day , they saw a big sign that said " lollipop contest " . the sign had a picture of a lollipop with many colors .

