he took a bite of their lollipops and smiled . he said , " thank you , sara and ben . you are good friends . "

they all smiled and became friends . they played together at the park and enjoyed their lollipops . they learned to be kind and respectful to each other . they had a good day . anna and ben were playing with magnets on the floor . they liked to see how the magnets stuck together or pushed away . anna had a big red magnet and ben had a small blue one .

