ben hugged anna . " yes , we can . you are my best friend . "

they played with their magnets happily , making them stick together and push away . they learned that magnets can reach many things , but friendship can reach even more . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . but it was a cold day and they did not have warm clothes . they started to tremble and shiver .

