" yes , tom . we are lucky . and we have each other , " lily said . tom and lily were playing in the garden . they liked to dig in the dirt and find bugs and worms . they also liked to plant seeds and watch them grow . one day , they found a big bean in a pod . they wanted to see what was inside .

they took the bean to their playhouse and put it on a table . they tried to open the pod , but it was too hard . they used a spoon , a fork , and a knife , but nothing worked . they were about to give up , when they heard a loud bark .

it was rex , their dog . he had smelled the bean and wanted to eat it . he ran to the playhouse and jumped on the table . he knocked over the spoon , the fork , and the knife . he grabbed the pod in his mouth and started to chew .

tom and lily were scared . they loved rex , but they did not want him to eat their bean . they wanted to protect it . they shouted , " no , rex , no ! drop it , drop it ! " they pulled on his ears and his tail , but he did not listen . he growled and shook his head .

then , something amazing happened . the pod cracked open in rex 's mouth . he spat out the pieces and the bean . he did not like the taste . he ran away , looking for something else to eat .

tom and lily were happy . they picked up the bean and looked at it . it was shiny and smooth . it had a little hole in the middle . they wondered what it was for . they decided to keep it as a treasure . they put it in a box and hid it under their bed . they hugged each other and smiled . they had found a magic bean . tom and sue were friends who liked to play with blocks . they liked to build towers and houses and cars with the blocks . one day , they found a big box of new blocks in the playroom . they were very happy and wanted to use them all .

" let 's have a contest , " tom said . " who can build the highest tower with the new blocks ? "

" ok , " sue said . " but we have to share the blocks and be fair . "

they started to build their towers , using different colors and shapes of blocks . tom was very fast and used a lot of blocks . he wanted to win the contest and have the highest tower . sue was slower and used fewer blocks . she wanted to make a nice and strong tower .

soon , tom 's tower was very high , but it was also very wobbly . he had to be careful not to knock it down . sue 's tower was lower , but it was also very sturdy . she had to use some smart tricks to make it stand .

" look at my tower ! " tom said . " it is higher than yours ! i am going to win ! "

" look at my tower ! " sue said . " it is nicer than yours ! i am going to win ! "

they kept building and arguing , until they ran out of blocks . tom put the last block on top of his tower , and it was very , very high . he raised his arms and cheered .

" i did it ! i did it ! i have the highest tower ! i win ! "

but then , something bad happened . tom 's tower was too high and too wobbly , and it fell down with a loud crash . all the blocks scattered on the floor . tom was sad and angry . he had lost his tower and his contest .

sue saw what happened and felt sorry for tom . she had the lowest tower , but it was still standing . she had won the contest , but she did not want to make tom feel worse . she had a big heart and a good idea .

" tom , do n't be sad , " sue said . " we can use your blocks and my blocks and build a new tower together . it will be higher and nicer than our towers . we can both win ! "

tom looked at sue and smiled . he liked her idea and her kindness . he had a big heart too .

" ok , sue , let 's do that , " tom said . " you are a good friend and a smart builder . we can both win ! "

they hugged and started to build a new tower together . they used all the blocks and shared them and were fair . they had fun and learned a lesson . the new tower was the highest and the nicest tower they ever built . they both raised their arms and cheered .

" we did it ! we did it ! we have the best tower ! we win ! "

the end . lila was a little girl who liked to play in the park . she had a toy lion that she took with her everywhere . she loved her lion very much and pretended it was her friend .

one day , she saw a big sign in the park that said " rare animals show " . she was curious and wanted to see the rare animals . she asked her mom if they could go , and her mom said yes . they walked to the show and saw many different animals . lila saw a snake , a monkey , a parrot , and a zebra . she was amazed and happy .

then she saw a real lion in a cage . it was big and yellow and had a long mane . it looked like her toy lion , but much bigger and scarier . lila wanted to see it closer , so she ran to the cage . her mom shouted " lila , wait ! do n't go near the lion ! " but lila did not listen . she thought the lion was friendly and wanted to play with her .

she reached the cage and said " hello , lion . do you want to be my friend ? i have a toy lion like you . see ? " she held up her toy lion and showed it to the real lion . the real lion saw the toy lion and growled . it did not like the toy lion . it thought it was a rival and wanted to attack it . it jumped at the cage and tried to grab the toy lion .

lila was scared and dropped her toy lion . the real lion caught the toy lion in its mouth and tore it apart . lila cried and screamed . her mom ran to her and hugged her . she said " lila , i 'm sorry . you should have listened to me . the lion is not a friend . it is a wild animal . it can hurt you and your toy . you should never go near a wild animal . you should relax and stay safe . "

lila learned a hard lesson that day . she lost her toy lion and her trust in the real lion . she realized that not all animals are friendly and that she should obey her mom . she wished she had relaxed and played with her toy lion in the park instead of going to the show . she was sad and sorry . the end . anna and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and their dog , spot . spot is a cute dog . he has brown fur and a black nose . he likes to run and jump and lick anna and ben .

one day , anna and ben are playing in the living room . they hear spot barking in the kitchen . they run to see what is wrong . they see spot standing on his hind legs , trying to reach the cupboard . the cupboard has the dog food inside .

" spot , what are you doing ? " anna asks . " you are not supposed to open the cupboard . that is naughty . "

" maybe he is hungry , " ben says . " let 's feed him some dog food . "

anna and ben get a bowl and a scoop . they open the cupboard and take out some dog food . they pour some dog food into the bowl and put it on the floor . spot wags his tail and runs to the bowl . he starts to eat the dog food .

" good boy , spot , " anna says . " you are a good dog . we love you . "

" yes , we love you , spot , " ben says . " but next time , wait for us to feed you . do n't try to open the cupboard by yourself . you could hurt yourself or make a mess . "

spot looks up at anna and ben . he licks his lips and barks . he is happy and full . he thanks anna and ben for feeding him . he cuddles with them on the couch . they play and laugh together . they are a happy family . lisa and ben are friends . they like to play together in the park . one day , they see a big sign . the sign says : " circus is here ! come and see the clowns , the animals and the tricks ! "

lisa and ben want to go to the circus . they run to their moms and ask for tickets . their moms say yes , but they have to be careful and stay together .

lisa and ben are very happy . they get their tickets and go to the circus . they see many things . they see a clown who makes funny jokes . they see a lion who roars and jumps through a hoop . they see a girl who walks on a rope high in the air .

but then , something bad happens . ben trips and falls . he hurts his knee . he cries and says : " ow , ow , ow ! it hurts ! "

lisa sees ben and runs to him . she says : " do n't cry , ben . i will help you . i have a band - aid in my pocket . i will put it on your knee . it will make you feel better . it will heal your boo - boo . "

lisa takes out her band - aid and puts it on ben 's knee . she gives him a hug and says : " there , there . you are brave , ben . you are my friend . do you want to see more of the circus ? "

ben smiles and says : " yes , lisa . thank you . you are my friend too . you are very kind and independent . you can do many things . let 's go and see more of the circus . "

lisa and ben hold hands and go to see more of the circus . they have a lot of fun . they are happy . they are friends . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with trucks in the park . they have big trucks and small trucks . they make noises like vroom and beep .

one day , tom has a new truck . it is red and shiny . it can carry many things . tom is happy . he wants to show sam his new truck .

" look , sam , look ! " tom says . " i have a new truck . it is red and shiny . it can carry many things . do you want to play with it ? "

sam looks at tom 's new truck . he likes it . he wants to play with it . but he also has his own truck . it is blue and old . it can carry some things . sam is sad . he thinks tom will not like his truck .

" your truck is nice , tom , " sam says . " but i have my own truck . it is blue and old . it can carry some things . do you want to play with it ? "

tom looks at sam 's truck . he does not care if it is blue and old . he cares if it is fun . he sees that sam 's truck can carry some things . he has an idea .

" let 's play together , sam , " tom says . " we can bring our trucks to the sandbox . we can fill them with sand and dump them . we can make a castle or a hill . we can have fun with our trucks . "

sam smiles . he likes tom 's idea . he thinks tom is a good friend . he agrees to play with tom .

" ok , tom , let 's play together , " sam says . " we can bring our trucks to the sandbox . we can fill them with sand and dump them . we can make a castle or a hill . we can have fun with our trucks . "

tom and sam run to the sandbox . they bring their trucks . they fill them with sand and dump them . they make a castle and a hill . they have fun with their trucks . they are happy .

the end . tommy loves to watch cartoons on tv . he likes the funny animals and the bright colors . he always laughs when they do silly things . sometimes he pretends to be a cartoon animal too .

one day , tommy found a big bag of candy in the kitchen . he was very happy . he wanted to eat all the candy and watch cartoons . he took the bag to the living room and turned on the tv . he saw his favorite cartoon . it was about a dog and a cat who were friends .

tommy opened the bag and took out a candy . it was red and shiny . he put it in his mouth and started to chew . it was very sweet and sticky . he liked it a lot . he took out another candy and chewed it too . he did not notice that the candy was making his teeth dirty .

soon , tommy had eaten many candies . he felt sick . his tummy hurt . he did not want to watch cartoons anymore . he wanted to lie down . he turned off the tv and went to his bed . he closed his eyes and tried to sleep .

his mom came home and saw the empty bag of candy on the floor . she was angry . she went to tommy 's room and saw him in his bed . he looked pale and sad . she saw his teeth and they were black and brown . she was worried .

" tommy , what did you do ? " she asked .

" i ate candy and watched cartoons , " tommy said in a weak voice .

" that was not a good idea , tommy . candy is bad for your teeth and your tummy . you should not eat so much . you should eat healthy food and drink water . and you should not watch too much tv . you should play and read and learn . that is more interesting and fun , " she said .

" i 'm sorry , mom . i did not know . i thought candy and cartoons were good . but they made me feel bad . i do n't want them anymore . i want to be healthy and happy , " tommy said .

" i 'm glad you understand , tommy . i love you and i want you to be well . come on , let 's go to the bathroom and brush your teeth . then i will make you some soup and read you a story . how does that sound ? " she said .

" that sounds good , mom . i love you too . thank you for taking care of me , " tommy said .

they hugged and went to the bathroom . tommy brushed his teeth and felt better . he ate some soup and listened to a story . he learned something new and he smiled . he decided to eat less candy and watch less cartoons . he decided to do more interesting and fun things . he was a good boy . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play with their toy trucks . they had a big pile of sand in the backyard , and they pretended to be builders . they used their trucks to load and unload the sand , and made roads and hills and castles .

one day , it was very hot and sunny , and they got sweaty and dirty from playing . their mom called them inside and said , " it 's time for a shower , boys . you need to wash off the sand and cool down . " but tom and sam did not want to stop playing . they said , " no , mom , we want to play more . we are not dirty , we are builders . "

their mom was not happy . she said , " you are not builders , you are boys . and boys need to listen to their mom and take a shower . if you do n't , you will get itchy and smelly and have bad dreams . now come on , or i will take away your trucks . "

tom and sam did not like that . they did not want to lose their trucks . but they were also restless and wanted to play more . they thought of a plan . they said , " ok , mom , we will take a shower . but can we take our trucks with us ? they are dirty too , and they need a shower . "

their mom thought for a moment . she said , " well , i guess you can , but only if you promise to wash them well and not make a mess in the bathroom . and you have to be quick , because it 's almost time for dinner . "

tom and sam agreed . they ran to the bathroom with their trucks , and turned on the shower . they put their trucks under the water , and pretended to wash them . but they also splashed and sprayed and made a lot of noise . they had fun , but they also made the bathroom wet and sandy .

their mom heard the noise and came to check on them . she was not happy . she said , " boys , what are you doing ? you are not taking a shower , you are making a mess . look at the floor , and the walls , and the towels . they are all wet and sandy . and you are still dirty . you did not wash yourselves , you only played with your trucks . "

tom and sam felt ashamed . they knew they did not listen to their mom , and they did not do what they said . they said , " sorry , mom , we were having fun . we did not mean to make a mess . we will clean it up , and we will take a real shower . "

their mom said , " you better do that , boys . and next time , when i tell you to do something , you do it . playing is good , but you also need to take care of yourself and your things . and you need to respect your mom and your home . do you understand ? "

tom and sam nodded . they said , " yes , mom , we understand . we will do better next time . we love you , mom . "

their mom smiled . she said , " i love you too , boys . now go and take a shower , and then come for dinner . and do n't forget to dry your trucks . "

the moral of the story is : listen to your mom and do what she says . playing is good , but you also need to take care of yourself and your things . and you need to respect your mom and your home . lily and ben were at the beach with their mom and dad . they saw a big boat on the water . it was white and shiny . it had a flag and a sail . lily said , " look , ben , a yacht ! it is so pretty ! "

