but anna did not want to be friends with lily anymore . she was very sad and hurt . she did not like her hair anymore . she did not trust lily anymore .

lily lost her best friend . she was very sorry . she realized that she made a big mistake . she wished she could take it back . but it was too late . jill and ben were twins who liked to play dress - up . one day , they found a big box of old clothes in the attic . they tried on hats , coats , scarves and shoes . jill saw a white veil and put it on her head . she felt like a princess .

