as he flew back to his branch , he realized that his new feathers were making too much noise and he could n't whistle quietly anymore . he missed his old quiet whistle . so , he took off his fashionable feathers and went back to his old self , happily whistling on his branch . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily who loved flowers . she would run through the garden , eager to pick the prettiest ones . one day , she found a big , red flower and picked it carefully . as she walked away , she heard a sound . it was a bird whistling ! lily was surprised and happy . she looked around and saw the bird sitting on a branch . she whistled back and the bird flew down to her . they became friends and played together in the garden every day . lily was very happy to have a new friend who could whistle so beautifully . sara and ben are brother and sister . they like to play with their toys in the living room . sara has a doll and ben has a car . they are happy .

