max felt better . he hugged lily back . they were both brave and kind . they decided to play some more , but more carefully . they had fun in the park . lily was a little girl who liked to play dress - up . she had many pretty clothes in her closet , but she wanted more . one day , she saw her mom 's laundry basket in the hall . it had some big clothes that looked nice and soft . lily decided to borrow some of them and try them on .

she took a pink sweater , a blue skirt , and a yellow scarf from the basket . she put them on and looked at herself in the mirror . she felt very happy and pretty . she did not think her mom would mind if she borrowed them for a little while .

she went outside to show her friends her new outfit . they were playing in the yard with a ball . lily joined them and threw the ball around . she did not notice that the sweater was too long and the skirt was too wide . they got caught on a branch and ripped . the scarf got dirty from the grass and mud .

lily 's mom came out to see what was going on . she saw lily wearing her clothes and how they were ruined . she was very angry and sad . she asked lily why she took her clothes without asking . lily said she just wanted to borrow them and play dress - up . she said she was sorry and did not mean to hurt them .

but lily 's mom did not forgive her . she said lily was naughty and selfish . she said she had to pay for the clothes and do extra chores . she took lily inside and made her take off the clothes . she did not let her play with her friends or watch tv . she sent her to her room and told her to think about what she did .

lily felt very bad and lonely . she wished she had not borrowed her mom 's clothes . she wished she had asked first or used her own clothes . she wished she could say sorry again and make her mom happy . she cried and cried until she fell asleep . she had a bad day . lily and ben were friends who liked to play with blocks . they liked to build towers and houses and bridges with their blocks . one day , they decided to make a big map of the country with their blocks . they used different colors and shapes to show the mountains , the rivers , the cities and the farms .

they worked hard and had fun , but they also had some problems . sometimes , they ran out of blocks or they disagreed on where to put them . sometimes , they knocked over each other 's blocks by accident or on purpose . they started to argue and shout and cry .

