they hugged and smiled . they were happy again . they finished their map and showed it to their teacher and their classmates . everyone liked their map and praised them . they learned that playing together is better than fighting and that sharing and caring make them happy . anna and ben are friends . they like to play with trains . they have a big track with many trains . they make the trains go fast and slow , and stop and go .

one day , a new boy comes to play . his name is tom . he has a pretty train . it is red and shiny . anna and ben want to see his train . they ask him nicely .

