the dog wags his tail and licks their faces . he is happy to have new friends . they eat and drink and then lie down in the tent . they close their eyes and dream of more adventures . anna and ben were playing in the park . they saw a big , fancy car with shiny windows and wheels . they ran to the car and looked inside .

