anna and ben felt sorry . they learned a lesson . they should not take things that are not theirs . they should respect other people 's things . they should be nice and honest . they hugged each other and said sorry . they decided to play with their own toys and books . they had fun and forgot about the fancy car and the mystery . tom and sam like to play hockey . they have sticks and a ball . they play in the park with their friends . they clap when they score a goal . they have fun .

