they try to go home . but they are lost . they do not know where they are . they are scared . they call for help . but no one hears them . they are alone in the dark . they wish they had listened to their friends . sam and mia were twins who liked to play with their toys . they had many cars , trucks , trains and planes that they could zoom around the house . one day , their dad said he had a surprise for them in the garage . he took them by the hand and led them outside .

