but this time , there is no fire . there is no smoke . there is no ash .

there is only fun . lily and sam went to the zoo with mom and dad . they saw many animals , like lions , monkeys , and elephants . lily liked the lions best . they were big and fierce and had loud roars . sam liked the monkeys best . they were funny and playful and had long tails .

