lily nodded . she learned her lesson . she still liked the lions , but she liked the monkeys more . she and sam gave the rest of the nuts to the monkeys and thanked them for playing with them . then they went to see the other animals in the zoo . they had a lot of fun . tom and lily were playing in the park . it was a sunny day and the park was peaceful . they liked to run , swing , slide and climb . they saw a big tree with a hole in it . they wanted to see what was inside .

