the park was not peaceful anymore . it was sad and scary . tom and lily cried . they wished they never found the gun . they wished they never hurt the bird . they wished they could go back to playing . but they could n't . they had done something very bad . lila and ben were playing with their blocks . they liked to make towers and bridges and houses . they also liked to draw symbols on some blocks with their crayons . lila drew a star , ben drew a heart , and they both drew a smiley face .

