lila and ben smiled and nodded . they liked that idea . they hoped max would learn his lesson . they went to their room and drew some new symbols . they drew a star , a heart , and a smiley face . and they also drew a dog with a big x on it . lily and tom were playing in the park . they saw a big bird fly in the sky . it had a long tail and bright colors .

