the end . ben and lily were friends who liked to play in the farm . they liked to run in the grass , chase the chickens and watch the cows . sometimes they helped their dads with the work , like picking corn or feeding the pigs .

one day , ben and lily decided to play a game . they wanted to see who could pick more corn from the field . they each took a big basket and ran to the corn plants . they started to pull the yellow ears and put them in their baskets .

" look , lily , i have more corn than you ! " ben said , showing his basket .

" no , you do n't , ben , i have more corn than you ! " lily said , showing her basket .

they kept picking corn and arguing , not paying attention to anything else . they did not see the sky getting dark and the wind getting strong . they did not hear the thunder and the rain . they did not notice the corn plants shaking and bending .

suddenly , a loud noise made them stop and look up . they saw a big , black cloud spinning in the air . it was coming towards them , fast and angry . it was a tornado !

" ben , lily , run ! " their dads shouted from the barn . " the tornado is coming ! it will increase and destroy everything ! "

ben and lily dropped their baskets and tried to run , but it was too late . the tornado was too close and too strong . it picked them up and threw them in the air , along with the corn , the baskets , the chickens and the cows . they screamed and cried , but no one could hear them or help them .

the tornado carried them far away , to a place where the sky was clear , but the land was empty and cold . there was no farm , no grass , no animals , no dads . there was only corn , scattered and broken . ben and lily were alone and scared . they wished they had not played that game . they wished they had listened to their dads . they wished they had been good friends . but it was too late . the end . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . they like to slide , swing and run . but today , they have a problem . there is only one red bike in the park . lily and tom both want the red bike .

lily says , " i saw the red bike first . it is mine . you can have the ugly green bike . " tom says , " no , i want the red bike . it is faster and nicer . you can have the ugly green bike . " they both pull the red bike . they are angry and sad .

then , a big boy comes . he is mean and rude . he says , " give me the red bike . it is mine now . you can have no bike . " he pushes lily and tom . he takes the red bike . he rides away . he laughs .

