" let 's close the door and hide under the bed , " he said .

mia nodded . she followed him to the door and closed it . then they ran to the bed and hid under it . they hoped no one would find them or the mess they made . they hugged each other and waited . lily liked to hug her parrot , coco . coco was green and red and had a yellow beak . he could talk and say " hello " and " i love you " . lily and coco were best friends .

one day , lily and coco went to the park with mommy . they saw a big dog that was barking and running . lily was scared of the dog . she held coco tight and said , " do n't worry , coco , i will keep you safe . "

but the dog saw coco and wanted to play . he ran towards lily and coco and jumped on them . lily screamed and coco flew away . the dog chased coco and tried to catch him . lily cried and mommy ran to help .

mommy shouted at the dog and made him go away . she hugged lily and said , " it 's okay , lily , you are safe now . where is coco ? " lily looked around and saw coco on a tree . he was scared and said , " help , help , i love you . "

mommy and lily called coco and asked him to come down . coco was afraid of the dog , but he saw lily and mommy and trusted them . he flew down and landed on lily 's shoulder . lily hugged coco and said , " i 'm sorry , coco , i 'm glad you are safe . i love you . " coco hugged lily and said , " i love you too . " mommy smiled and said , " let 's go home , lily and coco . you are both brave and good . " lily and coco nodded and went home with mommy . they were happy and safe . lily and ben like to play in the park . they have a ball and a kite . they run and laugh and have fun . one day , they see a hole in the ground . they look inside and see a mole . the mole is brown and furry and has a long nose .

" hello , mole ! " lily says . " do you want to play with us ? "

the mole nods and comes out of the hole . he likes the ball and the kite . he rolls the ball with his nose and chases the kite in the air . lily and ben are happy to have a new friend .

but then , a big wind comes . it blows the kite away . lily and ben run after it , but they ca n't catch it . they lose the kite . they are sad .

they go back to the hole , but they ca n't find the mole . he is gone . they lose the mole too . they are very sad .

they sit on the grass and cry . they have no ball , no kite , no mole . they have nothing to play with . they are bored and dull .

then , they hear a noise . it is the mole . he comes out of another hole . he has the kite in his mouth . he found it in a tree . he brings it to lily and ben . he is happy .

lily and ben are happy too . they hug the mole and thank him . they have their kite back . they have their mole back . they have something to play with . they are not bored and dull anymore . they are bright and cheerful . they play with the mole until it is time to go home . they say goodbye to the mole and promise to come back soon . the mole waves and goes back to his hole . he is glad to have new friends . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with toys and draw on the board . one day , they are in the playroom with their teacher , miss rose .

" look , lily , i made a house with blocks ! " ben says . he is eager to show lily his work .

" that 's nice , ben . can i help you ? " lily asks . she likes to build things too .

" sure , lily . you can make a door and a window . " ben says . he gives lily some blocks and a smile .

they work together and make a nice house . they are happy and proud .

" wow , you two did a great job ! " miss rose says . she comes to see their house . " can i take a picture of you and your house ? "

" yes , please ! " lily and ben say . they stand next to their house and pose .

" say cheese ! " miss rose says . she holds a camera .

" cheese ! " lily and ben say . they look at the camera .

but then , ben does something funny . he leans over and gives lily a kiss on the cheek .

lily is surprised . she feels her cheek get warm . she looks at ben and sees him blush .

miss rose is surprised too . she laughs and snaps the picture .

" ben , why did you kiss lily ? " miss rose asks .

" because i like her . she is my friend . " ben says .

" that 's very sweet , ben . but you should always ask before you kiss someone . do you understand ? " miss rose says .

" yes , miss rose . i 'm sorry , lily . can i kiss you ? " ben says .

lily thinks for a moment . she likes ben too . he is her friend . she nods and smiles .

" okay , ben . you can kiss me . " lily says .

they kiss again , gently and quickly . they giggle and hug .

miss rose smiles and shows them the picture . it is a nice picture . they see their house , their kiss , and their happy faces .

they like the picture . they like their house . they like each other . they are friends . lily and sam are friends . they like to play at the park . they gather rocks and sticks and leaves . they make a big pile . they say it is their castle .

they see a slide . it is long and shiny . they want to go on it . they run to the slide . they take turns . lily goes first . she sits on the slide . she slides down fast . she laughs . sam goes next . he slides down too . he says it is fun .

they see a dog . it is big and brown . it runs to them . it barks . lily and sam are scared . they drop their rocks and sticks and leaves . they run away from the dog . they hide behind a bench . they hug each other .

the dog sniffs their pile . it likes their rocks and sticks and leaves . it takes some in its mouth . it runs away with them . it is happy .

lily and sam peek from behind the bench . they see the dog . they see their pile . it is smaller now . they are sad . they cry . they want their rocks and sticks and leaves back . tim and mia liked to play in the forest . they saw many animals and plants . one day , they found a big mushroom . it was red and white and round .

" wow , look at this mushroom ! " tim said . " it is so big and pretty . i want to ride on it . "

" no , i want to ride on it ! " mia said . " it is my mushroom . i saw it first . "

they both ran to the mushroom and tried to climb on it . they pushed and pulled and shouted . they were very selfish . they did not want to share .

the mushroom did not like that . it felt their feet and hands and voices . it was angry and sad . it wanted to be left alone .

suddenly , the mushroom shook and bounced . tim and mia fell off the mushroom . they landed on the ground . they were scared and hurt .

they looked at the mushroom . it had a face . it had eyes and a mouth and a nose . it glared at them .

" go away ! " the mushroom said . " you are bad children . you are not nice to me or to each other . you do not deserve to ride on me . "

tim and mia felt sorry . they realized they were wrong . they got up and dusted themselves off .

" we are sorry , mushroom , " tim said . " we were selfish . we should have asked you first . and we should have taken turns . "

" yes , we are sorry , mushroom , " mia said . " we did not mean to hurt you . you are a living thing . you have feelings . we should have respected you . "

the mushroom softened . it saw that they were sincere . it smiled a little .

" thank you for saying sorry , " the mushroom said . " that is very kind of you . maybe you can ride on me another day . but only if you are gentle and careful and fair . "

tim and mia nodded . they thanked the mushroom and said goodbye . they walked away , holding hands . they learned a lesson . they decided to be more friendly and generous . they hoped to see the mushroom again . ben and lily were playing in the living room . they liked to pretend they were grown - ups and had a fancy party . they had some juice in small cups and some crackers on a plate . they also had a big bottle of wine that they found in the kitchen . they did not know what wine was , but it looked pretty .

" hello , lily , " ben said in a deep voice . " welcome to my party . would you like some wine ? "

" yes , please , ben , " lily said in a high voice . " thank you for inviting me . you have a lovely home . "

ben poured some wine into lily 's cup . he tried to be careful , but he spilled some on the floor . he did not notice . he gave the cup to lily and took one for himself . they clinked their cups and said , " cheers ! "

they sipped their wine and made faces . it tasted bad . they did not like it at all . they put their cups down and ate some crackers . they felt funny . they started to giggle and talk louder .

mom came into the living room . she saw the wine bottle and the spilled wine on the floor . she saw ben and lily with their cups and their red faces . she was very angry .

" ben ! lily ! what are you doing ? " she yelled . " that is not juice , that is wine ! wine is for grown - ups only ! you are not allowed to drink wine ! you could get sick ! "

she took the wine bottle and the cups away . she cleaned the floor with a cloth . she looked at ben and lily with a stern face .

" that was very naughty and dangerous , " she said . " you should never touch wine or any other drink that is not for you . you should always ask me or dad before you take anything from the kitchen . do you understand ? "

ben and lily nodded . they felt sorry and scared . they did not mean to be bad . they just wanted to have fun .

" i 'm sorry , mom , " ben said .

" me too , mom , " lily said .

mom hugged them and said , " i love you , but you have to be more careful . now , go to your room and rest . you need to get the wine out of your system . "

ben and lily went to their room . they lay down on their beds and closed their eyes . they felt sleepy and dizzy . they learned their lesson . they did not want to drink wine ever again . they only wanted juice and water .

the end . lily and ben were playing in the living room . they liked to pretend they were pirates and look for treasure . they used a big blanket as a sail and a wooden spoon as a sword . they had a lot of fun .

but then , lily saw something shiny on the table . it was an ashtray that mommy used to put her cigarettes in . lily thought it was a treasure . she climbed on the couch and reached for it . she did not know it was bad .

" look , ben , i found a treasure ! " she said , holding the ashtray . " it is shiny and round and has little holes in it . "

ben saw the ashtray and felt scared . he knew mommy did not like them to touch her things . he knew the ashtray was not a treasure . he tried to stop lily .

" no , lily , put it back ! " he said . " that is not a treasure . that is mommy 's ashtray . she will be mad if she sees you have it . "

but lily did not listen . she wanted to keep the ashtray . she thought it was pretty . she held it tight and ran away from ben . she did not see the cord on the floor . she tripped and fell . the ashtray flew out of her hand and broke on the floor . it made a loud noise .

mommy heard the noise and came to the living room . she saw the broken ashtray and the mess on the floor . she saw lily and ben . she was very mad . she yelled at them .

" what did you do ? " she said . " why did you touch my ashtray ? do you know how dangerous that is ? you could have hurt yourself or started a fire . you are very naughty . go to your room right now ! "

lily and ben felt sorry and scared . they did not mean to break the ashtray . they did not know it was bad . they started to cry . they ran to their room . they hugged each other . they wished they had not played with the ashtray . they wished they had listened to ben . they wished mommy was not mad . they wished they were still pirates . lily loved to play violin . she had a small violin that was just right for her . she liked to make music with it and sing along . she was very clever and learned many songs .

one day , lily wanted to show her friend ben how she could play violin . she invited him to her house and took him to her room . she said , " look , ben , this is my violin . do you want to hear me play ? "

ben nodded and smiled . he liked music too . he had a drum that he liked to bang . he said , " yes , lily , i want to hear you play . can i play my drum with you ? "

lily said , " sure , ben , that would be fun . but we have to be careful . we do n't want to break anything or make too much noise . "

lily and ben got ready to play . lily picked up her violin and put it under her chin . she held the bow in her hand . she said , " ben , do you know how to balance the violin ? "

ben shook his head . he said , " no , lily , i do n't know . how do you balance the violin ? "

lily said , " you have to hold it with your chin and your shoulder . like this . see ? you do n't need your hands to hold it . you need your hands to play the strings and the bow . can you try to balance the violin ? "

ben said , " ok , lily , i will try . " he took the violin from lily and put it under his chin . he tried to hold it with his shoulder , but it was hard . the violin slipped and fell to the floor . ben gasped and said , " oh no , lily , i 'm sorry . i dropped your violin . is it broken ? "

lily ran to the violin and picked it up . she checked it carefully . she said , " do n't worry , ben , it 's not broken . it 's just a little dirty . you have to be more gentle with the violin . it 's not like a drum . it 's very delicate . here , let me show you again how to balance it . "

lily and ben tried again . this time , ben was more careful . he held the violin with his chin and his shoulder . he said , " look , lily , i did it . i balanced the violin . "

lily smiled and said , " good job , ben . you are very clever . now , let 's play some music together . i will play the violin and you will play the drum . are you ready ? "

ben nodded and said , " yes , lily , i 'm ready . let 's play . "

lily and ben played some music together . they had a lot of fun . they were very happy . they were good friends . lily liked to dance . she danced every day . she danced in her room , in the garden , and in the park . she danced with her toys , with her friends , and with her family . she danced when she was happy , when she was sad , and when she was bored .

one day , lily saw a show on tv . it was about a nation of dancers . they danced in different ways . some danced fast , some danced slow . some danced high , some danced low . some danced with music , some danced with no sound . lily was amazed . she wanted to dance like them .

she asked her mom , " can i dance like them ? " her mom said , " yes , you can . you are flexible . you can learn new things . you can try different moves . you can have fun . " lily was excited . she said , " thank you , mom . i will dance like them . "

she turned off the tv . she put on her favorite dress . she found a big space . she started to dance . she danced like the nation of dancers . she danced fast and slow . she danced high and low . she danced with music and no sound . she danced with joy . she danced with love . she danced with herself . she danced like lily . one day , ben and mia went to the park with their mom . they saw a big tent with many flags and balloons . mom said it was a circus . ben and mia wanted to see the circus .

" can we go , mom ? please , please , please ? " they asked .

mom smiled and said , " yes , we can go . but first , we have to buy tickets . wait here for a minute , okay ? "

ben and mia nodded and waited near a pole . the pole was very high and had a rope on it . ben wondered what the rope was for . he wanted to touch it .

" look , mia , a rope ! " he said . " i want to pull it . maybe something fun will happen . "

mia shook her head . " no , ben , do n't do that . mom said to wait . the rope might be for the circus . you might break something . "

but ben did not listen . he reached for the rope and pulled it hard . suddenly , he heard a loud noise . he looked up and saw a big ball falling from the sky . the ball was red and shiny . it was a firework . it was going to strike the tent .

" ben , what did you do ? " mia cried . " you made a firework go off . it will burn the tent . we have to run . "

ben was scared . he let go of the rope and ran with mia . they found their mom and told her what happened . mom was angry and sad .

" ben , you did a very bad thing . you did not listen to me . you did not listen to mia . you played with something you did not know . you put yourself and others in danger . you ruined the circus for everyone . how do you feel ? "

ben felt ashamed . he looked at the tent and saw a hole in it . he saw the people running and screaming . he saw the firemen coming to put out the fire . he saw the circus people crying and shouting .

" i feel sorry , mom . i feel sorry , mia . i feel sorry , circus people . i did not mean to do it . i was curious . i wanted to have fun . but i was wrong . i was foolish . i learned my lesson . i will never do it again . "

mom hugged ben and mia . she said , " i 'm glad you are safe . i 'm glad you are sorry . but sorry is not enough . you have to make up for what you did . you have to apologize to the circus people . you have to help them fix the tent . you have to show them you care . that is the right thing to do . "

ben and mia nodded . they walked to the circus people and said they were sorry . they offered to help them fix the tent . they offered to share their toys and snacks . the circus people were still angry and sad , but they also saw that ben and mia were sincere and kind . they accepted their apology and their help . they thanked them and gave them a hug .

ben and mia felt better . they learned that curiosity is good , but not when it hurts others . they learned that listening is important , especially to mom and mia . they learned that saying sorry is good , but doing sorry is better . they learned that being kind and helpful is the best way to make friends . they learned a lot from the circus . tim and jen are twins . they like to play with their toys in their room . one day , they find a big box in the closet . they open the box and see many things inside . they see a hat , a scarf , a coat , and a pin .

" look , jen , a pin ! " tim says . he picks up the pin and shows it to jen . the pin is shiny and has a star on it .

" wow , tim , it is pretty ! " jen says . she wants to see the pin too . she reaches for the pin , but tim pulls it away .

" no , jen , it is mine ! " tim says . he puts the pin on his coat . he zips up his coat and puts on the hat and the scarf . he looks at himself in the mirror . he thinks he looks cool .

" tim , share with me ! " jen says . she is sad and angry . she does not like it when tim does not share . she looks around the box and sees a dull knife . she picks up the knife and runs to tim .

" jen , what are you doing ? " tim says . he sees jen with the knife and gets scared . he thinks jen wants to hurt him .

" give me the pin , tim , or i will cut your coat ! " jen says . she waves the knife at tim .

" jen , no , stop ! " tim says . he tries to back away , but he trips on the scarf . he falls to the floor and the pin falls off his coat .

jen sees the pin and grabs it . she is happy and puts it on her hat . she does not see that the knife has cut tim 's coat and made a big hole .

" look , tim , i have the pin ! " jen says . she shows tim the pin and smiles .

tim looks at jen and then at his coat . he sees the hole and starts to cry . he does not care about the pin anymore . he only cares about his coat .

" jen , you are mean ! " tim says . he cries louder and louder .

mom hears tim and jen and comes to their room . she sees the mess and the knife and the hole . she is angry and shocked .

" tim , jen , what have you done ? " mom says . she takes the knife and the pin away from them . she scolds them and makes them say sorry to each other . she tells them to never play with sharp things again . she hugs them and tries to fix the coat .

tim and jen feel bad and hug mom . they say sorry to mom and to each other . they learn to share and to be careful . they do not play with the box anymore . they play with their other toys and have fun . anna and ben are playing in the kitchen . they have a big sink with water and many cups and spoons . they want to test which cup can hold the most water .

" i have a red cup . it is big and round . i can fill it with water , " anna says .

" i have a blue cup . it is small and square . i can fill it with water too , " ben says .

they take turns to fill their cups with water from the sink . they count how many spoons of water they can put in each cup .

" one , two , three , four , five , six , seven , eight , nine , ten . my cup is full . it can hold ten spoons of water , " anna says .

" one , two , three , four , five , six . my cup is full . it can hold six spoons of water , " ben says .

anna and ben look at their cups . they see that anna 's cup is bigger and can hold more water than ben 's cup .

" anna , you win . your cup can hold more water than my cup . you have a good cup , " ben says .

" thank you , ben . you have a good cup too . it is blue and square . i like blue and square . do you want to try another cup ? " anna says .

" yes , i do . let 's find another cup . maybe we can find one that can hold more water than your cup , " ben says .

they put their cups on the table and look for another cup in the kitchen . they are ready to test more cups and have more fun . anna and ben love to travel with their mom and dad . they go on a big train that runs on steel tracks . the train is very fast and loud . it makes anna and ben excited and happy .

one day , they travel to a big city . they see many tall buildings and bright lights . they also see a fancy park with flowers and swings . mom and dad take them to the park and let them play . anna and ben have fun on the swings and slides . they make new friends with other kids .

but soon , it is time to go back to the train . mom and dad pack their bags and hold their hands . they walk to the train station and find their seats . the train starts to move and leaves the city . anna and ben look out the window and wave goodbye to the park and the buildings and the lights . they are tired but happy . they cuddle with mom and dad and fall asleep . they dream of their next travel . one day , anna and ben went to the park with their mom . they saw many things : trees , flowers , birds , swings , slides . they had fun playing and running .

anna liked to ask questions . she asked mom , " why is the sky blue ? " mom said , " the sky is blue because of the sun and the air . they make the light look blue . " anna said , " wow , that is cool ! "

ben liked to look at the sky . he saw a big white cloud . he asked mom , " what is that cloud ? " mom said , " that cloud is water in the air . sometimes the water falls down as rain . " ben said , " oh , i see ! "

mom was very compassionate . she loved anna and ben and answered their questions . she also hugged them and gave them snacks . she said , " you are both very smart and curious . i am proud of you ! "

anna and ben smiled . they were happy and grateful . they said , " we love you , mom ! " they hugged mom and looked at the sky . they wondered what else they could learn . tom and lily like to play in the field . they run and jump and laugh . they see many flowers and bugs and birds . they are happy .

one day , they see a big dog in the field . the dog is black and brown and has sharp teeth . the dog barks and growls . tom and lily are scared .

" let 's go away ! " lily says to tom . " the dog is crazy ! "

but tom does not listen . he wants to play with the dog . he thinks the dog is friendly . he runs to the dog and tries to pet it .

" tom , no ! " lily shouts . " the dog is bad ! "

but it is too late . the dog bites tom on his arm . tom screams and cries . he bleeds a lot . lily runs to help him . she is very sad .

the dog runs away . tom and lily are alone in the field . they are hurt and afraid . they wish they never played in the field . they wish they stayed at home . the end . lily and ben were playing in the park with their toys . they liked to make up stories with their dolls and cars . they saw a big tree with a hole in it . lily was nosy and wanted to see what was inside .

" let 's go there ! " she said to ben . " maybe there are animals or treasures in the hole . "

ben was not sure . he thought the hole looked dark and scary . he wanted to stay on the grass with his toys .

" no , lily , i do n't want to go there . it might be dangerous . what if there are bees or snakes or monsters in the hole ? " he said .

lily did not listen to ben . she urged him to follow her . she said it would be fun and exciting . she ran to the tree and peeked into the hole .

" wow , look , ben , there is a shelter in here ! someone made a bed and a table and a lamp with sticks and leaves . come and see ! " she shouted .

ben was curious , but he was also afraid . he walked slowly to the tree and looked into the hole . he saw the shelter , but he also saw something else . a big , furry , angry face with sharp teeth and claws . it was a bear , and it did not like visitors .

" roar ! " the bear growled . it jumped out of the hole and chased lily and ben .

lily and ben screamed and ran away . they dropped their toys and ran to their mom , who was sitting on a bench . she hugged them and asked them what happened .

" we saw a bear in the tree , mommy ! it was scary ! " lily said .

" why did you go to the tree , lily ? you know you should not go near strange places . you could get hurt or lost , " mommy said .

" i 'm sorry , mommy . i was nosy and wanted to see what was in the hole . i urged ben to come with me , but he did not want to . he was right , mommy . it was a bad idea , " lily said .

mommy nodded and said , " i 'm glad you are safe , lily and ben . next time , listen to your brother and stay away from danger . and do n't be so nosy , lily . sometimes , it is better to leave things alone . "

lily and ben said they were sorry and hugged mommy . they learned their lesson and never went to the tree again . they played with their toys and had fun in the park . they were happy and safe . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big pine tree . it is green and tall . they want to climb it .

" can we climb the pine tree ? " lily asks tom .

" yes , we can . but we have to be careful . the pine tree is very high . " tom says .

they hold hands and walk to the pine tree . they find a low branch . they pull themselves up . they feel happy . they see the sky and the birds .

" look , lily , we are so high ! " tom says .

" yes , tom , we are . we can see everything ! " lily says .

they smile and laugh . they lean on the pine tree . they feel the pine tree is strong and warm . they hug the pine tree . they say thank you to the pine tree . they love the pine tree . the pine tree loves them too . tom is a young boy who likes to play with his cars . he has many cars of different colors and sizes . he likes to make them go fast on the floor and make loud noises .

one day , tom is playing with his cars in his room . he sees a big wall with a picture of a train on it . he thinks the train is very cool and wants to get closer to it . he picks up his red car and puts it on the wall . he tries to make it go on the wall like the train , but it falls down .

tom is not happy . he wants his car to go on the wall . he picks up his blue car and puts it on the wall . he tries to make it go on the wall like the train , but it falls down too .

tom is very sad . he thinks his cars are broken . he starts to cry . he does not know why his cars can not go on the wall .

his mom hears him cry and comes to his room . she sees his cars on the floor and the wall with the picture of the train . she hugs tom and tells him that his cars are not broken . she tells him that cars can only go on the floor , not on the wall . she tells him that the wall is not real , it is only a picture . she tells him that the train is real , but it can only go on the tracks , not on the wall .

tom listens to his mom and feels better . he understands that his cars and the train are different . he stops crying and smiles . he picks up his cars and plays with them on the floor . he makes them go fast and make loud noises . he is happy again . he likes his cars and the wall with the picture of the train . sara and tom are friends . they like to play outside in the sun . one day , they find a big stick in the grass . they want to use it for a game .

" let 's play that we are wild animals , " sara says . " we can carry the stick like a bone . "

" ok , " tom says . " i will be a lion and you will be a tiger . we can roar and run . "

they take turns to carry the stick in their mouths . they pretend to chase each other and fight for the stick . they make loud noises and have fun .

but then , they hear a real roar . it is not from them . it is from a big dog . the dog sees the stick and wants it . it runs towards them , barking and growling .

sara and tom are scared . they drop the stick and run away . they hide behind a tree and hug each other .

" go away , dog ! " sara shouts . " that is our stick ! "

but the dog does not listen . it picks up the stick and runs away with it . it is happy to have a new toy .

sara and tom are sad . they lost their stick and their game . they go back to their house and tell their mom what happened .

" do n't worry , my sweeties , " mom says . " you can find another stick tomorrow . or you can play something else . the sun will still shine and you will still be friends . " sara likes to play with her white rabbit . she calls him fluffy . fluffy is soft and funny . he likes to hop and eat carrots . sara has a cage for fluffy . she puts him in the cage when she goes to sleep or to school .

one day , sara 's friend lily comes to visit . lily likes fluffy too . she wants to play with him . sara says , " ok , but we have to be careful . fluffy is fast and can run away . "

sara and lily take fluffy out of the cage . they hold him gently and pet him . they give him some carrots and lettuce . fluffy is happy . he wiggles his nose and ears .

but then , fluffy sees a butterfly . he wants to chase it . he jumps out of sara 's arms and runs after the butterfly . sara and lily are scared . they shout , " fluffy , come back ! fluffy , stop ! "

they run after fluffy . they try to catch him . but fluffy is faster . he follows the butterfly to the garden . he sees some flowers . he thinks they are tasty . he nibbles on them .

sara and lily find fluffy in the garden . they see him eating the flowers . they are angry . they say , " fluffy , you are naughty ! you ca n't eat the flowers . they are not for you . they are for mommy . she will be mad . "

they grab fluffy and bring him back to the cage . they say , " fluffy , you have to stay in the cage . you ca n't run away . you ca n't eat the flowers . you have to be good . "

