" turning in circles really does work ! " , he thought . so jim spent the rest of the day running on the smooth and perfect lawn . once upon a time , there was a tall mouse who lived deep in the woods . he was always looking for food to eat and fun things to do . one day he decided to make a trap . he wanted to catch his own food !

