her mom said , " uncle tom is tired . he needs to rest . tomorrow , he will perform for you again . " lucy understood . she let her uncle tom rest . she played with her toys instead .

the next day , uncle tom was not stubborn anymore . he was happy to perform for lucy . they sang , danced , and laughed together . lucy and her uncle tom had a great day . once upon a time , there was a little bird named tim . tim was not a big bird , but he was very mighty . he could fly high in the sky and sing beautiful songs . every day , tim would play with his friends in the park .

one day , tim started to worry . he could not find his friends . he flew around the park , looking for them . he called out their names , but they did not answer . tim was sad and worried .

then , tim saw his friends hiding behind a tree . they jumped out and shouted , " surprise ! " tim was so happy to see them . they had planned a fun day for tim because he was a mighty bird . tim did not worry anymore , and they all played happily together . once upon a time , there was a little cat named kitty . kitty had a very long and flexible tail . she liked to play with her tail all day .

one sunny day , kitty saw a big dog in the park . the dog wanted to play with kitty 's tail . but kitty did n't want to share her tail . so , they started to fight .

after a while , kitty and the dog stopped fighting . they both felt sad . then , kitty decided to share her tail with the dog . they played together and became friends . from that day on , kitty and the dog always played together in the park . one day , a little boy named tim went to the park with his mom . tim brought his favorite toy , a ball , in a sack . at the park , tim played with other kids and had a lot of fun . they ran , jumped , and laughed together . tim was very happy .

