tim and his mom started a search to find the ball . they looked under the trees , behind the bushes , and near the swings . finally , they found the sack with the ball inside it . tim was so happy to find his ball . they played some more and then went home . once upon a time , in a small place , there lived a little boy named tim . he loved to play with his red ball . one day , he saw an incredible big bird in his yard . the bird was very pretty and had many colors . tim wanted to talk to the bird .

" hi , bird ! do you want to play with me ? " tim asked . the bird looked at him and replied , " yes , i want to play with you , tim . " they played with tim 's red ball and had a lot of fun . but then , the sky got dark and it was time for tim to go home .

tim said to the bird , " bye , bird ! i will see you tomorrow . " the bird replied , " bye , tim ! i will come back . " but the next day , the incredible bird did not come back . tim was very sad . he waited and waited , but the bird never came back to play with him again . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim loved to play with his toy cars and trucks . one day , he found a big pipe in his yard . it was long and round . tim had an idea . " i will test if my toy cars can fit in this pipe , " he thought .

tim put his toy car at the top of the pipe . he let go and watched it roll down . " whee ! " he shouted . the car went very fast and came out the other side . tim was happy . he tested all his cars and trucks . they all fit in the pipe .

tim 's friend , sam , came over to play . " look , sam ! i found this pipe . let 's test our cars and trucks , " tim said . sam was excited . they took turns rolling their cars and trucks down the pipe . they laughed and had fun all day , playing with the big pipe . once upon a time , there was an ordinary cat named tom . tom liked to teach his friends new things . he had a dream of teaching all the animals in the forest .

one day , tom went to the forest to teach his friends . he met a bird named sally . tom taught sally how to jump high like a cat . sally was very happy and thanked tom for his help .

tom felt good about helping his friends . his dream of teaching all the animals came true . all the animals loved tom and they played together every day . and that is how an ordinary cat named tom became a special friend to all the animals in the forest . once upon a time , there was a small cat named tiny . tiny liked to play in the yard with his friends . they would run , jump , and chase each other all day long .

one day , tiny found a big , shiny rock in the yard . he thought it was very pretty . tiny wanted to make the rock even prettier , so he decided to polish it . he used his soft paws and a little water to rub the rock until it was shiny and smooth .

after tiny finished polishing the rock , he showed it to his friends . they all thought it was the prettiest rock they had ever seen . tiny was very happy and proud of his shiny rock . he put it in a special place in the yard , so everyone could see it and enjoy its beauty . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim loved to watch cartoons on his tv . one day , it was very cold outside , so tim stayed inside to watch his favorite cartoon .

