buddy and the little duck swam together . soon , the little duck was not scared anymore . they became best friends , always playing in the water . the loyal dog and the little duck swam happily ever after . once upon a time , there was a big , heavy box . inside the box , there was a yummy waffle . the waffle was very special because it could talk . it was a cold day , and the waffle was feeling very cold . it wanted to find a warm place , so it would not freeze .

the waffle jumped out of the heavy box and started to look for a warm place . it found a big , warm house . the waffle went inside the house and saw a nice , warm fire . the waffle was very happy because it would not freeze now . it sat close to the fire and started to feel warm and cozy .

but then , a big , hungry dog came into the room . the dog saw the waffle and thought it looked very yummy . the waffle was scared and tried to run away , but it was too late . the dog ate the waffle , and the waffle was gone forever . the waffle could not find a warm place to stay , and it had a bad ending . one day , a boy named tim was very excited . he was going to play a game with his friends . they wanted to play a game called " tie and score " .

