they took turns tying the ball and throwing it . each time they scored , they got more excited . they laughed and cheered when they made a point . at the end , they were all happy and tired from playing . once upon a time , a little girl named lucy wanted to spend time with her dad . they decided to go to the park . the sun was shining , and the birds were singing . lucy was very happy .

at the park , they saw a man selling ice . lucy asked her dad if they could buy some ice . her dad said it was too expensive . lucy was sad , but she understood .

they played on the swings and slides instead . lucy and her dad had a great time at the park . even though they did n't get the expensive ice , they still had lots of fun . and lucy knew that spending time with her dad was the best thing ever . once upon a time , in a small town , there lived a kind girl named amy . amy had a neighbor named tom . tom was a fierce boy who did not like to share his toys . one day , amy and tom were playing in the rain . they got very wet .

after the rain stopped , it was time to go inside . amy and tom needed to dry their clothes . amy asked tom if he wanted to come to her house to dry their clothes together . tom said no , he wanted to dry his clothes alone . amy felt sad but went home to dry her clothes .

amy 's mom helped her dry her clothes and they talked about sharing . amy 's mom said , " sharing is good . it makes friends happy . " the next day , amy shared her toys with tom . tom saw how happy it made amy and decided to share his toys too . they played together and became good friends . the moral of the story is that sharing can bring people together and make everyone happy . once upon a time , there was a big waffle . this waffle was not like other waffles . it could talk and walk . one day , the waffle met a little girl named lily . they became good friends .

" hi , waffle ! do you want to play with me ? " asked lily .

" yes , i would like that , " said the waffle . they played all day long . they ran , they jumped , and they laughed . but , the waffle was careless . it did not look where it was going . it tripped and fell on the ground . the waffle was sad and hurt .

lily saw that her friend was hurt . she wanted to help the waffle feel better . so , she said , " waffle , you need to sleep . sleep will help you feel better . " the waffle listened to lily and went to sleep . when it woke up , it felt much better . the waffle was happy and thanked lily for her help . from that day on , the waffle was more careful when it played with lily . they had lots of fun and were friends forever . once upon a time , a dog named max found a big bone . he was very happy and proud . max wanted to take the bone to his home , but the bone was too big for him to carry .

max asked his friend , a cat named lily , to help him . lily was very kind and wanted to help max . they worked together to carry the big bone . they walked and walked until they reached max 's home .

max was so happy that he shared the big bone with lily . they both felt proud that they could help each other . they played and had fun all day . from that day on , max and lily became best friends and always helped each other . once upon a time , in a busy little town , there lived a boy named tom . tom loved to play with his toys and equipment . he had cars , balls , and blocks . tom played with his toys every day , and he was very happy .

one day , tom 's mom told him , " tom , we need to increase the number of toys you have . let 's go to the toy store and buy more equipment for you to play with ! " tom was very excited . he jumped up and down , clapping his hands .

at the toy store , tom and his mom picked out many new toys and equipment . they bought more cars , balls , and blocks . when they got home , tom played with all his new toys . he was very busy and very happy . his mom smiled , watching tom enjoy his new equipment . one day , a little girl named mia went to the beach with her mom . they saw many things like sand , shells , and water . mia liked to play in the sand and make castles . she felt happy and peaceful at the beach .

then , mia saw a jellyfish in the water . it was big and pretty . mia asked her mom , " what is that ? " her mom said , " that is a jellyfish . we can look , but we should not touch it . " mia admired the jellyfish from far away .

later , mia and her mom sat on the sand and ate a snack . they talked about the jellyfish and how nice the day was . mia loved the beach and the jellyfish , and she felt very peaceful . once upon a time , there was a little car named cozy . cozy was a very anxious car . he always worried about not having enough fuel to go on trips . one day , cozy 's friend , a big truck named buddy , asked him to go on a long ride .

cozy was scared . he thought , " what if i run out of fuel ? what will i do ? " but he did n't want to say no to his friend . so , cozy and buddy started their trip . cozy kept looking at his fuel meter , getting more and more worried .

after a while , cozy told buddy about his fear . buddy gave cozy a big smile and said , " do n't worry , cozy ! i have extra fuel with me . if you need it , i will share it with you . " cozy felt comfort and happy . they both had a fun trip and cozy learned that with good friends , there is no need to be anxious . one day , a fox was walking in the woods . the sky was dark , and it started to rain . the fox did not like the rain , so he looked for a place to hide . he saw a big tree and went under it . the tree kept him dry from the rain .

while the fox was under the tree , he saw a crazy bird . the bird was flying in the rain and having fun . the fox thought the bird was silly for playing in the rain . he stayed under the tree and watched the bird .